\n    \"eng\": \"They made a collective decision to go on strike.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們做出了集體罷工的決定。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company has a collective bargaining agreement.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家公司簽有集體談判協議。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The artist sought to express a collective consciousness.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位藝術家試圖表達集體意識。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The collective effort of the team led to success.\",\n    \"ch\": \"團隊的集體努力帶來了成功。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這位藝術家試圖表達集體意識。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U66"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6151,"wordRef":"字彙王::u66::alien::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The film depicts a terrifying ____ invasion.","expectedAnswer":"alien","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The film depicts a terrifying ____ invasion.","clozeAnswer":"alien","exampleTranslation":"這部電影描繪了一場可怕的外星人入侵。","reference":{"eng":"alien","kk":"ˈeɪliən","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"外星人\"  ],  [    \"外籍人士\"  ],  [    \"不受歡迎的人\"  ],  [    \"無關係者\"  ]]","chEntries":["外星人","外籍人士","不受歡迎的人","無關係者"],"practiceMeaning":"這部電影描繪了一場可怕的外星人入侵。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 alienus，意為「別人的、外國的、不相干的」，為 alius「別的、其他的」之衍生詞。它進入中古英語 via 古法語 alien。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根，應視為整體詞源演變。作為名詞，主要語義是來自另一個國家、地方或宇宙的人。詞源中的「外國的、不相干的」概念是核心，引申出「外籍人士」和「外星人」。後也用於比喻意義，指一個群體中格格不入或與之無關的人。","definition":"1. a being from outer space; 2. a person who lives in a country but is not a citizen of that country; 3. a person who is completely different from other people and not accepted by them; 4. a person who is not related to you.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The film depicts a terrifying alien invasion.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這部電影描繪了一場可怕的外星人入侵。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is an alien in his own country, treated with suspicion.\",\n    \"ch\": \"在他自己的國家，他被視為外人，受到懷疑。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her ideas seemed alien to the rest of the group.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她的想法對團體中的其他人來說顯得很陌生。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The alien species was discovered in the deep