med ____ to the rest of the group.","clozeAnswer":"alien","exampleTranslation":"她的想法對團體中的其他人來說顯得很陌生。","reference":{"eng":"alien","kk":"ˈeɪliən","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"外星人\"  ],  [    \"外籍人士\"  ],  [    \"不受歡迎的人\"  ],  [    \"無關係者\"  ]]","chEntries":["外星人","外籍人士","不受歡迎的人","無關係者"],"practiceMeaning":"她的想法對團體中的其他人來說顯得很陌生。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 alienus，意為「別人的、外國的、不相干的」，為 alius「別的、其他的」之衍生詞。它進入中古英語 via 古法語 alien。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根，應視為整體詞源演變。作為名詞，主要語義是來自另一個國家、地方或宇宙的人。詞源中的「外國的、不相干的」概念是核心，引申出「外籍人士」和「外星人」。後也用於比喻意義，指一個群體中格格不入或與之無關的人。","definition":"1. a being from outer space; 2. a person who lives in a country but is not a citizen of that country; 3. a person who is completely different from other people and not accepted by them; 4. a person who is not related to you.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The film depicts a terrifying alien invasion.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這部電影描繪了一場可怕的外星人入侵。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is an alien in his own country, treated with suspicion.\",\n    \"ch\": \"在他自己的國家，他被視為外人，受到懷疑。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her ideas seemed alien to the rest of the group.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她的想法對團體中的其他人來說顯得很陌生。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The alien species was discovered in the deep ocean.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這種外星物種是在深海中發現的。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她的想法對團體中的其他人來說顯得很陌生。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U66"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4136,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::appeal::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The lawyer filed an ____.","expectedAnswer":"appeal","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The lawyer filed an ____.","clozeAnswer":"appeal","exampleTranslation":"律師提交了上訴。","reference":{"eng":"appeal","kk":"/əˈpiːl/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['懇求', '請求'], ['吸引力'], ['上訴']]","chEntries":["懇求","請求","吸引力","上訴"],"practiceMeaning":"律師提交了上訴。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 appellare（向...呼籲，控告）。核心概念是「正式的請求」或「有吸引力的特質」。","definition":"1. an earnest or urgent request; 2. the quality in a person or thing that causes pleasure or satisfaction; 3. an application to a higher court for a decision to be canceled or changed","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There was a strong appeal for donations.\",\n    \"ch\": \"有強烈的捐款呼籲。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The movie has great appeal for young people.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這部電影對年輕人有很大的吸引力。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The lawyer filed an appeal.\",\n    \"ch\": \"律師提交了上訴。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"律師提交了上訴。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U5、L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3059,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::associate::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He was the ____ of a known criminal.","expectedAnswer":"associate","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He was the ____ of a known criminal.","clozeAnswer":"associate","exampleTranslation":"他是個已知罪犯的同夥。","reference":{"eng":"associate","kk":"/əˈsoʊʃieɪt/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['使聯繫；與…交往'], ['認為…有關聯；把…視為夥伴'], ['聯合；合作']]","chEntries":["使聯繫","與…交往","認為…有關聯","把…視為夥伴","聯合","合作"],"practiceMeaning":"他是個已知罪犯的同夥。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'associatus'，'ad-' (to, toward) + 'sociatus' (companion)。核心意義是「連結」或「成為夥伴」。\n1. 使聯繫；與…交往：強調人與人之間的連結與互動，常指建立社交或業務關係。\n2. 認為…有關聯；把…視為夥伴：將兩個事物或概念連結在一起，認為它們之間有某種關聯性。\n3. 聯合；合作：指兩個或多個個體或團體共同行動或目標。","definition":"1. join together for a common purpose; unite; connect; 2. consider as connected; link; 3. connect or join; accompany.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She was asked to associate with the company's marketing team.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她被要求與公司的行銷團隊合作。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Many people associate wealth with happiness.\",\n    \"ch\": \"許多人將財富與幸福聯繫起來。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He was the associate of a known criminal.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是個已知罪犯的同夥。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他是個已知罪犯的同夥。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U39"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6213,"wordRef":"字彙王::u67::combat::vt","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We must ____ all forms of discrimination.","expectedAnswer":"combat","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We must ____ all forms of discrimination.","clozeAnswer":"combat","exampleTranslation":"我們必須反對一切形式的歧視。","reference":{"eng":"combat","kk":"kəmˈbæt","tense":"vt.","ch":"[  [    \"戰鬥\"  ],  [    \"與…搏鬥\"  ],  [    \"對抗\"  ],  [    \"反對\"  ]]","chEntries":["戰鬥","與…搏鬥","對抗","反對"],"practiceMeaning":"我們必須反對一切形式的歧視。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 combat，由 com-（一起）和 batre（打擊）組成，意為「共同打擊」。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根。作及物動詞時，核心語義是用武力與敵人交戰，或與某種難題、問題、疾病等進行激烈鬥爭。此及物動詞義必須接受詞，例如 combat the enemy、combat disease、combat poverty。中文翻譯為「戰鬥；與…搏鬥；對抗；反對」。","definition":"1. to fight against an enemy or opponent in order to win control of something; 2. to try to stop something bad from happening or to stop someone from doing something bad.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The army successfully combatted the invasion.\",\n    \"ch\": \"軍隊成功擊退了入侵。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Scientists are working to combat the spread of the virus.\",\n    \"ch\": \"科學家們正在努力對抗病毒的傳播。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We must combat all forms of discrimination.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們必須反對一切形式的歧視。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們必須反對一切形式的歧視。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U67"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4203,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::exchange::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He works at the stock ____.","expectedAnswer":"exchange","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He works at the stock ____.","clozeAnswer":"exchange","exampleTranslation":"他在證券交易所工作。","reference":{"eng":"exchange","kk":"/ɪksˈtʃeɪndʒ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['交換；兌換'], ['交流；談話'], ['（股票、貨幣等的）交易所']]","chEntries":["交換","兌換","交流","談話","交易所"],"practiceMeaning":"他在證券交易所工作。","analysis":"名詞形式源自動詞 'exchange'。1. “交換；兌換”指交換的行為或結果。2. “交流；談話”指思想、資訊的相互傳遞過程。3. “交易所”是特定場所的名稱，指進行金融商品交換的機構。","definition":"1. the act of giving one thing and receiving another in return; 2. conversation; 3. a place where shares or other securities are bought and sold.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The exchange of gifts is common at Christmas.\",\n    \"ch\": \"交換禮物在聖誕節很常見。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We had a brief exchange of views.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們就此交換了簡短的看法。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He works at the stock exchange.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在證券交易所工作。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他在證券交易所工作。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5785,"wordRef":"字彙王::u60::format::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We need to decide on the ____ for the presentation.","expectedAnswer":"format","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We need to decide on the ____ for the presentation.","clozeAnswer":"format","exampleTranslation":"我們需要決定簡報的編排形式。","reference":{"eng":"format","kk":"ˈfɔrmæt","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"格式\"  ],  [    \"版面\"  ],  [    \"形式\"  ],  [    \"編排\"  ]]","chEntries":["格式","版面","形式","編排"],"practiceMeaning":"我們需要決定簡報的編排形式。","analysis":"此字為名詞，與動詞同源，源自拉丁語forma（形式；形狀）。format作為名詞，核心語義是指「事物的結構、安排或呈現方式」。可以是文件、磁碟、節目、演講的特定結構或樣式。語意演變上，從「形式」的概念，具體化為「被組織或安排好的樣式」。","definition":"1. the way in which something is arranged or organized; 2. the size, shape, or arrangement of something; 3. a particular way in which something is presented or published.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The report needs to be in a specific format.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這份報告需要採用特定的格式。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The book's format makes it easy to read.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這本書的版面設計易於閱讀。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to decide on the format for the presentation.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要決定簡報的編排形式。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們需要決定簡報的編排形式。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U60"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5480,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l4::harvest::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"They celebrated the ____ festival.","expectedAnswer":"harvest","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"They celebrated the ____ festival.","clozeAnswer":"harvest","exampleTranslation":"他們慶祝了豐收節。","reference":{"eng":"harvest","kk":"ˈhɑrvəst","tense":"n.","ch":"[['收成'], ['收穫'], ['收割']]","chEntries":["收成","收穫","收割"],"practiceMeaning":"他們慶祝了豐收節。","analysis":"此字源自古英語 'hærfest'，與許多日耳曼語族語言（如荷蘭語 'herfst'，德語 'Herbst'）中表示「秋天」的詞相關。最初，'harvest' 指的是「秋季」，因為這是農作物收成的季節。隨著時間演變，'harvest' 的主要語意轉移到了「收成」或「收穫」這個動作和結果上，也保留了「秋季」或「收割季節」的含義。核心語意是「農作物成熟並被收割的季節或過程」。","definition":"1. The process or period of gathering in crops.; 2. The crops gathered (esp. during an autumn harvest).; 3. The season when ripened crops are gathered.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The farmers rejoiced at the abundant harvest.\",\n    \"ch\": \"農民們為豐收而歡欣鼓舞。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This year's harvest was particularly good.\",\n    \"ch\": \"今年的收成特別好。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They celebrated the harvest festival.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們慶祝了豐收節。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他們慶祝了豐收節。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4178,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::honor::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We must ____ our commitments.","expectedAnswer":"honor","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We must ____ our commitments.","clozeAnswer":"honor","exampleTranslation":"我們必須履行我們的承諾。","reference":{"eng":"honor","kk":"/ˈɑːnər/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['尊敬', '敬重'], ['遵守', '履行（諾言、義務）'], ['（銀行）兌現（支票）']]","chEntries":["尊敬","敬重","遵守","履行","兌現"],"practiceMeaning":"我們必須履行我們的承諾。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 honor（尊敬、名譽）。核心概念是「給予尊重」或「兌現承諾」。","definition":"1. regard with great respect; 2. fulfill (an obligation) or keep (an agreement); 3. accept and pay (a bill of exchange)","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He always honors his promises.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他總是信守諾言。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The bank will honor the check.\",\n    \"ch\": \"銀行將兌現這張支票。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We must honor our commitments.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們必須履行我們的承諾。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們必須履行我們的承諾。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5571,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l6::load::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is carrying a heavy emotional ____.","expectedAnswer":"load","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is carrying a heavy emotional ____.","clozeAnswer":"load","exampleTranslation":"他承受著沉重的精神負擔。","reference":{"eng":"load","kk":"loʊd","tense":"n.","ch":"[['負荷'], ['載重'], ['裝載量'], ['負擔']]","chEntries":["負荷","載重","裝載量","負擔"],"practiceMeaning":"他承受著沉重的精神負擔。","analysis":"此字源自古英語 \"lād\"，意為 \"way, journey, cargo\"（路，旅程，貨物），最終可能源自原始印歐語 \\*leith-（to go, to travel，去，旅行）。\"lād\" 最初指「旅程」或「所載的貨物」。\"load\" 作名詞，核心語義是「被攜帶或承受的重量、數量或負擔」。它可以指物理上的「貨物」（cargo）；「機器或車輛所能承受的最大重量」（carrying capacity）；在工程學上指「作用在結構上的力」（force or stress）；在計算機領域指「載入的數據或程式」（data to be loaded）；引申義指「精神上的負擔」（burden）。","definition":"1. A large quantity of goods or people, especially one that is carried or conveyed; 2. The weight of goods put on a vehicle or in a ship, aircraft, etc.; 3. A quantity of something such as ammunition, that is put into a gun; 4. The amount of work or responsibility that someone has.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The maximum load for this elevator is 1000 kg.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這部電梯的最大負荷是 1000 公斤。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The lorry had a heavy load of timber.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這輛貨車載有大量木材。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is carrying a heavy emotional load.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他承受著沉重的精神負擔。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The game's graphics load slowly.\",\n    \"ch\": \"遊戲的畫面載入很慢。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他承受著沉重的精神負擔。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6081,"wordRef":"字彙王::u64::massage::vt","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The committee tried to ____ the data to make the project look successful.","expectedAnswer":"massage","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The committee tried to ____ the data to make the project look successful.","clozeAnswer":"massage","exampleTranslation":"委員會試圖操縱數據，讓項目看起來成功。","reference":{"eng":"massage","kk":"məˈsɑʒ","tense":"vt.","ch":"[  [    \"按摩\"  ],  [    \"撫摩\"  ],  [    \"（非正式）操縱；處理\"  ]]","chEntries":["按摩","撫摩","操縱","處理"],"practiceMeaning":"委員會試圖操縱數據，讓項目看起來成功。","analysis":"此字由法語 massage 演變而來，核心語義是「用手揉捏、按壓」。作為及物動詞，指對身體進行按摩的動作。引申用法包括非正式地指「操縱」或「不正當地處理」資訊或情況，以便得到有利結果（例如 massage the figures）。","definition":"1. rub and knead (a part of the body) or to treat (a complaint) by rubbing and kneading; 2. (informal) manipulate or alter (figures, information, etc.) to present a favorable view.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The therapist massaged his sore shoulders.\",\n    \"ch\": \"治療師按摩了他痠痛的肩膀。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She learned to massage her baby's feet.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她學會了按摩寶寶的腳。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The committee tried to massage the data to make the project look successful.\",\n    \"ch\": \"委員會試圖操縱數據，讓項目看起來成功。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"委員會試圖操縱數據，讓項目看起來成功。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U64"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5670,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l8::negative::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The company reported ____ growth.","expectedAnswer":"negative","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company reported ____ growth.","clozeAnswer":"negative","exampleTranslation":"該公司報告了負增長。","reference":{"eng":"negative","kk":"ˈnɛɡətɪv","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['負面的'], ['否定的'], ['消極的'], ['（數值）負的']]","chEntries":["負面的","否定的","消極的","負的"],"practiceMeaning":"該公司報告了負增長。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 negativus，來自 negare（否認，to deny），其根源為 ne-（不，not）+ -are（動詞字尾）。ne- 來自原始印歐語 *ne-（不）。核心語義為「否認」、「拒絕」或「沒有」。構詞上，ne- 提供「否定」的概念，-gativus 為形容詞後綴，表示「性質」。此處為形容詞用法，描述事物「表達否定」、「帶來壞處」或「低於零」。","definition":"expressing or implying denial, disagreement, or refusal; characterized by the absence rather than the presence of distinguishing qualities; less than zero.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His response was negative.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的回應是否定的。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The test results were negative.\",\n    \"ch\": \"檢測結果為陰性。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company reported negative growth.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司報告了負增長。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"該公司報告了負增長。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5793,"wordRef":"字彙王::u60::offering::vt","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is ____ his help to the community.","expectedAnswer":"offering","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is ____ his help to the community.","clozeAnswer":"offering","exampleTranslation":"他正在向社區提供幫助。","reference":{"eng":"offering","kk":"ˈɔfərɪŋ","tense":"vt.","ch":"[  [    \"提供\"  ],  [    \"提出\"  ],  [    \"奉獻\"  ]]","chEntries":["提供","提出","奉獻"],"practiceMeaning":"他正在向社區提供幫助。","analysis":"此處 offering 是動詞offer的現在分詞形式，具動詞義。offer源自古英語offrian，受拉丁語offerre（奉獻；提供）影響。offerre由ob-（朝向；針對）+ferre（帶來；運送）組成。核心語義是用意願將某物呈現給他人，使其可被接受或使用。語意演變上，從「帶來」引申為「主動提出」或「自願給予」。","definition":"1. to present something for acceptance or rejection; 2. to make available for purchase or use; 3. to present or give something as a gift or tribute.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They are offering a discount for early bookings.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們為提前預訂提供折扣。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company is offering a new service to its customers.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司正在為其客戶提供一項新服務。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is offering his help to the community.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他正在向社區提供幫助。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他正在向社區提供幫助。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U60"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5847,"wordRef":"字彙王::u58::parallel::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"His life story has ____ with mine.","expectedAnswer":"parallel","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"His life story has ____ with mine.","clozeAnswer":"parallel","exampleTranslation":"他的人生經歷與我頗為相似。","reference":{"eng":"parallel","kk":"ˈpærəlel","tense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"平行的\"  ],  [    \"並列的\"  ],  [    \"類似的\"  ],  [    \"同時發生的\"  ]]","chEntries":["平行的","並列的","類似的","同時發生的"],"practiceMeaning":"他的人生經歷與我頗為相似。","analysis":"此字源自希臘語 'parallēlos'，由 'para-' (beside) 和 'allos' (other) 構成，意為「相鄰的」或「並行的」。'Parallel' 在幾何學中指永不相交的兩條線。在更廣泛的語境中，它描述的是事物在空間上「並排」或在時間上「同時」發生、或在性質上「類似」的關係。空間上的平行與時間上的同時，以及性質上的類比，都共享了「不交叉」、「不干涉」或「共同前進」的意象。例如，也可指「結構相似的」。","definition":"1. (of lines, planes, or surfaces) side by side and having the same distance continuously between them.; 2. Occurring or existing at the same time.; 3. Having a marked similarity or resemblance.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The two roads run parallel to each other.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這兩條路相互平行。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The events occurred in parallel.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這些事件是同時發生的。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His life story has parallel with mine.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的人生經歷與我頗為相似。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The two buildings have a parallel structure.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這兩座建築有著平行的結構。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他的人生經歷與我頗為相似。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U58"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4450,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::rank::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He has a high ____ among scientists.","expectedAnswer":"rank","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He has a high ____ among scientists.","clozeAnswer":"rank","exampleTranslation":"他在科學家中有很高的地位。","reference":{"eng":"rank","kk":"/ræŋk/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['等級'], ['地位'], ['（軍隊中的）軍階'], ['（受尊敬或重視的）程度'], ['（事物）類別']]","chEntries":["等級","地位","軍階","程度","類別"],"practiceMeaning":"他在科學家中有很高的地位。","analysis":"源自古法語 ranc，意為「隊伍」、「行列」。早期語意指「整齊排列的隊伍」。引申為在隊伍中的位置，即「等級」、「地位」。在軍事中，指軍階。也可引申為事物在某個標準下的位置，例如「受尊敬的程度」。","definition":"1. A position in an organization or society; 2. A level in an organization or society; 3. (often plural) The officers of a particular grade or rank in the armed forces; 4. A high or respected position in a hierarchy or scale.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She achieved the rank of captain in the army.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她在軍隊中晉升到上尉軍階。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The restaurant is of the highest rank in the city.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家餐廳是城裡等級最高的。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He has a high rank among scientists.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在科學家中有很高的地位。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他在科學家中有很高的地位。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5802,"wordRef":"字彙王::u60::resume::vt","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Please ____ your seat.","expectedAnswer":"resume","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Please ____ your seat.","clozeAnswer":"resume","exampleTranslation":"請回到您的座位上。","reference":{"eng":"resume","kk":"rɪˈzum","tense":"vt.","ch":"[  [    \"恢復（某事）\"  ],  [    \"重新開始\"  ]]","chEntries":["恢復","重新開始"],"practiceMeaning":"請回到您的座位上。","analysis":"此字為及物動詞，源自拉丁語resumere，由re-（再次）+sumere（拿起；採取）組成。sumere本身來自sub-（在……下面）+emere（拿；購買）。核心語義是「再次拿起」或「重新開始」。語意演變上，從「再次拿取」引申為「恢復中斷的活動或狀態」。","definition":"1. to begin again or continue after a pause or interruption; 2. to take up again.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He decided to resume his studies after a year off.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他決定休學一年後重拾學業。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The meeting will resume at 2 PM.\",\n    \"ch\": \"會議將於下午兩點恢復。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please resume your seat.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請回到您的座位上。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"請回到您的座位上。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U60"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6189,"wordRef":"字彙王::u66::shiver::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The music made her ____ with delight.","expectedAnswer":"shiver","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The music made her ____ with delight.","clozeAnswer":"shiver","exampleTranslation":"音樂讓她高興得渾身顫抖。","reference":{"eng":"shiver","kk":"ˈʃɪvər","tense":"v.","ch":"[  [    \"發抖\"  ],  [    \"顫抖\"  ]]","chEntries":["發抖","顫抖"],"practiceMeaning":"音樂讓她高興得渾身顫抖。","analysis":"此字源自中古英語 shiveren，可能是擬聲詞，模仿寒冷或恐懼時的顫抖聲。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根，應視為整體詞源演變。作為動詞，其核心語義是「由於寒冷、恐懼或興奮而身體不由自主地顫抖」。此生理反應的語義是其主要構成要素。","definition":"1. tremble, typically as a result of fear, excitement, or cold.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He shivered in the cold wind.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在寒風中發抖。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She shivered with fear when she heard the noise.\",\n    \"ch\": \"聽到噪音時，她因為害怕而顫抖。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The music made her shiver with delight.\",\n    \"ch\": \"音樂讓她高興得渾身顫抖。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A cold shiver ran down his spine.\",\n    \"ch\": \"一陣寒意沿著他的脊椎爬過。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"音樂讓她高興得渾身顫抖。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U66"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6249,"wordRef":"字彙王::u67::thrust::vt","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The engine ____ the boat forward.","expectedAnswer":"thrust","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The engine ____ the boat forward.","clozeAnswer":"thrust","exampleTranslation":"引擎推動船向前行駛。","reference":{"eng":"thrust","kk":"θrʌst","tense":"vt.","ch":"[  [    \"插入\"  ],  [    \"刺\"  ],  [    \"猛推\"  ],  [    \"推進\"  ]]","chEntries":["插入","刺","猛推","推進"],"practiceMeaning":"引擎推動船向前行駛。","analysis":"此字源自古英語 þȳst（用力推，刺）。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根。作及物動詞時，核心語義是用力將某物向前、向上或向某方向推動或刺入。也可指突然將某人或某物推入某個地方。此及物動詞義必須接受詞，例如 thrust a sword、thrust a hand、thrust someone into a room。中文翻譯為「插入；刺；猛推；推進」。","definition":"1. to push something or someone with force; 2. to put something somewhere with a sudden, forceful movement; 3. to push something forward or into something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He thrust his hands into his pockets.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他把手插進口袋裡。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The bull thrust its horns at the matador.\",\n    \"ch\": \"公牛用角刺向鬥牛士。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The engine thrust the boat forward.\",\n    \"ch\": \"引擎推動船向前行駛。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"引擎推動船向前行駛。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U67"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5824,"wordRef":"字彙王::u58::blur::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The past few weeks have been a ____ of activity.","expectedAnswer":"blur","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The past few weeks have been a ____ of activity.","clozeAnswer":"blur","exampleTranslation":"過去幾周是一段忙碌到眼花繚亂的時期。","reference":{"eng":"blur","kk":"blər","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"模糊不清\"  ],  [    \"污點\"  ],  [    \"模糊的影像\"  ],  [    \"渾淆不清的狀態\"  ]]","chEntries":["模糊不清","污點","模糊的影像","渾淆不清的狀態"],"practiceMeaning":"過去幾周是一段忙碌到眼花繚亂的時期。","analysis":"此字詞源不明，可能與「模糊」的聲音或視覺有關。字義的演變傾向於指代一種不清晰、不確定的視覺或狀態。'Blur' 作名詞時，指一個不清晰的影像、一個模糊的區域，或一種混淆的狀態，使其難以分辨。這種不清晰感可能是由於移動、距離、視覺障礙或概念上的混淆所致。它描述了一種「失去清晰邊界」或「失去準確性」的狀態。例如，有時也指「一種使人興奮或眼花繚亂的迅速變化」。","definition":"1. A thing that is seen or heard indistinctly.; 2. A smudge or stain.; 3. A confused or disordered state.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The city lights were a blur in the distance.\",\n    \"ch\": \"城市燈火在遠方是一片模糊。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Tears made his vision a blur.\",\n    \"ch\": \"淚水使他的視線變得模糊。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The memory of that day is just a blur.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那天的記憶只是一片模糊。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The past few weeks have been a blur of activity.\",\n    \"ch\": \"過去幾周是一段忙碌到眼花繚亂的時期。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"過去幾周是一段忙碌到眼花繚亂的時期。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U58"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6161,"wordRef":"字彙王::u66::collective::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ effort of the team led to success.","expectedAnswer":"collective","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ effort of the team led to success.","clozeAnswer":"collective","exampleTranslation":"團隊的集體努力帶來了成功。","reference":{"eng":"collective","kk":"kəˈlɛktɪv","tense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"集體的\"  ],  [    \"共同的\"  ],  [    \"集中的\"  ]]","chEntries":["集體的","共同的","集中的"],"practiceMeaning":"團隊的集體努力帶來了成功。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 collectīvus，是動詞 colligere「收集、聚集」的衍生形容詞。colligere 由 com- (together) + legere (to gather) 組成。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根，但 com-「一起」和 legere「收集」是其核心語意來源。作為形容詞，其核心語義是「屬於、與、或由兩個或多個個體共同組成」。詞源中的「一起收集」概念與「集體的」概念緊密相關。此義項由「聚集」的動作引申為「集體的」狀態或性質。","definition":"1. relating to or affecting all the people or things in a group; 2. done by or involving all the people in a group; 3. formed by the union of several individuals or things into one; 4. relating to or characteristic of a collective or the collective consciousness.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They made a collective decision to go on strike.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們做出了集體罷工的決定。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company has a collective bargaining agreement.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家公司簽有集體談判協議。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The artist sought to express a collective consciousness.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位藝術家試圖表達集體意識。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The collective effort of the team led to success.\",\n    \"ch\": \"團隊的集體努力帶來了成功。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"團隊的集體努力帶來了成功。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U66"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5852,"wordRef":"字彙王::u58::patrol::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ spotted a suspicious vehicle.","expectedAnswer":"patrol","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ spotted a suspicious vehicle.","clozeAnswer":"patrol","exampleTranslation":"巡邏隊發現了一輛可疑車輛。","reference":{"eng":"patrol","kk":"pəˈtroʊl","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"巡邏\"  ],  [    \"巡邏隊\"  ],  [    \"巡邏路線\"  ],  [    \"守衛\"  ]]","chEntries":["巡邏","巡邏隊","巡邏路線","守衛"],"practiceMeaning":"巡邏隊發現了一輛可疑車輛。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 'patrouiller' (to wade through mire, to patrol)，其詞源不確定，可能與拉丁語 'pastor' (shepherd) 或 'pala' (spade) 有關，表示「巡視」、「守衛」的概念。'Patrol' 作名詞時，指由軍隊、警察或安全人員進行的例行性巡視，以維護秩序、偵測威脅或確保安全。它強調的是一種「規律性」、「監視性」的移動或隊伍。例如，也可指「輪值守衛」。","definition":"1. The action of moving around as a guard.; 2. A person or group of people or animals who patrol an area.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The police 