choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The police ____ car drove by.","clozeAnswer":"patrol","exampleTranslation":"警車巡邏經過。","reference":{"eng":"patrol","kk":"pəˈtroʊl","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"巡邏\"  ],  [    \"巡邏隊\"  ],  [    \"巡邏路線\"  ],  [    \"守衛\"  ]]","chEntries":["巡邏","巡邏隊","巡邏路線","守衛"],"practiceMeaning":"警車巡邏經過。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 'patrouiller' (to wade through mire, to patrol)，其詞源不確定，可能與拉丁語 'pastor' (shepherd) 或 'pala' (spade) 有關，表示「巡視」、「守衛」的概念。'Patrol' 作名詞時，指由軍隊、警察或安全人員進行的例行性巡視，以維護秩序、偵測威脅或確保安全。它強調的是一種「規律性」、「監視性」的移動或隊伍。例如，也可指「輪值守衛」。","definition":"1. The action of moving around as a guard.; 2. A person or group of people or animals who patrol an area.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The police patrol car drove by.\",\n    \"ch\": \"警車巡邏經過。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The night patrol is responsible for security.\",\n    \"ch\": \"夜間巡邏隊負責安全。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They established a patrol route around the perimeter.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們在周邊地區設立了巡邏路線。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The patrol spotted a suspicious vehicle.\",\n    \"ch\": \"巡邏隊發現了一輛可疑車輛。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"警車巡邏經過。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U58"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6185,"wordRef":"字彙王::u66::poke::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Don't ____ the bear!","expectedAnswer":"poke","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Don't ____ the bear!","clozeAnswer":"poke","exampleTranslation":"別去戳熊！","reference":{"eng":"poke","kk":"poʊk","tense":"v.","ch":"[  [    \"戳\"  ],  [    \"捅\"  ],  [    \"按\"  ],  [    \"探究\"  ]]","chEntries":["戳","捅","按","探究"],"practiceMeaning":"別去戳熊！","analysis":"此字源自中古英語 pokien，可能是擬聲詞，模仿戳或捅的動作。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根，應視為整體詞源演變。作為動詞，其核心語義是用手指或尖物輕輕觸碰、戳或捅。此生理動作的語義是其主要構成要素。也可用於比喻意義，如「探究」。","definition":"1. to push something or someone with your finger or a sharp object; 2. to press a button or switch; 3. to try to find out information about someone's affairs; 4. to move forward slowly and with difficulty.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Don't poke the bear!\",\n    \"ch\": \"別去戳熊！\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She poked him in the ribs to get his attention.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她戳了戳他的肋骨，引起他的注意。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He poked at the screen with his finger.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他用手指按了按螢幕。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She poked her head out of the window.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她把頭探出窗外。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"別去戳熊！","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U66"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3192,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::project::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The construction ____ is expected to be completed by next year.","expectedAnswer":"project","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The construction ____ is expected to be completed by next year.","clozeAnswer":"project","exampleTranslation":"這個建築項目預計將在明年完工。","reference":{"eng":"project","kk":"/ˈprɒdʒɛkt/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['項目；計畫'], ['（尤指政府或公司的）工程']]","chEntries":["項目","計畫","工程"],"practiceMeaning":"這個建築項目預計將在明年完工。","analysis":"名詞用法，源自動詞 'project'。'Project' 指的是一項有特定目標、計劃和時間表的複雜工作或活動，通常需要多個步驟來完成。它可以是個人、公司或政府的計畫。常強調其規模、複雜性和預定的完成時間。","definition":"1. an individual or collaborative enterprise that is carefully planned and designed to achieve a particular aim; 2. a planned piece of work that has a specific purpose.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The construction project is expected to be completed by next year.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個建築項目預計將在明年完工。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is working on a research project for her thesis.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她正在為她的論文進行一個研究項目。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The government has launched a new infrastructure project.\",\n    \"ch\": \"政府啟動了一個新的基礎設施項目。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這個建築項目預計將在明年完工。","sourceName":"字彙王、龍騰課本","unitName":"U40、L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5595,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l7::protest::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Citizens gathered to ____ against