品","範例"],"practiceMeaning":"您想嚐嚐我們的起司樣本嗎？","analysis":"此字源自古法語 'essample'，意為「範例、例子」，來自拉丁語 'exemplum'（例子、範本）。'Exemplum' 是由 'ex-'（出）和 'templum'（樣板、模型）構成。在中古英語中，'sample' 是一個非標準形式，後來演變成現代的 'sample'。'Sample' 作名詞，指「為了代表整體而取出的部分」，用於檢驗、展示或研究。核心語意是「代表整體的一部分」。","definition":"1. A small part or quantity intended to show what the whole is like.; 2. A specimen or example.; 3. A representative part or a single item from a larger whole.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Would you like to try a sample of our new cheese?\",\n    \"ch\": \"您想嚐嚐我們的起司樣本嗎？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The scientist took a blood sample for analysis.\",\n    \"ch\": \"科學家抽取了血液樣本進行分析。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is just a sample of his work.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這只是他作品的一個範例。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"您想嚐嚐我們的起司樣本嗎？","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4701,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u17::seal::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The document bore the official ____ of the king.","expectedAnswer":"seal","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The document bore the official ____ of the king.","clozeAnswer":"seal","exampleTranslation":"文件蓋有國王的官方印章。","reference":{"eng":"seal","kk":"/ˈsil/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['印章'], ['封條'], ['（海豹）'], ['密封物']]","chEntries":["印章","封條","密封物"],"practiceMeaning":"文件蓋有國王的官方印章。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 *sigillum*（小標記），與 'sign'（標誌）同源。第一義指用於壓印圖案或文字的工具，常代表權威或認證。第二義指用於封閉或保護的材料。第三義指一種海洋哺乳動物。第四義指用於防止滲漏的裝置。","definition":"1. A stamp or device used to impress a mark or design, typically for authentication or security. 2. A piece of wax or other material used to fasten or secure something. 3. A marine mammal of the order Pinnipedia. 4. A device or material used to prevent the passage of liquid or gas.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The document bore the official seal of the king.\",\n    \"ch\": \"文件蓋有國王的官方印章。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The package was secured with a tamper-proof seal.\",\n    \"ch\": \"包