ense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"單獨的\"  ],  [    \"獨奏的\"  ],  [    \"獨唱的\"  ]]","chEntries":["單獨的","獨奏的","獨唱的"],"practiceMeaning":"她表演了一段獨舞。","analysis":"此字源自義大利語 solo，意為「單獨的」，最終來源於拉丁語 solus（alone）。核心語義是「獨自一人」。可以用來形容表演（獨奏、獨唱）或行為（獨自完成）。","definition":"1. performed alone; 2. done or being performed by a person without help.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She performed a solo dance.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她表演了一段獨舞。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He achieved his goals through solo effort.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他通過單獨努力達成了目標。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The violinist played a beautiful solo.\",\n    \"ch\": \"小提琴家演奏了一曲優美的獨奏。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她表演了一段獨舞。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U64"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4487,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::stir::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"____ the soup gently.","expectedAnswer":"Stir","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"____ the soup gently.","clozeAnswer":"Stir","exampleTranslation":"輕輕攪拌湯。","reference":{"eng":"stir","kk":"/stɜːr/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['攪拌'], ['移動'], ['激發'], ['引起（感情、興趣等）']]","chEntries":["攪拌","移動","激發","引起"],"practiceMeaning":"輕輕攪拌湯。","analysis":"源自古英語 styrian，意為「移動」、「激動」。核心語意是「引起移動」。引申為「攪拌」液體，使之混合或活躍；「引起」注意、興趣或情感。也可指「使開始行動」。","definition":"1. To move or cause to move slightly; 2. To mix (a substance) by moving it around with a spoon or similar object; 3. To rouse or incite; 4. To arouse or inspire (a feeling or quality).","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Stir the soup gently.\",\n    \"ch\": \"輕輕攪拌湯。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The news of his success stirred excitement among his friends.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他成功的消息激起了他朋友們的興奮。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Don't stir from your seat.\",\n    \"ch\": \"別從座位上移動。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"輕輕攪拌湯。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3927,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u2::strength::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He has great physical ____.","expectedAnswer":"strength","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He has great physical ____.","clozeAnswer":"strength","exampleTranslation":"他擁有強大的體力。","reference":{"eng":"strength","kk":"/streŋkθ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['力量', '力氣'], ['強度'], ['優勢'], ['效力']]","chEntries":["力量","力氣","強度","優勢","效力"],"practiceMeaning":"他擁有強大的體力。","analysis":"源自古英語 'strengþu'，由 'streng' (意為「強壯的」) 和 '-þu' (名詞後綴，表示「狀態」) 組成。指物理上的力量、堅固的程度、精神上的毅力、能力或優勢。","definition":"1. the quality or state of being physically strong; 2. the capacity to withstand great force or pressure; 3. the degree to which something is powerful or effective; 4. an advantage or good quality.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He has great physical strength.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他擁有強大的體力。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The strength of the fabric is impressive.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這塊布料的強度令人印象深刻。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her biggest strength is her determination.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她最大的優勢是她的決心。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The strength of the argument was undeniable.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個論點的說服力是無可否認的。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他擁有強大的體力。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4330,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::substance::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Water is a chemical ____.","expectedAnswer":"substance","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Water is a chemical ____.","clozeAnswer":"substance","exampleTranslation":"水是一種化學物質。","reference":{"eng":"substance","kk":"/ˈsʌbstəns/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['物質；材料'], ['實質；要旨'], ['（論點、計畫等的）重要性；意義'], ['（非法）藥物']]","chEntries":["物質","材料","實質","要旨","重要性","意義","藥物"],"practiceMeaning":"水是一種化學物質。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'substantia'，意為 'being, essence, material'，來自 'subsistere' (to stand under, to exist)，由 'sub-' (under) 和 'sistere' (to stand) 構成。核心意為『立足於下』、『存在』。1. 指『物質、材料』，有形的、構成事物的東西。2. 指事物的『實質、要旨』，內在的內容而非形式。3. 指『重要性、意義』，有實質內容，有價值。4. 指具有精神作用的『藥物』，強調其作為一種『物質』對人的影響。","definition":"a type of solid liquid, or gas that is made of a particular combination of atoms and that makes up all matter; the most important part of something; importance or value","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Water is a chemical substance.\",\n    \"ch\": \"水是一種化學物質。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The report lacks substance and is full of vague statements.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這份報告缺乏實質內容，充滿了含糊不清的陳述。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He had a substance abuse problem.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他有藥物濫用問題。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His argument has a lot of substance.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的論點很有分量。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"水是一種化學物質。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5864,"wordRef":"字彙王::u58::tackle::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ was successful.","expectedAnswer":"tackle","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ was successful.","clozeAnswer":"tackle","exampleTranslation":"那次阻截很成功。","reference":{"eng":"tackle","kk":"ˈtækl","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"處理\"  ],  [    \"阻截\"  ],  [    \"裝備\"  ],  [    \"漁具\"  ],  [    \"工具\"  ]]","chEntries":["處理","阻截","裝備","漁具","工具"],"practiceMeaning":"那次阻截很成功。","analysis":"此名詞形式與動詞形式同源。當指「處理」或「阻截」時，是從動詞派生而來，表示「處理」或「阻截」的行為。在體育語境中，指「阻截」的動作。另一常見義是指「設備」或「工具」，特別是「釣魚用具」或「運動裝備」。此義的來源可能與「抓住」的原始概念有關，因為這些工具都是用來「抓住」或「操控」對象的。例如，也可指「釣魚的工具」。","definition":"1. The action of tackling in sports.; 2. Equipment used for a particular sport or activity, especially fishing.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The tackle was successful.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那次阻截很成功。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He bought new fishing tackle.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他買了新的釣魚裝備。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The football player made a great tackle.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那位足球運動員做出了一個精彩的阻截。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The tackle box contained various lures and hooks.\",\n    \"ch\": \"漁具箱裡裝有各種釣餌和魚鉤。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"那次阻截很成功。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U58"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4504,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::take::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Please ____ this book.","expectedAnswer":"take","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Please ____ this book.","clozeAnswer":"take","exampleTranslation":"請拿這本書。","reference":{"eng":"take","kk":"/teɪk/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['拿'], ['取得'], ['接受'], ['花費（時間、金錢）'], ['考慮'], ['採取（行動、措施）']]","chEntries":["拿","取得","接受","花費","考慮","採取"],"practiceMeaning":"請拿這本書。","analysis":"源自古英語 tacan，意為「抓住」、「獲得」。是一個非常核心且用途廣泛的動詞。其語意極其豐富，涵蓋了從具體的「獲取」、「攜帶」到抽象的「接受」、「考慮」、「採取」等。","definition":"1. To lay hold of (something) with one's hands; 2. To obtain possession of; 3. To accept or receive; 4. To spend or require (time or effort); 5. To consider or regard in a particular way; 6. To carry out or perform (an action or undertaking).","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please take this book.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請拿這本書。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It will take an hour to finish.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這需要一個小時才能完成。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to take action immediately.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們必須立即採取行動。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Do you take sugar in your coffee?\",\n    \"ch\": \"你的咖啡加糖嗎？\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"請拿這本書。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6199,"wordRef":"字彙王::u66::thesis::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She is writing her doctoral ____ on artificial intelligence.","expectedAnswer":"thesis","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She is writing her doctoral ____ on artificial intelligence.","clozeAnswer":"thesis","exampleTranslation":"她正在撰寫關於人工智能的博士論文。","reference":{"eng":"thesis","kk":"ˈθiːsɪs","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"論文\"  ],  [    \"論點\"  ],  [    \"學說\"  ]]","chEntries":["論文","論點","學說"],"practiceMeaning":"她正在撰寫關於人工智能的博士論文。","analysis":"此字源自古希臘語 θέσις (thesis)，意為「放置、安排、主張」，與 θεῖναι (theinai)「放置」同源。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根。作為名詞，其核心語