運輸。與名詞的「渡輪」概念直接相關。","definition":"to transport (someone or something) by ferry.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The ferry will carry cars and passengers across the bay.\",\n    \"ch\": \"渡輪將載運汽車和乘客橫渡海灣。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They ferried supplies to the remote village.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們用渡船運送物資到偏遠的村莊。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"渡輪將載運汽車和乘客橫渡海灣。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U42"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6076,"wordRef":"字彙王::u64::fiscal::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The government announced new ____ policies.","expectedAnswer":"fiscal","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The government announced new ____ policies.","clozeAnswer":"fiscal","exampleTranslation":"政府宣布了新的財政政策。","reference":{"eng":"fiscal","kk":"ˈfɪskəl","tense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"財政的\"  ],  [    \"財政上的\"  ],  [    \"稅收的\"  ]]","chEntries":["財政的","財政上的","稅收的"],"practiceMeaning":"政府宣布了新的財政政策。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 fiscus，意為「籃子，錢箱」，特別是「國庫」或「公共財政」。核心語義與「財政」、「稅收」、「公共金庫」相關。Fiscal 作為形容詞，用來修飾與政府的收入、支出、預算、稅務和貨幣政策相關的事務。","definition":"relating to government revenue, especially taxes.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The government announced new fiscal policies.\",\n    \"ch\": \"政府宣布了新的財政政策。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company's fiscal year ends in December.\",\n    \"ch\": \"公司的財政年度於十二月結束。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Fiscal responsibility is important for economic stability.\",\n    \"ch\": \"財政責任對經濟穩定很重要。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"政府宣布了新的財政政策。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U64"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3984,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u3::flash::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"A ____ of lightning lit up the night.","expectedAnswer":"flash","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"A ____ of lightning lit up the night.","clozeAnswer":"flash","exampleTranslation":"一道閃電照亮了夜晚。","reference":{"eng":"flash","kk":"/flæʃ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['閃光', '閃光燈'], ['一陣', '瞬間'], ['（新聞）快訊', '（電視）閃報']]","chEntries":["閃光","閃光燈","一陣","瞬間","快訊","閃報"],"practiceMeaning":"一道閃電照亮了夜晚。","analysis":"詞源：同上。名詞指瞬間發生的光或事件。","definition":"1. a sudden brief burst of bright light; 2. a very short period of time; 3. a brief news report.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A flash of lightning lit up the night.\",\n    \"ch\": \"一道閃電照亮了夜晚。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"In a flash, he was gone.\",\n    \"ch\": \"瞬間，他就消失了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We received a flash report on the incident.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們收到了一份關於該事件的快訊。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"一道閃電照亮了夜晚。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5582,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l6::flaw::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The vase had a small ____ in the glaze.","expectedAnswer":"flaw","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The vase had a small ____ in the glaze.","clozeAnswer":"flaw","exampleTranslation":"這個花瓶的釉面有一個小瑕疵。","reference":{"eng":"flaw","kk":"flɔ","tense":"n.","ch":"[['缺點'], ['瑕疵'], ['裂痕'], ['缺陷']]","chEntries":["缺點","瑕疵","裂痕","缺陷"],"practiceMeaning":"這個花瓶的釉面有一個小瑕疵。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 \"flau\"，詞源不甚確定，可能與古高地德語 \"flāh\"（flat, smooth，平坦的，光滑的）或與 \"flow\"（流動）有關。原始語義可能與「表面不平坦」或「中間有裂縫」有關。因此，\"flaw\" 的核心語義是指「某物的不完美之處」，特別是「一個細微的、可能影響整體功能的缺陷或裂痕」。它可以是物理上的（e.g., a flaw in a diamond），也可以是抽象上的（e.g., a flaw in an argument）。","definition":"1. A mark, blemish, or other imperfection which mars a substance or object; 2. An instance of being imperfect or defective; 3. A weakness in a person's character.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The vase had a small flaw in the glaze.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個花瓶的釉面有一個小瑕疵。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His argument had a serious flaw.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的論點有一個嚴重的缺陷。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Despite this flaw, the plan was generally well-received.\",\n    \"ch\": \"儘管有這個缺點，這個計畫總體上還是受到好評。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這個花瓶的釉面有一個小瑕疵。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5581,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l6::flawless::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Her performance was ____.","expectedAnswer":"flawless","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Her performance was ____.","clozeAnswer":"flawless","exampleTranslation":"她的演出無可挑剔。","reference":{"eng":"flawless","kk":"ˈflɔlɪs","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['無瑕疵的'], ['完美的'], ['無可挑剔的']]","chEntries":["無瑕疵的","完美的","無可挑剔的"],"practiceMeaning":"她的演出無可挑剔。","analysis":"此字由名詞 \"flaw\" 加上否定字尾 \"-less\" 構成。\"flaw\" 源自古法語 \"flau\"，可能來自古高地德語 \"flāh\"（flat, smooth，平坦的，光滑的），或與 \"flow\"（流動）有關，引申為「缺陷、裂痕」。\"-less\" 是常見的否定字尾，表示「沒有」。因此，\"flawless\" 的核心語義是「沒有任何缺陷、裂痕或瑕疵」。它強調事物達到了完美的狀態，無可挑剔。","definition":"1. Without any blemishes or imperfections; perfect; 2. Without a fault or defect.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her performance was flawless.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她的演出無可挑剔。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The diamond was flawless.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這顆鑽石無瑕疵。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He made a flawless execution of the plan.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他完美地執行了這個計畫。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她的演出無可挑剔。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6122,"wordRef":"字彙王::u65::fluency::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She speaks English with great ____.","expectedAnswer":"fluency","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She speaks English with great ____.","clozeAnswer":"fluency","exampleTranslation":"她能流利地說英語。","reference":{"eng":"fluency","kk":"ˈfluːənsi","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"流利\"  ],  [    \"流暢\"  ],  [    \"流利性\"  ]]","chEntries":["流利","流暢","流利性"],"practiceMeaning":"她能流利地說英語。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 fluēns，是 fluere（流動）的現在分詞。構詞上，fluere 的核心語義是「流動」。此名詞表示說話或寫作時的流利、順暢，沒有停頓或困難。也可指事物或過程的流暢性。其語意演變是從具體的「流動」到抽象的「說話順暢」。","definition":"1. the ability to speak or write a language easily, smoothly, and expressively; 2. the quality of flowing easily or smoothly.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\":