的', '不清晰的']]","chEntries":["有霧的","霧濛濛的","模糊的","不清晰的"],"practiceMeaning":"那是一個有霧的早晨，所以我們看不到山。","analysis":"由 'fog' (霧) 加上形容詞字尾 '-y' 構成。\n    1. 有霧的：指天氣有霧，能見度低。\n    2. 模糊的、不清晰的：引申為思路、理解或記憶不清，如同在霧中一樣。","definition":"1. (of the weather or a place) full of fog; misty.; 2. (of a person's thoughts or memory) confused or unclear.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It was a foggy morning, so we couldn't see the mountains.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那是一個有霧的早晨，所以我們看不到山。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I'm a bit foggy on the details of the plan.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我對計劃的細節有點模糊。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The driver couldn't see well because of the foggy conditions.\",\n    \"ch\": \"由於霧濛濛的狀況，司機看不清楚。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"那是一個有霧的早晨，所以我們看不到山。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U11"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4687,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u17::fold::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Please ____ the laundry neatly.","expectedAnswer":"fold","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Please ____ the laundry neatly.","clozeAnswer":"fold","exampleTranslation":"請把衣服整齊地摺好。","reference":{"eng":"fold","kk":"/ˈfoʊld/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['摺疊'], ['（軍隊）集合'], ['（企業、組織）倒閉、停業'], ['（雙手）抱住、攏住']]","chEntries":["摺疊","集合","倒閉、停業","抱住、攏住"],"practiceMeaning":"請把衣服整齊地摺好。","analysis":"源自古英語 *fealdan*，與 'fold'（柵欄）同源，表示「重複」、「包圍」。核心是將東西對摺或層疊。引申至軍事上的集合（將士兵收攏），商業上的終止營運（公司無法維持），或用手臂將人或物擁入懷中。","definition":"1. To bend something over on itself so that one part covers another. 2. (of an army or organization) To cease to be effective or organized; to disband or collapse. 3. To bring one's arms together around someone or something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please fold the laundry neatly.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請把衣服整齊地摺好。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company folded after only two years in business.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家公司經營兩年後就倒閉了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She folded her child in her arms.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她把孩子摟在懷裡。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslati