ranged or organized; 2. the size, shape, or arrangement of something; 3. a particular way in which something is presented or published.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The report needs to be in a specific format.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這份報告需要採用特定的格式。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The book's format makes it easy to read.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這本書的版面設計易於閱讀。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to decide on the format for the presentation.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要決定簡報的編排形式。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這份報告需要採用特定的格式。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U60"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4124,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::frank::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He gave a ____ assessment of the situation.","expectedAnswer":"frank","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He gave a ____ assessment of the situation.","clozeAnswer":"frank","exampleTranslation":"他對情況做了坦白的評估。","reference":{"eng":"frank","kk":"/fræŋk/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['坦白的', '直率的']]","chEntries":["坦白的","直率的"],"practiceMeaning":"他對情況做了坦白的評估。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 francus（自由的，不受約束的），後引申為「誠實的」。核心概念是「不受隱瞞、真誠」。","definition":"1. open, direct, and unreserved in speech or expression; 2. (of a letter or document) delivered openly and without secrecy","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He gave a frank assessment of the situation.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他對情況做了坦白的評估。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I appreciate your frank opinion.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我欣賞你直率的意見。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She was frank with him about her feelings.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她對他坦誠了她的感受。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他對情況做了坦白的評估。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3877,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u1::fright::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The loud noise gave me a ____.","expectedAnswer":"fright","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The loud noise gave me a ____.","clozeAnswer":"fright","exampleTranslation":"巨大的聲響嚇了我一跳。","reference":{"eng":"fright","kk":"/fraɪt/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['驚恐', '恐懼'], ['驚嚇']]","chEntries":["驚恐","恐懼","驚嚇"],"practiceMeaning":"巨大的聲響嚇了我一跳。","analysis":"源自古英語 'fyrhto'，與 'fear' (恐懼) 同源。核心是強烈的恐懼感。指突然而來的、強烈的恐懼，常由某事或某物引起。","definition":"1. a sudden, intense feeling of fear. 2. the cause of sudden fear.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The loud noise gave me a fright.\",\n    \"ch\": \"巨大的聲響嚇了我一跳。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She looked at him in fright.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她驚恐地看著他。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He jumped back in fright.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他因驚嚇而向後跳。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"巨大的聲響嚇了我一跳。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4322,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::fuel::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We need to ____ the generator before the storm.","expectedAnswer":"fuel","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We need to ____ the generator before the storm.","clozeAnswer":"fuel","exampleTranslation":"我們需要在風暴來臨前為發電機加燃料。","reference":{"eng":"fuel","kk":"/ˈfjuːəl/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['加燃料；提供燃料'], ['（使）加劇；鼓動']]","chEntries":["加燃料","提供燃料","加劇","鼓動"],"practiceMeaning":"我們需要在風暴來臨前為發電機加燃料。","analysis":"動詞形式源自名詞 'fuel'。1. 意為『為…加燃料』，供應燃燒或運轉所需的物質。2. 作為比喻用法，意為『加劇；鼓動』，指為某種情感、衝突或活動提供動力，使其更加強烈或活躍。","definition":"to supply an aircraft, ship, or other vehicle with fuel; to increase or make a feeling stronger","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to fuel the generator before the storm.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要在風暴來臨前為發電機加燃料。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The rumors fueled public anger.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這些謠言加劇了公眾的憤怒。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The factory was fueled by coal.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家工廠以煤炭為燃料。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們需要在風暴來臨前為發電機加燃料。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3155,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::funeral::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We attended the ____ of our close friend.","expectedAnswer":"funeral","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We attended the ____ of our close friend.","clozeAnswer":"funeral","exampleTranslation":"我們參加了我們摯友的葬禮。","reference":{"eng":"funeral","kk":"/ˈfjuːnərəl/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['葬禮；喪禮']]","chEntries":["葬禮","喪禮"],"practiceMeaning":"我們參加了我們摯友的葬禮。","analysis":"詞源來自拉丁語 'funus'，意為「喪禮，屍體」。'Funeral' 指的是為死者舉行的儀式，通常包括告別、埋葬或火化等環節。它是一個與死亡、哀悼和紀念相關的莊重儀式。","definition":"a ceremony for burying or cremating a dead person.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We attended the funeral of our close friend.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們參加了我們摯友的葬禮。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The funeral procession moved slowly through the town.\",\n    \"ch\": \"送葬隊伍緩慢地穿過城鎮。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She wore black to the funeral as a sign of mourning.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她穿著黑色的衣服參加葬禮，以示哀悼。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們參加了我們摯友的葬禮。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U40"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3157,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::generosity::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Her ____ in helping the homeless was admirable.","expectedAnswer":"generosity","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Her ____ in helping the homeless was admirable.","clozeAnswer":"generosity","exampleTranslation":"她幫助無家可歸者的慷慨令人欽佩。","reference":{"eng":"generosity","kk":"/ˌdʒɛnəˈrɒsɪtɪ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['慷慨；大方'], ['（尤指對窮人）慷慨的捐贈']]","chEntries":["慷慨","大方","慷慨的捐贈"],"practiceMeaning":"她幫助無家可歸者的慷慨令人欽佩。","analysis":"名詞，源自形容詞 'generous'。'Generosity' 是指樂於給予、分享或幫助他人的品質，特別是慷慨地付出金錢、時間或情感，且不求回報。它強調的是一種寬宏大量、無私的品格。","definition":"the quality of being kind and generous; the quality of being willing to give more of something, especially money, than is expected or needed.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her generosity in helping the homeless was admirable.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她幫助無家可歸者的慷慨令人欽佩。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We were touched by the generosity of the donors.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們對捐助者的慷慨深受感動。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The generosity of spirit shown by the community was inspiring.\",\n    \"ch\": \"社區所展現的精神上的慷慨鼓舞人心。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她幫助無家可歸者的慷慨令人欽佩。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U40"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3158,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::generous::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is a ____ donor to many charities.","expectedAnswer":"generous","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is a ____ donor to many charities.","clozeAnswer":"generous","exampleTranslation":"他是許多慈善機構的慷慨捐助者。","reference":{"eng":"generous","kk":"/ˈdʒɛnərəs/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['慷慨的；大方的'], ['（尺寸、數量等）豐富的，寬大的'], ['（思想、氣度等）寬宏的']]","chEntries":["慷慨的","大方的","豐富的，寬大的","寬宏的"],"practiceMeaning":"他是許多慈善機構的慷慨捐助者。","analysis":"詞源來自拉丁語 'generosus'，意為「出身高貴的，慷慨的」。'Generous' 形容的是一個人樂於給予、分享，並且不吝嗇。其語意也延伸至描述尺寸、份量或提供的東西非常豐富、充足，或是一種寬宏大量、不計較的態度。","definition":"1. showing a readiness to give more of something, especially money, than is strictly necessary or expected; 2. (of a thing) larger or more plentiful than is usual or necessary; 3. showing kindness and openness of mind.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is a generous donor to many charities.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是許多慈善機構的慷慨捐助者。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The restaurant served generous portions of food.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家餐廳提供的份量很豐富。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She has a generous spirit and always tries to help others.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她有著寬宏的 spirit，總是試圖幫助他人。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他是許多慈善機構的慷慨捐助者。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U40"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4072,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u4::gesture::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He made a welcoming ____.","expectedAnswer":"gesture","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He made a welcoming ____.","clozeAnswer":"gesture","exampleTranslation":"他做了一個歡迎的手勢。","reference":{"eng":"gesture","kk":"/ˈdʒɛstʃər/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['手勢', '姿態'], ['表示', '姿態（尤指善意的）']]","chEntries":["手勢","姿態","表示"],"practiceMeaning":"他做了一個歡迎的手勢。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'gestus'，是 'gerere' (to carry, to bear, to do) 的過去分詞。核心是「做」、「執行」。因此，'gesture' 指通過身體動作（尤其是手和頭）來表達意思的「手勢」或「姿態」，也指為了表示某種情感或意圖而做的「表示」或「姿態」。","definition":"1. a movement of your hand or body to express an idea or meaning; 2. an action that you take in order to show your feelings or intentions","example":"[\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"他做了一個歡迎的手勢。\",\n    \"eng\": \"He made a welcoming gesture.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"她善意的姿態非常受讚賞。\",\n    \"eng\": \"Her gesture of kindness was much appreciated.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"他舉起手，表示投降。\",\n    \"eng\": \"He raised his hand in a gesture of surrender.\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他做了一個歡迎的手勢。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4546,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u11::guidance::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She received excellent ____ from her mentor.","expectedAnswer":"guidance","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She received excellent ____ from her mentor.","clozeAnswer":"guidance","exampleTranslation":"她從導師那裡得到了極好的指導。","reference":{"eng":"guidance","kk":"/ˈɡaɪdəns/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['指導', '引導'], ['建議', '意見']]","chEntries":["指導","引導","建議","意見"],"practiceMeaning":"她從導師那裡得到了極好的指導。","analysis":"由 'guide' (指導) 加上名詞字尾 '-ance' (表示狀態、行為) 構成。 'guide' 源自古法語 'guider'，最終源自日耳曼語，意為 'to show the way' (指引方向)。 'guidance' 指提供方向、建議或幫助的行為或過程。","definition":"1. advice or information aimed at resolving a problem or difficulty.; 2. the process of showing or telling someone the way to a place or destination.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She received excellent guidance from her mentor.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她從導師那裡得到了極好的指導。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The teacher provided guidance on how to write the essay.\",\n    \"ch\": \"老師就如何寫論文提供了指導。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need clear guidance on this matter.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要關於這件事的明確指導。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她從導師那裡得到了極好的指導。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U11"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4211,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::handsome::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is a tall, ____ man.","expectedAnswer":"handsome","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is a tall, ____ man.","clozeAnswer":"handsome","exampleTranslation":"他是一位高大英俊的男人。","reference":{"eng":"handsome","kk":"/ˈhænsəm/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['英俊的；漂亮的（用於男性）'], ['（物體、建築）好看的；體面的'], ['（金額）相當可觀的；豐厚的']]","chEntries":["英俊的","漂亮的","好看的","體面的","相當可觀的","豐厚的"],"practiceMeaning":"他是一位高大英俊的男人。","analysis":"詞源不確定，可能與古英語 'hæðnes'（健康）有關，強調“健壯”的特質。1. “英俊的”指外表吸引人，通常用於男性。2. “好看的；體面的”形容物體或建築物外觀令人愉悅。3. “相當可觀的；豐厚的”是抽象意義，指金額大，令人滿意。","definition":"1. good-looking (esp. of a man); 2. good in appearance or pleasing to look at (esp. of things or buildings); 3. (of a sum of money) large or impressive.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is a tall, handsome man.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是一位高大英俊的男人。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They bought a handsome antique desk.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們買了一張漂亮的古董書桌。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She received a handsome inheritance.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她繼承了一筆可觀的遺產。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他是一位高大英俊的男人。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3092,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::harsh::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The teacher gave him ____ criticism.","expectedAnswer":"harsh","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The teacher gave him ____ criticism.","clozeAnswer":"harsh","exampleTranslation":"老師對他進行了嚴厲的批評。","reference":{"eng":"harsh","kk":"/hɑːrʃ/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['嚴厲的；殘酷的'], ['刺耳的；粗糙的'], ['嚴酷的（天氣、條件）']]","chEntries":["嚴厲的","殘酷的","刺耳的","粗糙的","嚴酷的"],"practiceMeaning":"老師對他進行了嚴厲的批評。","analysis":"起源不明，可能與古挪威語 'harskr' (dry) 有關。核心意義是「不舒適」或「令人不快」。\n1. 嚴厲的；殘酷的：指對待人或事物的方式不寬容、不友好、或過於嚴苛。\n2. 刺耳的；粗糙的：指聲音不悅耳，或觸感粗糙，令人不適。\n3. 嚴酷的（天氣、條件）：指天氣惡劣，環境艱難，難以忍受。","definition":"1. unpleasantly rough or shocking to the senses; 2. severe or cruel; 3. (of a sound or voice) unpleasantly harsh or grating.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The teacher gave him harsh criticism.\",\n    \"ch\": \"老師對他進行了嚴厲的批評。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The desert climate is harsh.\",\n    \"ch\": \"沙漠氣候十分嚴酷。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The noise was harsh and loud.\",\n    \"ch\": \"噪音刺耳而響亮。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"老師對他進行了嚴厲的批評。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U39"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5480,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l4::harvest::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The farmers rejoiced at the abundant ____.","expectedAnswer":"harvest","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The farmers rejoiced at the abundant ____.","clozeAnswer":"harvest","exampleTranslation":"農民們為豐收而歡欣鼓舞。","reference":{"eng":"harvest","kk":"ˈhɑrvəst","tense":"n.","ch":"[['收成'], ['收穫'], ['收割']]","chEntries":["收成","收穫","收割"],"practiceMeaning":"農民們為豐收而歡欣鼓舞。","analysis":"此字源自古英語 'hærfest'，與許多日耳曼語族語言（如荷蘭語 'herfst'，德語 'Herbst'）中表示「秋天」的詞相關。最初，'harvest' 指的是「秋季」，因為這是農作物收成的季節。隨著時間演變，'harvest' 的主要語意轉移到了「收成」或「收穫」這個動作和結果上，也保留了「秋季」或「收割季節」的含義。核心語意是「農作物成熟並被收割的季節或過程」。","definition":"1. The process or period of gathering in crops.; 2. The crops gathered (esp. during an autumn harvest).; 3. The season when ripened crops are gathered.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The farmers rejoiced at the abundant harvest.\",\n    \"ch\": \"農民們為豐收而歡欣鼓舞。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This year's harvest was particularly good.\",\n    \"ch\": \"今年的收成特別好。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They celebrated the harvest festival.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們慶祝了豐收節。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"農民們為豐收而歡欣鼓舞。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3935,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u2::hateful::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He made a ____ remark about her.","expectedA