zeSentence":"Millions of people fought for their ____.","clozeAnswer":"liberty","exampleTranslation":"數百萬人為他們的自由而戰。","reference":{"eng":"liberty","kk":"/ˈlɪbərti/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['自由'], ['（對規則、禮節等的）失禮；過分鹵莽']]","chEntries":["自由","失禮","過分鹵莽"],"practiceMeaning":"數百萬人為他們的自由而戰。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'libertas' (freedom)，來自 'liber' (free)。核心是『自由』的概念。1. 指享有政治、社會、個人不受約束的權利和狀態，即『自由』。2. 指過度行使自由，不受約束，導致『失禮』或『鹵莽』的行為，超過了應有的界限。","definition":"the state of being free to make your own choices and decisions and to live as you want to live; freedom to behave or act in a way you choose","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Millions of people fought for their liberty.\",\n    \"ch\": \"數百萬人為他們的自由而戰。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Students were given more liberty in choosing their courses.\",\n    \"ch\": \"學生們在選擇課程方面被賦予了更多的自由。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He took the liberty of borrowing my car without asking.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他擅自借了我的車，沒有經過我的允許。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"數百萬人為他們的自由而戰。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4000,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u3::look::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Her ____ of surprise was evident.","expectedAnswer":"look","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Her ____ of surprise was evident.","clozeAnswer":"look","exampleTranslation":"她驚訝的神情很明顯。","reference":{"eng":"look","kk":"/lʊk/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['外觀', '樣子'], ['神情', '表情'], ['（時尚）潮流']]","chEntries":["外觀","樣子","神情","表情","潮流"],"practiceMeaning":"她驚訝的神情很明顯。","analysis":"詞源：同上。名詞形式，指外表、給人印象的樣子，或流行風格。","definition":"1. the outward appearance or visible aspect of a person or thing; 2. a particular facial expression; 3. a style or fashion.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her look of surprise was evident.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她驚訝的神情很明顯。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The new look for the season is all about bright colors.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這一季的新造型是關於鮮豔的色彩。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她驚訝的神情很明顯。","sourceNa