es":[],"clozeSentence":"The company is building a new oil ____.","clozeAnswer":"pipeline","exampleTranslation":"該公司正在建造新的輸油管道。","reference":{"eng":"pipeline","kk":"ˈpaɪplaɪn","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"管道\"  ],  [    \"管線\"  ],  [    \"輸出管道\"  ],  [    \"輸送系統\"  ]]","chEntries":["管道","管線","輸出管道","輸送系統"],"practiceMeaning":"該公司正在建造新的輸油管道。","analysis":"此字為複合詞，由 pipeline（水管）和 line（線）組成。pipe 意為「管子」，line 意為「線；管道」。因此，pipeline 的核心語義是「輸送液體或氣體的管道」。modern 用法常引申為「生產線」、「供應鏈」或「預備供應的來源」，尤指項目、產品或資源正在發展或輸送中。","definition":"1. a long pipe, typically underground, for transporting liquids or gases over long distances; 2. a system or process through which something is conveyed or transmitted; a channel for conveying information or resources.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company is building a new oil pipeline.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司正在建造新的輸油管道。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We have several new projects in the pipeline.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們有幾個新項目正在籌備中。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The pipeline ensures a steady supply of natural gas.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這條管線確保了天然氣的穩定供應。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"該公司正在建造新的輸油管道。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U65"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6133,"wordRef":"字彙王::u65::pitcher::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She poured water from the ____.","expectedAnswer":"pitcher","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She poured water from the ____.","clozeAnswer":"pitcher","exampleTranslation":"她從壺裡倒了水。","reference":{"eng":"pitcher","kk":"ˈpɪtʃər","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"投手\"  ],  [    \"罐子\"  ],  [    \"壺\"  ]]","chEntries":["投手","罐子","壺"],"practiceMeaning":"她從壺裡倒了水。","analysis":"此字有兩主要詞源。一源自古法語 pichier，意為「帶柄的水罐」，來自拉丁語 picta，意為「繪製的」（指罐上的裝飾），向上可追溯至 pey（繪畫）。此義項指帶有把手和壺嘴的容器。另一源自 pitch（投擲），指在棒球運動中投球的人。因此，此字有兩個不同的語義分支，但構詞上並無直接關聯。","definition":"1. a container, typically with a handle and spout, for serving drinks; 2. a player in baseball or softball who throws the ball from the pitcher's mound toward the catcher.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She poured water from the pitcher.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她從壺裡倒了水。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The star pitcher threw a perfect game.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位明星投手投出了一場無失分比賽。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He filled the pitcher with lemonade.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他把罐子裝滿了檸檬水。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她從壺裡倒了水。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U65"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3924,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u2::playful::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ puppy chased its tail.","expectedAnswer":"playful","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ puppy chased its tail.","clozeAnswer":"playful","exampleTranslation":"那隻愛玩的幼犬追著自己的尾巴。","reference":{"eng":"playful","kk":"/ˈpleɪfəl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['愛玩的', '嬉戲的'], ['戲謔的'], ['有趣的']]","chEntries":["愛玩的","嬉戲的","戲謔的","有趣的"],"practiceMeaning":"那隻愛玩的幼犬追著自己的尾巴。","analysis":"源自古英語 'plæġful'，由 'plæġa' (意為「遊戲」) 和 '-ful' (形容詞後綴) 組成。指喜歡玩耍、嬉戲的；也可指以戲弄、開玩笑的態度，或形容事物活潑有趣。","definition":"1. fond of games and fun; full of playfulness; 2. (of a person or their behavior) light-hearted and not serious; 3. (of an animal) energetic and lively.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The playful puppy chased its tail.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那隻愛玩的幼犬追著自己的尾巴。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He made a playful remark about her new hairstyle.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他對她的新髮型開了個玩笑。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The music had a playful, lighthearted quality.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這音樂具有一種活潑、輕鬆的特質。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"那隻愛玩的幼犬追著自己的尾巴。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6182,"wordRef":"字彙王::u66::pledge::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He made a ____ to donate money.","expectedAnswer":"pledge","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He made a ____ to donate money.","clozeAnswer":"pledge","exampleTranslation":"他承諾捐款。","reference":{"eng":"pledge","kk":"plɛdʒ","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"保證\"  ],  [    \"承諾\"  ],  [    \"誓言\"  ],  [    \"抵押品\"  ]]","chEntries":["保證","承諾","誓言","抵押品"],"practiceMeaning":"他承諾捐款。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 plege，意為「保證、抵押品」。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根。作為名詞，其核心語義是由動詞 pledge「保證、承諾、抵押」名詞化而來，指「一個鄭重的承諾或保證」，或「被用作擔保的物品」。詞源中的「抵押品」概念是其核心，引申出「承諾」和「擔保」的意義。","definition":"1. a solemn promise or undertaking; 2. something given as security for a loan or debt.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He made a pledge to donate money.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他承諾捐款。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The pledge was met with skepticism.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個承諾受到了懷疑。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She gave her necklace as a pledge.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她將項鍊作為抵押品。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The candidate made a pledge to lower taxes.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位候選人承諾減稅。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他承諾捐款。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U66"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5472,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l4::plenty::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We have ____ of time.","expectedAnswer":"plenty","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We have ____ of time.","clozeAnswer":"plenty","exampleTranslation":"我們有充裕的時間。","reference":{"eng":"plenty","kk":"ˈplɛnti","tense":"n.","ch":"[['充足'], ['豐富'], ['大量']]","chEntries":["充足","豐富","大量"],"practiceMeaning":"我們有充裕的時間。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 'plente'，意為「滿足、充足」，來自拉丁語 'plenitas'（充滿），'plenus'（滿的）。最初在中古英語中，'plenty' 既可用作名詞，表示「充足、豐富」，也可作形容詞，表示「充足的」。作為名詞，它強調的是「足夠或超出需求的量」，即「充足、富裕」。它可以指物質上的充足，也可以指抽象意義上的充裕。","definition":"1. A large or sufficient amount or quantity; more than enough.; 2. Abundance.; 3. A state of abundance.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We have plenty of time.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們有充裕的時間。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There is plenty of food for everyone.\",\n    \"ch\": \"每個人都有足夠的食物。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She has plenty of talent.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她有豐富的才能。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們有充裕的時間。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4684,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u17::plug::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Make sure the TV ____ is firmly in the socket.","expectedAnswer":"plug","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Make sure the TV ____ is firmly in the socket.","clozeAnswer":"plug","exampleTranslation":"確保電視插頭牢固地插在插座裡。","reference":{"eng":"plug","kk":"/ˈplʌɡ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['插頭'], ['塞子'], ['（非正式）廣告推銷']]","chEntries":["插頭","塞子","廣告推銷"],"practiceMeaning":"確保電視插頭牢固地插在插座裡。","analysis":"源自古英語 *ploc*，意為「樹樁」、「木塊」，可能與堵塞、連接的概念有關。第一義指電器連接電源的裝置；第二義指用來堵塞孔洞的物體。第三義則引申為對某事物的推銷或宣傳。","definition":"1. A device inserted into a socket to make an electrical connection. 2. A piece of material used to stop up a hole or opening. 3. (informal) An act of advertising or promoting something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Make sure the TV plug is firmly in the socket.\",\n    \"ch\": \"確保電視插頭牢固地插在插座裡。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He put a plug in the hole to stop the leak.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他用塞子堵住洞以阻止洩漏。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The movie had a lot of product plugs.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這部電影有很多產品置入性行銷。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"確保電視插頭牢固地插在插座裡。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U17"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5797,"wordRef":"字彙王::u60::poetic::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The sunset cast a ____ glow over the landscape.","expectedAnswer":"poetic","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The sunset cast a ____ glow over the landscape.","clozeAnswer":"poetic","exampleTranslation":"夕陽為大地投下詩意的光輝。","reference":{"eng":"poetic","kk":"poʊˈɛtɪk","tense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"詩的\"  ],  [    \"詩意的\"  ],  [    \"詩人般的\"  ]]","chEntries":["詩的","詩意的","詩人般的"],"practiceMeaning":"夕陽為大地投下詩意的光輝。","analysis":"此字為形容詞，構詞自poet（詩人）+ -ic（形容詞字尾，表示「關於……的；具有……性質的」）。poet源自古希臘語poiētēs（創作者，詩人），來自poiein（製作；創造）。-ic字尾源自拉丁語-icus。因此，poetic的核心語義是指「與詩歌有關的」，或「具有詩歌的特質」，例如優美、富有想像力、富含情感等。語意演變上，從「詩歌的」具體意義，擴展到「富含詩意」的抽象描述。","definition":"1. relating to or characteristic of poets or poetry; 2. having an appropriate quality or style for poetry; 3. having an imaginative or expressive quality.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The sunset cast a poetic glow over the landscape.\",\n    \"ch\": \"夕陽為大地投下詩意的光輝。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She wrote a poetic description of her childhood.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她寫了一段詩意般地描述她的童年。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The poem uses simple language but has a powerful poetic effect.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這首詩語言樸素，卻有強烈的詩意效果。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"夕陽為大地投下詩意的光輝。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U60"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4187,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::practical::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"This is a ____ solution to the problem.","expectedAnswer":"practical","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This is a ____ solution to the problem.","clozeAnswer":"practical","exampleTranslation":"這是解決問題的一個實際的方案。","reference":{"eng":"practical","kk":"/ˈpræktɪkl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['實際的；實用的'], ['傾向於做的；合乎實際的'], ['（有）實際經驗的']]","chEntries":["實際的","實用的","傾向於做的","合乎實際的","實際經驗的"],"practiceMeaning":"這是解決問題的一個實際的方案。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 practicus，意為“實踐的，活躍的”，來自希臘語 prassein，意為“做”。核心概念是與“做”或“行動”相關。1. “實際的”強調與理論相對，基於實際情況，具有實用價值。2. “合乎實際的”強調可行性，不脫離現實。3. “有實際經驗的”強調親身實踐的知識，而非僅僅理論。","definition":"1. concerned with the actual doing or using of something rather than with theory and ideas; 2. sensible and realistic in dealing with matters; 3. having or involving practical knowledge or skill.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is a practical solution to the problem.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是解決問題的一個實際的方案。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need a practical approach, not just theories.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要一種實用的方法，而不僅僅是理論。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is very practical and good at managing household affairs.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她非常務實，很擅長管理家務。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這是解決問題的一個實際的方案。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U6、L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4210,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::price::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"What is the ____ of this book?","expectedAnswer":"price","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"What is the ____ of this book?","clozeAnswer":"price","exampleTranslation":"這本書的價格是多少？","reference":{"eng":"price","kk":"/praɪs/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['價格'], ['（為獲得某物所付出的）代價']]","chEntries":["價格","代價"],"practiceMeaning":"這本書的價格是多少？","analysis":"源自古法語 pris，意為“獎勵，價值”，來自拉丁語 pretium（價格，價值）。核心是某物或某事的價值評估。1. “價格”是指商品或服務的貨幣價值。2. “代價”是抽象意義，指為了達成某事而必須付出的努力、犧牲或其他成本。","definition":"1. the amount of money expected, required, or given in payment for something; 2. the cost, especially in terms of effort or sacrifice, incurred in achieving or obtaining something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"What is the price of this book?\",\n    \"ch\": \"這本書的價格是多少？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He learned the hard way the price of dishonesty.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他通過慘痛的教訓明白了不誠實的代價。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The price of success is hard work.\",\n    \"ch\": \"成功的代價是辛勤的工作。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這本書的價格是多少？","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5485,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l4::private::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He prefers to keep his personal life ____.","expectedAnswer":"private","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He prefers to keep his personal life ____.","clozeAnswer":"private","exampleTranslation":"他傾向於保守個人隱私。","reference":{"eng":"private","kk":"ˈpraɪvət","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['私人的'], ['私有的'], ['秘密的']]","chEntries":["私人的","私有的","秘密的"],"practiceMeaning":"他傾向於保守個人隱私。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'privatus'，是 'privare'（使失去、剝奪）的過去分詞。'Privare' 來自 'privus'（個人的、缺乏的）。'Privatus' 原意是「不屬於公職的」，引申為「屬於個人的、不公開的、私有的」。核心語意是「不屬於公眾、不公開、僅限於個人」。","definition":"1. Belonging to or for the use of one particular person or group rather than for public or general use.; 2. Not intended to be known or seen by the public.; 3. (Of a person) not employed in government or public service.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He prefers to keep his personal life private.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他傾向於保守個人隱私。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is a private matter, not for public discussion.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是私人事務，不宜公開討論。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She owns a private company.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她擁有一家私人公司。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他傾向於保守個人隱私。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3884,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u1::process::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The manufacturing ____ is complex.","expectedAnswer":"process","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The manufacturing ____ is complex.","clozeAnswer":"process","exampleTranslation":"製造過程很複雜。","reference":{"eng":"process","kk":"/ˈprɑːsɛs/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['過程', '程序'], ['手續']]","chEntries":["過程","程序","手續"],"practiceMeaning":"製造過程很複雜。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'processus'，'pro-' (forward) + 'cedere' (to go)。核心是「向前進行」。指一系列連續發生的事件、步驟或操作，以達成某種結果。","definition":"a series of actions or steps taken in order to achieve a particular end.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The manufacturing process is complex.\",\n    \"ch\": \"製造過程很複雜。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"What is the process for applying for a visa?\",\n    \"ch\": \"申請簽證的程序是什麼？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The digestion process breaks down food.\",\n    \"ch\": \"消化過程分解食物。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"製造過程很複雜。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4212,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::profit::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The company made a large ____ last year.","expectedAnswer":"profit","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company made a large ____ last year.","clozeAnswer":"profit","exampleTranslation":"公司去年盈利頗豐。","reference":{"eng":"profit","kk":"/ˈprɒfɪt/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['利潤；收益'], ['好處；益處']]","chEntries":["利潤","收益","好處","益處"],"practiceMeaning":"公司去年盈利頗豐。","analysis":"源自古法語 profit，意為“好處，進步”，來自拉丁語 profectus，'pro-'（向前）+ 'facere'（做）。字面意思是“向前做”，引申為“進步，成就，好處”。1. “利潤”是商業和金融領域的核心含義。2. “好處；益處”是更廣泛的意義，指任何有益的結果。","definition":"1. a financial gain, especially the difference between the amount earned and the amount spent in buying, operating, or producing something; 2. an advantage or benefit gained from something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company made a large profit last year.\",\n    \"ch\": \"公司去年盈利頗豐。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It's in our best interest to maximize profit.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們的最大利益在於將利潤最大化。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He found great profit in studying history.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在研究歷史中發現了很多益處。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"公司去年盈利頗豐。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3246,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::promise::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"I ____ to be there on time.","expectedAnswer":"promise","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"I ____ to be there on time.","clozeAnswer":"promise","exampleTranslation":"我保證準時到場。","reference":{"eng":"promise","kk":"/ˈprɑːmɪs/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['承諾'], ['保證'], ['預示']]","chEntries":["承諾","保證","預示"],"practiceMeaning":"我保證準時到場。","analysis":"動詞形式，指給予『諾言』或『承諾』。引申為『預示』某種情況或結果，尤其是有好的潛力。","definition":"1. declare that one will do or refrain from doing something; 2. give grounds for expecting or hoping that (something good) will happen.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I promise to be there on time.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我保證準時到場。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The weather forecast promises sunshine tomorrow.\",\n    \"ch\": \"天氣預報預示著明天會有陽光。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She promised him her support.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她向他保證了她的支持。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我保證準時到場。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U41"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3182,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::prosperity::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The nation enjoyed a period of economic ____.","expectedAnswer":"prosperity","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The nation enjoyed a period of economic ____.","clozeAnswer":"prosperity","exampleTranslation":"這個國家經歷了一段經濟繁榮時期。","reference":{"eng":"prosperity","kk":"/prɒˈspɛrɪtɪ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['繁榮；昌盛'], ['興旺；成功']]","chEntries":["繁榮","昌盛","興旺","成功"],"practiceMeaning":"這個國家經歷了一段經濟繁榮時期。","analysis":"名詞，源自形容詞 'prosperous'。指「繁榮」、「昌盛」或「興旺」的狀態，通常指經濟上的富裕、成功和順遂。它代表著一個國家、地區、企業或個人處於良好發展和成功的時期，生活富足。","definition":"1. the state of being successful, especially in making money; 2. wealth and success.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The nation enjoyed a period of economic prosperity.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個國家經歷了一段經濟繁榮時期。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We wish you health, happiness, and prosperity in the New Year.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們祝您在新的一年裡健康、快樂、興旺。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The industrial revolution brought great prosperity to many cities.\",\n    \"ch\": \"工業革命為許多城市帶來了巨大的繁榮。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這個國家經歷了一段經濟繁榮時期。","sourceName":"字彙王、龍騰課本","unitName":"U40、L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5596,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l7::protest::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Thousands joined the ____ against the government's policies.","expectedAnswer":"protest","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Thousands joined the ____ against the government's policies.","clozeAnswer":"protest","exampleTranslation":"數千人加入了抗議政府政策的遊行。","reference":{"eng":"protest","kk":"ˈproʊtɛst","tense":"n.","ch":"[['抗議'], ['抗議活動'], ['反對聲明']]","chEntries":["抗議","抗議活動","反對聲明"],"practiceMeaning":"數千人加入了抗議政府政策的遊行。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'protestari'，意為「公開聲明，作證」，由 'pro-'（公開地）和 'testari'（證明，作證）組成，後者又源於 'testis'（證人）。在構詞學上，此名詞形式是從動詞 'protest' 派生而來，透過零轉換 (zero derivation) 或內部構詞變化。詞源核心是「公開表明反對」。原始語意是「公開的聲明」，後來專指「公開表達不滿、反對的集體行動或聲明」。這與動詞形式的語意高度相關，但作為名詞