___ changes.","clozeAnswer":"radical","exampleTranslation":"這項提議要求進行根本性的改變。","reference":{"eng":"radical","kk":"ˈrædɪkl","tense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"激進的\"  ],  [    \"根本的\"  ],  [    \"徹底的\"  ],  [    \"主根的\"  ]]","chEntries":["激進的","根本的","徹底的","主根的"],"practiceMeaning":"這項提議要求進行根本性的改變。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'radicalis'，是 'radix' (root) 的派生詞。'Radix' 指「根」，引申為「基礎」、「起源」。'-al' 是常見的形容詞字尾。'Radical' 的核心語意與「根」相關，指「關於根部的」或「從根源來的」。這引申出「根本的」、「徹底的」意思，表示涉及事物最基本的部分。引申到政治或社會思想，則指追求根本性變革的「激進的」。例如，也可指「極端的」或「全面的」。","definition":"1. Relating to or affecting the fundamental nature of something; far-reaching or thorough.; 2. (of change or action) advocating or based on thorough or complete political or social change.; 3. Relating to the root of a plant or hair follicle.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The proposal calls for radical changes.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這項提議要求進行根本性的改變。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is known for his radical political views.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他以其激進的政治觀點而聞名。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is a radical solution to the problem.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是一個解決問題的徹底方案。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The dentist performed a radical surgery to remove the tumor.\",\n    \"ch\": \"牙醫進行了根除性手術以移除腫瘤。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這項提議要求進行根本性的改變。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U58"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4717,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u17::recorder::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He used a digital ____ to capture the lecture.","expectedAnswer":"recorder","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He used a digital ____ to capture the lecture.","clozeAnswer":"recorder","exampleTranslation":"他使用數位錄音機來錄下講座。","reference":{"eng":"recorder","kk":"/rɪˈkɔːrdər/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['錄音機'], ['紀錄者'], ['（樂器）直笛']]","chEntries":["錄音機","紀錄者","直笛"],"practiceMeaning":"他使用數位錄音機來錄下講座。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 *recordari*（記住），通過法語 *recordeur*（紀錄者）傳入。指能夠記錄聲音的設備。也指記錄信息的人，或一種在中世紀和文藝復興時期流行的木管樂器。","definition":"1. A device for recording sound. 2. A person who records or keeps records. 3. A musical instrument of the flute family.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He used a digital recorder to capture the lecture.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他使用數位錄音機來錄下講座。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The historian acted as the recorder of events.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位歷史學家擔任了事件的紀錄者。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She played the recorder beautifully.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她演奏的直笛非常優美。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他使用數位錄音機來錄下講座。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U17"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5518,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l5::recruit::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The company is looking to ____ new graduates.","expectedAnswer":"recruit","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company is looking to ____ new graduates.","clozeAnswer":"recruit","exampleTranslation":"公司正在尋找招募應屆畢業生。","reference":{"eng":"recruit","kk":"rɪˈkruːt","tense":"v.","ch":"[['招募'], ['招聘'], ['新兵'], ['新成員'], ['新成員']]","chEntries":["招募","招聘","新兵","新成員"],"practiceMeaning":"公司正在尋找招募應屆畢業生。","analysis":"此字源自法語 'recruter'，意為 'to enroll, to muster troops'。後者源自拉丁語 'recrescere'，由 're-' (again) + 'crescere' (to grow) 構成，意為「重新生長」。構詞上，'re-' 表示「再次」，'crut'（或 'cresc'）是 'crescere' 的詞幹，意為「生長、增加」。原始語義是指「使軍隊再次增長」或「招募新成員以補充」。現代英語中，'recruit' 擴展為「招募」任何人加入組織（軍隊、公司、團隊等），以及「招募」這個動作本身。","definition":"to enlist (someone) in the armed forces; to obtain (new members) for an organization; to gain (new adherents or supporters).","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company is looking to recruit new graduates.\",\n    \"ch\": \"公司正在尋找招募應屆畢業生。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They are trying to recruit volunteers for the event.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們正試圖為活動招募志願者。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The army recruits young men and women.\",\n    \"ch\": \"軍隊招募年輕男女。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"公司正在尋找招募應屆畢業生。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4710,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u17::reg