布構成的」、「破舊的」或「邊緣參差不齊的」。它描述的是一種不整齊、不規則、破爛的狀態，可以形容衣物、頭髮、邊緣，甚至聲音。例如，也可指「聲音沙啞的」。","definition":"1. Having rough, torn edges or fringes.; 2. Wearing torn or dirty clothes.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He wore ragged clothes.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他穿著襤褸的衣服。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The ragged edge of the cloth needed mending.\",\n    \"ch\": \"布料參差不齊的邊緣需要修補。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The sound of his voice was ragged.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的聲音聽起來沙啞。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The old flag was ragged and torn.\",\n    \"ch\": \"舊旗幟破舊不堪，撕裂了。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"布料參差不齊的邊緣需要修補。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U58"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3895,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u1::rate::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"What is the exchange ____ between these currencies?","expectedAnswer":"rate","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"What is the exchange ____ between these currencies?","clozeAnswer":"rate","exampleTranslation":"這兩種貨幣的匯率是多少？","reference":{"eng":"rate","kk":"/reɪt/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['比率', '費率'], ['級別', '等級']]","chEntries":["比率","費率","級別","等級"],"practiceMeaning":"這兩種貨幣的匯率是多少？","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'rata'，'ratus' (reckoned, decided) 的女性單數形式。核心是「計算」、「估計」。引申為某事物的量或程度相對於另一事物的比例，或根據價值、質量等給出的等級。","definition":"1. a measure, quantity, or frequency, typically one measured against some other quantity or measure. 2. a fixed price paid or charged for something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The unemployment rate has decreased.\",\n    \"ch\": \"失業率已下降。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"What is the exchange rate between these currencies?\",\n    \"ch\": \"這兩種貨幣的匯率是多少？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The hotel is rated as a five-star establishment.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家飯店被評為五星級。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這兩種貨幣的匯率是多少？","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U1、L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4416,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::raw::adj","mode":"cloze_en","