nslation":"霧霾會引起呼吸系統問題。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U67"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5521,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l5::sneak::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She managed to ____ a cookie before dinner.","expectedAnswer":"sneak","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She managed to ____ a cookie before dinner.","clozeAnswer":"sneak","exampleTranslation":"她設法在晚飯前偷偷拿了一塊餅乾。","reference":{"eng":"sneak","kk":"sniːk","tense":"v.","ch":"[['偷偷地走'], ['潛行'], ['鬼鬼祟祟地行動'], ['偷偷地拿（或做）']]","chEntries":["偷偷地走","潛行","鬼鬼祟祟地行動","偷偷地拿"],"practiceMeaning":"她設法在晚飯前偷偷拿了一塊餅乾。","analysis":"此字源自中古英語 'sneken'，與古英語 'snēcan' 同源，可能來自原始日耳曼語 *snēkanan。其原始語義與「爬行」、「潛行」或「緩慢移動」有關。構詞上無明顯字首、字根、字尾。語意演變從「緩慢、不易察覺地移動」引申為「偷偷地、鬼鬼祟祟地行動」，尤其強調避免被發現。引申義還包括「偷偷地拿走」或「偷偷地做某事」。","definition":"to move furtively and stealthily; to carry or place (something) somewhere secretly.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He tried to sneak out of the room without being noticed.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他試圖不被注意到地悄悄溜出房間。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She managed to sneak a cookie before dinner.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她設法在晚飯前偷偷拿了一塊餅乾。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她設法在晚飯前偷偷拿了一塊餅乾。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4165,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::society::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is a member of the Royal ____.","expectedAnswer":"Society","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is a member of the Royal ____.","clozeAnswer":"Society","exampleTranslation":"他是皇家學會的會員。","reference":{"eng":"society","kk":"/səˈsaɪəti/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['社會'], ['學會', '協會']]","chEntries":["社會","學會","協會"],"practiceMeaning":"他是皇家學會的會員。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 societas（夥伴關係，聯盟），由 socius（夥伴）而來。核心概念是「一群人共同生活、交往的集合體」。","definition":"1. the aggregate of people living together in a more or less ordered community; 2. an association or group of people with similar interests or aims","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They live 