感。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 sotil，意為「精細、纖細、巧妙」，來自拉丁語 subtilis，由 sub-（在…下面）+ tĭla（紡織品、結構，來自 texere「編織」）組成。原意是「編織得非常細密」。引申為「不易察覺的、微妙的、精細的」。可指氣味、味道、變化、或人的心思。","definition":"so delicate or precise as not to be obvious; slight and gradual; (of a person or their manner) making use of clever indirect methods; artful.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There was a subtle change in her attitude.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她的態度有了微妙的轉變。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He has a subtle sense of humor.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他有著一種含蓄的幽默感。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The wine had a subtle hint of oak.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這款酒帶有一絲淡淡的橡木味。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他有著一種含蓄的幽默感。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U62"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5567,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l6::swift::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ movement of the bird caught my eye.","expectedAnswer":"swift","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ movement of the bird caught my eye.","clozeAnswer":"swift","exampleTranslation":"那隻鳥敏捷的動作吸引了我的目光。","reference":{"eng":"swift","kk":"swɪft","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['快速的'], ['敏捷的'], ['迅速的']]","chEntries":["快速的","敏捷的","迅速的"],"practiceMeaning":"那隻鳥敏捷的動作吸引了我的目光。","analysis":"此字源自古英語 \"swift\"，與荷蘭語 \"swift\"、德語 \"sch(w)ift\" 同源，最終可追溯至原始印歐語 \\*swep-（to go, to flow，去，流動）。其核心語義是「快速、敏捷」。\"swift\" 形容詞用於描述人、動物、動作或事件，強調其移動或發生的速度極快，沒有延遲。它比 \"fast\" 更強調一種流暢、敏捷的移動感。例如 \"a swift current\"（湍急的水流），\"swift progress\"（快速的進展）。","definition":"1. Happening or moving very quickly; 2. Able to move very quickly; agile.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He made a swift decision.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他做了一個迅速的決定。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The swift movement of the bird caught my eye.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那隻鳥敏捷的動作吸引了我的目光。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need a swift response to this crisis.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要對這場危機作出迅速的應對。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"那隻鳥敏捷的動作吸引了我的目光。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4689,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u17::tag::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He's known by the ____ 'The Professor'.","expectedAnswer":"tag","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He's known by the ____ 'The Professor'.","clozeAnswer":"tag","exampleTranslation":"他被稱為「教授」。","reference":{"eng":"tag","kk":"/ˈtæɡ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['標籤'], ['（非正式）稱號、綽號'], ['（追蹤、定位用的）標識'], ['（兒童遊戲）追逐遊戲']]","chEntries":["標籤","稱號、綽號","標識","追逐遊戲"],"practiceMeaning":"他被稱為「教授」。","analysis":"源自斯堪地那維亞語，意為「懸掛物」。核心是附著在物品上用於識別、標示的物品。延伸至非正式的綽號、用於追蹤的電子標識，以及兒童遊戲中的追逐。'tag question' (附加問句) 也是由 'tag' 的附屬、附加的概念衍生。","definition":"1. A label attached to something for the purpose of identification or information. 2. (informal) A nickname. 3. A device attached to something for tracking or identification purposes. 4. A children's game in which one person chases the others.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please remove the price tag before washing the garment.\",\n    \"ch\": \"清洗衣物前請移除價格標籤。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He's known by the tag 'The Professor'.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他被稱為「教授」。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We played tag in the park.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們在公園玩追逐遊戲。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他被稱為「教授」。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U17"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4504,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::take::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"It will ____ an hour to finish.","expectedAnswer":"take","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"It will ____ an hour to finish.","clozeAnswer":"take","exampleTranslation":"這需要一個小時才能完成。","reference":{"eng":"take","kk":"/teɪk/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['拿'], ['取得'], ['接受'], ['花費（時間、金錢）'], ['考慮'], ['採取（行動、措施）']]","chEntries":["拿","取得","接受","花費","考慮","採取"],"practiceMeaning":"這需要一個小時才能完成。","analysis":"源自古英語 tacan，意為「抓住」、「獲得」。是一個非常核心且用途廣泛的動詞。其語意極其豐富，涵蓋了從具體的「獲取」、「攜帶」到抽象的「接受」、「考慮」、「採取」等。","definition":"1. To lay hold of (something) with one's hands; 2. To obtain possession