e":"He tried to ____ his anger.","clozeAnswer":"temper","exampleTranslation":"他試圖抑制自己的憤怒。","reference":{"eng":"temper","kk":"/ˈtempər/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['鍛煉', '錘煉（金屬）'], ['使（情緒）緩和', '調和']]","chEntries":["鍛煉","錘煉","使緩和","調和"],"practiceMeaning":"他試圖抑制自己的憤怒。","analysis":"承襲名詞的語意，指透過加熱和冷卻等過程來改變材料的硬度和韌性。也可指透過控制來使情緒緩和。","definition":"to make metal harder by heating it and cooling it rapidly; to moderate or soften.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The blacksmith tempered the steel.\",\n    \"ch\": \"鐵匠錘煉了鋼。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He tried to temper his anger.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他試圖抑制自己的憤怒。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他試圖抑制自己的憤怒。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6100,"wordRef":"字彙王::u64::testify::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Her actions ____ to her sincerity.","expectedAnswer":"testify","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Her actions ____ to her sincerity.","clozeAnswer":"testify","exampleTranslation":"她的行為證明了她的真誠。","reference":{"eng":"testify","kk":"ˈtɛstəˌfaɪ","tense":"v.","ch":"[  [    \"證明\"  ],  [    \"作證\"  ],  [    \"表明\"  ]]","chEntries":["證明","作證","表明"],"practiceMeaning":"她的行為證明了她的真誠。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 testis（witness）和 facere（to make）。核心語義是「做出見證」或「證明」。在法律上，testify 指「在法庭上作證」。廣義上，testify 可以指「表明」、「證明」某事物的存在或真實性。","definition":"1. give evidence as a witness in a court or legal proceeding; 2. serve as a testimony to; show or confirm.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He was called to testify in the trial.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他被傳喚出庭作證。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her actions testify to her sincerity.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她的行為證明了她的真誠。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Witnesses will testify about what they saw.\",\n    \"ch\": \"目擊者將會作證他們所見。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她的行為證明了她的真誠。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U64"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6101,"wordRef":"字彙王::u64::theology::n","mode":"cloze_en","question