xample":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It was a tough decision to make.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是一個艱難的決定。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He's a tough negotiator.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是一位強硬的談判者。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Leather is a tough material.\",\n    \"ch\": \"皮革是一種堅韌的材料。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The police were tough on the criminals.\",\n    \"ch\": \"警方對罪犯採取了嚴厲的措施。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他是一位強硬的談判者。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U1、L7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4550,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u11::trace::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"There was a ____ of perfume in the air.","expectedAnswer":"trace","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"There was a ____ of perfume in the air.","clozeAnswer":"trace","exampleTranslation":"空氣中有一絲香水味。","reference":{"eng":"trace","kk":"/treɪs/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['蹤跡', '痕跡'], ['微量', '少量']]","chEntries":["蹤跡","痕跡","微量","少量"],"practiceMeaning":"空氣中有一絲香水味。","analysis":"源自古法語 'tracer'，意為 'to follow a course, track' (跟蹤、追蹤)。\n    1. 蹤跡、痕跡：指過去事件留下的明顯或細微的證據，如 'footprints are traces of someone's passage' (腳印是某人走過的痕跡)。\n    2. 微量、少量：指極其微小的數量，常與 'of' 搭配，如 'a trace of salt' (一點點鹽)。","definition":"1. a mark, object, or other indication of the existence or passing of something.; 2. a very small quantity of something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The police found no trace of the missing hikers.\",\n    \"ch\": \"警方沒有找到失蹤的登山客的任何蹤跡。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There was a trace of perfume in the air.\",\n    \"ch\": \"空氣中有一絲香水味。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He disappeared without a trace.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他消失得無影無蹤。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"空氣中有一絲香水味。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U11"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4565,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u11::trail::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We hiked along a beautiful mountain ____.","expectedAnswer":"trail","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We hiked along a beautiful mountain ____.","clozeAnswer":"trail","exampleTranslation":"我們沿著一條美麗的山間小徑徒步。","reference":{"eng":"trail","kk":"/treɪl/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['蹤跡', '痕跡'], ['小徑', '步道'], ['（一連串）跟隨者', '追隨者'], ['（飄落或拖曳的）蹤跡，軌跡']]","chEntries":["蹤跡","痕跡","小徑","步道","跟隨者","追隨者","蹤跡，軌跡"],"practiceMeaning":"我們沿著一條美麗的山間小徑徒步。","analysis":"源自古法語 'trahiner'，意為 'to drag' (拖曳)。\n    1. 蹤跡、痕跡：指經過留下的可見或不可見的證據。\n    2. 小徑、步道：指在野外或林間供人行走的小路，常是被不斷踩踏形成的。\n    3. 跟隨者：指跟在前面的人或事物後面的隊伍。\n    4. 蹤跡、軌跡：指物體移動後留下的線條或路徑，如 'smoke trail' (煙跡)。","definition":"1. a mark or a series of signs or objects left behind by the passage of someone or something.; 2. a path or track made through a wild or hilly region.; 3. a series of people or things following behind.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The detective followed the faint trail of footprints.\",\n    \"ch\": \"偵探跟蹤著微弱的腳印蹤跡。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We hiked along a beautiful mountain trail.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們沿著一條美麗的山間小徑徒步。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The winning team was followed by a trail of cheering fans.\",\n    \"ch\": \"獲勝隊伍後面是一群歡呼的粉絲。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A long train of smoke trailed behind the plane.\",\n    \"ch\": \"一長串煙跡在飛機後面拖曳。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們沿著一條美麗的山間小徑徒步。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U11"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4525,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::trouble::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"I don't want to cause you any ____.","expectedAnswer":"trouble","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"I don't want to cause you any ____.","clozeAnswer":"trouble","exampleTranslation":"我不想給你帶來任何麻煩。","reference":{"eng":"trouble","kk":"/ˈtrʌbl/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['麻煩'], ['困難'], ['憂慮'], ['（健康）病痛']]","chEntries":["麻煩","困難","憂慮","病痛"],"practiceMeaning":"我不想給你帶來任何麻煩。","analysis":"源自古法語 troble，來自拉丁語 turba，意為「混亂」、「人群」。核心語意是「混亂、干擾」。引申為「困難」、「麻煩」、「憂慮」、「疾病」等。","definition":"1. Difficulty or problems; 2. Worry or anxiety; 3. A state of