er":"prevent","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She wears gloves to ____ her hands from getting dry.","clozeAnswer":"prevent","exampleTranslation":"她戴手套以防止手部乾燥。","reference":{"eng":"prevent","kk":"/prɪˈvent/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['阻止', '預防'], ['防止']]","chEntries":["阻止","預防","防止"],"practiceMeaning":"她戴手套以防止手部乾燥。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'praevenire'，由 'prae-' (意為「在…之前」) 和 'venire' (意為「來」) 組成。最初的意思是「預先到達」，引申為「預防、阻止某事發生」。","definition":"1. to stop someone from doing something or to stop something from happening; 2. to take action to stop something from happening or to stop someone from doing something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The police were unable to prevent the robbery.\",\n    \"ch\": \"警方未能阻止這場搶劫。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Regular exercise can help prevent heart disease.\",\n    \"ch\": \"規律運動有助於預防心臟病。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She wears gloves to prevent her hands from getting dry.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她戴手套以防止手部乾燥。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她戴手套以防止手部乾燥。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4113,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::previous::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We discussed this issue in the ____ meeting.","expectedAnswer":"previous","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We discussed this issue in the ____ meeting.","clozeAnswer":"previous","exampleTranslation":"我們在上次會議中討論了這個問題。","reference":{"eng":"previous","kk":"/ˈpriːviəs/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['先前的', '以前的'], ['（順序、時間或地位）前面的']]","chEntries":["先前的","以前的","前面的"],"practiceMeaning":"我們在上次會議中討論了這個問題。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 praevius，由 prae-（在...之前）+ via（道路）組成，原意為「走在前面的」。引申為在時間、順序或重要性上「先於」某事或某物。","definition":"1. existing or happening before the present time or in the past; 2. coming before something else in order or importance","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She has no previous experience in this field.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她在這個領域沒有先前經驗。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is the previous owner's phone number.\