學的人，後演變為大學中傳授知識、享有較高學術地位的教師。","definition":"a teacher of the highest rank in a college or university.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is a professor of history at Oxford University.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她是牛津大學的歷史學教授。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The professor delivered an engaging lecture.\",\n    \"ch\": \"教授做了一場引人入勝的演講。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He hopes to become a full professor one day.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他希望有一天能成為正教授。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他希望有一天能成為正教授。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5412,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l3::progress::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We witnessed the slow ____ of the disease.","expectedAnswer":"progress","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We witnessed the slow ____ of the disease.","clozeAnswer":"progress","exampleTranslation":"我們見證了疾病的緩慢進展。","reference":{"eng":"progress","kk":"ˈprɑːɡres","tense":"n.","ch":"[['進步'], ['進展'], ['進行']]","chEntries":["進步","進展","進行"],"practiceMeaning":"我們見證了疾病的緩慢進展。","analysis":"此字源自古英語 \"progres\"，進一步可追溯至拉丁語 \"progressus\"，意為\"向前行\"。其中 \"pro-\" 是表示\"向前\"、\"在前面\"的字首，\"gressus\" 則是拉丁語 \"gradi\" (行走) 的過去分詞詞幹。構詞上，\"pro-\" 提供了方向性，\"gressus\" 則提供了核心的\"行走\"或\"移動\"語意，共同構成「向前移動」的概念，進而引申為「進步」或「進展」。最初的語義指物理上的前進，後來演變成抽象的「進步」或「發展」。","definition":"movement toward a destination; forward movement; forward movement in development or advancement; a series of events or actions that follow each other; the act of moving forward or advancing; the forward movement of something or someone.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The project is making good progress.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個計畫進展良好。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Technological progress has been rapid.\",\n    \"ch\": \"科技進步一直很迅速。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We witnessed the slow progress of the disease.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們見證了疾病的緩慢進展。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們見證了疾病的緩慢進展。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4310,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::protection::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We need to implement stronger data ____ measures.","expectedAnswer":"protection","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We need to implement stronger data ____ measures.","clozeAnswer":"protection","exampleTranslation":"我們需要實施更強力的數據保護措施。","reference":{"eng":"protection","kk":"/prəˈtɛkʃən/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['保護；庇護'], ['防護；防禦'], ['保護費；保護性措施']]","chEntries":["保護","庇護","防護","防禦","保護費","保護性措施"],"practiceMeaning":"我們需要實施更強力的數據保護措施。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'protectio'，意為 'cover, shelter'。由 'pro-' (forward, in front of) 和 'tegere' (to cover) 構成。'pro-' 強化了『向前』、『前方』的動作，而 'tegere' 則指『遮蓋』，兩者結合即為『在前方遮蓋以保護』，引申為各種形式的保護、防衛、安全措施。","definition":"the action of protecting someone or something, or the state of being protected; a measure taken to protect someone or something","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The children are under the protection of their parents.\",\n    \"ch\": \"孩子們在父母的保護之下。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The spy wore a bulletproof vest for protection.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這名間諜穿了防彈背心以求保護。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to implement stronger data protection measures.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要實施更強力的數據保護措施。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們需要實施更強力的數據保護措施。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3185,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::psychological::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Her research focused on the ____ development of children.","expectedAnswer":"psychological","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Her research focused on the ____ development of children.","clozeAnswer":"psychological","exampleTranslation":"她的研究重點是兒童的心理發展。","reference":{"eng":"psychological","kk":"/ˌsaɪkəˈlɒdʒɪkl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['心理的；心理學的']]","chEntries":["心理的","心理學的"],"practiceMeaning":"她的研究重點是兒童的心理發展。","analysis":"形容詞，源自 'psychology'。'Psychological' 描述的是與心靈、思想、情感、行為和心理過程相關的。它可以用來解釋人的動機、行為的潛在原因，