"ch":"[['策略'], ['戰術']]","chEntries":["策略","戰術"],"practiceMeaning":"你處理難纏客戶的策略是什麼？","analysis":"此字源自希臘語 \"tak tikos\"（relating to arrangement or order，與安排或秩序有關），來自 \"tassein\"（to arrange, put in order，安排，排序）。\"tassein\" 引申為「戰術上的安排」。\"tactic\"（單數）和 \"tactics\"（複數）都可以指「為達成特定目標而採取的具體行動或策略」。 \"tactics\"（複數）更常指「軍事上的戰術」，而 \"tactic\"（單數）則更傾向於指「在特定情境下的一種應對方式或策略」。核心語義是「為了實現某個較大目標而採取的具體步驟或方法」。","definition":"1. An action or tactic used to achieve a particular aim; 2. A plan for achieving a particular goal; a strategy.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His tactic was to divide and conquer.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的策略是分而治之。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company adopted a new marketing tactic.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司採用了一種新的市場行銷策略。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"What is your tactic for dealing with difficult customers?\",\n    \"ch\": \"你處理難纏客戶的策略是什麼？\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"你處理難纏客戶的策略是什麼？","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3919,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u2::technique::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"This cooking ____ will ensure a moist cake.","expectedAnswer":"technique","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This cooking ____ will ensure a moist cake.","clozeAnswer":"technique","exampleTranslation":"這種烹飪方法將保證蛋糕濕潤。","reference":{"eng":"technique","kk":"/tekˈniːk/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['技巧', '技術'], ['方法']]","chEntries":["技巧","技術","方法"],"practiceMeaning":"這種烹飪方法將保證蛋糕濕潤。","analysis":"源自希臘語 'tekhnikos' (意為「屬於藝術或工藝的」)，來自 'tekhnē' (意為「藝術、技巧、工藝」)。最初指藝術或工藝上的技巧，後廣泛應用於各種領域，指達成目標的特定方法或技能。","definition":"1. a way of carrying out a particular task, especially the ones in which you have to learn special skills; 2. skill in an art, craft, or technique.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The artist used a unique technique to create the painting.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位藝術家運用獨特的技巧創作了這幅畫。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He learned the technique of playing the piano from his teacher.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他從老師那裡學會了彈鋼琴的