「添加」，演變為「加法」（數學上的）、「增加的行為或過程」，以及「被添加的物品」。","definition":"1. The action or process of adding something to something else; 2. The process of adding up numbers; 3. A thing added to something else.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The addition of a new wing significantly increased the museum's exhibition space.\",\n    \"ch\": \"新翼樓的增加顯著擴大了博物館的展覽空間。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The children are learning basic addition in school.\",\n    \"ch\": \"孩子們正在學校學習基本的加法。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The new feature is a welcome addition to the software.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這項新功能是該軟體一個受歡迎的補充。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"新翼樓的增加顯著擴大了博物館的展覽空間。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5603,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l7::additionally::adv","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The hotel offers free breakfast; ____, guests can use the gym.","expectedAnswer":"additionally","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The hotel offers free breakfast; ____, guests can use the gym.","clozeAnswer":"additionally","exampleTranslation":"飯店提供免費早餐；此外，客人還可以使用健身房。","reference":{"eng":"additionally","kk":"əˈdɪʃənəli","tense":"adv.","ch":"[['此外'], ['而且'], ['另外']]","chEntries":["此外","而且","另外"],"practiceMeaning":"飯店提供免費早餐；此外，客人還可以使用健身房。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'additio'，意為「添加」，由 'addere'（添加）派生而來。構詞上，'addition' 是核心名詞（意為「加法」或「添加物」），加上了形容詞化後綴 '-al'，成為 'additional'（附加的），最後再接副詞化後綴 '-ly'，形成副詞 'additionally'。'-ly' 後綴將形容詞轉換為副詞，表示「以……的方式」或「具有……的性質」。'additional' 的「附加的」語意，透過 '-ly' 轉化為副詞，表示「額外地」、「此外」。原始語意是「增加的、額外的」，在副詞形式中，它用於引入額外的資訊或論點。","definition":"1. In addition; also; 2. Furthermore.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The hotel offers free breakfast; additionally, guests can use the gym.\",\n    \"ch\": \"飯店提供免費早餐；此外，客人還可以使用健身房。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is a talented musician and, additionally, a skilled writer.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是一位才華橫溢的音樂家，而且，他也是一位技巧嫻熟的作家。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"飯店提供免費早餐；此外，客人還可以使用健身房。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitNa