rupt","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company went ____ after a year of losses.","clozeAnswer":"bankrupt","exampleTranslation":"該公司在虧損一年後破產了。","reference":{"eng":"bankrupt","kk":"/ˈbæŋkrʌpt/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['破產的；倒閉的']]","chEntries":["破產的","倒閉的"],"practiceMeaning":"該公司在虧損一年後破產了。","analysis":"源自義大利語 'banca rotta'，意為「壞的長凳」。在中世紀，銀行家（banker）若無力償債，其交易的長凳（bench）會被打破，象徵其破產。此詞語意逐漸演變為指財政上的破產。","definition":"declared in law unable to pay one's debts.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company went bankrupt after a year of losses.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司在虧損一年後破產了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He was declared bankrupt and had to sell all his assets.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他被宣布破產，不得不出售所有資產。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"該公司在虧損一年後破產了。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U42"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3265,"wordRef":"字彙王::u42::bankruptcy::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The firm filed for ____ protection.","expectedAnswer":"bankruptcy","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The firm filed for ____ protection.","clozeAnswer":"bankruptcy","exampleTranslation":"該公司申請了破產保護。","reference":{"eng":"bankruptcy","kk":"/ˈbæŋkrʌpsi/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['破產；倒閉']]","chEntries":["破產","倒閉"],"practiceMeaning":"該公司申請了破產保護。","analysis":"由 'bankrupt' 加上 '-cy' (狀態，性質) 後綴構成。指破產的狀態或法律程序。","definition":"the state of being bankrupt; the legal process of dealing with the debts of a person or company that cannot pay what they owe.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The firm filed for bankruptcy protection.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司申請了破產保護。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Bankruptcy can have long-term consequences for a person's financial future.\",\n    \"ch\": \"破產可能對個人的財務未來產生長期影響。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"該公司申請了破產保護。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U42"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4288,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u7::basic-necessities::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Foo