木叢中飛了出來。","analysis":"源自古英語 *busc*，與日耳曼語系其他語言詞彙同源，指較小的、多莖的、經常是低矮的木本植物。引申至形容人跡罕至、偏遠的地區，特別是澳大利亞內陸。","definition":"1. A shrub or clump of shrubs with stems of wood, trailing or growing in the form of a shrub. 2. (informal, chiefly Australian) An area of undeveloped country, especially that lying beyond the settled suburbs of a town or city.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A bird suddenly flew out of the bush.\",\n    \"ch\": \"一隻鳥突然從灌木叢中飛了出來。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He grew up in the bush, far from any city.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在偏遠地區長大，離任何城市都很遠。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"一隻鳥突然從灌木叢中飛了出來。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U17"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5363,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l1::by-no-means::adv","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is ____ a perfect student.","expectedAnswer":"by no means","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is ____ a perfect student.","clozeAnswer":"by no means","exampleTranslation":"他絕不是一個完美的學生。","reference":{"eng":"by no means","kk":"baɪ ˈnoʊ miːnz","tense":"adv.","ch":"[['絕不'], ['一點也不']]","chEntries":["絕不","一點也不"],"practiceMeaning":"他絕不是一個完美的學生。","analysis":"此片語由 by（藉由）+ no（沒有）+ means（方法、手段）組成。字面意思是「沒有任何方法」。其功能是加強否定語氣，表達「絕對不可能」、「絕不」的意思。與 not by any means 語意相同，用來強調否定。","definition":"not at all in any way; under no circumstances.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is by no means a perfect student.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他絕不是一個完美的學生。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is by no means the end of the story.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這絕不是故事的結局。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他絕不是一個完美的學生。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3204,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::cabinet::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The president appointed new members to the ____.","expectedAnswer":"cabinet","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The president appointed new members to the ____.","clozeAnswer":"cabinet","exampleTranslation":"總統任命了新的內閣成員。","reference":{"eng":"cabinet","kk":"/ˈkæbɪnət/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['內閣'], ['櫥櫃'], ['陳列櫃'], ['（照片）相框']]","chEntries":["內閣","櫥櫃","陳列櫃","相框"],"practiceMeaning":"總統任命了新的內閣成員。","analysis":"詞源來自拉丁文 'capanna' (hut) 和 'capa' (head covering)，後演變成中古法語 'cabane' (cabin)。早期指小房間或私人空間，進而引申為存放物品的櫃子，以及政治上聚集重要人物的「小房間」（內閣）。","definition":"1. a group of ministers or other senior government officials; 2. a piece of furniture with shelves or drawers for storing things; 3. a small cupboard or cabinet, especially one used for display.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The president appointed new members to the cabinet.\",\n    \"ch\": \"總統任命了新的內閣成員。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She keeps her china in a glass-fronted cabinet.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她把瓷器放在一個玻璃門櫥櫃裡。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He opened the antique cabinet to show the precious vase.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他打開古董陳列櫃，展示了那個珍貴的花瓶。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"總統任命了新的內閣成員。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U41"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3209,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::cargo::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ship is carrying a large ____ of grain.","expectedAnswer":"cargo","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ship is carrying a large ____ of grain.","clozeAnswer":"cargo","exampleTranslation":"這艘船載有大量穀物貨物。","reference":{"eng":"cargo","kk":"/ˈkɑːrɡoʊ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['貨物'], ['載貨']]","chEntries":["貨物","載貨"],"practiceMeaning":"這艘船載有大量穀物貨物。","analysis":"詞源來自西班牙文 'cargo'，意為 'load, burden'，來自拉丁文 'carricare'，意為 'to load a cart'。指船、飛機、火車等運輸工具所載的貨物。","definition":"goods carried on a ship, aircraft, or vehicle.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The ship is carrying a large cargo of grain.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這艘船載有大量穀物貨物。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Smugglers were caught with illegal cargo.\",\n    \"ch\": \"走私者被抓獲時攜帶了非法貨物。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這艘船載有大量穀物貨物。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U41"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5121,"wordRef":"字彙王::u62::carnival::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The city holds a vibrant ____ every year.","expectedAnswer":"carnival","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The city holds a vibrant ____ every year.","clozeAnswer":"carnival","exampleTranslation":"這座城市每年都會舉辦熱鬧的嘉年華。","reference":{"eng":"carnival","kk":"ˈkɑːrnəvl","tense":"n.","ch":"[['嘉年華'], ['狂歡節'], ['（臨時）遊樂場']]","chEntries":["嘉年華","狂歡節","遊樂場"],"practiceMeaning":"這座城市每年都會舉辦熱鬧的嘉年華。","analysis":"此字源自中古法語 carnavale，意為「告別肉類」。詞源可追溯至中世紀拉丁語 carnis levale，即「取消肉類」的意思，與基督教的四旬齋（Lent）前的慶祝活動有關。核心語意為「節日、慶典」，尤指節日期間的熱鬧、歡樂活動，包括遊行、表演、娛樂等。","definition":"a public festival, especially one held outdoors with amusements, processions, and music; a period of celebration, often before Lent.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The city holds a vibrant carnival every year.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這座城市每年都會舉辦熱鬧的嘉年華。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Children enjoyed the rides at the carnival.\",\n    \"ch\": \"孩子們在遊樂場裡玩得很開心。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這座城市每年都會舉辦熱鬧的嘉年華。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U62"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3210,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::carrier::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The airline is a major cargo ____.","expectedAnswer":"carrier","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The airline is a major cargo ____.","clozeAnswer":"carrier","exampleTranslation":"這家航空公司是一家主要的貨物運輸公司。","reference":{"eng":"carrier","kk":"/ˈkæriər/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['運輸公司'], ['載體'], ['搬運工'], ['（病原體的）攜帶者']]","chEntries":["運輸公司","載體","搬運工","攜帶者"],"practiceMeaning":"這家航空公司是一家主要的貨物運輸公司。","analysis":"源自動詞 'carry'，意為『攜帶、運輸』。'carrier' 指執行『攜帶』行為的對象或事物。引申意義廣泛，包括運輸服務提供者、傳遞者、疾病的攜帶者等，皆圍繞『傳輸』核心概念。","definition":"1. a person or thing that carries or transports something; 2. a company that transports goods or passengers; 3. a person or animal that is infected with a disease and can spread it to others.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The airline is a major cargo carrier.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家航空公司是一家主要的貨物運輸公司。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Mosquitoes are carriers of malaria.\",\n    \"ch\": \"蚊子是瘧疾的傳播媒介。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He worked as a mail carrier for twenty years.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他擔任了二十年的郵差（送信人）。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這家航空公司是一家主要的貨物運輸公司。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U41"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4371,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::cast-a-shadow-on::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The scandal ____ the company's reputation.","expectedAnswer":"cast a shadow on","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The scandal ____ the company's reputation.","clozeAnswer":"cast a shadow on","exampleTranslation":"這起醜聞損害了公司的聲譽。","reference":{"eng":"cast a shadow on","kk":"None","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['對…蒙上陰影；損害…的聲譽']]","chEntries":["對…蒙上陰影","損害…的聲譽"],"practiceMeaning":"這起醜聞損害了公司的聲譽。","analysis":"此為片語分析。'cast' (v.) 指『投射』。'a shadow' (n.) 指『一個陰影』。'on' (prep.) 指『在…上』。這個片語是一個比喻，指某事或某人對另一個事物、情況或聲譽產生了負面、不好的影響，使其變得不那麼美好或受人質疑。","definition":"to have a bad effect on something, or to make something seem less good or happy","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The scandal cast a shadow on the company's reputation.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這起醜聞損害了公司的聲譽。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His illness cast a shadow on their otherwise happy holiday.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的生病給本來愉快的假期蒙上了一層陰影。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這起醜聞損害了公司的聲譽。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5286,"wordRef":"字彙王::u63::certainty::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"There is no ____ that he will come.","expectedAnswer":"certainty","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"There is no ____ that he will come.","clozeAnswer":"certainty","exampleTranslation":"不能確定他是否會來。","reference":{"eng":"certainty","kk":"ˈsɜːrtənti","tense":"n.","ch":"[['確定', '無疑'], ['確定的事物', '必然發生的事']]","chEntries":["確定","無疑","確定的事物","必然發生的事"],"practiceMeaning":"不能確定他是否會來。","analysis":"此字由形容詞 'certain' 加上抽象名詞後綴 '-ty' 構成。'certain' 源自拉丁語 'certus'（確定的，來自 'cernere'，意為「分辨、確定」）。'certainty' 的核心語意是「確定性」、「無可懷疑的狀態」。它可以指一種心理狀態（確信），也可以指客觀的事實（確定之事）。","definition":"the state of being free from doubt; something that is sure to happen or be the case.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There is no certainty that he will come.\",\n    \"ch\": \"不能確定他是否會來。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The certainty of her victory was never in doubt.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她獲勝是確定的，毫無疑問。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"不能確定他是否會來。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U63"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5620,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l7::certificate::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He received a ____ of completion for the course.","expectedAnswer":"certificate","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He received a ____ of completion for the course.","clozeAnswer":"certificate","exampleTranslation":"他收到了課程的結業證書。","reference":{"eng":"certificate","kk":"sərˈtɪfɪkət","tense":"n.","ch":"[['證書'], ['證明書']]","chEntries":["證書","證明書"],"practiceMeaning":"他收到了課程的結業證書。","analysis":"此字源自中世紀拉丁語 'certificatum'，意為「證明」，由 'certus'（確定的）和 'facere'（做）組成，'certus' 本身源自 'cernere'（分辨）。構詞學上，'cert-' 是「確定的」、「真實的」的詞根，'-i-' 是連接母音，'fic-'（來自 'facere'）是「做」、「使」的詞根，'-ate' 是動詞化後綴，'-um' 標示中性名詞。'certificare' 意為「使確定」，'certificatum' 則指「被證明的事物」。因此，'certificate' 指「用以證明某事或某人資格的文件」。","definition":"1. A document confirming the fact of something; 2. A qualification awarded for successfully completing a course of study or examination.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He received a certificate of completion for the course.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他收到了課程的結業證書。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She needs to present her birth certificate.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她需要出示她的出生證明。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他收到了課程的結業證書。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4733,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u17::chaos::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The stock market crash plunged the economy into ____.","expectedAnswer":"chaos","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The stock market crash plunged the economy into ____.","clozeAnswer":"chaos","exampleTranslation":"股市崩潰使經濟陷入混亂。","reference":{"eng":"chaos","kk":"/ˈkeɪɑs/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['混亂'], ['無秩序']]","chEntries":["混亂","無秩序"],"practiceMeaning":"股市崩潰使經濟陷入混亂。","analysis":"源自希臘語 *khaos*，原指宇宙創生前一片混亂、無序的狀態。核心是完全的無秩序、雜亂無章。","definition":"1. Complete disorder and confusion.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The stock market crash plunged the economy into chaos.\",\n    \"ch\": \"股市崩潰使經濟陷入混亂。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"After the earthquake, the city was in a state of chaos.\",\n    \"ch\": \"地震後，這座城市一片混亂。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"股市崩潰使經濟陷入混亂。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、字彙王、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U17、U63、L7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5288,"wordRef":"字彙王::u63::chapel::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The wedding ceremony will be held in the college ____.","expectedAnswer":"chapel","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The wedding ceremony will be held in the college ____.","clozeAnswer":"chapel","exampleTranslation":"婚禮將在學院的禮拜堂舉行。","reference":{"eng":"chapel","kk":"ˈtʃæpəl","tense":"n.","ch":"[['小教堂', '禮拜堂'], ['（尤指附屬於較大建築物的）禮拜堂', '（某些組織或團體的）祈禱室']]","chEntries":["小教堂","禮拜堂","祈禱室"],"practiceMeaning":"婚禮將在學院的禮拜堂舉行。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 'chapele'，意為「斗篷，後來指聖馬丁的斗篷，再後來指存放聖物的聖殿」。'chapele' 又來自中古拉丁語 'cappella'，指「聖馬丁的斗篷」或「關於斗篷的小教堂」。'cappella' 本身是 'cappa'（斗篷）的小型化。核心語意從「與聖物相關的場所」演變為「小型的宗教場所」。","definition":"a small church or a room used for private worship, especially in a large institution such as a school, prison, or hospital.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The wedding ceremony will be held in the college chapel.\",\n    \"ch\": \"婚禮將在學院的禮拜堂舉行。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There is a small chapel in the hospital for patients and visitors.\",\n    \"ch\": \"醫院裡有一個小禮拜堂，供病人和訪客使用。\"\n  }\