exampleTranslation":"他在鄰縣的一個小鎮長大。","reference":{"eng":"county","kk":"/ˈkaʊnti/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['郡'], ['縣']]","chEntries":["郡","縣"],"practiceMeaning":"他在鄰縣的一個小鎮長大。","analysis":"源自古法語 conte，來自拉丁語 comitatus，意為「陪伴」，後來指「伯爵的領地」。在英語國家，常作為行政區劃單位。在英國和美國，是重要的地理和行政分區。","definition":"1. A division of a country, especially a large one in England or the US, forming an administrative and sometimes judicial district; 2. An administrative region in various countries.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He grew up in a small town in the next county.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在鄰縣的一個小鎮長大。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The county council is responsible for local services.\",\n    \"ch\": \"郡議會負責當地的公共服務。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他在鄰縣的一個小鎮長大。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5534,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l5::courageous::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ firefighter rescued the child from the burning building.","expectedAnswer":"courageous","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ firefighter rescued the child from the burning building.","clozeAnswer":"courageous","exampleTranslation":"這位勇敢的消防員從燃燒的建築中救出了孩子。","reference":{"eng":"courageous","kk":"kəˈreɪdʒəs","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['勇敢的'], ['有膽量的']]","chEntries":["勇敢的","有膽量的"],"practiceMeaning":"這位勇敢的消防員從燃燒的建築中救出了孩子。","analysis":"此字由名詞 'courage' 加上形容詞字尾 '-ous' 構成。'-ous' 是源自拉丁語的字尾，常用於形成形容詞，表示「充滿……」、「具有……性質」。'courage' 源自古法語 'corage'，來自拉丁語 'cor' (heart)。原始語義是「有心（勇敢的）」，引申為「內心的力量、勇氣」。'courageous' 的構詞結構清晰地表明其含義是「充滿勇氣的、勇敢的」。它描述了一種面對危險、困難或痛苦時表現出的堅毅與無畏。","definition":"showing no fear in the face of danger or pain; brave.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The courageous firefighter rescued the child from the burning building.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位勇敢的消防員從燃燒的建築中救出了孩子。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It takes a courageous person to admit their mistakes.\",\n    \"ch\": \"承認錯誤需要一個有勇氣的人。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這位勇敢的消防員從燃燒的建築中救出了孩子。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5078,"wordRef":"字彙王::u61::coverage::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The news ____ of the election was extensive.","expectedAnswer":"coverage","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The news ____ of the election was extensive.","clozeAnswer":"coverage","exampleTranslation":"這次選舉的新聞報導十分廣泛。","reference":{"eng":"coverage","kk":"ˈkʌvərɪdʒ","tense":"n.","ch":"[['報導'], ['覆蓋範圍'], ['保險範圍']]","chEntries":["報導","覆蓋範圍","保險範圍"],"practiceMeaning":"這次選舉的新聞報導十分廣泛。","analysis":"此字由 'cover' (覆蓋) + '-age' (名詞化後綴) 構成。'-age' 常用於形成名詞，表示狀態、行為、總量或集合，如 'storage', 'carriage'。'Coverage' 的核心語義是 '被覆蓋的程度或範圍'。這引申為新聞媒體對事件的 '報導範圍'，保險條款對風險的 '保障範圍'，以及資訊或訊號的 '傳播範圍'。","definition":"1. The extent to which something is covered or protected.; 2. The amount of information about an event or subject that is included in newspapers, television programmes, etc.; 3. The amount of protection that an insurance policy gives you.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The news coverage of the election was extensive.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這次選舉的新聞報導十分廣泛。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"What is the coverage of your car insurance?\",\n    \"ch\": \"你的汽車保險的保險範圍是什麼？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The remote area has poor mobile phone coverage.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那個偏遠地區的手機訊號覆蓋很差。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這次選舉的新聞報導十分廣泛。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U61"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3071,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::crack::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ice on the lake began to ____.","expectedAnswer":"crack","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ice on the lake began to ____.","clozeAnswer":"crack","exampleTranslation":"湖面上的冰開始破裂。","reference":{"eng":"crack","kk":"/kræk/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['破裂；斷裂'], ['使（聲音）嘶啞'], ['破解；解決（難題）'], ['（尤指戰時）嚴厲批評']]","chEntries":["破裂","斷裂","使嘶啞","破解","解決","嚴厲批評"],"practiceMeaning":"湖面上的冰開始破裂。","analysis":"源自古英語 'cracian'，或與斯堪地那維亞語有關。核心意義是「產生縫隙」或「突然斷裂」。\n1. 破裂；斷裂：指物體表面出現裂縫或完全斷開。\n2. 使（聲音）嘶啞：指聲音因壓力、疲勞或情緒而變得不穩定、沙啞。\n3. 破解；解決（難題）：指成功解決複雜的問題或破解密碼。\n4. （尤指戰時）嚴厲批評：指強烈、直接地指出某人的錯誤或缺陷。","definition":"1. to break without dividing into two completely separate pieces; 2. to make a sudden loud noise; 3. to break something into many pieces; 4. to say something in a voice that is not steady because you are sad or angry; 5. to solve a problem or find the answer to something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The ice on the lake began to crack.\",\n    \"ch\": \"湖面上的冰開始破裂。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His voice cracked when he tried to speak.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他試圖說話時聲音變嘶啞了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The team managed to crack the code.\",\n    \"ch\": \"團隊設法破解了密碼。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The newspaper cracked down on the corrupt politician.\",\n    \"ch\": \"報紙嚴厲抨擊了腐敗的政客。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"湖面上的冰開始破裂。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U39"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3134,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::crash::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The police are investigating the cause of the car ____.","expectedAnswer":"crash","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The police are investigating the cause of the car ____.","clozeAnswer":"crash","exampleTranslation":"警方正在調查這起車禍的原因。","reference":{"eng":"crash","kk":"/kræʃ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['碰撞；墜毀'], ['（電腦系統等的）故障，崩潰'], ['（價格的）暴跌'], ['（尤指在某種場合，為了尋求某物而）混進去；不請自來']]","chEntries":["碰撞","墜毀","故障，崩潰","暴跌","混進去","不請自來"],"practiceMeaning":"警方正在調查這起車禍的原因。","analysis":"名詞用法，源自動詞 'crash'。指「碰撞」或「墜毀」的事件。也指電腦系統或程式的「故障」或「崩潰」，以及金融市場的「暴跌」。'Crash' 也可以指非正式的「混進」某個派對或場合，通常是沒有被邀請的。","definition":"1. a violent impact or collision; 2. a sudden failure of a computer system or program; 3. a sudden and dramatic fall in prices or values; 4. (informal) an act of attending a party or event uninvited.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The police are investigating the cause of the car crash.\",\n    \"ch\": \"警方正在調查這起車禍的原因。\