system has greatly improved the ____ of our operations.","expectedAnswer":"efficiency","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The new system has greatly improved the ____ of our operations.","clozeAnswer":"efficiency","exampleTranslation":"新系統大大提高了我們營運的效率。","reference":{"eng":"efficiency","kk":"ɪˈfɪʃənsi","tense":"n.","ch":"[['效率'], ['效能']]","chEntries":["效率","效能"],"practiceMeaning":"新系統大大提高了我們營運的效率。","analysis":"此字由 \"efficient\" 加上名詞化字尾 \"-cy\" 構成。\"efficient\" 源自拉丁語 \"efficiēns\"，是 \"efficere\"（to work out, accomplish, produce，完成，達成，生產）的現在分詞。\"efficere\" 由 \"ex-\"（out）和 \"facere\"（to make, to do，製造，做）組成，意為「製造出來，完成」。\"-cy\" 是構成抽象名詞的字尾。因此，\"efficiency\" 的核心語義是「有效完成某事的能力或狀態」，即「效率」或「效能」。它強調的是以最少的資源（時間、精力、金錢）達成最大的產出或目標。","definition":"1. The state or quality of being efficient; 2. The ability to accomplish something with the least amount of wasted time, effort, or resources.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The new system has greatly improved the efficiency of our operations.\",\n    \"ch\": \"新系統大大提高了我們營運的效率。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We are always looking for ways to increase our energy efficiency.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們一直在尋找提高能源效率的方法。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her efficiency in handling multiple tasks is remarkable.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她同時處理多項任務的效率令人稱道。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"新系統大大提高了我們營運的效率。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4573,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u11::efficient::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"This is a very ____ method of production.","expectedAnswer":"efficient","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This is a very ____ method of production.","clozeAnswer":"efficient","exampleTranslation":"這是一種非常高效的生產方法。","reference":{"eng":"efficient","kk":"/ɪˈfɪʃənt/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['效率高的', '功效大的'], ['（人）精幹的', '有能力的']]","chEntries":["效率高的","功效大的","精幹的","有能力的"],"practiceMeaning":"這是一種非常高效的生產方法。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'efficiens'，'efficere' (to accomplish - 完成、達成) 的現在分詞。核心概念是能夠有效且迅速地達成目標，不浪費資源。\n    1. 效率高的、功效大的：指在生產、工作或運轉時，以最少的投入獲得最大的產出。\n    2. 精幹的、有能力的：指個人在工作方面能夠高效地完成任務。","definition":"1. working or functioning in a way that achieves maximum productivity with minimum wasted effort or expense.; 2. (of a person) competent and capable.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is a very efficient method of production.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是一種非常高效的生產方法。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is an efficient manager who gets things done.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是一位做事有效的經理。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The new system is more efficient than the old one.\",\n    \"ch\": \"新系統比舊系統更有效率。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這是一種非常高效的生產方法。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U11、L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5126,"wordRef":"字彙王::u62::ego::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"His ____ was badly bruised by the criticism.","expectedAnswer":"ego","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"His ____ was badly bruised by the criticism.","clozeAnswer":"ego","exampleTranslation":"他的自尊心因批評而大受打擊。","reference":{"eng":"ego","kk":"ˈiːgoʊ","tense":"n.","ch":"[['自我'], ['自尊心'], ['自我意識']]","chEntries":["自我","自尊心","自我意識"],"practiceMeaning":"他的自尊心因批評而大受打擊。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 ego，意為「我」。這是拉丁語的第一人稱單數主格代名詞。在心理學上，由佛洛伊德提出，ego 指的是人格結構中負責現實原則的部分，是「自我」的概念。在日常用語中，ego 也指「自尊心」或「自我中心」。","definition":"a person's sense of self-esteem or self-importance; the part of the mind that mediates between the conscious and the unconscious and is responsible for reality testing and a sense of personal identity.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His ego was badly bruised by the criticism.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的自尊心因批評而大受打擊。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The psychologist discussed the concept of the ego.\",\n    \"ch\": \"心理學家討論了「自我」的概念。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他的自尊心因批評而大受打擊。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U62"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5474,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l4::elaborate::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Could you please ____ on your proposal?","expectedAnswer":"elaborate","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Could you please ____ on your proposal?","clozeAnswer":"elaborate","exampleTranslation":"您能否詳細闡述一下您的提案？","reference":{"eng":"elaborate","kk":"iˈlæbəreɪt","tense":"v.","ch":"[['詳細說明'], ['闡述'], ['詳細制定']]","chEntries":["詳細說明","闡述","詳細制定"],"practiceMeaning":"您能否詳細闡述一下您的提案？","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'elaborare'，意為「努力工作、精製、詳細闡述」。'E-' 意為「出、完全」，'laborare' 意為「工作」。作為動詞，'elaborate' 的核心語意是「付出努力去完成某事」，引申為「詳細地闡述」或「精心設計」。當用於解釋或說明時，強調的是「將複雜或隱晦的內容，通過添加細節和解釋，使其變得清晰、易懂」。當用於計劃或製作時，強調「投入大量時間和精力來完善」。","definition":"1. Develop or present (a theory, policy, or system) in detail.; 2. Explain more fully.; 3. Make or become more complex or detailed.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Could you please elaborate on your proposal?\",\n    \"ch\": \"您能否詳細闡述一下您的提案？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The scientist elaborated a new theory of relativity.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位科學家詳細闡述了一種新的相對論。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company elaborated a detailed marketing plan.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司制定了詳細的行銷計畫。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"您能否詳細闡述一下您的提案？","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4611,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u16::elderly::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The bus offered a seat to an ____ woman.","expectedAnswer":"elderly","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The bus offered a seat to an ____ woman.","clozeAnswer":"elderly","exampleTranslation":"公車上給了一位年長婦人座位。","reference":{"eng":"elderly","kk":"/ˈeldərli/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['年長的'], ['老年的']]","chEntries":["年長的","老年的"],"practiceMeaning":"公車上給了一位年長婦人座位。","analysis":"由 'elder' (年長者) + '-ly' (形容詞後綴) 組成。'Elder' 源自古英語 'ældra' (較老的)，是 'old' 的比較級。此字是比較客氣和尊重的說法，指年齡較大的人，通常帶有同情和關懷的意味。","definition":"old or aging; of advanced age.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The bus offered a seat to an elderly woman.\",\n    \"ch\": \"公車上給了一位年長婦人座位。\"\n  