 指構成事物的『基本要素、成分』。3. 指『惡劣的環境、條件』，如風雨、寒冷等，強調其粗獷、基礎的性質。4. 指『微量、痕跡』，如『一絲』、『一點』，強調其是某事物最基礎、最簡單的部分。","definition":"a part of something, especially a system or plan; any of the four basic substances: earth, air, fire, and water; a substance that cannot be broken down into simpler substances by chemical means; a small trace of something","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Oxygen is an element.\",\n    \"ch\": \"氧氣是一種元素。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Patience is an important element of success.\",\n    \"ch\": \"耐心是成功的重要要素。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They were exposed to the elements.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們遭受了風雨的侵襲。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There was an element of truth in his statement.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的陳述中有一絲真理。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"氧氣是一種元素。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4139,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::elevator::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Please take the ____ to the fifth floor.","expectedAnswer":"elevator","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Please take the ____ to the fifth floor.","clozeAnswer":"elevator","exampleTranslation":"請搭電梯到五樓。","reference":{"eng":"elevator","kk":"/ˈɛlɪveɪtər/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['電梯']]","chEntries":["電梯"],"practiceMeaning":"請搭電梯到五樓。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 elevatus，是動詞 elevare（舉起）的過去分詞。核心概念是「使升高」。引申為用來上下移動的裝置。","definition":"a platform or compartment housed in a shaft for raising and lowering people or things to or from various floors or levels","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please take the elevator to the fifth floor.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請搭電梯到五樓。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The elevator was out of order.\",\n    \"ch\": \"電梯故障了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He pressed the button for the elevator.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他按了電梯按鈕。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"請搭電梯到五樓。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5294,"wordRef":"字彙王::u63::eligible::adj