c::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The country has a diverse ____ population.","expectedAnswer":"ethnic","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The country has a diverse ____ population.","clozeAnswer":"ethnic","exampleTranslation":"這個國家擁有多元的種族人口。","reference":{"eng":"ethnic","kk":"/ˈeθnɪk/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['種族的；民族的'], ['有異國情調的；非西方風格的']]","chEntries":["種族的","民族的","有異國情調的","非西方風格的"],"practiceMeaning":"這個國家擁有多元的種族人口。","analysis":"源自希臘語 'ethnikos' (pertaining to a people or nation)，'ethnos' (nation, people)。核心意義是「與民族或群體相關」。\n1. 種族的；民族的：指與特定的種族或民族群體及其文化、特徵相關。\n2. 有異國情調的；非西方風格的：常用來描述來自不同文化或國家，具有獨特風格的事物。","definition":"1. relating to a population subgroup with a common national or cultural tradition; 2. relating to a particular race of people.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The country has a diverse ethnic population.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個國家擁有多元的種族人口。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She enjoys exploring different ethnic cuisines.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她喜歡探索不同的民族風味美食。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這個國家擁有多元的種族人口。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U39"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5782,"wordRef":"字彙王::u60::exotic::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The market was filled with ____ fruits and spices.","expectedAnswer":"exotic","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The market was filled with ____ fruits and spices.","clozeAnswer":"exotic","exampleTranslation":"市場裡擺滿了各種異國水果和香料。","reference":{"eng":"exotic","kk":"ɪɡˈzɑtɪk","tense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"外來的\"  ],  [    \"異國風情的\"  ],  [    \"奇特的\"  ],  [    \"新奇的\"  ]]","chEntries":["外來的","異國風情的","奇特的","新奇的"],"practiceMeaning":"市場裡擺滿了各種異國水果和香料。","analysis":"此字為形容詞，源自中古英語exotique，來自拉丁語exoticus，再追溯至希臘語exōtikos（來自外國的），由exō（在外面）衍生而來。exō本身源自原始印歐語\\\\*eks-（外面）。因此，exotic的核心語義是指「來自外國的」，特別是來自遙遠、不尋常地方的。引申為「奇特的」、「新奇的」或「有異國情調的」。語意演變上，從「來自國外」發展到「與本地不同、奇特、吸引人的」。","definition":"1. originating in or characteristic of a distant foreign country; 2. attractively unusual or 