__ the rules of the game to me?","expectedAnswer":"explain","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Can you ____ the rules of the game to me?","clozeAnswer":"explain","exampleTranslation":"你能向我解釋一下遊戲規則嗎？","reference":{"eng":"explain","kk":"/ɪkˈspleɪn/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['解釋；說明'], ['闡明；辨明']]","chEntries":["解釋","說明","闡明","辨明"],"practiceMeaning":"你能向我解釋一下遊戲規則嗎？","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'explanare'，'ex-' (out) + 'planus' (plain)。核心意義是「使事物變得平坦、清晰」。\n1. 解釋；說明：指闡述事物的性質、原因、過程、意義等，使其易於理解。\n2. 闡明；辨明：指辨別或說明某事物與另一事物的區別，或說明其真實情況。","definition":"1. to make something clear or easy to understand by describing it or giving reasons; 2. to give the reason for something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Can you explain the rules of the game to me?\",\n    \"ch\": \"你能向我解釋一下遊戲規則嗎？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He tried to explain his behavior.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他試圖解釋自己的行為。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"你能向我解釋一下遊戲規則嗎？","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U39"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5083,"wordRef":"字彙王::u61::exploration::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ of space continues to fascinate scientists.","expectedAnswer":"exploration","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ of space continues to fascinate scientists.","clozeAnswer":"exploration","exampleTranslation":"太空探索持續吸引著科學家。","reference":{"eng":"exploration","kk":"ˌekspləˈreɪʃn","tense":"n.","ch":"[['探索'], ['勘探'], ['考察']]","chEntries":["探索","勘探","考察"],"practiceMeaning":"太空探索持續吸引著科學家。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'explorare'，由 'ex-' (out) + 'plorare' (to cry out, to search) 構成，原意是 '喊出以尋找，調查'。'Exploration' 的核心語義是 '對未知或未被充分了解的區域、領域或主題進行深入的調查、發現和研究'。它包含了 '尋找'、'發現' 和 '研究' 的過程，強調的是對新事物的好奇心和求知欲。","definition":"1. The action of exploring an unfamiliar area or subject.; 2. The systematic investigation of a subject or issue.; 3. The activity of traveling around a place to learn about it.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The exploration of space continues to fascinate scientists.\",\n    \"ch\": \"太空探索持續吸引著科學家。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company is involved in oil exploration.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司從事石油勘探。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Their exploration of the Amazon rainforest yielded new discoveries.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們對亞馬遜雨林的考察帶來了新發現。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"太空探索持續吸引著科學家。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U61"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4061,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u4::explore::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The team will ____ new territories.","expectedAnswer":"explore","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The team will ____ new territories.","clozeAnswer":"explore","exampleTranslation":"這個團隊將探索新的地域。","reference":{"eng":"explore","kk":"/ɪkˈsplɔr/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['探索', '探險'], ['研究', '調查']]","chEntries":["探索","探險","研究","調查"],"practiceMeaning":"這個團隊將探索新的地域。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'explorare'，由 'ex-' (out) + 'plorare' (to cry out, to search) 構成，原意是「大聲呼喊尋找」。核心是「尋找」、「探究」。因此，'explore' 指「深入探究」未知的事物（地理、概念、理論等）。","definition":"1. to travel to or around (a place) in order to learn about it; 2. to discuss or examine (a subject or problem) in detail","example":"[\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"這個團隊將探索新的地域。\",\n    \"eng\": \"The team will explore new territories.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要研究所有可能的解決方案。\",\n    \"eng\": \"We need to explore all possible solutions.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"科學家們正在探索海洋深處。\",\n    \"eng\": \"Scientists are exploring the depths of the ocean.\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這個團隊將探索新的地域。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5638,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l8::extent::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The full ____ of the damage is not yet known.","expectedAnswer":"extent","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The full ____ of the damage is not yet known.","clozeAnswer":"extent","exampleTranslation":"損壞的全部程度尚不明確。","reference":{"eng":"extent","kk":"ɪkˈstɛnt","tense":"n.","ch":"[['程度'], ['範圍'], ['面積'], ['廣度']]","chEntries":["程度","範圍","面積","廣度"],"practiceMeaning":"損壞的全部程度尚不明確。","analysis":"此字源自中古英語 extent，意為「測量」。其來自拉丁語 extentus，是 extend（伸展，擴展）的過去分詞。extend 來自拉丁語 extendere，由 ex-（出，out）+ tendere（伸展，to stretch）組成。tendere 來自原始印歐語 *ten-（伸展）。因此，extent 的核心語義是「被伸展或擴展到的範圍或程度」。構詞上，ex- 提供「出」或「向外」的方向，tendere 提供「伸展」的核心動作。此處為名詞用法，指代事物的「程度」、「範圍」、「廣度」或「規模」。","definition":"the degree or scope to which something is the case; the size or amount of something; the area covered by something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The full extent of the damage is not yet known.\",\n    \"ch\": \"損壞的全部程度尚不明確。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The extent of his knowledge is impressive.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他知識的廣度令人印象深刻。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"To what extent do you agree with him?\",\n    \"ch\": \"你在多大程度上同意他的看法？\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"損壞的全部程度尚不明確。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3171,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::extinct::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Dinosaurs have been ____ for millions of years.","expectedAnswer":"extinct","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Dinosaurs have been ____ for millions of years.","clozeAnswer":"extinct","exampleTranslation":"恐龍已經滅絕數百萬年了。","reference":{"eng":"extinct","kk":"/ɪkˈstɪŋkt/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['滅絕的；絕種的'], ['（物種、制度、語言等）已消失的；不復存在的']]","chEntries":["滅絕的","絕種的","已消失的","不復存在的"],"practiceMeaning":"恐龍已經滅絕數百萬年了。","analysis":"詞源來自拉丁語 'extinctus'，意為「熄滅，毀滅」，源於 'exstinguere'（熄滅，毀滅）。'Extinct' 指的是某個物種、族群、制度、語言或事物完全消失，不再存在。最常見的用法是形容已滅絕的動物或植物。它強調的是「徹底消失」和「不復存在」的狀態。","definition":"1. (of a species, family, or other larger group) having no living members; 2. no longer in existence; having died out.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Dinosaurs have been extinct for millions of years.\",\n    \"ch\": \"恐龍已經滅絕數百萬年了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The dodo is an example of an extinct bird.\",\n    \"ch\": \"渡渡鳥是一種已滅絕的鳥類。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The tradition became extinct after the war.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個傳統在戰後消失了。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"恐龍已經滅絕數百萬年了。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U40、U61"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4404,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::extreme::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is a man of ____ views.","expectedAnswer":"extreme","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is a man of ____ views.","clozeAnswer":"extreme","exampleTranslation":"他持有極端的觀點。","reference":{"eng":"extreme","kk":"/ɪkˈstriːm/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['極端的', '極大的'], ['極端的', '過激的'], ['極大的', '最大的']]","chEntries":["極端的","極大的","過激的","最大的"],"practiceMeaning":"他持有極端的觀點。","analysis":"詞源自拉丁語 'extremus'，'ex-' (out) 的最高級。意為「最外面的、最後的」。引申為程度、數量、行為等達到最高或最甚的狀態。","definition":"very great or severe; reaching a high or the highest degree; very different from normal or from each other.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is a man of extreme views.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他持有極端的觀點。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The country faced extreme poverty.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該國面臨極度貧困。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The expedition faced extreme conditions.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這次探險面臨極端惡劣的條件。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他持有極端的觀點。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4534,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u11::faint::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She heard a ____ cry for help.","expectedAnswer":"faint","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She heard a ____ cry for help.","clozeAnswer":"faint","exampleTranslation":"她聽到微弱的求救聲。","reference":{"eng":"faint","kk":"/feɪnt/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['微弱的', '模糊的'], ['昏眩的', '無力的']]","chEntries":["微弱的","模糊的","昏眩的","無力的"],"practiceMeaning":"她聽到微弱的求救聲。","analysis":"源自古法語 'feint'，意為 'feigned, false, weak' (偽裝的、虛假的、軟弱的)。此字根與 'feign' (假裝) 同源。\n    'adj.' 意義延伸：\n    1. 微弱、模糊：指感官可察覺的程度極低，如 'faint sound' (微弱的聲音)，'faint light' (微弱的光)。\n    2. 虛弱、無力：指身體或精神上的狀態，如 'faint with hunger' (因飢餓而無力)，'faint hope' (渺茫的希望)。","definition":"1. (of a light, sound, smell, or colour) scarcely perceptible; faint.; 2. feeling weak and dizzy and liable to collapse.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She heard a faint cry for help.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她聽到微弱的求救聲。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He felt faint and had to sit down.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他感到頭暈，不得不坐下。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There was a faint smell of gas in the air.\",\n    \"ch\": \"空氣中有微弱的瓦斯味。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她聽到微弱的求救聲。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U11"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3216,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::farewell::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We held a small party for his ____.","expectedAnswer":"farewell","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We held a small party for his ____.","clozeAnswer":"farewell","exampleTranslation":"我們為他的告別舉行了一個小型派對。","reference":{"eng":"farewell","kk":"/ˌfɛrˈwɛl/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['告別'], ['離別']]","chEntries":["告別","離別"],"practiceMeaning":"我們為他的告別舉行了一個小型派對。","analysis":"源自古英語 'fāran wel'，字面意思是『去得好』，是離別時的祝福語。演變成名詞，指告別的時刻或行為。","definition":"an act of saying goodbye or parting.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We held a small party for his farewell.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們為他的告別舉行了一個小型派對。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It was a tearful farewell.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是一場含淚的告別。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們為他的告別舉行了一個小型派對。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U41"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3287,"wordRef":"字彙王::u42::fax::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Please send the report by ____.","expectedAnswer":"fax","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Please send the report by ____.","clozeAnswer":"fax","exampleTranslation":"請將報告以傳真方式發送。","reference":{"eng":"fax","kk":"/fæks/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['傳真；傳真文件']]","chEntries":["傳真","傳真文件"],"practiceMeaning":"請將報告以傳真方式發送。","analysis":"縮寫自 'facsimile' (副本)，源自拉丁語 'fac simile' (照樣製作)。指將文件副本通過電話線傳輸的技