"n.","ch":"[['回饋；意見；反應'], ['（電子設備的）反饋，聲嘯']]","chEntries":["回饋","意見","反應","反饋，聲嘯"],"practiceMeaning":"我們收到了對我們新產品的大量正面回饋。","analysis":"由 'feed'（饋送）+ 'back'（回）組成。'Feedback' 指將某個過程的結果或輸出作為輸入，以評估、改進或調整該過程。在人際互動中，它是關於某人表現的意見或評價。在技術領域，它可能是系統對其自身輸出的反應，或用戶對產品的反應。核心概念是「回歸」、「反應」或「評估」。","definition":"1. information about the reactions of customers or others to a product, service, or person; 2. the return of output from one stage of a process as input to a later stage; 3. (in electronics) the modification of a signal by passing it back to an earlier stage.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We received a lot of positive feedback on our new product.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們收到了對我們新產品的大量正面回饋。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Your feedback is important to help us improve.\",\n    \"ch\": \"您的意見對我們改進很重要。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The microphone produced an annoying feedback sound.\",\n    \"ch\": \"麥克風發出了一種惱人的聲嘯。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們收到了對我們新產品的大量正面回饋。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U40"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3290,"wordRef":"字彙王::u42::ferry::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We took the ____ to cross to the island.","expectedAnswer":"ferry","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We took the ____ to cross to the island.","clozeAnswer":"ferry","exampleTranslation":"我們搭乘渡輪前往島上。","reference":{"eng":"ferry","kk":"/ˈfɛri/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['渡輪；擺渡船'], ['（渡輪的）航線']]","chEntries":["渡輪","擺渡船","航線"],"practiceMeaning":"我們搭乘渡輪前往島上。","analysis":"源自古英語 'ferigan' (運輸)。指用於在兩岸之間運送乘客或車輛的船隻，以及其運營的固定路線。","definition":"a boat or ship for taking passengers and often vehicles across a river or narrow area of water; the service provided by such a boat or ship.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We took the ferry to cross to the island.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們搭乘渡輪前往島上。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The ferry schedule is available online.\",\n    \"ch\": \"渡輪的班次表可以在網上查到。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們搭乘渡輪前往島上。","sourceName":"字彙王","unit