lexible","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This material is very ____ and easy to work with.","clozeAnswer":"flexible","exampleTranslation":"這種材料非常柔軟，易於加工。","reference":{"eng":"flexible","kk":"/ˈflɛksəbl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['靈活的；可彎曲的'], ['易於適應的；適應性強的'], ['（價格、時間等）可協商的']]","chEntries":["靈活的","可彎曲的","易於適應的","適應性強的","可協商的"],"practiceMeaning":"這種材料非常柔軟，易於加工。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'flexibilis'，由 'flectere' (彎曲) + '-ibilis' (可) 組成。指能夠輕易彎曲或改變形狀，引申至行為、計劃或安排，表示容易適應變化、不僵化。","definition":"1. able to be easily bent or changed; 2. able to adapt or be adapted to new conditions; 3. open to change or negotiation.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This material is very flexible and easy to work with.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這種材料非常柔軟，易於加工。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We offer flexible working hours for our employees.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們為員工提供彈性工作時間。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company has a flexible approach to problem-solving.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家公司在解決問題方面採取靈活的策略。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這種材料非常柔軟，易於加工。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U42"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5643,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l8::flock::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"A ____ of birds flew overhead.","expectedAnswer":"flock","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"A ____ of birds flew overhead.","clozeAnswer":"flock","exampleTranslation":"一群鳥從頭頂飛過。","reference":{"eng":"flock","kk":"flɑːk","tense":"n.","ch":"[['（鳥、羊等）群'], ['（人）群眾']]","chEntries":["群","群眾"],"practiceMeaning":"一群鳥從頭頂飛過。","analysis":"此字源自古英語 flocc，意為「群」。其詞源不確定，但與原始日耳曼語 *flukaz（群）有關。核心語義指代「一群相似的動物」或「聚集的人」。構詞上，此字為單一詞根，無明顯字首字尾。此處為名詞用法，表示一群動物（尤指鳥類或羊）或聚集在一起的人。","definition":"a number of birds, sheep, or other animals gathered together; a group of people.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A flock of birds flew overhead.\",\n    \"ch\": \"一群鳥從頭頂飛過。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A flock of tourists gathered around the guide.\",\n    \"ch\": \"一群遊客圍繞著導遊。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"一群鳥從頭頂飛過。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4395,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::flour::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"You need ____, eggs, and sugar to make a cake.","expectedAnswer":"flour","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"You need ____, eggs, and sugar to make a cake.","clozeAnswer":"flour","exampleTranslation":"做蛋糕需要麵粉、雞蛋和糖。","reference":{"eng":"flour","kk":"/ˈflaʊər/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['麵粉', '粉']]","chEntries":["麵粉","粉"],"practiceMeaning":"做蛋糕需要麵粉、雞蛋和糖。","analysis":"詞源自古法語 'flor de farine'，意為「麵粉中最精細的部分」（'flor' 意為花）。發音與 'flower' (花) 相同，兩者為同音異義詞。","definition":"a powder obtained by grinding grain, typically wheat, and used to make bread, cakes, and pastry.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"You need flour, eggs, and sugar to make a cake.\",\n    \"ch\": \"做蛋糕需要麵粉、雞蛋和糖。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The baker used whole wheat flour for the bread.\",\n    \"ch\": \"麵包師傅用全麥麵粉做麵包。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"做蛋糕需要麵粉、雞蛋和糖。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3085,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::fluent::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She is ____ in three languages.","expectedAnswer":"fluent","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She is ____ in three languages.","clozeAnswer":"fluent","exampleTranslation":"她精通三種語言。","reference":{"eng":"fluent","kk":"/ˈfluːənt/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['流利的；流暢的'], ['（思想、表達）暢達的']]","chEntries":["流利的","流暢的","暢達的"],"practiceMeaning":"她精通三種語言。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'fluens'，'fluere' (to flow)。核心意義是「像水一樣流動」。\n1. 流利的；流暢的：指說話或寫作時，語言運用自如，沒有間斷或困難。\n2. （思想、表達）暢達的：指思想清晰，表達順暢，沒有阻礙。","definition":"1. able to speak or write a language easily, quickly, and well; 2. speaking or writing easily, smoothly, and clearly.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is fluent in three languages.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她精通三種語言。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His explanation was fluent and easy to understand.\