 young children.","expectedAnswer":"foster","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The program aims to ____ creativity in young children.","clozeAnswer":"foster","exampleTranslation":"該計劃旨在培養幼童的創造力。","reference":{"eng":"foster","kk":"ˈfɔstər","tense":"vt.","ch":"[  [    \"培養\"  ],  [    \"促進\"  ],  [    \"養育\"  ],  [    \"鼓勵\"  ]]","chEntries":["培養","促進","養育","鼓勵"],"practiceMeaning":"該計劃旨在培養幼童的創造力。","analysis":"此字源自古英語 fōster，意為「餵養，養育」。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根。作及物動詞時，核心語義是鼓勵、促進或養育事物的發展，特別是抽象的概念，如成長、進步、關係或情感。也可以指實際養育孩子。此及物動詞義必須接受詞，例如 foster growth、foster understanding、foster children。中文翻譯為「培養；促進；養育；鼓勵」。","definition":"1. to encourage the development or growth of something; 2. to take care of a child, or to provide a home for a child, for a period of time.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The program aims to foster creativity in young children.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該計劃旨在培養幼童的創造力。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to foster a sense of community.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要促進社區意識。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They decided to foster a child from the local orphanage.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們決定領養當地孤兒院的一個孩子。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"該計劃旨在培養幼童的創造力。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U67"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4621,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u16::fountain::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Children were playing near the ____ in the park.","expectedAnswer":"fountain","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Children were playing near the ____ in the park.","clozeAnswer":"fountain","exampleTranslation":"孩子們在公園的噴泉附近玩耍。","reference":{"eng":"fountain","kk":"/ˈfaʊntən/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['噴泉'], ['噴水池'], ['源泉']]","chEntries":["噴泉","噴水池","源泉"],"practiceMeaning":"孩子們在公園的噴泉附近玩耍。","analysis":"源自古法語 'fontaine'，來自拉丁語 'fons' (泉水)。核心概念是水源或噴出水的裝置。可以是天然的泉水，也可以是人工建造的噴泉或噴水池。引申義可指某事物產生的源頭。","definition":"a structure that sends a stream of water into the air; a source or origin.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Children were playing near the fountain 