"prompt":"The ship sailed into the ____ at dawn.","expectedAnswer":"harbor","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ship sailed into the ____ at dawn.","clozeAnswer":"harbor","exampleTranslation":"船在黎明時駛入港口。","reference":{"eng":"harbor","kk":"/ˈhɑːrbər/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['港口', '避風港'], ['（秘密的）藏身處']]","chEntries":["港口","避風港","藏身處"],"practiceMeaning":"船在黎明時駛入港口。","analysis":"源自古英語 'herebeorg'，由 'here' (army, host - 軍隊) 和 'beorg' (shelter, protection - 庇護所) 組成。最初意為軍隊的避難所。引申為船隻停泊的避風港，也指秘密藏匿罪犯或非法物品的地方。","definition":"1. a place where ships may anchor safely; a port.; 2. a place of refuge or shelter.; 3. a place where a person or thing secretly stays.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The ship sailed into the harbor at dawn.\",\n    \"ch\": \"船在黎明時駛入港口。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The island served as a natural harbor for pirates.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個島嶼是海盜的天然藏身處。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"船在黎明時駛入港口。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U11"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5479,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l4::harmony::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The two nations lived in ____ for many years.","expectedAnswer":"harmony","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The two nations lived in ____ for many years.","clozeAnswer":"harmony","exampleTranslation":"這兩個國家和諧相處了許多年。","reference":{"eng":"harmony","kk":"ˈhɑrməni","tense":"n.","ch":"[['和諧'], ['融洽'], ['和聲']]","chEntries":["和諧","融洽","和聲"],"practiceMeaning":"這兩個國家和諧相處了許多年。","analysis":"此字源自希臘語 'harmonia'（結合、協調、和聲），後來經由拉丁語 'harmonia' 傳入古英語 'harmoie'，再到中古英語 'harmony'。'Harmonia' 本身來自 'harmos'（連接、鎖扣）。在音樂上，它指「不同音高並存時產生的悅耳聲音」。在社會和人際關係上，它引申為「各方之間協調、融洽、沒有衝突的狀態」。核心語意是「各部分組合在一起時產生的協調與一致」。","definition":"1. The quality of forming a pleasing and consistent whole.; 2. Agreement or concord; peaceful relations.; 3. (Music) The combination of notes played or sung simultaneously to produce a pleasing effect.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The two nations lived in harmony for many years.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這兩個國家和諧相處了許多年。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The choir sang in perfect harmony.\",\n    \"ch\": \"合唱團以完美的和聲演唱。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to find a way to live in harmony with nature.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要找到一種與大自然和諧共處的方式。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這兩個國家和諧相處了許多年。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5481,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l4::harvest::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The farmers began to ____ the wheat.","expectedAnswer":"harvest","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The farmers began to ____ the wheat.","clozeAnswer":"harvest","exampleTranslation":"農民們開始收割小麥。","reference":{"eng":"harvest","kk":"ˈhɑrvəst","tense":"v.","ch":"[['收割'], ['收穫']]","chEntries":["收割","收穫"],"practiceMeaning":"農民們開始收割小麥。","analysis":"此字由名詞 'harvest'（收成）派生而來。作為動詞，'harvest' 的意思是「收割、採集農作物」。它直接承襲了名詞的語意，指進行收穫動作的過程。這個動詞強調的是將成熟的作物從土地上採集下來的行為。核心語意是「進行收割」。","definition":"1. Gather (a crop) from the fields.; 2. (Of a crop) yield or give as a harvest.; 3. Gather or reap.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The farmers began to harvest the wheat.\",\n    \"ch\": \"農民們開始收割小麥。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We helped to harvest the apples.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們幫忙採收蘋果。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The land yielded a good harvest.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這片土地收穫頗豐。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"農民們開始收割小麥。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4510,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::have::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"I ____ a car.","expectedAnswer":"have","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"I ____ a car.","clozeAnswer":"have","exampleTranslation":"我有一輛車。","reference":{"eng":"have","kk":"/hæv/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['有'], ['持有'], ['經歷（事件、情況）'], ['吃、喝'], ['導致'], ['認為']]","chEntries":["有","持有","經歷","吃、喝","導致","認為"],"practiceMeaning":"我有一輛車。","analysis":"源自古英語 habban。是一個極其核心且語意廣泛的動詞。常用作助動詞（如構成現在完成時），也獨立表示「擁有」、「持有」、「經歷」等。語意涵蓋物理擁有、抽象擁有、經歷、飲食、原因等。","definition":"1. To possess, own, or hold; 2. To experience (a feeling, state, or injury); 3. To eat, drink, or take; 4. To cause to happen; 5. To consider or regard.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I have a car.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我有一輛車。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We had a great time at the party.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們在派對上度過了愉快的時光。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Have some tea.\",\n    \"ch\": \"喝點茶。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I think he is mistaken.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我認為他弄錯了。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我有一輛車。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3225,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::hawk::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"A ____ circled high above the field.","expectedAnswer":"hawk","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"A ____ circled high above the field.","clozeAnswer":"hawk","exampleTranslation":"一隻老鷹在高飛過田野。","reference":{"eng":"hawk","kk":"/hɔk/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['鷹'], ['隼']]","chEntries":["鷹","隼"],"practiceMeaning":"一隻老鷹在高飛過田野。","analysis":"詞源來自古英語 'hafoc'。指一類日間飛行、視力敏銳的肉食性猛禽，以其兇猛和高超的飛行技巧聞名。","definition":"a medium-sized diurnal bird of prey with a hooked beak and eyesight as keen as that of an eagle.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A hawk circled high above the field.\",\n    \"ch\": \"一隻老鷹在高飛過田野。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The falconer trained his hawk to hunt.\",\n    \"ch\": \"訓鷹師訓練他的隼去狩獵。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"一隻老鷹在高飛過田野。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U41"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4208,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::headquarters::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The company's ____ are in New York.","expectedAnswer":"headquarters","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company's ____ are in New York.","clozeAnswer":"headquarters","exampleTranslation":"該公司的總部設在紐約。","reference":{"eng":"headquarters","kk":"/ˈhedkwɔːrtərz/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['總部；指揮部']]","chEntries":["總部","指揮部"],"practiceMeaning":"該公司的總部設在紐約。","analysis":"源自 'head'（頭）+ 'quarters'（駐紮地，四分之一）。'Quarters' 作為複數名詞，原意是指士兵的營房或住所。'Headquarters' 最初是指軍隊的指揮部或司令部所在地，即“頭領”的“駐紮地”。後廣泛用於指任何組織或機構的核心辦公地點。","definition":"A place from which military operations are directed; the central administration or command of an organization.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company's headquarters are in New York.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司的總部設在紐約。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The general gave orders from headquarters.\",\n    \"ch\": \"將軍從指揮部發布了命令。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"該公司的總部設在紐約。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5300,"wordRef":"字彙王::u63::heir::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is the sole ____ to his father's fortune.","expectedAnswer":"heir","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is the sole ____ to his father's fortune.","clozeAnswer":"heir","exampleTranslation":"他是他父親財產的唯一繼承人。","reference":{"eng":"heir","kk":"ɛr","tense":"n.","ch":"[['繼承人']]","chEntries":["繼承人"],"practiceMeaning":"他是他父親財產的唯一繼承人。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 'hered'，來自拉丁語 'heres'（繼承人）。在英語中，'h' 在此處不發音。構詞上，'her-' 為詞根，'es' 可能與表示「人」的後綴有關，最終指向「繼承財產或地位的人」。","definition":"a person legally entitled to the property or rank of another on that person's death.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is the sole heir to his father's fortune.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是他父親財產的唯一繼承人。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The prince is the heir to the throne.\",\n    \"ch\": \"王子是王位的繼承人。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他是他父親財產的唯一繼承人。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U63"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4254,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u7::historic::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The signing of the treaty was a ____ moment for both countries.","expectedAnswer":"historic","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The signing of the treaty was a ____ moment for both countries.","clozeAnswer":"historic","exampleTranslation":"簽署條約是兩國的歷史性時刻。","reference":{"eng":"historic","kk":"/hɪˈstɔːrɪk/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['歷史性的'], ['歷史上重要的']]","chEntries":["歷史性的","歷史上重要的"],"practiceMeaning":"簽署條約是兩國的歷史性時刻。","analysis":"源自希臘語 'histor'（知道、詢問）。'Historic' 指的是「在歷史上是重要的、有意義的」，通常與重大的事件或人物相關。它強調事件的「重要性」，而非僅僅是「過去的」。與 'historical'（歷史的，指關於歷史的）不同。","definition":"famous or important in history, or potentially important in the future.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The signing of the treaty was a historic moment for both countries.\",\n    \"ch\": \"簽署條約是兩國的歷史性時刻。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The building has historic significance.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這棟建築具有歷史意義。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"簽署條約是兩國的歷史性時刻。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3949,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u2::hopeful::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She is ____ about her job prospects.","expectedAnswer":"hopeful","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She is ____ about her job prospects.","clozeAnswer":"hopeful","exampleTranslation":"她對自己的工作前景感到樂觀。","reference":{"eng":"hopeful","kk":"/ˈhəʊpfəl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['抱有希望的', '有希望的'], ['充滿希望的']]","chEntries":["抱有希望的","有希望的","充滿希望的"],"practiceMeaning":"她對自己的工作前景感到樂觀。","analysis":"由 'hope' (名詞/動詞，希望) 和 '-ful' (形容詞後綴) 組成。指對未來抱有樂觀的期望，或表示有成功的可能。","definition":"1. feeling or inspiring optimism about a future event; 2. having or characterized by hope.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is hopeful about her job prospects.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她對自己的工作前景感到樂觀。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It's a hopeful sign for the economy.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是經濟的一個好兆頭。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They are hopeful that a solution can be found.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們對找到解決方案抱有希望。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她對自己的工作前景感到樂觀。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5129,"wordRef":"字彙王::u62::housing::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The city is facing a severe ____ shortage.","expectedAnswer":"housing","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The city is facing a severe ____ shortage.","clozeAnswer":"housing","exampleTranslation":"這座城市面臨嚴重的住房短缺。","reference":{"eng":"housing","kk":"ˈhaʊzɪŋ","tense":"n.","ch":"[['房屋'], ['住房'], ['住宅（的）']]","chEntries":["房屋","住房","住宅"],"practiceMeaning":"這座城市面臨嚴重的住房短缺。","analysis":"此字是動詞 house（提供住所、容納）的現在分詞（gerund 或 present participle），後轉為名詞。house 源自古英語 hūs（房子），與原始日耳曼語 *hūsan- 相關。核心語意為「提供住所的行為或狀態」，引申為「集合的房屋」、「住房供給」或「建築材料（如外殼、框架）」。","definition":"houses and apartments considered collectively; accommodation; a protective casing or covering.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The city is facing a severe housing shortage.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這座城市面臨嚴重的住房短缺。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They are responsible for the housing of the refugees.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們負責難民的安置。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這座城市面臨嚴重的住房短缺。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U62"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6123,"wordRef":"字彙王::u65::hypothesis::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We formed a ____ about the cause of the disease.","expectedAnswer":"hypothesis","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We formed a ____ about the cause of the disease.","clozeAnswer":"hypothesis","exampleTranslation":"我們對疾病的成因提出了一個假設。","reference":{"eng":"hypothesis","kk":"haɪˈpɑːθəsɪs","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"假設\"  ],  [    \"假說\"  ],  [    \"設想\"  ]]","chEntries":["假設","假說","設想"],"practiceMeaning":"我們對疾病的成因提出了一個假設。","analysis":"此字源自希臘語 hypothesis，由 hypo-（在……下面；次要的）和 thesis（放置；論點；主張）組成。hypo- 意為「在下面」，thesis 意為「放置；主張」。因此，hypothesis 的核心語義是「放在……下面做基礎的主張」，即一個初步的、待驗證的解釋或主張。此名詞常用於科學研究，指對現象的初步解釋，有待實驗驗證。其語意演變是從「放在下面」到「作為基礎的論點」。","definition":"A supposition or proposed explanation made on the basis of limited evidence as a starting point for further investigation.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We formed a hypothesis about the cause of the disease.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們對疾病的成因提出了一個假設。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The scientist tested the hypothesis through experiments.\",\n    \"ch\": \"科學家通過實驗來驗證這個假說。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is just a hypothesis, not a proven fact.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這只是一個假設，不是已證實的事實。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們對疾病的成因提出了一個假設。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U65"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6124,"wordRef":"字彙王::u65::icon::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is an ____ of the fashion industry.","expectedAnswer":"icon","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is an ____ of the fashion industry.","clozeAnswer":"icon","exampleTranslation":"他是時尚界的偶像。","reference":{"eng":"icon","kk":"ˈaɪkɑːn","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"圖像\"  ],  [    \"圖標\"  ],  [    \"偶像\"  ]]","chEntries":["圖像","圖標","偶像"],"practiceMeaning":"他是時尚界的偶像。","analysis":"此字源自希臘語 eikōn，意為「圖像；肖像」。在早期，主要指宗教畫像，特別是東方教會中用於崇拜的聖像。在 modern English 中，icon 指電腦螢幕上的小圖形符號（圖標），或比喻某個領域中被廣泛崇拜或模仿的傑出人物（偶像）。其語意演變是從「圖像」到「宗教聖像」，再到「電腦圖標」和「現代偶像」。","definition":"1. a person or thing regarded as a representative symbol or as worthy of veneration; 2. a small graphic image or symbol on a computer screen that represents a program, command, or file.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is an icon of the fashion industry.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是時尚界的偶像。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Click on the folder icon to open it.\",\n    \"ch\": \"點擊文件夾圖標將其打開。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The artist became an icon of the youth movement.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位藝術家成為青年運動的標誌性人物。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他是時尚界的偶像。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U65"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3167,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::impose::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He didn't want to ____ his political views on others.","expectedAnswer":"impose","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He didn't want to ____ his political views on others.","clozeAnswer":"impose","exampleTranslation":"他不想將自己的政治觀點強加於人。","reference":{"eng":"impose","kk":"/ɪmˈpoʊz/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['強加；硬塞'], ['強制實施；推行']]","chEntries":["強加","硬塞","強制實施","推行"],"practiceMeaning":"他不想將自己的政治觀點強加於人。","analysis":"詞源來自拉丁語 'imponere'，意為「放置，加在...之上」，由 'in-'（在...之上）+ 'ponere'（放置）組成。'Impose' 強調的是將某物（想法、規則、負擔、人）強行施加或強加於他人，使之接受，通常是在對方不情願或沒有選擇的情況下。也可以指強制實施法律、稅收或限制。","definition":"1. force (someone) to accept or put up with something; 2. inflict (something unwelcome or unpleasant) on someone; 3. establish or apply (a tax, fine, rule, etc.) by authority.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He didn't want to impose his political views on others.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他不想將自己的政治觀點強加於人。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The government decided to impose a new tax on luxury goods.\",\n    \"ch\": \"政府決定對奢侈品徵收新稅。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She felt that her relatives were imposing on her kindness.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她覺得她的親戚在利用她的善良。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他不想將自己的政治觀點強加於人。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U40"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5049,"wordRef":"字彙王::u59::impulse::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She bought the dress on ____.","expectedAnswer":"impulse","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She bought the dress on ____.","clozeAnswer":"impulse","exampleTranslation":"她一時衝動買了那件洋裝。","reference":{"eng":"impulse","kk":"ˈɪmpʌls","tense":"n.","ch":"[['衝動'], ['心血來潮'], ['（物理學）衝量'], ['（神經）衝動']]","chEntries":["衝動","心血來潮","衝量"],"practiceMeaning":"她一時衝動買了那件洋裝。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語impulsus，是動詞impellere（推動、驅使）的過去分詞。impellere 由 im-（朝向、進入）+ pellere（推動）組成。impulse 的核心語意是「一種突然的、強烈的驅動力或推動」。引申為「衝動」（未經思考的行為）、生理學上的「神經衝動」以及物理學上的「衝量」。OCR 掃描時可能將 'p' 誤判為 'r'。此處修正為 impulse。","definition":"1. a sudden strong and unreflective urge or desire to act; 2. a sudden brief command signal in physiology; 3. (in physics) the product of the force and time during which it acts.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She bought the dress on impulse.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她一時衝動買了那件洋裝。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A sudden impulse made him turn around.\",\n    \"ch\": \"一股突如其來的衝動讓他轉過身。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Nerve impulses are transmitted along the axon.\",\n    \"ch\": \"神經衝動沿著軸突傳遞。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她一時衝動買了那件洋裝。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U59"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5672,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l8::in-question::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Let's focus on the issue ____.","expectedAnswer":"in question","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Let's focus on the issue ____.","clozeAnswer":"in question","exampleTranslation":"讓我們關注所討論的問題。","reference":{"eng":"in question","kk":"ɪn ˈkwɛstʃən","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['所討論的'], ['所提及的'], ['有疑問的']]","chEntries":["所討論的","所提及的","有疑問的"],"practiceMeaning":"讓我們關注所討論的問題。","analysis":"此片語由介詞 in + 名詞 question（問題）構成。question 源自古法語 queste（詢問，search），來自拉丁語 quaestio（詢問，subject of inquiry）。其核心語義為「需要解答的疑問」或「所討論的議題」。in question 字面意思為「在問題之中」，引申為「被討論、被考慮或有爭議的」事物。此片語作為形容詞片語，用於修飾名詞，指出其是當前討論或爭議的焦點。沒有單獨的構詞分析，應視為固定片語。","definition":"being discussed or considered; the subject of discussion; causing doubt or uncertainty.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Let's focus on the issue in question.\",\n    \"ch\": \"讓我們關注所討論的問題。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The suitability of the candidate is in question.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位候選人的適任性受到質疑。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"讓我們關注所討論的問題。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4306,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u7::in-summary::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"____, the new policy is expected to improve efficiency.","expectedAnswer":"In summary","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"____, the new policy is expected to improve efficiency.","clozeAnswer":"In summary","exampleTranslation":"總之，新政策預計將提高效率。","reference":{"eng":"in summary","kk":"/ɪn ˈsʌməri/","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['總之'], ['概括地說']]","chEntries":["總之","概括地說"],"practiceMeaning":"總之，新政策預計將提高效率。","analysis":"由介詞 'in'（在）和名詞 'summary'（摘要）組成。'In summary' 是用於引導結語的片語，表示「將前面討論的內容做一個簡短的總結」。","definition":"briefly; in a short statement.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"In summary, the new policy is expected to improve efficiency.\",\n    \"ch\": \"總之，新政策預計將提高效率。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"In summary, the meeting was productive and achieved its goals.\",\n    \"ch\": \"總括來說，這次會議富有成效並達成了目標。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"總之，新政策預計將提高效率。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5503,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l4::in-the-same-boat::idiom","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We're all ____ when it comes to saving money.","expectedAnswer":"in the same boat","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We're all ____ when it comes to saving money.","clozeAnswer":"in the same boat","exampleTranslation":"在省錢這件事上，我們都處境相同。","reference":{"eng":"in the same boat","kk":"ɪn ðə seɪm boʊt","tense":"idiom","ch":"[['處境相同'], ['同舟共濟'], ['處於同樣的困境']]","chEntries":["處境相同","同舟共濟","處於同樣的困境"],"practiceMeaning":"在省錢這件事上，我們都處境相同。","analysis":"這個片語字面意思是「在同一條船上」。'In the same boat' 表示「與他人共享相同的處境、情況或命運」。如果一群人都在同一條船上，那麼他們面臨的危險、挑戰或經歷都是相同的。這個片語常用來描述「大家都在同一種困難或不利的處境中」。核心語意是「共享相同的處境」。","definition":"1. In the same difficult or unpleasant situation as someone else.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We're all in the same boat when it comes to saving money.\",\n    \"ch\": \"在省錢這件事上，我們都處境相同。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Don't worry, you're not alone; we're all in the same boat.\",\n    \"ch\": \"別擔心，你不是一個人；我們都處境相同。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"With the company facing bankruptcy, all the employees are in the same boat.\",\n    \"ch\": \"隨著公司面臨破產，所有員工都處境相同。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"在省錢這件事上，我們都處境相同。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5633,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l7::in-this-regard::adv-phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The company has invested heavily in new technology; ____, they are ahead of their competitors.","expectedAnswer":"in this regard","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company has invested heavily in new technology; ____, they are ahead of their competitors.","clozeAnswer":"in this regard","exampleTranslation":"該公司在新能源技術上投入巨資；在這方面，他們領先於競爭對手。","reference":{"eng":"in this regard","kk":"ɪn ðɪs rɪˈɡɑrd","tense":"adv. phrase","ch":"[['在這方面']]","chEntries":["在這方面"],"practiceMeaning":"該公司在新能源技術上投入巨資；在這方面，他們領先於競爭對手。","analysis":"此片語由介詞 'in'（在……中），指示代名詞 'this'（這個）和名詞 'regard'（方面、考慮）組成。'in' 源自古英語 'in'；'this' 源自古英語 'þis'；'regard' 源自古法語 'reguarder'（看、注意），意為「目光」、「考慮」、「方面」。構詞學上，'regard' 本身是個多義詞，在此作為名詞，與 'in this' 結合，表示「就這個特定提到的方面而言」。它用於指代前面剛說過或暗示過的主題、情況或觀點，作為進一步討論的依據。","definition":"With reference to this matter; concerning this.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company has invested heavily in new technology; in this regard, they are ahead of their competitors.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司在新能源技術上投入巨資；在這方面，他們領先於競爭對手。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Customer satisfaction is important. In this regard, we need to improve our service.\",\n    \"ch\": \"顧客滿意度很重要。在這方面，我們需要改進我們的服務。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"該公司在新能源技術上投入巨資；在這方面，他們領先於競爭對手。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3104,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::income::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The company's annual ____ increased by 10%.","expectedAnswer":"income","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company's annual ____ increased by 10%.","clozeAnswer":"income","exampleTranslation":"該公司的年收入增加了10%。","reference":{"eng":"income","kk":"/ˈɪnkʌm/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['收入；收益']]","chEntries":["收入","收益"],"practiceMeaning":"該公司的年收入增加了10%。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'invenire' (to come in)。指「進入」的錢財。\n1. 收入；收益：指個人、家庭或公司在一段時期內賺取的金錢。","definition":"1. money that you earn from doing work or through investment; 2. the amount of money that a person or country 