e loves to ____ scarves for her grandchildren.","expectedAnswer":"knit","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She loves to ____ scarves for her grandchildren.","clozeAnswer":"knit","exampleTranslation":"她喜歡為孫子孫女編織圍巾。","reference":{"eng":"knit","kk":"/ˈnɪt/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['編織（毛線等）'], ['（傷口）癒合']]","chEntries":["編織","癒合"],"practiceMeaning":"她喜歡為孫子孫女編織圍巾。","analysis":"源自古英語 *knittan*，與荷蘭語 *knippen*（剪、捏）同源，可能與原始印歐語 *gned-*（編織、結合）有關。核心概念是將線或纖維纏繞、結合在一起。此動作延伸至生物體的癒合過程，將斷裂處重新連結。","definition":"1. To form (fabric or a garment) by interlocking loops of wool, yarn, or other fibres with knitting needles; (of fabric) to be formed in this way. 2. (of a wound or broken bone) To heal or join together by forming new tissue.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She loves to knit scarves for her grandchildren.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她喜歡為孫子孫女編織圍巾。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The doctor said the cut would knit up nicely.\",\n    \"ch\": \"醫生說傷口會很好地癒合。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她喜歡為孫子孫女編織圍巾。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U17"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4724,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u17::label::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Please ____ the boxes with their contents.","expectedAnswer":"label","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Please ____ the boxes with their contents.","clozeAnswer":"label","exampleTranslation":"請為箱子貼上內容物的標籤。","reference":{"eng":"label","kk":"/ˈleɪbəl/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['貼標籤'], ['標記'], ['（非正式）稱呼、歸類']]","chEntries":["貼標籤","標記","稱呼、歸類"],"practiceMeaning":"請為箱子貼上內容物的標籤。","analysis":"動詞形式，指為某物貼上標籤、進行標記，或將其歸類、命名。","definition":"1. To attach a label to something. 2. To assign a name or description to someone or something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please label the boxes with their contents.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請為箱子貼上內容物的標籤。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They were labeled as troublemakers.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們被貼上了麻煩製造者的標籤。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"請為箱子貼上內容物的標籤。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字"