e is a man of great integrity.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是一個品格高尚的人。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"All men are created equal.\",\n    \"ch\": \"人人生而平等。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is looking for a good man to marry.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她在尋找一個好男人結婚。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他是一個品格高尚的人。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5301,"wordRef":"字彙王::u63::mandate::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The government has a clear ____ from the people.","expectedAnswer":"mandate","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The government has a clear ____ from the people.","clozeAnswer":"mandate","exampleTranslation":"政府擁有人民的明確授權。","reference":{"eng":"mandate","kk":"ˈmændeɪt","tense":"n.","ch":"[['授權', '命令'], ['（國際聯盟或聯合國託管下的）委任統治區'], ['（某群體或個人）的權力或授權']]","chEntries":["授權","命令","委任統治區","的權力或授權"],"practiceMeaning":"政府擁有人民的明確授權。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'mandatum'（命令，委託，來自 'mandare'，意為「命令，委派」）。'mandare' 由 'manus'（hand）和 'dare'（to give）構成，原意是「將（某事）交到手中」。構詞上，'mand-' 為詞根，'-ate' 為後綴。核心語意是「被給予的權力」或「被給予的指令」。在現代英語中，'mandate' 可以指正式的命令、授權，也可以指由選舉產生的政府所擁有的民意授權。","definition":"an official order or commission to do something; the authority to carry out a policy or course of action, regarded as given by the electorate to a representative; a territory administered by another country.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The government has a clear mandate from the people.\",\n    \"ch\": \"政府擁有人民的明確授權。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The UN mandate expired last year.\",\n    \"ch\": \"聯合國的託管期去年已滿。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"政府擁有人民的明確授權。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U63"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5303,"wordRef":"字彙王::u63::masculine::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He has a very ____ voice.","expectedAnswer":"masculine","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He has a very ____ voice.","clozeAnswer":"masculine","exampleTranslation":"他的聲音非常男性化。","reference":{"eng":"masculine","kk":"ˈmæskjəlɪn","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['男性的', '男子氣概的'], ['（語法）陽性的']]","chEntries":["男性的","男子氣概的","陽性的"],"practiceMeaning":"他的聲音非常男性化。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'masculinus'（男性的），來自 'masculus'（雄性的，來自 'mas'，意為「男性」）。構詞上，'mascul-' 為詞根，'-ine' 為形容詞後綴。核心語意與「男性」相關，可用於生理性別、社會性別特徵（男子氣概），以及語法中的「陽性」詞性。","definition":"having or denoting qualities traditionally associated with men; relating to or denoting words or phrases that refer to males; male.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He has a very masculine voice.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的聲音非常男性化。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The adjective 'le' is masculine in French.\",\n    \"ch\": \"形容詞 'le' 在法語中是陽性的。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他的聲音非常男性化。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U63"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6082,"wordRef":"字彙王::u64::meantime::adv","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The train will be here in ten minutes; in the ____, you can sit down.","expectedAnswer":"meantime","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The train will be here in ten minutes; in the ____, you can sit down.","clozeAnswer":"meantime","exampleTranslation":"火車十分鐘後就到；在此期間，你可以坐下。","reference":{"eng":"meantime","kk":"ˈmintˌaɪm","tense":"adv.","ch":"[  [    \"其間\"  ],  [    \"同時\"  ]]","chEntries":["其間","同時"],"practiceMeaning":"火車十分鐘後就到；在此期間，你可以坐下。","analysis":"此字為複合詞，由 mean（中間的）和 time（時間）組成。核心語義是「在中間的時間裡」或「在兩件事之間的時間裡」。它用來連接兩個事件或時間段，指在第一個事件發生時或之後，到第二個事件發生前的那段時間。","definition":"during the time between two specified times or events.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The train will be here in ten minutes; in the meantime, you can sit down.\",\n    \"ch\": \"火車十分鐘後就到；在此期間，你可以坐下。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She's studying abroad for a year. In the meantime, her family is taking care of her apartment.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她將在國外學習一年。與此同時，她的家人會幫忙照看她的公寓。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We are waiting for the results. Meantime, let's review the previous findings.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們在等待結果。同時，讓我們複習一下之前的發現