    \"eng\": \"Lack of motivation is a common problem for students.\",\n    \"ch\": \"缺乏學習動力是學生的常見問題。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His primary motivation for moving was a better job.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他搬遷的主要動機是為了更好的工作。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"缺乏學習動力是學生的常見問題。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U39"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3231,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::mule::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ was strong enough to carry heavy loads.","expectedAnswer":"mule","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ was strong enough to carry heavy loads.","clozeAnswer":"mule","exampleTranslation":"那頭騾子強壯到足以馱載重物。","reference":{"eng":"mule","kk":"/mjuːl/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['騾子'], ['倔強的人'], ['（鞋）拖鞋']]","chEntries":["騾子","倔強的人","拖鞋"],"practiceMeaning":"那頭騾子強壯到足以馱載重物。","analysis":"詞源來自拉丁文 'mulus'。指驢與馬雜交產生的不育雌性後代。因其固執和強壯的特性，引申指『倔強的人』。另外，特指一種無後跟的鞋子，稱為『mule shoes』。","definition":"1. a sterile hybrid animal between a male donkey and a female horse; 2. a type of shoe that is backless and typically has a pointed toe.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The mule was strong enough to carry heavy loads.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那頭騾子強壯到足以馱載重物。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He's as stubborn as a mule.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他像騾子一樣固執。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She wore a pair of comfortable mules around the house.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她在家裡穿著一雙舒適的拖鞋。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"那頭騾子強壯到足以馱載重物。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U41"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5466,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l4::multiple::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The project requires ____ skills.","expectedAnswer":"multiple","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The project requires ____ skills.","clozeAnswer":"multiple","exampleTranslation":"這個專案需要多種技能。","reference":{"eng":"multiple","kk":"ˈmʌltəpəl","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['多個的'], ['多種的'], ['重複的']]","chEntries":["多個的","多種的","重複的"],"practiceMeaning":"這個專案需要多種技能。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'multiplus'，由 'multus'（許多）和 '-plus'（-倍的）組成。'-plus' 在此類似於「加」或「倍」。'Multus' 意為「多的、許多的」。因此，'multiple' 的核心語意是「由許多部分組成、包含許多事物、或有多個」。它可以用來形容數量、種類或元素的眾多。與 'many' 相比，'multiple' 更強調「由多個獨立部分構成」或「多重性」的概念。","definition":"1. Consisting of, including, or involving more than one individual, element, or part.; 2. Many; numerous.; 3. (Of a number) divisible by another number without a remainder.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The project requires multiple skills.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個專案需要多種技能。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She has multiple reasons for her decision.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她對她的決定有多重理由。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He suffered multiple injuries in the accident.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在事故中受了多處傷。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這個專案需要多種技能。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4181,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::murder::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The police are investigating a brutal ____.","expectedAnswer":"murder","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The police are investigating a brutal ____.","clozeAnswer":"murder","exampleTranslation":"警方正在調查一起殘酷的謀殺案。","reference":{"eng":"murder","kk":"/ˈmɜːrdər/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['謀殺；兇殺案'], ['（尤指）嚴酷的毀滅']]","chEntries":["謀殺","兇殺案","嚴酷的毀滅"],"practiceMeaning":"警方正在調查一起殘酷的謀殺案。","analysis":"源自古英語 morthor，意為“謀殺”。詞源學上與古諾爾斯語 morð、古高地德語 mord 相關，最終可追溯至原始印歐語 *mer-，意為“殺死”。其核心概念是蓄意且非法地奪取生命。引申義則是任何極其殘酷的毀滅或傷害，例如 'murder the landscape'（毀壞景觀）。","definition":"1. the unlawful killing of another human being with malice aforethought; 2. a brutal or violent destruction or damage.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The police are investigating a brutal murder.\",\n    \"ch\": \"警方正在調查一起殘酷的謀殺案。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They were accused of committing murder.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們被控犯有謀殺罪。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This decision was a murder of artistic integrity.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個決定是對藝術完整性的嚴重破壞。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"警方正在調查一起殘酷的謀殺案。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U6、L1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5135,"wordRef":"字彙王::u62::muscular::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He has a ____ physique.","expectedAnswer":"muscular","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He has a ____ physique.","clozeAnswer":"muscular","exampleTranslation":"他有著肌肉發達的體格。","reference":{"eng":"muscular","kk":"ˈmʌskjələr","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['肌肉的'], ['強壯的'], ['肌肉發達的']]","chEntries":["肌肉的","強壯的","肌肉發達的"],"practiceMeaning":"他有著肌肉發達的體格。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 muscularis，由 musculus（肌肉，是 mus 的指小詞，意為「小老鼠」）+ -aris（形容詞字尾）組成。musculus 之所以稱為「小老鼠」，是因為古羅馬人認為肌肉收縮時的形狀像老鼠在皮膚下移動。核心語意是「與肌肉有關的」，引申為「強壯的、肌肉發達的」。","definition":"relating to or consisting of muscle; having well-developed muscles; strong.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He has a muscular physique.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他有著肌肉發達的體格。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The athlete underwent muscular training.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位運動員接受了肌肉訓練。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他有著肌肉發達的體格。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U62"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4500,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::nationwide::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The government launched a ____ campaign against pollution.","expectedAnswer":"nationwide","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The government launched a ____ campaign against pollution.","clozeAnswer":"nationwide","exampleTranslation":"政府發起了全國性的反污染運動。","reference":{"eng":"nationwide","kk":"/ˌneɪʃnˈwaɪd/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['全國性的']]","chEntries":["全國性的"],"practiceMeaning":"政府發起了全國性的反污染運動。","analysis":"由 nation (國家) 和 wide (廣泛的) 組成。核心語意是「遍及整個國家的」。","definition":"1. Extending or spread throughout a whole nation.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The government launched a nationwide campaign against pollution.\",\n    \"ch\": \"政府發起了全國性的反污染運動。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There was a nationwide shortage of the drug.\",\n    \"ch\": \"全國範圍內都出