    \"ch\": \"原住民的文化通過口述傳統得以保存。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Tourists should respect the customs of the natives.\",\n    \"ch\": \"遊客應尊重當地居民的習俗。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"原住民的文化通過口述傳統得以保存。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4454,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::navy::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He joined the ____ after graduating from college.","expectedAnswer":"navy","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He joined the ____ after graduating from college.","clozeAnswer":"navy","exampleTranslation":"他大學畢業後加入了海軍。","reference":{"eng":"navy","kk":"/ˈneɪvi/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['海軍']]","chEntries":["海軍"],"practiceMeaning":"他大學畢業後加入了海軍。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 navis，意為「船」。最初指與海運有關的事物。後來專指國家的海軍部隊，負責海上防禦和作戰。顏色「海軍藍」也源自於此。因此，語意從「船」引申為「船隊」、「海軍」。","definition":"1. The branch of a country's armed forces that is concerned with serving on the sea; 2. A fleet of ships.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He joined the navy after graduating from college.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他大學畢業後加入了海軍。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The navy conducted a large-scale exercise.\",\n    \"ch\": \"海軍進行了一次大規模演習。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他大學畢業後加入了海軍。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5561,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l6::network::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The company has an extensive marketing ____.","expectedAnswer":"network","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company has an extensive marketing ____.","clozeAnswer":"network","exampleTranslation":"這家公司擁有廣泛的市場網絡。","reference":{"eng":"network","kk":"ˈnɛtwɜrk","tense":"n.","ch":"[['網絡'], ['網路'], ['網絡系統'], ['人脈']]","chEntries":["網絡","網路","網絡系統","人脈"],"practiceMeaning":"這家公司擁有廣泛的市場網絡。","analysis":"此字源自中古英語 \"netwerk\"，由 \"net\"（網）和 \"work\"（工作，結構）組成。\"net\" 源自古英語 \"nett\"，最終可追溯至原始印歐語 \\*ned-（to tie, bind，綁，繫）。\"work\" 源自古英語 \"weorc\"，最終可追溯至原始印歐語 \\*werg-（to do, to work，做，工作）。 \"network\" 最初指「由網狀結構構成的物品」，例如漁網或編織品。隨著科技發展，\"network\" 的語義擴展到「互相連接的系統」，例如電話網絡、電腦網絡。在社會學和商業領域，\"network\" 也指「由人組成的聯繫體系」，即「人脈」或「社交網絡」。核心語義是「由相互連接的元素組成的結構」。","definition":"1. A group of interconnected computers, machines, etc.; 2. A system of roads, railways, etc.; 3. A group of people who know each other and can help each other; 4. A system of connected television or radio stations.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company has an extensive marketing network.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家公司擁有廣泛的市場網絡。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The internet is a global computer network.\",\n    \"ch\": \"網際網路是一個全球性的電腦網絡。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Building a strong professional network is important for career advancement.\",\n    \"ch\": \"建立強大的人脈網絡對職業發展很重要。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這家公司擁有廣泛的市場網絡。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4303,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u7::observe-the-law::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"All citizens are expected to ____.","expectedAnswer":"observe the law","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"All citizens are expected to ____.","clozeAnswer":"observe the law","exampleTranslation":"所有公民都被期望遵守法律。","reference":{"eng":"observe the law","kk":"/əbˈzɜːrv ðə lɔː/","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['遵守法律']]","chEntries":["遵守法律"],"practiceMeaning":"所有公民都被期望遵守法律。","analysis":"結合了動詞 'observe'（遵守、觀察）和名詞片語 'the law'（法律）。'Observe the law' 的意思是「依循、遵守法律規定，不違反法律」。","definition":"to obey and follow the rules and regulations of the law.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"All citizens are expected to observe the law.\",\n    \"ch\": \"所有公民都被期望遵守法律。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company pledged to observe the law in all its operations.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司承諾在其所有營運中遵守法律。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"所有公民都被期望遵守法律。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4039,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u4::occasion::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"This is a special ____ for our family.","expectedAnswer":"occasion","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This is a special ____ for our family.","clozeAnswer":"occasion","exampleTranslation":"這是我們家的特殊場合。","reference":{"eng":"occasion","kk":"/əˈkeɪʒən/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['時機', '機會'], ['場合', '時刻'], ['原因', '起因']]","chEntries":["時機","機會","場合","時刻","原因","起因"],"practiceMeaning":"這是我們家的特殊場合。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'occasio'，意為「機會」，由 'ob-' (against, toward) + 'cadere' (to fall) 構成，字面意思是「（事件）的發生、來臨」。引申為「時機」、「機會」，也指特定的「場合」、「時刻」。第四個義項「原因」則是由「機會」進一步引申，表示引起某事發生的「原因」或「起因」。","definition":"1. a particular time or event; 2. a special or important event; 3. a reason or cause","example":"[\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"這是我們家的特殊場合。\",\n    \"eng\": \"This is a special occasion for our family.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"他錯過了太多發言的機會。\",\n    \"eng\": \"He has missed too many occasions to speak.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"壞天氣是取消野餐的原因。\",\n    \"eng\": \"The bad weather was the occasion for cancelling the picnic.\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這是我們家的特殊場合。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5051,"wordRef":"字彙王::u59::odds::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"What are the ____ of winning the lottery?","expectedAnswer":"odds","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"What are the ____ of winning the lottery?","clozeAnswer":"odds","exampleTranslation":"中樂透的機率是多少？","reference":{"eng":"odds","kk":"ɑːdz","tense":"n.","ch":"[['可能性'], ['機率'], ['（尤指賭博中的）賠率']]","chEntries":["可能性","機率","賠率"],"practiceMeaning":"中樂透的機率是多少？","analysis":"此字源自中古英語oddes，是 odd（奇數、單獨的）的複數形式。最初可能指「單獨的、不規則的」，引申為「機會、可能性」。其核心語意是「不確定的、難以預測的結果」。在賭博中，odds 指的是「贏的機會與輸的機會的比例」。OCR 掃描時可能將 'o' 誤判為 '0'，或 'd' 誤判為 'cl'。此處修正為 odds，通常以複數形式出現。","definition":"1. the probability of something happening or being the case; 2. the ratio between the amounts staked by parties to a gamble or bet.","example":"[\n  {\n   