esult of an event or process.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The outcome of the election was surprising.\",\n    \"ch\": \"選舉結果出人意料。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We are waiting to see the outcome of the experiments.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們正在等待實驗的結果。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"選舉結果出人意料。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U39"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3105,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::outstanding::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is an ____ student with a high GPA.","expectedAnswer":"outstanding","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is an ____ student with a high GPA.","clozeAnswer":"outstanding","exampleTranslation":"他是一位傑出的學生，GPA很高。","reference":{"eng":"outstanding","kk":"/ˌaʊtˈstændɪŋ/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['傑出的；卓越的'], ['未償還的；未解決的']]","chEntries":["傑出的","卓越的","未償還的","未解決的"],"practiceMeaning":"他是一位傑出的學生，GPA很高。","analysis":"由 'out' (out of) + 'standing' (stand) 組成。核心意義是「站得很突出」。\n1. 傑出的；卓越的：指表現非常出色，比其他人或事物更優秀。\n2. 未償還的；未解決的：指尚未支付、完成或解決的債務、任務或問題。","definition":"1. extremely good; excellent; 2. very noticeable; 3. not yet paid, solved, or dealt with.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is an outstanding student with a high GPA.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是一位傑出的學生，GPA很高。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company has a large amount of outstanding debts.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家公司有大筆未償還的債務。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他是一位傑出的學生，GPA很高。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U39"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4065,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u4::oven::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Please put the cake in the ____.","expectedAnswer":"oven","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Please put the cake in the ____.","clozeAnswer":"oven","exampleTranslation":"請把蛋糕放進烤箱。","reference":{"eng":"oven","kk":"/ˈʌvən/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['烤箱', '烘箱']]","chEntries":["烤箱","烘箱"],"practiceMeaning":"請把蛋糕放進烤箱。","analysis":"源自古英語 'ofen'。詞源不詳，但與其他日耳曼語族的類似詞語（如德語 'Ofen'）有關，指加熱或烘烤的裝置。","definition":"a large container for cooking food, that is closed on all sides and heated from the outside, by gas or electricity","example":"[\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"請把蛋糕放進烤箱。\",\n    \"eng\": \"Please put the cake in the oven.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"烤箱正在預熱到攝氏180度。\",\n    \"eng\": \"The oven is preheating to 180 degrees Celsius.\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"請把蛋糕放進烤箱。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5635,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l8::overflow::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ from the burst pipe flooded the basement.","expectedAnswer":"overflow","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ from the burst pipe flooded the basement.","clozeAnswer":"overflow","exampleTranslation":"爆裂水管的溢流淹沒了地下室。","reference":{"eng":"overflow","kk":"ˌoʊvərˈfloʊ","tense":"n.","ch":"[['溢出'], ['洪水'], ['（資訊、情感等）泛濫']]","chEntries":["溢出","洪水","泛濫"],"practiceMeaning":"爆裂水管的溢流淹沒了地下室。","analysis":"此字源自古英語 oferflowan，由 ofer（超過，over）+ flowan（流動，flow）組成。ofer 是原始日耳曼語 *ufar，來自原始印歐語 *upo-ro-（向上）。flowan 來自原始日耳曼語 *flōaną，原始印歐語 *pleu-（流動）。其原始語義為「水流超出邊緣」，後引申為任何液體、資訊、情感或人數的「過量」或「湧現」現象。構詞上，over- 標示程度上的「過」，flow 標示核心的「流動」概念。此處為名詞用法，指代「溢出」的結果或狀態。","definition":"the action of flowing over the brim of a container; a flood; an excessive amount or abundance of something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The overflow from the burst pipe flooded the basement.\",\n    \"ch\": \"爆裂水管的溢流淹沒了地下室。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The overflow of data made it difficult to analyze.\",\n    \"ch\": \"數據的泛濫使得分析變得困難。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"爆裂水管的溢流淹沒了地下室。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5138,"wordRef":"字彙王::u62::oversee::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The manager will ____ the project's progress.","expectedAnswer":"oversee","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The manager will ____ the project's progress.","clozeAnswer":"oversee","exampleTranslation":"經理將監督專案的進度。","reference":{"eng":"oversee","kk":"ˌoʊvərˈsiː","tense":"v.","ch":"[['監督'], ['監管'], ['審查']]","chEntries":["監督","監管","審查"],"practiceMeaning":"經理將監督專案的進度。","analysis":"此字為複合詞，由 over-（在…上方、超越）+ see（看見）組成。over- 在此表示「從高處、從整體上」。see 源自古英語 sēon。核心語意是「從上方、從整體上看」，引申為「監督、管理、確保事情按計畫進行」。","definition":"supervise (a person or their work), especially in an official capacity; observe or watch over.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The manager will oversee the project's progress.\",\n    \"ch\": \"經理將監督專案的進度。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She was appointed to oversee the charity's finances.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她被任命負責監督該慈善機構的財務。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"經理將監督專案的進度。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U62"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4486,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::ownership::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ of the property has been transferred to his son.","expectedAnswer":"ownership","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ of the property has been transferred to his son.","clozeAnswer":"ownership","exampleTranslation":"該財產的所有權已轉移給他的兒子。","reference":{"eng":"ownership","kk":"/ˈoʊnərʃɪp/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['所有權'], ['擁有']]","chEntries":["所有權","擁有"],"practiceMeaning":"該財產的所有權已轉移給他的兒子。","analysis":"源自 own (擁有)。加上 -ership (表示「狀態」、「資格」或「行為」的名詞後綴)。核心語意是「擁有某物的狀態」。","definition":"1. The act, state, or right of owning something; 2. Possession.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The ownership of the property has been transferred to his son.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該財產的所有權已轉移給他的兒子。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He asserted his ownership of the land.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他主張自己對這塊土地的所有權。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"該財產的所有權已轉移給他的兒子。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4331,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::pad::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She placed a ____ under the hot dish.","expected