:"presidency","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"His ____ was marked by economic reforms.","clozeAnswer":"presidency","exampleTranslation":"他的總統任期以經濟改革為標誌。","reference":{"eng":"presidency","kk":"ˈprezɪdənsi","tense":"n.","ch":"[['總統任期'], ['總統職位'], ['總統任期內的權力']]","chEntries":["總統任期","總統職位","總統任期內的權力"],"practiceMeaning":"他的總統任期以經濟改革為標誌。","analysis":"此字由 'president' (總統) + '-cy' (名詞化後綴，表示職位、狀態、權力) 構成。'-cy' 常用於形成表示職位或狀態的名詞，如 'democracy', 'agency'。'Presidency' 指的是 '擔任總統的職位' 或 '總統的任期'，以及在此期間所擁有的 '權力' 和 '職責'。","definition":"1. The office or position of president.; 2. The period of time during which someone is president.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His presidency was marked by economic reforms.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的總統任期以經濟改革為標誌。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The next presidency faces many challenges.\",\n    \"ch\": \"下一個總統任期面臨許多挑戰。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他的總統任期以經濟改革為標誌。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U61"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5095,"wordRef":"字彙王::u61::presidential::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ election will be held next year.","expectedAnswer":"presidential","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ election will be held next year.","clozeAnswer":"presidential","exampleTranslation":"總統選舉將於明年舉行。","reference":{"eng":"presidential","kk":"ˌprezɪˈdenʃl","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['總統的'], ['總統制的']]","chEntries":["總統的","總統制的"],"practiceMeaning":"總統選舉將於明年舉行。","analysis":"此字由 'president' (總統) + '-ial' (形容詞化後綴，表示相關的、屬於……的) 構成。'-ial' 後綴將名詞轉換為形容詞，表明事物與 'president' 或 'presidency' 有關。因此，'presidential' 指的是 '與總統有關的'，例如 'presidential election' (總統選舉) 或 'presidential decree' (總統的命令)。它也可用來形容體制，如 'presidential system' (總統制)。","definition":"1. Relating to or characteristic of a president or the office of president.; 2. Relating to or suitable for a president.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The presidential election will be held next year.\",\n    \"ch\": \"總統選舉將於明年舉行。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He gave a presidential address to the nation.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他向全國發表了總統講話。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The hotel suite is very presidential.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這間酒店套房非常豪華，有總統級的氣派。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"總統選舉將於明年舉行。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U61"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3929,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u2::prevent::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The police were unable to ____ the robbery.","expectedAnswer":"prevent","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The police were unable to ____ the robbery.","clozeAnswer":"prevent","exampleTranslation":"警方未能阻止這場搶劫。","reference":{"eng":"prevent","kk":"/prɪˈvent/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['阻止', '預防'], ['防止']]","chEntries":["阻止","預防","防止"],"practiceMeaning":"警方未能阻止這場搶劫。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'praevenire'，由 'prae-' (意為「在…之前」) 和 'venire' (意為「來」) 組成。最初的意思是「預先到達」，引申為「預防、阻止某事發生」。","definition":"1. to stop someone from doing something or to stop something from happening; 2. to take action to stop something from happening or to stop someone from doing something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The police were unable to prevent the robbery.\",\n    \"ch\": \"警方未能阻止這場搶劫。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Regular exercise can help prevent heart disease.\",\n    \"ch\": \"規律運動有助於預防心臟病。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She wears gloves to prevent her hands from getting dry.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她戴手套以防止手部乾燥。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"警方未能阻止這場搶劫。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5438,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l3::priceless::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ancient vase is a ____ artifact.","expectedAnswer":"priceless","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ancient vase is a ____ artifact.","clozeAnswer":"priceless","exampleTranslation":"這件古老的瓷瓶是一件無價的藝術品。","reference":{"eng":"priceless","kk":"ˈpraɪsləs","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['無價的'], ['極其珍貴的']]","chEntries":["無價的","極其珍貴的"],"practice