t of property.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他擁有許多財產。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The property was inherited from her grandparents.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這份財產是從她祖父母那裡繼承來的。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Water has the property of expanding when it freezes.\",\n    \"ch\": \"水具有結冰時膨脹的特性。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他擁有許多財產。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U1、L1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3180,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::prosper::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Businesses that adapt to new technology tend to ____.","expectedAnswer":"prosper","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Businesses that adapt to new technology tend to ____.","clozeAnswer":"prosper","exampleTranslation":"適應新技術的企業往往會興旺發達。","reference":{"eng":"prosper","kk":"/ˈprɒspər/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['興旺；繁榮；成功']]","chEntries":["興旺","繁榮","成功"],"practiceMeaning":"適應新技術的企業往往會興旺發達。","analysis":"詞源來自拉丁語 'prosperus'，意為「順利的，成功的」。'Prosper' 指的是在事業、財富、健康或生活方面取得成功，變得興旺和繁榮。它強調的是一種積極的發展和成功的趨勢，通常伴隨著財富的增加或幸福感的提升。","definition":"succeed financially; be fortunate or successful.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Businesses that adapt to new technology tend to prosper.\",\n    \"ch\": \"適應新技術的企業往往會興旺發達。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"May you prosper in all your endeavors.\",\n    \"ch\": \"願你在所有事業上都取得成功。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The city has prospered since the new industry arrived.\",\n    \"ch\": \"自從新產業進駐以來，這座城市就開始繁榮起來。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"適應新技術的企業往往會興旺發達。","sourceName":"字彙王、龍騰課本","unitName":"U40、L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4310,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::protection::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The children are under the ____ of their parents.","expectedAnswer":"protection","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The children are under the ____ of their parents.","clozeAnswer":"protection","exampleTranslation":"孩子們在父母的保護之下。","reference":{"eng":"protection","kk":"/prəˈtɛkʃən/","tense":"n