ardless","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She decided to go, ____ of the weather.","clozeAnswer":"regardless","exampleTranslation":"她決定去，不管天氣怎樣。","reference":{"eng":"regardless","kk":"rɪˈɡɑːrdləs","tense":"adv.","ch":"[['不管怎樣'], ['不顧一切地'], ['儘管如此']]","chEntries":["不管怎樣","不顧一切地","儘管如此"],"practiceMeaning":"她決定去，不管天氣怎樣。","analysis":"此字由 regard（考慮、顧及）加上否定字尾 -less（沒有）構成，加上前綴 re-（再次、加強）可能增強語意。其核心語意是「不考慮（某事）、不顧及（某事）」。表示不論情況如何，都要堅持做某事。OCR 掃描時可能將 'r' 誤判為 'n'，或 'g' 誤判為 'l'。此處修正為 regardless。","definition":"without paying attention to the present situation; despite the prevailing circumstances.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She decided to go, regardless of the weather.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她決定去，不管天氣怎樣。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He continued to work, regardless of the difficulties.\",\n    \"ch\": \"儘管有困難，他還是繼續工作。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她決定去，不管天氣怎樣。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U59"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4709,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u17::regret::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He expressed deep ____ for his actions.","expectedAnswer":"regret","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He expressed deep ____ for his actions.","clozeAnswer":"regret","exampleTranslation":"他對自己的行為深感後悔。","reference":{"eng":"regret","kk":"/rɪˈɡrɛt/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['後悔'], ['遺憾']]","chEntries":["後悔","遺憾"],"practiceMeaning":"他對自己的行為深感後悔。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 *regrettere*，由 *re-*（再次）和 *gratus*（愉快的，引申為滿足）構成，字面意思是「不再愉快」。核心是對於過去未能做或已做之事感到惋惜或不滿。這種情感往往伴隨著對未來的擔憂。","definition":"1. A feeling of sadness, repentance, or disappointment over something that has happened or been done.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He expressed deep regret for his actions.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他對自己的行為深感後悔。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There is no point in living with regret.\",\n    \"ch\": \"活在後悔中毫無意義。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他對自己的行為深感後悔。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U17"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},