zeAnswer":"situated","exampleTranslation":"這家酒店坐落於俯瞰大海的山丘上。","reference":{"eng":"situated","kk":"ˈsɪtʃueɪtɪd","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['位於'], ['坐落於']]","chEntries":["位於","坐落於"],"practiceMeaning":"這家酒店坐落於俯瞰大海的山丘上。","analysis":"此字為動詞 \"situate\" 的過去分詞，可作形容詞使用。\"situate\" 源自拉丁語 \"situare\"，意為\"使處於……位置\"，來自 \"situs\" (位置、地點)。構詞上，\"situ-\" 提供了核心的「位置」語意，\"-ate\" 是動詞字尾。 \"Situatd\" 作形容詞，表示某物「被放置在」或「位於」某個特定地點或環境，通常用來描述建築物、城市或地理位置。","definition":"located or positioned in a particular place or position.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The hotel is situated on a hill overlooking the sea.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家酒店坐落於俯瞰大海的山丘上。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The village is situated in a remote valley.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個村莊坐落於一個偏遠的山谷中。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The ancient ruins are situated near the river.\",\n    \"ch\": \"古老的廢墟位於河邊附近。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這家酒店坐落於俯瞰大海的山丘上。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3974,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u3::skate::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She learned to ____ when she was five years old.","expectedAnswer":"skate","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She learned to ____ when she was five years old.","clozeAnswer":"skate","exampleTranslation":"她五歲時學會了溜冰。","reference":{"eng":"skate","kk":"/skeɪt/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['溜冰', '滑冰']]","chEntries":["溜冰","滑冰"],"practiceMeaning":"她五歲時學會了溜冰。","analysis":"詞源：古挪威語 'skaut' (滑冰鞋)。指使用溜冰鞋在冰上或輪滑場上移動的動作。","definition":"to move on skates.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She learned to skate when she was five years old.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她五歲時學會了溜冰。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她五歲時學會了溜冰。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5806,"wordRef":"字彙王::u60::skeleton::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The museum displayed a dinosaur ____.","expectedAnswer":"skeleton","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The museum disp