": \"Farmers sow seeds in the spring.\",\n    \"ch\": \"農民在春天播種。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The teacher tried to sow seeds of curiosity in her students.\",\n    \"ch\": \"老師試圖在學生心中播下好奇的種子。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"農民在春天播種。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U61"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5465,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l4::span::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The new highway will ____ the entire valley.","expectedAnswer":"span","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The new highway will ____ the entire valley.","clozeAnswer":"span","exampleTranslation":"新高速公路將會橫跨整個山谷。","reference":{"eng":"span","kk":"spæn","tense":"v.","ch":"[['跨越'], ['橫跨'], ['持續']]","chEntries":["跨越","橫跨","持續"],"practiceMeaning":"新高速公路將會橫跨整個山谷。","analysis":"此字源自名詞 'span'（跨度、期間）。作為動詞，'span' 繼承了名詞的核心語意，表示「橫跨」或「持續」。當用於物理空間時，意指「從一端延伸到另一端」，如「跨越一座橋樑」。當用於時間時，意指「持續一段時間」，如「跨越數年」。此動詞形式是從名詞語意直接轉化而來，強調的是「延伸」或「覆蓋」的動作。核心語意是「從一個點延伸到另一個點，無論是空間還是時間」。","definition":"1. Extend or stretch across a wide area or length.; 2. Last or be maintained for a period of time.; 3. Bridge or cross.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The new highway will span the entire valley.\",\n    \"ch\": \"新高速公路將會橫跨整個山谷。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His career spanned more than fifty years.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的職業生涯持續了五十多年。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The festival spans three days.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個節日持續三天。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"新高速公路將會橫跨整個山谷。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5436,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l3::spare::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Do you have a ____ tire in your car?","expectedAnswer":"spare","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Do you have a ____ tire in your car?","clozeAnswer":"spare","exampleTranslation":"你的車上有備胎嗎？","reference":{"eng":"spare","kk":"sper","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['備用的'], ['多餘的'], ['節省的'], ['空閒的'], ['無事可做的']]","chEntries":["備用的","多餘的","節省的","空閒的","無事可做的"],"practiceMeaning":"你的車上有備胎嗎？","analysis":"此字源自古英語 \"spær\"，意為\"節儉的\"、\"稀少的\"。其詞源可能與\"sparse\" (稀疏的) 有聯繫。構詞上沒有明顯的字首、字根或字尾可拆解，應視為一個整體詞源的演變。原始語義是「稀少」、「節省」，引申為「不需要的」、「多餘的」，因此可以用作「備用的」；同時也表示「有空閒的」、「可供支配的」。","definition":"not being used or needed at the moment; kept in reserve for future use; not used or spoken; not strictly necessary; not busy; free.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Do you have a spare tire in your car?\",\n    \"ch\": \"你的車上有備胎嗎？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I have some spare time this afternoon.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我今天下午有些空閒時間。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She managed to spare a few dollars for charity.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她設法省下了一些錢捐給慈善機構。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"你的車上有備胎嗎？","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3993,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u3::specific::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Do you have any ____ instructions for me?","expectedAnswer":"specific","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Do you have any ____ instructions for me?","clozeAnswer":"specific","exampleTranslation":"您有任何具體的指示要給我嗎？","reference":{"eng":"specific","kk":"/spəˈsɪfɪk/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['特定的', '具體的'], ['明確的', '確切的'], ['（種類）獨特的']]","chEntries":["特定的","具體的","明確的","確切的","獨特的"],"practiceMeaning":"您有任何具體的指示要給我嗎？","analysis":"詞源：拉丁文 'specificus' (區分的、特定的)，源自 'species' (種類、外觀)。指明確界定、不含糊的，或屬於某一特定類別的。","definition":"1. clearly defined or identified; 2. relating to a particular thing, person, or category; 3. precisely indicated or stated.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Do you have any specific instructions for me?\",\n    \"ch\": \"您有任何具體的指示要給我嗎？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This disease is specific to the region.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這種疾病是該地區特有的。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need more specific details about the project.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要關於這個計畫更具體的細節。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"您有任何具體的指示要給我嗎？","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accura