sur- 表示「在……之上」或「超過」，render 則意為「給予、交付」。","definition":"the act of surrendering; an act of yielding to the control of another person or force.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The surrender of the fortress was inevitable.\",\n    \"ch\": \"要塞的投降是不可避免的。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"After a long siege, the rebels agreed to surrender.\",\n    \"ch\": \"經過長期圍困，叛軍同意投降。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"要塞的投降是不可避免的。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4470,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::survey::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The company conducted a ____ of customer satisfaction.","expectedAnswer":"survey","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company conducted a ____ of customer satisfaction.","clozeAnswer":"survey","exampleTranslation":"該公司進行了一項客戶滿意度調查。","reference":{"eng":"survey","kk":"/ˈsɜːrveɪ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['調查'], ['勘測']]","chEntries":["調查","勘測"],"practiceMeaning":"該公司進行了一項客戶滿意度調查。","analysis":"源自古法語 surveoir，意為「看」、「檢查」。sur- (上) + voir (看)。核心語意是「仔細地觀看」、「檢查」。引申為對情況、意見或土地進行整體性的「調查」或「勘測」。","definition":"1. A general view, examination, or description of something; 2. An investigation of the opinions or experience of a group of people, based on a series of questions; 3. An act of measuring the position, slopes, or dimensions of an area of land.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company conducted a survey of customer satisfaction.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司進行了一項客戶滿意度調查。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The surveyor took measurements for the new building.\",\n    \"ch\": \"測量員為新建築進行了測量。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A recent survey revealed that most people prefer to work from home.\",\n    \"ch\": \"最近的一項調查顯示，大多數人更願意在家工作。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"該公司進行了一項客戶滿意度調查。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5861,"wordRef":"字彙王::u58::sustain::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The 