definition":"1. Happening or moving very quickly; 2. Able to move very quickly; agile.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He made a swift decision.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他做了一個迅速的決定。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The swift movement of the bird caught my eye.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那隻鳥敏捷的動作吸引了我的目光。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need a swift response to this crisis.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要對這場危機作出迅速的應對。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他做了一個迅速的決定。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4689,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u17::tag::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Please remove the price ____ before washing the garment.","expectedAnswer":"tag","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Please remove the price ____ before washing the garment.","clozeAnswer":"tag","exampleTranslation":"清洗衣物前請移除價格標籤。","reference":{"eng":"tag","kk":"/ˈtæɡ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['標籤'], ['（非正式）稱號、綽號'], ['（追蹤、定位用的）標識'], ['（兒童遊戲）追逐遊戲']]","chEntries":["標籤","稱號、綽號","標識","追逐遊戲"],"practiceMeaning":"清洗衣物前請移除價格標籤。","analysis":"源自斯堪地那維亞語，意為「懸掛物」。核心是附著在物品上用於識別、標示的物品。延伸至非正式的綽號、用於追蹤的電子標識，以及兒童遊戲中的追逐。'tag question' (附加問句) 也是由 'tag' 的附屬、附加的概念衍生。","definition":"1. A label attached to something for the purpose of identification or information. 2. (informal) A nickname. 3. A device attached to something for tracking or identification purposes. 4. A children's game in which one person chases the others.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please remove the price tag before washing the garment.\",\n    \"ch\": \"清洗衣物前請移除價格標籤。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He's known by the tag 'The Professor'.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他被稱為「教授」。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We played tag in the park.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們在公園玩追逐遊戲。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"清洗衣物前請移除價格標籤。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U17"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5631,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l7::take-care-of::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","