s":[],"clozeSentence":"The street ____ sold hot dogs and pretzels.","clozeAnswer":"vendor","exampleTranslation":"街頭小販賣熱狗和椒鹽捲餅。","reference":{"eng":"vendor","kk":"ˈvɛndər","tense":"n.","ch":"[['賣家'], ['銷售商'], ['供應商']]","chEntries":["賣家","銷售商","供應商"],"practiceMeaning":"街頭小販賣熱狗和椒鹽捲餅。","analysis":"此字源自古法語vendeor，來自拉丁語vendere（出售），是動詞vendere的派生。vendere由venum（出售）+ dare（給予）組成。vendor 的核心語意是「銷售商品或服務的人或公司」。通常指小型或個人化的銷售者，但也可用於較大公司。OCR 掃描時可能將 'v' 誤判為 'u'，或 'd' 誤判為 'cl'。此處修正為 vendor。","definition":"1. a person or company that sells goods or services; 2. a person or company that sells goods, especially on the street.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The street vendor sold hot dogs and pretzels.\",\n    \"ch\": \"街頭小販賣熱狗和椒鹽捲餅。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We are looking for a reliable software vendor.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們正在尋找一個可靠的軟體供應商。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"街頭小販賣熱狗和椒鹽捲餅。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U59"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6252,"wordRef":"字彙王::u67::venue::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The stadium is a popular ____ for concerts.","expectedAnswer":"venue","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The stadium is a popular ____ for concerts.","clozeAnswer":"venue","exampleTranslation":"這個體育場是舉辦音樂會的熱門場地。","reference":{"eng":"venue","kk":"ˈvɛnju","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"場地\"  ],  [    \"地點\"  ],  [    \"場所\"  ]]","chEntries":["場地","地點","場所"],"practiceMeaning":"這個體育場是舉辦音樂會的熱門場地。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 venue，意為「到來，地點」，向上可追溯至拉丁語 venire，意為「來」。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根。名詞義指某事將要發生的地點，特別是活動、演出、會議或運動比賽的場所。中文翻譯為「場地；地點；場所」。","definition":"1. the place where an organized event such as a concert, conference, or sporting event takes place; 2. the place where an action or event happens.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The stadium is a popular venue for concerts.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個體育場是舉辦音樂會的熱門場地。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We are looking for a venue for our wedding reception.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們正在為我們的婚禮招待會尋找一個場所。\"\n