,"unitName":"L1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4693,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u17::weave::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The fine ____ of the silk made it very expensive.","expectedAnswer":"weave","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The fine ____ of the silk made it very expensive.","clozeAnswer":"weave","exampleTranslation":"絲綢細緻的織法使其價格昂貴。","reference":{"eng":"weave","kk":"/ˈwiv/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['編織物'], ['織法']]","chEntries":["編織物","織法"],"practiceMeaning":"絲綢細緻的織法使其價格昂貴。","analysis":"名詞形式，指編織的動作或其產生的結果，如布料的織法或成品。","definition":"1. The pattern or structure of fabric formed by weaving. 2. Fabric made by weaving.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The fine weave of the silk made it very expensive.\",\n    \"ch\": \"絲綢細緻的織法使其價格昂貴。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"絲綢細緻的織法使其價格昂貴。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U17"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3875,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u1::wed::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"They decided to ____ next spring.","expectedAnswer":"wed","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"They decided to ____ next spring.","clozeAnswer":"wed","exampleTranslation":"他們決定明年春天結婚。","reference":{"eng":"wed","kk":"/wɛd/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['結婚']]","chEntries":["結婚"],"practiceMeaning":"他們決定明年春天結婚。","analysis":"源自古英語 'weddian'，意為「訂婚」、「發誓」。核心是「承諾」或「結合」。在現代英語中，主要指舉行婚禮，正式結為夫婦。","definition":"to marry; become husband and wife.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They decided to wed next spring.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們決定明年春天結婚。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The couple wed in a private ceremony.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這對情侶在一個私人的儀式中結婚。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他們決定明年春天結婚。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5816,"wordRef":"字彙王::u60::whereas::conj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Some people like to travel abroad, ____ others prefer to stay home.","expectedAnswer":"whereas","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Some people like to travel abroad, ____ others prefer to stay home.","clozeAnswer":"whereas","exampleTranslation":"有些人喜歡出國旅行，而有些人則偏好待在家裡。","reference":{"eng":"whereas","kk":"ˌwɛərˈæz","tense":"conj.","ch":"[  [    \"然而\"  ],  [    \"比較起來\"  ],  [    \"鑒於\"  ]]","chEntries":["然而","比較起來","鑒於"],"practiceMeaning":"有些人喜歡出國旅行，而有些人則偏好待在家裡。","analysis":"此字為連接詞，源自中古英語wheras，由where（在哪裡）+as（如同；和）組成。核心語義是「用來連接兩個對比或比較的子句，表示前者與後者之間的差異」。語意演變上，從「在哪裡……如同……」，演變為表示「對比」或「儘管如此」的連接詞。","definition":"1. in contrast or comparison with; 2. in view of the fact that; because.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Some people like to travel abroad, whereas others prefer to stay home.\",\n    \"ch\": \"有些人喜歡出國旅行，而有些人則偏好待在家裡。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is very outgoing, whereas his brother is quite shy.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他非常外向，而他的兄弟則相當害羞。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The plan is expensive, whereas the alternative is less effective.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個計劃很昂貴，而另一種選擇效果較差。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"有些人喜歡出國旅行，而有些人則偏好待在家裡。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U60"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5113,"wordRef":"字彙王::u61::wither::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The flowers began to ____ in the heat.","expectedAnswer":"wither","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The flowers began to ____ in the heat.","clozeAnswer":"wither","exampleTranslation":"花兒在炎熱中開始枯萎。","reference":{"eng":"wither","kk":"ˈwɪðər","tense":"v.","ch":"[['枯萎'], ['凋謝'], ['衰敗']]","chEntries":["枯萎","凋謝","衰敗"],"practiceMeaning":"花兒在炎熱中開始枯萎。","analysis":"此字源自古英語 'wiðerian'，意為 '枯萎、乾枯'。其核心語義是 '由於缺乏水分、養分或活力而變得乾癟、萎縮並失去生命力'。這通常用於植物，但也可比喻形容人、事業或情感的衰退、衰敗或失去活力。","definition":"1. To become weak and dry through lack of water.; 2. To become dry and shriveled.; 3. To lose strength or vigor.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The flowers began to wither in the heat.\",\n    \"ch\": \"花兒在炎熱中開始枯萎。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His enthusiasm for the project withered away.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他對這個專案的熱情逐漸消退。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The old man seemed to wither with grief.\",\n    \"ch\": \"老人似乎因悲傷而日漸憔悴。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"花兒在炎熱中開始枯萎。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U61"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5349,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l1::worship::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Many people ____ the sun.","expectedAnswer":"worship","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Many people ____ the sun.","clozeAnswer":"worship","exampleTranslation":"許多人崇拜太陽。","reference":{"eng":"worship","kk":"ˈwɜːrʃɪp","tense":"v.","ch":"[['崇拜'], ['敬拜'], ['禮拜']]","chEntries":["崇拜","敬拜","禮拜"],"practiceMeaning":"許多人崇拜太陽。","analysis":"此字源自古英語 weorþscipe，由 weorþ（價值、尊嚴）+ -scipe（狀態、職位，相當於現代的 -ship）組成。原始語意為「價值、尊嚴的狀態」。後演變為「對神祇或崇高事物的尊敬與崇拜」。構詞上，weorþ- 表示「價值、值得」，-scipe 構成抽象名詞。現代語意主要指宗教上的「崇拜、敬拜」。亦可作名詞使用。","definition":"to show reverence and adoration for (a deity); to honor or revere (an object, idol, or other entity) as a god; to feel or express extreme admiration, love, or reverence for.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Many people worship the sun.\",\n    \"ch\": \"許多人崇拜太陽。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They gathered to worship at the church.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們聚集在教堂裡進行禮拜。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"許多人崇拜太陽。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4293,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u7::a-large-sum-of-money::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The company had to pay ____ in damages.","expectedAnswer":"a large sum of money","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company had to pay ____ in damages.","clozeAnswer":"a large sum of money","exampleTranslation":"這家公司不得不支付一大筆錢作為賠償。","reference":{"eng":"a large sum of money","kk":"/ə lɑːrdʒ sʌm əv ˈmʌni/","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['一大筆錢']]","chEntries":["一大筆錢"],"practiceMeaning":"這家公司不得不支付一大筆錢作為賠償。","analysis":"結合了形容詞 'large'（大的）、名詞 'sum'（總數、金額