單。","analysis":"此字源自中古英語 acknown（知道）加上ledge（承認），結合了「知道」與「承認」兩層含義。acknowledge 的核心構詞可追溯至古英語 'cnāwan'（知道）和 'lecgan'（放置、使……），意指「確認某事物已知」。詞源上，'a-' 是加強前綴，'know' 來自原始日耳曼語 *kannaną (to know)，'ledge' 則來自古英語 'lecgan' (to lay down, to cause to lie down)，與'lay' 同源。在語言演變中，'a-' 前綴加強了動詞的語意，'ledge' 演變成與承認、確認相關的意義。最初的語義是「確認某事已知的狀態」，進而引申出「承認」或「認可」某事實、聲明或權威。此外，'acknowledge' 也可用來表示「告知」收件人已收到訊息，這源於確認訊息已「被知道」的概念。更進一步，也可指「表示對某人的存在或地位的認可」，例如在社交場合。","definition":"1. To accept or admit the existence or truth of; to recognize the fact or importance of.; 2. To express recognition or appreciation of.; 3. To inform (someone) of the receipt of (a letter, message, etc.).; 4. To recognize the existence, presence, or fact of.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He has to acknowledge his mistakes.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他必須承認他的錯誤。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We acknowledge receipt of your order.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們謹此告知已收到您的訂單。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She acknowledged his efforts with a smile.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她以微笑認可了他的努力。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The guard acknowledged the visitor with a nod.\",\n    \"ch\": \"守衛點頭表示認可訪客。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們謹此告知已收到您的訂單。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U58"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5338,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l1::acquisition::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ of new skills is crucial for career growth.","expectedAnswer":"acquisition","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ of new skills is crucial for career growth.","clozeAnswer":"acquisition","exampleTranslation":"獲得新技能對職業發展至關重要。","reference":{"eng":"acquisition","kk":"ækˈwɪzɪʃən","tense":"n.","ch":"[['獲得'], ['收購'], ['收購物']]","chEntries":["獲得","收購","收購物"],"practiceMeaning":"獲得新技能對職業發展至關重要。","analysis":"此字由動詞 acquire 加上名詞字尾 -ition 構成。acquire 源自古法語 aquerre，來自拉丁語 adquirere（尋找、獲得）。-ition 是拉丁語的抽象名詞字尾，表示「行為、狀態或結果」。因此，acquisition 的核心語意為「獲得的行為或結果」，引申為「獲得某物（尤指較大的物品，如公司）」或「收購」。","definition":"an act of acquiring or gaining possession; something that is acquired, especially a company or property bought by another company.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company's latest acquisition has increased its market share.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司最新的收購增加了其市場佔有率。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The acquisition of new skills is crucial for career growth.\",\n    \"ch\": \"獲得新技能對職業發展至關重要。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"獲得新技能對職業發展至關重要。","sourceName":"龍騰課本、字彙王","unitName":"L1、U64"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6062,"wordRef":"字彙王::u64::acute::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He has an ____ sense of smell.","expectedAnswer":"acute","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He has an ____ sense of smell.","clozeAnswer":"acute","exampleTranslation":"他有靈敏的嗅覺。","reference":{"eng":"acute","kk":"əˈkjut","tense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"尖銳的\"  ],  [    \"敏銳的\"  ],  [    \"嚴重的\"  ],  [    \"急性的\"  ]]","chEntries":["尖銳的","敏銳的","嚴重的","急性的"],"practiceMeaning":"他有靈敏的嗅覺。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 acutus，意為「尖的，銳利的」，是動詞 acuere（to sharpen）的過去分詞。構詞上，ac- 來自 acu-，意為「尖、銳利」，-ute 是形容詞後綴。此字的核心語義與「尖銳」相關，引申出多種含義：物理上的「尖銳」形狀；感知上的「敏銳」；情況上的「嚴重」或「劇烈」；醫學上的「急性」發作。這些義項都體現了「程度極高」或「非常明顯」的特點。","definition":"1. sharp or penetrating, especially in intellect, perception, or physical appearance (e.g., an acute angle); 2. (of a bad situation or feeling) intense; severe; 3. (of a disease or condition) of sudden onset, sharp rise, and short course.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The triangle has an acute angle.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個三角形有一個銳角。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He has an acute sense of smell.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他有靈敏的嗅覺。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The situation is becoming increasingly acute.\",\n    \"ch\": \"局勢正變得日益嚴峻。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She suffers from acute appendicitis.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她患有急性闌尾炎。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他有靈敏的嗅覺。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U64"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3978,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u3: