個人、團體或國家。中文翻譯為「盟友；同盟國；夥伴；支持者」。","definition":"1. a country or person that you have agreed to support or work with; 2. a person who helps or supports you.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The two nations have been long-standing allies.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這兩個國家是長期的盟友。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He found an ally in his fight for justice.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在爭取正義的鬥爭中找到了一位夥伴。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is a trusted ally of the senator.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她是參議員的信任夥伴。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他在爭取正義的鬥爭中找到了一位夥伴。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U67"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6209,"wordRef":"字彙王::u67::alongside::prep","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He sat ____ his wife at the wedding.","expectedAnswer":"alongside","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He sat ____ his wife at the wedding.","clozeAnswer":"alongside","exampleTranslation":"他在婚禮上坐在他妻子旁邊。","reference":{"eng":"alongside","kk":"əˈlɔŋˈsaɪd","tense":"prep.","ch":"[  [    \"在…旁邊\"  ],  [    \"與…並排\"  ],  [    \"與…同時\"  ],  [    \"除了…之外\"  ]]","chEntries":["在…旁邊","與…並排","與…同時","除了…之外"],"practiceMeaning":"他在婚禮上坐在他妻子旁邊。","analysis":"此片語由介詞 along 和名詞 side 組成。along 源自古英語，意為「 along（沿著）」，side 源自古英語 sīde，意為「邊緣，側面」。此字在現代英語中可視為固定搭配，不需拆解。作介詞時，表示空間上的「在…旁邊；與…並排」，或表示時間、行動上的「與…同時；與…一起」，以及表示比較或支持的「與…相比；支持…」。","definition":"1. next to someone or something; 2. at the same time as someone or something else; 3. in addition to someone or something else; 4. supporting or cooperating with someone or something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The ship sailed alongside the coast.\",\n    \"ch\": \"船隻沿著海岸航行。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He sat alongside his wife at the wedding.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在婚禮上坐在他妻子旁邊。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We are working alongside our international partners.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們正與我們的國際夥伴一同合作。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Alongside his main job, he volunteers at a shelter.\",\n    \"ch\": \"除了他的主要工作之外，他還在收容所做志工。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTransla