ation":"法官做出了公平的裁決。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5537,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l5::fake::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The signature on the document looked ____.","expectedAnswer":"fake","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The signature on the document looked ____.","clozeAnswer":"fake","exampleTranslation":"文件上的簽名看起來是假的。","reference":{"eng":"fake","kk":"feɪk","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['假的'], ['仿製的'], ['虛假的']]","chEntries":["假的","仿製的","虛假的"],"practiceMeaning":"文件上的簽名看起來是假的。","analysis":"此字源自中古英語 'faken'，其詞源不確定，可能與低地德語 'faken' (to deceive) 或北歐語言有關，總體指向「欺騙、偽造」的概念。構詞上無明顯字首、字根、字尾。原始語義與「虛假、欺騙」相關。'fake' 作形容詞時，描述的是「非真實的、仿製的、非本來的」，與「真品、真實」相對立。","definition":"not genuine; imitation or counterfeit.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He was wearing a fake designer watch.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他戴著一只仿製的名牌手錶。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The signature on the document looked fake.\",\n    \"ch\": \"文件上的簽名看起來是假的。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"文件上的簽名看起來是假的。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4075,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u4::familiar::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The music sounded ____.","expectedAnswer":"familiar","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The music sounded ____.","clozeAnswer":"familiar","exampleTranslation":"這音樂聽起來很熟悉。","reference":{"eng":"familiar","kk":"/fəˈmɪliər/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['熟悉的', '常見的'], ['親近的', '親密的']]","chEntries":["熟悉的","常見的","親近的","親密的"],"practiceMeaning":"這音樂聽起來很熟悉。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'familiaris'，由 'familia' (family) 構成，意為「家庭的」、「屬於家庭的」。核心是與「家」或「親近的人」有關。因此，'familiar' 指「親近的」、「熟悉的」，引申為「常見的」、「容易辨認的」。","definition":"1. well known from long or close contact; 2. closely acquainted; 3. common or ordinary","example":"[\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"他熟悉這座城市。\",\n    \"eng\": \"He is familiar with the city.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"這音樂聽起來很熟悉。\",\n    \"eng\": \"The music sounded familiar.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"他們是從小就親近的朋友。\",\n    \"eng\": \"They were familiar friends from childhood.\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這音樂聽起來很熟悉。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4142,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::fashionable::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"This is the most ____ restaurant in town.","expectedAnswer":"fashionable","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This is the most ____ restaurant in town.","clozeAnswer":"fashionable","exampleTranslation":"這是鎮上最時髦的餐廳。","reference":{"eng":"fashionable","kk":"/ˈfæʃənəbl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['時髦的', '流行的']]","chEntries":["時髦的","流行的"],"practiceMeaning":"這是鎮上最時髦的餐廳。","analysis":"源自 fashion（時尚，流行式樣）+ -able（形容詞後綴）。核心概念是「符合當時的流行趨勢」。","definition":"1. conforming to or following the current style or fashion; 2. stylish and elegant","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She wore a fashionable dress.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她穿了一件時髦的連衣裙。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is the most fashionable restaurant in town.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是鎮上最時髦的餐廳。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He has a fashionable haircut.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的髮型很時髦。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這是鎮上最時髦的餐廳。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3285,"wordRef":"字彙王::u42::fatal::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"This was a ____ blow to the company's finances.","expectedAnswer":"fatal","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This was a ____ blow to the company's finances.","clozeAnswer":"fatal","exampleTranslation":"這是對公司財政的毀滅性打擊。","reference":{"eng":"fatal","kk":"/ˈfeɪtl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['致命的；毀滅性的'], ['決定性的；重大的'], ['（尤指對健康）嚴重的，不可挽回的']]","chEntries":["致命的","毀滅性的","決定性的","重大的","嚴重的，不可挽回的"],"practiceMeaning":"這是對公司財政的毀滅性打擊。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'fatalis'，由 'fatum' (命運，神諭) 演變而來。最初指由命運決定的，後主要指導致死亡的，引申至造成嚴重後果或決定性的事物。","definition":"1. causing death; deadly; 2. of, c