結構"],"practiceMeaning":"這頂帽子上裝飾著一根藍色的羽毛。","analysis":"源自古英語 *feðer*，與拉丁語 *penna*（羽毛、翅膀）同源。核心是鳥類用於飛行、保暖的外部結構。引申至用於裝飾或構成某些器物的羽狀部分。","definition":"1. Each separate article of plumage forming the external covering of a bird. 2. A decoration made from feathers. 3. The blade of an oar or paddle.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A small feather drifted down from the bird's wing.\",\n    \"ch\": \"一根小羽毛從鳥的翅膀上飄落。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The hat was adorned with a single blue feather.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這頂帽子上裝飾著一根藍色的羽毛。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He dipped the feather of the oar into the water.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他將船槳的槳葉浸入水中。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這頂帽子上裝飾著一根藍色的羽毛。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U17"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5398,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l2::finance::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The bank agreed to ____ their new business.","expectedAnswer":"finance","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The bank agreed to ____ their new business.","clozeAnswer":"finance","exampleTranslation":"銀行同意為他們的新業務提供資金。","reference":{"eng":"finance","kk":"ˈfaɪnæns","tense":"v.","ch":"[['資助'], ['為……提供資金']]","chEntries":["資助","為……提供資金"],"practiceMeaning":"銀行同意為他們的新業務提供資金。","analysis":"此字源自名詞 'finance' (財政、金融)。核心語意是「提供資金」。作動詞時，'finance' 指「為某項目、企業或個人提供所需的資金」。","definition":"Provide funding for (a person or enterprise).","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The project was financed by a private investor.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個項目由一位私人投資者資助。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The bank agreed to finance their new business.\",\n    \"ch\": \"銀行同意為他們的新業務提供資金。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"銀行同意為他們的新業務提供資金。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6076,"wordRef":"字彙王::u64::fiscal::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The company's ____ year ends in December.","expectedAnswer":"fiscal","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company's ____ year ends in December.","clozeAnswer":"fiscal","exampleTranslation":"公司的財政年度於十二月結束。","reference":{"eng":"fiscal","kk":"ˈfɪskəl","tense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"財政的\"  ],  [    \"財政上的\"  ],  [    \"稅收的\"  ]]","chEntries":["財政的","財政上的","稅收的"],"practiceMeaning":"公司的財政年度於十二月結束。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 fiscus，意為「籃子，錢箱」，特別是「國庫」或「公共財政」。核心語義與「財政」、「稅收」、「公共金庫」相關。Fiscal 作為形容詞，用來修飾與政府的收入、支出、預算、稅務和貨幣政策相關的事務。","definition":"relating to government revenue, especially taxes.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The government announced new fiscal policies.\",\n    \"ch\": \"政府宣布了新的財政政策。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company's fiscal year ends in December.\",\n    \"ch\": \"公司的財政年度於十二月結束。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Fiscal responsibility is important for economic stability.\",\n    \"ch\": \"財政責任對經濟穩定很重要。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"公司的財政年度於十二月結束。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U64"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5582,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l6::flaw::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"His argument had a serious ____.","expectedAnswer":"flaw","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"His argument had a serious ____.","clozeAnswer":"flaw","exampleTranslation":"他的論點有一個嚴重的缺陷。","reference":{"eng":"flaw","kk":"flɔ","tense":"n.","ch":"[['缺點'], ['瑕疵'], ['裂痕'], ['缺陷']]","chEntries":["缺點","瑕疵","裂痕","缺陷"],"practiceMeaning":"他的論點有一個嚴重的缺陷。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 \"flau\"，詞源不甚確定，可能與古高地德語 \"flāh\"（flat, smooth，平坦的，光滑的）或與 \"flow\"（流動）有關。原始語義可能與「表面不平坦」或「中間有裂縫」有關。因此，\"flaw\" 的核心語義是指「某物的不完美之處」，特別是「一個細微的、可能影響整體功能的缺陷或裂痕」。它可以是物理上的（e.g., a flaw in a diamond），也可以是抽象上的（e.g., a flaw in an argument）。","definition":"1. A mark, blemish, or other imperfection which mars a substance or object; 2. An instance of being imperfect or defective; 3. A weakness in a person's character.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The vase had a small flaw in the glaze.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個花瓶的釉面有一個小瑕疵。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His argument had a serious flaw.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的論點有一個嚴重的缺陷。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Despite this flaw, the plan was generally well-received.\",\n    \"ch\": \"儘管有這個缺點，這個計畫總體上還是受到好評。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他的論點有一個嚴重的缺陷。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5581,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l6::flawless::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The diamond was ____.","expectedAnswer":"flawless","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The diamond was ____.","clozeAnswer":"flawless","exampleTranslation":"這顆鑽石無瑕疵。","reference":{"eng":"flawless","kk":"ˈflɔlɪs","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['無瑕疵的'], ['完美的'], ['無可挑剔的']]","chEntries":["無瑕疵的","完美的","無可挑剔的"],"practiceMeaning":"這顆鑽石無瑕疵。","analysis":"此字由名詞 \"flaw\" 加上否定字尾 \"-less\" 構成。\"flaw\" 源自古法語 \"flau\"，可能來自古高地德語 \"flāh\"（flat, smooth，平坦的，光滑的），或與 \"flow\"（流動）有關，引申為「缺陷、裂痕」。\"-less\" 是常見的否定字尾，表示「沒有」。因此，\"flawless\" 的核心語義是「沒有任何缺陷、裂痕或瑕疵」。它強調事物達到了完美的狀態，無可挑剔。","definition":"1. Without any blemishes or imperfections; perfect; 2. Without a fault or defect.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her performance was flawless.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她的演出無可挑剔。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The diamond was flawless.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這顆鑽石無瑕疵。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He made a flawless execution of the plan.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他完美地執行了這個計畫。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這顆鑽石無瑕疵。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5046,"wordRef":"字彙王::u59::fluid::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"In physics, a ____ is a substance that continuously deforms under shear stress.","expectedAnswer":"fluid","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"In physics, a ____ is a substance that continuously deforms under shear stress.","clozeAnswer":"fluid","exampleTranslation":"在物理學中，流體是指在剪應力下連續變形的物質。","reference":{"eng":"fluid","kk":"ˈfluːɪd","tense":"n.","ch":"[['液體'], ['流體']]","chEntries":["液體","流體"],"practiceMeaning":"在物理學中，流體是指在剪應力下連續變形的物質。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語fluidus，是動詞fluere（流動）的形容詞形式。fluere 又來自原始印歐語 *pleu-（流動）。fluid 作名詞指「能夠流動的物質，與固體和氣體相對」，即「液體」或「流體」。此用法直接體現了其詞源「流動」的核心語意。","definition":"a substance that flows freely, like water.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The body is composed of various fluids.\",\n    \"ch\": \"人體由各種液體組成。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"In physics, a fluid is a substance that continuously deforms under shear stress.\",\n    \"ch\": \"在物理學中，流體是指在剪應力下連續變形的物質。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"在物理學中，流體是指在剪應力下連續變形的物質。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U59"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4575,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u11::foggy::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"I'm a bit ____ on the details of the plan.","expectedAnswer":"foggy","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"I'm a bit ____ on the details of the plan.","clozeAnswer":"foggy","exampleTranslation":"我對計劃的細節有點模糊。","reference":{"eng":"foggy","kk":"/ˈfɒɡi/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['有霧的', '霧濛濛的'], ['（頭腦、理解等）模糊的', '不清晰的']]","chEntries":["有霧的","霧濛濛的","模糊的","不清晰的"],"practiceMeaning":"我對計劃的細節有點模糊。","analysis":"由 'fog' (霧) 加上形容詞字尾 '-y' 構成。\n    1. 有霧的：指天氣有霧，能見度低。\n    2. 模糊的、不清晰的：引申為思路、理解或記憶不清，如同在霧中一樣。","definition":"1. (of the weather or a place) full of fog; misty.; 2. (of a person's thoughts or memory) confused or unclear.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It was a foggy morning, so we couldn't see the mountains.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那是一個有霧的早晨，所以我們看不到山。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I'm a bit foggy on the details of the plan.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我對計劃的細節有點模糊。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The driver couldn't see well because of the foggy conditions.\",\n    \"ch\": \"由於霧濛濛的狀況，司機看不清楚。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我對計劃的細節有點模糊。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U11"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5449,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l3::fond::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He has ____ memories of his childhood.","expectedAnswer":"fond","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He has ____ memories of his childhood.","clozeAnswer":"fond","exampleTranslation":"他對童年有著美好的回憶。","reference":{"eng":"fond","kk":"fɑːnd","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['喜愛的'], ['深情的'], ['寵愛的'], ['喜歡的']]","chEntries":["喜愛的","深情的","寵愛的","喜歡的"],"practiceMeaning":"他對童年有著美好的回憶。","analysis":"此字源自中古英語 \"fonned\"，意為\"愚蠢的\"、\"裝模作樣的\"，後來演變成\"喜愛的\"。其詞源與\"fool\" (傻瓜) 可能有關，但語義發生了轉變。構詞上沒有明顯的字首、字根或字尾可拆解，應視為一個整體詞源的演變。原始的「愚蠢」語義可能在某些情境下轉化為「過度的愛」、「溺愛」，進而演變為現代意義上的「喜愛的」、「深情的」。","definition":"having an affection or liking for someone or something; loving or caring deeply for someone or something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is very fond of her grandchildren.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她非常喜愛她的孫子孫女。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He has fond memories of his childhood.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他對童年有著美好的回憶。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They are fond of classical music.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們喜歡古典音樂。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他對童年有著美好的回憶。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4526,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::for::prep","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He works ____ a large company.","expectedAnswer":"for","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He works ____ a large company.","clozeAnswer":"for","exampleTranslation":"他在一家大公司工作。","reference":{"eng":"for","kk":"/fər/, /fɔːr/","tense":"prep.","ch":"[['為了'], ['給'], ['支持'], ['持續（一段時間）']]","chEntries":["為了","給","支持","持續"],"practiceMeaning":"他在一家大公司工作。","analysis":"源自古英語 for。是一個極其常見且語意複雜的介詞。核心語意是「目的」、「原因」、「受益者」。引申義廣泛，包括「持續時間」、「代表」、「傾向」等。","definition":"1. Intended to achieve or affect; 2. In order to benefit or be given to; 3. In support of or in agreement with; 4. During (a period of time).","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This gift is for you.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這份禮物是給你的。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He works for a large company.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在一家大公司工作。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She stayed for two weeks.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她待了兩週。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They are fighting for their freedom.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們正在為自由而戰。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他在一家大公司工作。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4529,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u11::forever::adv","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She will ____ be remembered for her kindness.","expectedAnswer":"forever","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She will ____ be remembered for her kindness.","clozeAnswer":"forever","exampleTranslation":"她將因她的善良而被永遠記住。","reference":{"eng":"forever","kk":"/fərˈɛvər/","tense":"adv.","ch":"[['永遠地', '永久地'], ['一直地', '不斷地']]","chEntries":["永遠地","永久地","一直地","不斷地"],"practiceMeaning":"她將因她的善良而被永遠記住。","analysis":"此字由 'for' (為了) 和 'ever' (永遠) 組成。'ever' 源自古英語 'æfre'，意為 'always' (總是)。'for' 則來自古英語 'fōr' (因為、目的)。 'forever' 結合兩者，表示時間上的永恆，引申為持續不斷的狀態。","definition":"1. for all future time; for always; eternally.; 2. continually; constantly.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They promised to love each other forever.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們承諾永遠愛對方。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She will forever be remembered for her kindness.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她將因她的善良而被永遠記住。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He seemed to talk forever about his vacation.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他似乎不斷地談論他的假期。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她將因她的善良而被永遠記住。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U11"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6172,"wordRef":"字彙王::u66::forge::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The intense heat of the ____ was palpable.","expectedAnswer":"forge","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The intense heat of the ____ was palpable.","clozeAnswer":"forge","exampleTranslation":"鍛造爐的熾熱讓人觸手可及。","reference":{"eng":"forge","kk":"fɔrdʒ","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"鍛造廠\"  ],  [    \"熔爐\"  ]]","chEntries":["鍛造廠","熔爐"],"practiceMeaning":"鍛造爐的熾熱讓人觸手可及。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 forge，是動詞 forge「鍛造」的名詞化，最終源自拉丁語 fabrica「工廠、製造、工藝」。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根。作為名詞，其核心語義是指「用於鍛造金屬的工廠或設備」。此義項由動詞「鍛造」延伸出動作發生的場所。","definition":"1. a furnace or fire for heating metal; 2. a workshop where metal is forged.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The blacksmith worked in his forge.\",\n    \"ch\": \"鐵匠在他的鍛造廠裡工作。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The intense heat of the forge was palpable.\",\n    \"ch\": \"鍛造爐的熾熱讓人觸手可及。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He learned the art of metalworking in the forge.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在鍛造廠學到了金屬加工的技藝。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"鍛造爐的熾熱讓人觸手可及。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U66"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6173,"wordRef":"字彙王::u66::forum::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ will focus on environmental issues.","expectedAnswer":"forum","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ will focus on environmental issues.","clozeAnswer":"forum","exampleTranslation":"這次討論會將聚焦於環境議題。","reference":{"eng":"forum","kk":"ˈfɔrəm","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"論壇\"  ],  [    \"討論會\"  ],  [    \"廣場\"  ],  [    \"（辯論、討論的）場所\"  ]]","chEntries":["論壇","討論會","廣場","場所"],"practiceMeaning":"這次討論會將聚焦於環境議題。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 forum，意為「公共場所、市場、廣場」。在古羅馬，它是舉行公共集會、辯論和商業活動的中心。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根。作為名詞，其核心語義是「一個用於公開討論、辯論或交流意見的場所或場合」。此義項由古羅馬時期的「公共廣場」引申出「討論會」和「論壇」的現代用法。","definition":"1. a place, meeting, or medium where ideas and views on a particular issue can be exchanged; 2. a public meeting or lecture, typically held in a university or college, at which invited speakers debate a topic of current interest.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The internet forum is a popular place for discussion.\",\n    \"ch\": \"網路論壇是一個受歡迎的討論場所。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The forum will focus on environmental issues.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這次討論會將聚焦於環境議題。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It's an open forum for all members to express their views.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是個讓所有成員表達意見的公開論壇。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They held a town hall forum on public safety.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們就公共安全問題舉行了市政廳論壇。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這次討論會將聚焦於環境議題。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U66"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5085,"wordRef":"字彙王::u61::foul::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The referee called a ____ for rough play.","expectedAnswer":"foul","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The referee called a ____ for rough play.","clozeAnswer":"foul","exampleTranslation":"裁判因粗野的犯規判罰了一個犯規。","reference":{"eng":"foul","kk":"faʊl","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['骯髒的'], ['污穢的'], ['惡劣的']]","chEntries":["骯髒的","污穢的","惡劣的"],"practiceMeaning":"裁判因粗野的犯規判罰了一個犯規。","analysis":"此字源自古英語 'fūl'，與德語 'faul' (rotten) 同源，原始語義為 '腐爛的、惡臭的'。其核心概念是 '不乾淨、不道德或令人不悅的'。這可以指物理上的汙穢，如 'foul water' (髒水)；也可以指道德上的卑劣，如 'foul play' (不正當的手段)；或者指天氣的惡劣，如 'foul weather' (惡劣天氣)。","definition":"1. Very dirty; polluted.; 2. Extremely unpleasant or disagreeable.; 3. (In sports) Against the rules; unfair.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He had to clean the foul smell from his room.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他不得不清除房間裡的惡臭。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The referee called a foul for rough play.\",\n    \"ch\": \"裁判因粗野的犯規判罰了一個犯規。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The weather turned foul during the night.\",\n    \"ch\": \"夜裡天氣變得惡劣。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"裁判因粗野的犯規判罰了一個犯規。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U61"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4124,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::frank::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"I appreciate your ____ opinion.","expectedAnswer":"frank","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"I appreciate your ____ opinion.","clozeAnswer":"frank","exampleTranslation":"我欣賞你直率的意見。","reference":{"eng":"frank","kk":"/fræŋk/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['坦白的', '直率的']]","chEntries":["坦白的","直率的"],"practiceMeaning":"我欣賞你直率的意見。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 francus（自由的，不受約束的），後引申為「誠實的」。核心概念是「不受隱瞞、真誠」。","definition":"1. open, direct, and unreserved in speech or expression; 2. (of a letter or document) delivered openly and without secrecy","example":"[\n  {\n    \