elous","kk":"ˈmɑrvələs","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['極好的'], ['奇妙的'], ['令人驚嘆的']]","chEntries":["極好的","奇妙的","令人驚嘆的"],"practiceMeaning":"她在這個專案上做得非常出色。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'mirabil '，意為「奇妙的、驚人的」，來自 'mirari'（驚奇）。構詞學上，'marvel'（名詞，奇蹟）是核心詞，加上形容詞化後綴 '-ous'。'-ous' 是常見的形容詞化字尾，表示「充滿……的」、「具有……性質的」。因此，'marvelous' 的意思是「充滿奇蹟的」、「令人驚奇的」、「極好的」。","definition":"1. Causing wonder; extraordinary; 2. Extremely good; wonderful.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The view from the mountaintop was marvelous.\",\n    \"ch\": \"山頂的景色令人驚嘆。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She did a marvelous job on the project.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她在這個專案上做得非常出色。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她在這個專案上做得非常出色。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6081,"wordRef":"字彙王::u64::massage::vt","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She learned to ____ her baby's feet.","expectedAnswer":"massage","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She learned to ____ her baby's feet.","clozeAnswer":"massage","exampleTranslation":"她學會了按摩寶寶的腳。","reference":{"eng":"massage","kk":"məˈsɑʒ","tense":"vt.","ch":"[  [    \"按摩\"  ],  [    \"撫摩\"  ],  [    \"（非正式）操縱；處理\"  ]]","chEntries":["按摩","撫摩","操縱","處理"],"practiceMeaning":"她學會了按摩寶寶的腳。","analysis":"此字由法語 massage 演變而來，核心語義是「用手揉捏、按壓」。作為及物動詞，指對身體進行按摩的動作。引申用法包括非正式地指「操縱」或「不正當地處理」資訊或情況，以便得到有利結果（例如 massage the figures）。","definition":"1. rub and knead (a part of the body) or to treat (a complaint) by rubbing and kneading; 2. (informal) manipulate or alter (figures, information, etc.) to present a favorable view.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The therapist massaged his sore shoulders.\",\n    \"ch\": \"治療師按摩了他痠痛的肩膀。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She learned to massage her baby's feet.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她學會了按摩寶寶的腳。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The committee tried to massage the data to make the project look successful.\",\n    \"ch\": \"委員會試圖操縱數據，讓項目看起來成功。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她學會了按摩寶寶的腳。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U64"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4356,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::material-comforts::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He has always enjoyed the ____ of life.","expectedAnswer":"material comforts","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He has always enjoyed the ____ of life.","clozeAnswer":"material comforts","exampleTranslation":"他一直享受著物質上的舒適生活。","reference":{"eng":"material comforts","kk":"None","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['物質享受；物質上的舒適']]","chEntries":["物質享受","物質上的舒適"],"practiceMeaning":"他一直享受著物質上的舒適生活。","analysis":"此為片語分析。'material' (adj.) 源自拉丁語 'materialis'，意為『物質的』，指與『精神、形式』相對。'comforts' (n. pl.) 源自 'comfort' (n.)，指『舒適、便利』。兩者結合，指生活中與身體享受、便利有關的『物質上的滿足』。","definition":"things such as comfortable housing, good food, and warm clothes that make life pleasant","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The refugees lacked basic material comforts.\",\n    \"ch\": \"難民們缺乏基本的物質享受。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He has always enjoyed the material comforts of life.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他一直享受著物質上的舒適生活。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他一直享受著物質上的舒適生活。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3097,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::maximum::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"There is a ____ of two pieces of luggage per person.","expectedAnswer":"maximum","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"There is a ____ of two pieces of luggage per person.","clozeAnswer":"maximum","exampleTranslation":"每人最多允許攜帶兩件行李。","reference":{"eng":"maximum","kk":"/ˈmæksɪməm/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['最大數量；最大值'], ['最高限度']]","chEntries":["最大數量","最大值","最高限度"],"practiceMeaning":"每人最多允許攜帶兩件行李。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'maximus' (greatest)。是形容詞 'maximum' 的名詞形式。指「最大的數量」或「最高的程度」。\n1. 最大數量；最大值：指某個變數或集合中的最大數值。\n2. 最高限度：指為了達到某種標準或要求所允許的最高條件。","definition":"1. the greatest amount or degree allowed or possible; 2. the highest limit.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The maximum of the function is 100.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該函數的最大值是100。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There is a maximum of two pieces of luggage per person.\",\n    \"ch\": \"每人最多允許攜帶兩件行李。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"每人最多允許攜帶兩件行李。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U39、U40"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4640,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u16::means::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He lives comfortably on his ____.","expectedAnswer":"means","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He lives comfortably on his ____.","clozeAnswer":"means","exampleTranslation":"他依靠自己的財富過著舒適的生活。","reference":{"eng":"means","kk":"/miːnz/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['方法'], ['手段'], ['財富'], ['（數）平均數']]","chEntries":["方法","手段","財富","平均數"],"practiceMeaning":"他依靠自己的財富過著舒適的生活。","analysis":"源自古英語 'mæġen' (力量、能力)。最初指達成目的的手段或力量。現代用法非常廣泛，可以指到達某個結果的方式（方法、手段），也可以指財富（especially plural \"means\"），在數學中則指平均值。","definition":"a method, course of action, or instrument by which something can be achieved; wealth or financial resources; the average of a set of numbers.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"What is the best means to achieve this goal?\",\n    \"ch\": \"達到這個目標的最佳方法是什麼？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He lives comfortably on his means.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他依靠自己的財富過著舒適的生活。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Calculate the arithmetic means of the two sets of data.\",\n    \"ch\": \"計算這兩組數據的算術平均數。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他依靠自己的財富過著舒適的生活。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U16"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4460,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::meanwhile::adv","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The government is discussing new policies; ____, the economic situation is worsening.","expectedAnswer":"meanwhile","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The government is discussing new policies; ____, the economic situation is worsening.","clozeAnswer":"meanwhile","exampleTranslation":"政府正在討論新政策；在此期間，經濟形勢卻在惡化。","reference":{"eng":"meanwhile","kk":"/ˈminwaɪl/","tense":"adv.","ch":"[['同時'], ['在此期間']]","chEntries":["同時","在此期間"],"practiceMeaning":"政府正在討論新政策；在此期間，經濟形勢卻在惡化。","analysis":"由 mean (意思是「中間」，也可指「意圖」) 和 while (時間) 組成。核心語意是「在兩個時間點之間」，或「在一個事件發生的同時」。常連接兩個並行發生的事件或情況。","definition":"1. At the same time; 2. During the interval between two stated times.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is preparing dinner, and meanwhile, her husband is setting the table.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她正在準備晚餐，同時，她的丈夫正在擺餐桌。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The government is discussing new policies; meanwhile, the economic situation is worsening.\",\n    \"ch\": \"政府正在討論新政策；在此期間，經濟形勢卻在惡化。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"政府正在討論新政策；在此期間，經濟形勢卻在惡化。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U10、L9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5665,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l8::measurement::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Accurate ____ is crucial in science.","expectedAnswer":"measurement","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Accurate ____ is crucial in science.","clozeAnswer":"measurement","exampleTranslation":"精確的測量在科學中至關重要。","reference":{"eng":"measurement","kk":"ˈmɛʒərmənt","tense":"n.","ch":"[['測量'], ['度量'], ['尺寸'], ['測量結果']]","chEntries":["測量","度量","尺寸","測量結果"],"practiceMeaning":"精確的測量在科學中至關重要。","analysis":"此字由 measure（測量）+ -ment（名詞字尾）構成。measure 源自拉丁語 mensura（測量）。-ment 是常見的名詞字尾，表示「動作」、「狀態」或「結果」。構詞上，measure 提供核心的「測量」概念，-ment 將其名詞化。核心語義為「測量的行為」、「測量結果」或「測量的尺寸」。此處為名詞用法，指代「測量」的動作、過程或結果。","definition":"the action of measuring something; a quantity or the size, amount, or degree of something as measured.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The measurement of the room was 3 meters by 4 meters.\",\n    \"ch\": \"房間的尺寸是 3 米乘以 4 米。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Accurate measurement is crucial in science.\",\n    \"ch\": \"精確的測量在科學中至關重要。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"精確的測量在科學中至關重要。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6083,"wordRef":"字彙王::u64::mechanism::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We need to understand the ____ of disease transmission.","expectedAnswer":"mechanism","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We need to understand the ____ of disease transmission.","clozeAnswer":"mechanism","exampleTranslation":"我們需要了解疾病傳播的機制。","reference":{"eng":"mechanism","kk":"ˈmɛkəˌnɪzəm","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"機制\"  ],  [    \"機械裝置\"  ],  [    \"構造\"  ],  [    \"原理\"  ]]","chEntries":["機制","機械裝置","構造","原理"],"practiceMeaning":"我們需要了解疾病傳播的機制。","analysis":"此字源自希臘語 mēkhanḗ（machine, device, means），來自 mēkhanos（inventive, clever）。核心語義是「機器」或「裝置」。引申為「機制」，指某事物運作的方式、過程或內部結構，尤其是指一套相互關聯的組成部分如何協同工作以達成某種結果。","definition":"1. a system of parts working together in a machine; 2. a natural or physical process considered in terms of the way in which it operates; 3. a way of achieving something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The mechanism of the clock needs to be repaired.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這台鐘表的機械裝置需要修理。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to understand the mechanism of disease transmission.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要了解疾病傳播的機制。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is a simple mechanism to open the bottle.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是一個開啟瓶子的簡單裝置。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們需要了解疾病傳播的機制。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U64"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4204,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::mend::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is recovering and will soon ____.","expectedAnswer":"mend","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is recovering and will soon ____.","clozeAnswer":"mend","exampleTranslation":"他正在康復，很快就會好起來。","reference":{"eng":"mend","kk":"/mend/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['修補；縫補'], ['（使）恢復；（使）好轉']]","chEntries":["修補","縫補","恢復","好轉"],"practiceMeaning":"他正在康復，很快就會好起來。","analysis":"源自古英語 mendan，意為“改善，加強”，後來與法語 demente（破壞）的反義詞 'amender'（改正）混合。核心是“修復，使其回到更好的狀態”。1. “修補”指恢復物體的完整性。2. “恢復；好轉”指恢復健康、關係或狀況。","definition":"1. to repair something that is broken or damaged; 2. to get better or to make something better after a problem or illness.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Can you mend this torn shirt?\",\n    \"ch\": \"你能把這件破了的襯衫補好嗎？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is recovering and will soon mend.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他正在康復，很快就會好起來。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The two countries are trying to mend their relations.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這兩個國家正試圖修復它們的關係。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他正在康復，很快就會好起來。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4417,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::mental::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He suffered from ____ fatigue after hours of studying.","expectedAnswer":"mental","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He suffered from ____ fatigue after hours of studying.","clozeAnswer":"mental","exampleTranslation":"他經過數小時的學習後感到精神疲憊。","reference":{"eng":"mental","kk":"/ˈmentl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['精神上的', '心理上的'], ['智力的', '腦力的'], ['（尤指兒童）精神失常的']]","chEntries":["精神上的","心理上的","智力的","腦力的","精神失常的"],"practiceMeaning":"他經過數小時的學習後感到精神疲憊。","analysis":"詞源自拉丁語 'mentalis'，'mens' (mind)。指與思想、心理狀態或智力相關的。","definition":"relating to the mind; relating to or affecting the intellect; informal, often offensive: having a serious mental illness.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Mental health is as important as physical health.\",\n    \"ch\": \"心理健康與身體健康同等重要。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He suffered from mental fatigue after hours of studying.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他經過數小時的學習後感到精神疲憊。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他經過數小時的學習後感到精神疲憊。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U9、L1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4586,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u11::merchant::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He became a wealthy ____ in the silk trade.","expectedAnswer":"merchant","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He became a wealthy ____ in the silk trade.","clozeAnswer":"merchant","exampleTranslation":"他成為絲綢貿易中的一位富商。","reference":{"eng":"merchant","kk":"/ˈmɜːrtʃənt/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['商人', '商販'], ['（尤指）貿易商']]","chEntries":["商人","商販","貿易商"],"practiceMeaning":"他成為絲綢貿易中的一位富商。","analysis":"源自古法語 'marchant'，'marchier' (to trade - 交易)。指從事貿易、買賣商品以獲取利潤的人。","definition":"1. a person or company involved in wholesale trade, especially one dealing with foreign countries or supplying goods to a particular trade.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The merchant sold spices to sailors.\",\n    \"ch\": \"商人向海員們出售香料。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He became a wealthy merchant in the silk trade.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他成為絲綢貿易中的一位富商。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他成為絲綢貿易中的一位富商。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U11"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5554,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l6::merely::adv","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"It was ____ a suggestion, not an order.","expectedAnswer":"merely","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"It was ____ a suggestion, not an order.","clozeAnswer":"merely","exampleTranslation":"這只是一個建議，並非命令。","reference":{"eng":"merely","kk":"ˈmɪrli","tense":"adv.","ch":"[['僅僅'], ['只是'], ['不過是']]","chEntries":["僅僅","只是","不過是"],"practiceMeaning":"這只是一個建議，並非命令。","analysis":"此字是 \"mere\"（僅僅的）加上副詞字尾 \"-ly\" 構成。\"mere\" 源自古英語 \"mǣre\"，意為 \"boundary, limit, distinguished\"（界線，極限，傑出的），後來語義演變為 \"nothing more than, only\"（僅僅是，不過是），可能與「極小」或「單一」的概念有關。因此，\"merely\" 作為副詞，強調「僅僅」、「只是」的意思，表示所敘述的事物或情況是有限的、微不足道的，或者沒有其他更重要的內容。","definition":"1. Just only; solely; 2. In the smallest degree; only.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He was merely trying to help.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他只是想幫忙。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It was merely a suggestion, not an order.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這只是一個建議，並非命令。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is not merely a singer, but also a talented actress.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她不只是個歌手，更是一位才華洋溢的演員。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這只是一個建議，並非命令。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6128,"wordRef":"字彙王::u65::metropolitan::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The city has a large ____ population.","expectedAnswer":"metropolitan","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The city has a large ____ population.","clozeAnswer":"metropolitan","exampleTranslation":"這座城市擁有龐大的都會人口。","reference":{"eng":"metropolitan","kk":"ˌmɛtrəˈpɑːlɪtən","tense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"都會的\"  ],  [    \"大都會的\"  ],  [    \"首府的\"  ]]","chEntries":["都會的","大都會的","首府的"],"practiceMeaning":"這座城市擁有龐大的都會人口。","analysis":"此字源自希臘語 mētropolis，由 mētēr（母親）和 polis（城市）組成，意為「母城」，指一個地區的中心城市或首府。構詞上，mētēr 意為「母親」，polis 意為「城市」。因此，metropolitan 的核心語義是「與大城市相關」。此形容詞指與大都市、其區域或居民相關的。其語意演變是從「母城」到「大城市」。","definition":"1. relating to or denoting a metropolis or its inhabitants; 2. the capital or chief city of a country or region.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"metropolitan area\",\n    \"ch\": \"都會區\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The city has a large metropolitan population.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這座城市擁有龐大的都會人口。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"metropolitan opera\",\n    \"ch\": \"大都會歌劇院\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這座城市擁有龐大的都會人口。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U65"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6179,"wordRef":"字彙王::u66::miniature::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The artist painted a ____ portrait.","expectedAnswer":"miniature","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The artist painted a ____ portrait.","clozeAnswer":"miniature","exampleTranslation":"這位藝術家畫了一幅微型肖像。","reference":{"eng":"miniature","kk":"ˈmɪniətʃər","tense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"小型的\"  ],  [    \"微型的\"  ],  [    \"縮小的\"  ]]","chEntries":["小型的","微型的","縮小的"],"practiceMeaning":"這位藝術家畫了一幅微型肖像。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 miniatura，與 miniare「塗色」（尤其指手稿中的紅色）有關，可能與 minor「較小的」有關。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根，應視為整體詞源演變。作為形容詞，其核心語義是指「非常小的、微小的」。此義項由「小的」概念引申，強調尺寸上的微小。","definition":"1. a thing that is very small in size.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She has a collection of miniature cars.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她收藏了一批微型汽車。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The artist painted a miniature portrait.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位藝術家畫了一幅微型肖像。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is a miniature version of the original building.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是這個建築物的一個縮小版。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He bought a miniature schnauzer puppy.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他買了一隻迷你雪納瑞幼犬。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這位藝術家畫了一幅微型肖像。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U66"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3094,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::minimum::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ wage has been increased.","expectedAnswer":"minimum","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ wage has been increased.","clozeAnswer":"minimum","exampleTranslation":"最低工資已經提高了。","reference":{"eng":"minimum","kk":"/ˈmɪnɪməm/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['最小的；最低的']]","chEntries":["最小的","最低的"],"practiceMeaning":"最低工資已經提高了。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'minimus' (smallest)。核心意義是「最小」。\n1. 最小的；最低的：指數量、程度、或尺寸上的最小可能值。","definition":"1. the smallest possible amount or degree; 2. the least quantity.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to maintain a minimum level of safety.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要維持最低的安全水平。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The minimum wage has been increased.\",\n    \"ch\": \"最低工資已經提高了。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"最低工資已經提高了。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U39"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4543,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u11::minus::prep","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The temperature dropped to ____ five degrees Celsius.","expectedAnswer":"minus","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The temperature dropped to ____ five degrees Celsius.","clozeAnswer":"minus","exampleTranslation":"溫度降到了攝氏零下五度。","reference":{"eng":"minus","kk":"/ˈmaɪnəs/","tense":"prep.","ch":"[['減去', '帶有負數的']]","chEntries":["減去","帶有負數的"],"practiceMeaning":"溫度降到了攝氏零下五度。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'minus'，意為 'less' (更少)。\n    1. 減去：在數學上表示減法運算。\n    2. 帶有負數：指