（派遣）的名詞。字尾 -ary 表示「與…相關的人」。因此，missionary 指被派遣出去傳播宗教信仰的人，特別是基督宗教。中文翻譯為「傳教士；宣教士」。","definition":"a person sent to spread religious beliefs in a foreign country.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The missionary worked tirelessly to convert the local population.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位傳教士不懈地工作，以向當地居民傳播信仰。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She became a missionary in Africa.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她成為了非洲的一名宣教士。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The organization supports missionaries in several countries.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該組織支持在幾個國家的傳教士。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她成為了非洲的一名宣教士。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U67"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3099,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::monitor::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We need to ____ the situation closely.","expectedAnswer":"monitor","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We need to ____ the situation closely.","clozeAnswer":"monitor","exampleTranslation":"我們需要密切關注事態發展。","reference":{"eng":"monitor","kk":"/ˈmɑːnɪtər/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['監控；監視'], ['（定期）檢查；跟蹤']]","chEntries":["監控","監視","檢查","跟蹤"],"practiceMeaning":"我們需要密切關注事態發展。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'monitor' (one who warns)，'monere' (to warn, remind)。核心意義是「提醒」或「觀察」。\n1. 監控；監視：指持續觀察、記錄或控制某人或某事的行為或進展。\n2. （定期）檢查；跟蹤：指定期檢查某事物的狀態或進展，以確保其按計劃進行。","definition":"1. to watch and check something or someone over a period of time; 2. to observe and keep a record of the progress or development of something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The nurse will monitor the patient's vital signs.\",\n    \"ch\": \"護士將監測病人的生命體徵。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to monitor the situation closely.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要密切關注事態發展。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們需要密切關注事態發展。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U39"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5090,"wordRef":"字彙王::u61::monopoly::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The government is trying to break up the ____.","expectedAnswer":"monopoly","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The government is trying to break up the ____.","clozeAnswer":"monopoly","exampleTranslation":"政府正試圖打破壟斷。","reference":{"eng":"monopoly","kk":"məˈnɒpəli","tense":"n.","ch":"[['壟斷'], ['獨佔'], ['專賣權']]","chEntries":["壟斷","獨佔","專賣權"],"practiceMeaning":"政府正試圖打破壟斷。","analysis":"此字源自希臘語 'monos' (single) + 'polein' (to sell)。'Monopoly' 指的是一家公司或個人對某種商品或服務擁有 '獨一無二的銷售權'，不受競爭影響。這意味著他們可以控制價格和供應。引申開來，它也可以指對任何事物（如權力、資源）的 '獨佔' 或 '壟斷' 狀態。","definition":"1. The exclusive possession or control of the supply of or trade in a commodity or service.; 2. A company or group having exclusive control of a commodity or service.; 3. Exclusive possession or control.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company has a monopoly on the production of rare minerals.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家公司獨佔了稀有礦物的生產。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The government is trying to break up the monopoly.\",\n    \"ch\": \"政府正試圖打破壟斷。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This game is about building a real estate monopoly.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個遊戲是關於建立房地產壟斷的。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"政府正試圖打破壟斷。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U61"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5706,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l9::morality::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"His personal ____ was questioned.","expectedAnswer":"morality","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"His personal ____ was questioned.","clozeAnswer":"morality","exampleTranslation":"他的個人品德受到了質疑。","reference":{"eng":"morality","kk":"məˈræləti","tense":"n.","ch":"[['道德'], ['品德'], ['道德性']]","chEntries":["道德","品德","道德性"],"practiceMeaning":"他的個人品德受到了質疑。","analysis":"此字由形容詞 'moral' 加上名詞化後綴 '-ity' 構成。'moral' 源自拉丁語 moralis（關於習俗、品格的）。'-ity' 後綴用於將形容詞轉化為抽象名詞，表示「……的狀態、性質或品質」。因此，'morality' 指的就是「道德的狀態、品質或體系」，即「道德」或「品德」。核心語意是「關於是非對錯的準則、原則或體系」。","definition":"a set of principles of right and wrong behavior; the degree to which something is morally good or bad.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The story explored themes of morality and redemption.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個故事探討了道德和救贖的主題。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His personal morality was questioned.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的個人品德受到了質疑。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他的個人品德受到了質疑。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5379,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l2::mud::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He got his shoes covered in ____.","expectedAnswer":"mud","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He got his shoes covered in ____.","clozeAnswer":"mud","exampleTranslation":"他的鞋子沾滿了泥。","reference":{"eng":"mud","kk":"mʌd","tense":"n.","ch":"[['泥'], ['泥漿'], ['（俚語）鞋子']]","chEntries":["泥","泥漿","鞋子"],"practiceMeaning":"他的鞋子沾滿了泥。","analysis":"此字源自古英語 mudde。其詞源不甚清晰，但可能與「軟的、濕的」等概念有關。核心語意是「一種由土壤和水混合而成的柔軟、濕黏的物質」。它可以用於描述自然界的泥土，也指人造的泥漿，或比喻「困難、困境」（stuck in the mud）。","definition":"1. wet soil or earth; 2. a soft, sticky matter resulting from the mixing of earth or sand with water.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The heavy rain turned the field into a sea of mud.\",\n    \"ch\": \"連日大雨把田野變成了泥沼。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He got his shoes covered in mud.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的鞋子沾滿了泥。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他的鞋子沾滿了泥。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5378,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l2::muddy::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The river water was ____ after the heavy rain.","expectedAnswer":"muddy","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The river water was ____ after the heavy rain.","clozeAnswer":"muddy","exampleTranslation":"大雨過後，河水變得渾濁。","reference":{"eng":"muddy","kk":"ˈmʌdi","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['泥濘的'], ['沾滿泥的'], ['渾濁的']]","chEntries":["泥濘的","沾滿泥的","渾濁的"],"practiceMeaning":"大雨過後，河水變得渾濁。","analysis":"此字源自名詞 'mud' (泥)。'-y' 是形容詞字尾，表示「充滿……的」。'mud' 源自古英語 mudde。核心語意是「充滿泥土」。因此，'muddy' 形容「被泥土覆蓋」或「充滿泥漿」的狀態，常用於描述地面、水或物體。","definition":"1. covered or full of mud; 2. (of water) containing mud or silt.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The children came in with muddy boots.\",\n    \"ch\": \"孩子們穿著沾滿泥的靴子進來了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The river water was muddy after the heavy rain.\",\n    \"ch\": \"大雨過後，河水變得渾濁。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"大雨過後，河水變得渾濁。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4560,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u11::multiply::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Bacteria can ____ rapidly under favorable conditions.","expectedAnswer":"multiply","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Bacteria can ____ rapidly under favorable conditions.","clozeAnswer":"multiply","exampleTranslation":"細菌在有利條件下可以迅速繁殖。","reference":{"eng":"multiply","kk":"/ˈmʌltɪplaɪ/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['乘以', '（數學上）乘'], ['繁殖', '增殖'], ['增加', '增多']]","chEntries":["乘以","乘","繁殖","增殖","增加","增多"],"practiceMeaning":"細菌在有利條件下可以迅速繁殖。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'multiplicare'，'multus' (many - 許多) 的派生詞。\n    1. 乘以：數學運算，將一個數與另一個數相乘。\n    2. 繁殖、增殖：生物體產生後代，數量增加。\n    3. 增加、增多：泛指數量、規模等的大幅增加。","definition":"1. (of a living organism) reproduce; generate offspring.; 2. increase or cause to increase greatly in number or quantity.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Two multiplied by three equals six.\",\n    \"ch\": \"二乘以三等於六。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Bacteria can multiply rapidly under favorable conditions.\",\n    \"ch\": \"細菌在有利條件下可以迅速繁殖。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The problems seem to multiply each day.\",\n    \"ch\": \"問題似乎一天天增多。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"細菌在有利條件下可以迅速繁殖。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U11、L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5344,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l1::murderer::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He was identified as the ____.","expectedAnswer":"murderer","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He was identified as the ____.","clozeAnswer":"murderer","exampleTranslation":"他被確認為兇手。","reference":{"eng":"murderer","kk":"ˈmɜːrdərər","tense":"n.","ch":"[['謀殺犯'], ['兇手']]","chEntr