","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Don't be so ____; things might get better.","clozeAnswer":"pessimistic","exampleTranslation":"別這麼悲觀；情況可能會好轉。","reference":{"eng":"pessimistic","kk":"/ˌpɛsɪˈmɪstɪk/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['悲觀的'], ['悲觀主義的']]","chEntries":["悲觀的","悲觀主義的"],"practiceMeaning":"別這麼悲觀；情況可能會好轉。","analysis":"源自 'pessimism' (悲觀主義)，詞源來自拉丁文 'pessimus' (worst)。指傾向於看到事物的消極面，預期最壞的結果。","definition":"tending to see all the worst aspects of something or to expect that the worst will happen.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He has a pessimistic outlook on life.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他對生活持悲觀的看法。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Don't be so pessimistic; things might get better.\",\n    \"ch\": \"別這麼悲觀；情況可能會好轉。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"別這麼悲觀；情況可能會好轉。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U41"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6088,"wordRef":"字彙王::u64::phase::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The moon is in its waxing ____.","expectedAnswer":"phase","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The moon is in its waxing ____.","clozeAnswer":"phase","exampleTranslation":"月亮處於其上弦階段。","reference":{"eng":"phase","kk":"feɪz","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"階段\"  ],  [    \"時期\"  ],  [    \"（月亮、行星的）相位\"  ]]","chEntries":["階段","時期","相位"],"practiceMeaning":"月亮處於其上弦階段。","analysis":"此字源自希臘語 phasis（appearance, manifestation, phase），來自 phainō（to appear, to show）。核心語義是「出現」或「顯現」。引申為事物發展過程中的一個「階段」或「時期」。在天文學中，指天體可見部分的變化，即「相位」。","definition":"1. a distinct period or stage in a process of change or forming; 2. each of the shapes of the moon or a planet seen from the earth.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The project is in its final phase.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個項目正處於最後階段。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The moon is in its waxing phase.\",\n    \"ch\": \"月亮處於其上弦階段。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We are going through a difficult phase.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們正經歷一段艱難時期。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"月亮處於其上弦階段。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U64"},"learningMeta":{"