lozeSentence":"The school helps with job ____.","clozeAnswer":"placement","exampleTranslation":"學校協助學生安排工作職位。","reference":{"eng":"placement","kk":"ˈpleɪsmənt","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"放置\"  ],  [    \"安插\"  ],  [    \"職位安排\"  ],  [    \"安置\"  ]]","chEntries":["放置","安插","職位安排","安置"],"practiceMeaning":"學校協助學生安排工作職位。","analysis":"此字由動詞 place（放置）加上名詞後綴 -ment（表示動作、狀態或結果）構成。place 源自古法語 plaser，意為「地方」，向上可追溯至拉丁語 platea（廣場；街道）。因此，placement 的核心語義是「放置的行為或結果」。此名詞表示將某物放置在特定位置的動作，或指人被安排到某個職位、場所或情況。其語意演變是從具體的「放置」到抽象的「安排、安置」。","definition":"1. the action, process, or result of placing something or someone in a particular position or situation; 2. the arrangement of something in a particular position.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"the placement of the furniture\",\n    \"ch\": \"家具的擺放\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The school helps with job placement.\",\n    \"ch\": \"學校協助學生安排工作職位。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"children's placement in foster homes\",\n    \"ch\": \"兒童被安置在寄養家庭\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"學校協助學生安排工作職位。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U65"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5056,"wordRef":"字彙王::u59::plea::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The defendant entered a ____ of not guilty.","expectedAnswer":"plea","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The defendant entered a ____ of not guilty.","clozeAnswer":"plea","exampleTranslation":"被告聲稱無罪。","reference":{"eng":"plea","kk":"pliː","tense":"n.","ch":"[['懇求'], ['請求'], ['（法律）辯護陳述']]","chEntries":["懇求","請求","辯護陳述"],"practiceMeaning":"被告聲稱無罪。","analysis":"此字源自古法語plait，來自拉丁語placitum，意為「有利」、「判決」。最初意指「申訴、爭論」。在英語中，plea 主要指「懇切的請求或懇求」，尤指在困境中或為了得到幫助。在法律語境中，指「被告的辯護陳述」（如 guilty plea）。其核心語意是「強烈的請求或為自己辯護」。OCR 掃描時可能將 'p' 誤判為 'r'。此處修正為 plea。","definition":"1. an earnest or emotional request; 2. a formal statement by or on behalf of a defendant admitting guilt or expressing innocence.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She made a plea for help.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她懇求幫助。\"\n  },\n  {