stis'（證人）。在構詞上，'pro-' 字首改變了語意方向，強調「公開」和「對抗」。'testari' 則提供了「聲明」或「作證」的核心語意。最初的語意是「公開表明反對或不贊同」，後來演變為現代英語中廣泛使用的「抗議」或「反對」的動詞，常涉及集體行動來表達不滿。","definition":"1. To express objection to or disapproval of; 2. To take part in a public demonstration of objection to an idea or course of action.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Citizens gathered to protest against the new law.\",\n    \"ch\": \"市民們聚集起來抗議這項新法律。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She decided to protest the unfair treatment by quitting her job.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她決定透過辭職來抗議不公平的待遇。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她決定透過辭職來抗議不公平的待遇。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3185,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::psychological::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The experiment measured the ____ responses of the subjects.","expectedAnswer":"psychological","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The experiment measured the ____ responses of the subjects.","clozeAnswer":"psychological","exampleTranslation":"實驗測量了受試者的心理反應。","reference":{"eng":"psychological","kk":"/ˌsaɪkəˈlɒdʒɪkl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['心理的；心理學的']]","chEntries":["心理的","心理學的"],"practiceMeaning":"實驗測量了受試者的心理反應。","analysis":"形容詞，源自 'psychology'。'Psychological' 描述的是與心靈、思想、情感、行為和心理過程相關的。它可以用來解釋人的動機、行為的潛在原因，或指與心理學學科相關的研究、理論或方法。","definition":"1. relating to the characteristics of the human mind or behavior; 2. relating to the science of psychology.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Stress can have significant psychological effects.\",\n    \"ch\": \"壓力會產生顯著的心理影響。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The experiment measured the psychological responses of the subjects.\",\n    \"ch\": \"實驗測量了受試者的心理反應。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her research focused on the psychological development of children.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她的研究重點是兒童的心理發展。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"實驗測量了受試者的心理反應。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U40"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3249,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::public::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ appreciated the efforts.","expectedAnswer":"public","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ appreciated the efforts.","clozeAnswer":"public","exampleTranslation":"公眾讚賞這些努力。","reference":{"eng":"public","kk":"/ˈpʌblɪk/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['公眾'], ['民眾']]","chEntries":["公眾","民眾"],"practiceMeaning":"公眾讚賞這些努力。","analysis":"名詞形式，指『廣大的群眾』或『社會大眾』。與『private』(私人) 相對。","definition":"the ordinary people in general; the community.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The decision will affect the public.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個決定將影響公眾。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The public appreciated the efforts.\",\n    \"ch\": \"公眾讚賞這些努力。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"公眾讚賞這些努力。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U41"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4264,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u7::purse::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He handed her a small velvet ____.","expectedAnswer":"purse","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He handed her a small velvet ____.","clozeAnswer":"purse","exampleTranslation":"他遞給她一個小小的天鵝絨錢包。","reference":{"eng":"purse","kk":"/pɜːrs/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['錢包'], ['皮夾'], ['（尤指女性使用的）手提包']]","chEntries":["錢包","皮夾","手提包"],"practiceMeaning":"他遞給她一個小小的天鵝絨錢包。","analysis":"源自古法語 'boursette'，意為「小袋子」。'Purse' 最初指用於裝錢的小袋子，後來演變成現代的「錢包」或「皮夾」。在英式英語中，'purse' 也常指女性的手提包。","definition":"a small bag, typically for money or credit cards; a woman's handbag.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She kept her credit cards in her purse.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她把信用卡放在錢包裡。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He handed her a small velvet purse.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他遞給她一個小小的天鵝絨錢包。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他遞給她一個小小的天鵝絨錢包。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4163,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::question::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"That's a tricky ____.","expectedAnswer":"question","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"That's a tricky ____.","clozeAnswer":"question","exampleTranslation":"這是一個棘手的問題。","reference":{"eng":"question","kk":"/ˈkwestʃən/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['問題'], ['疑問']]","chEntries":["問題","疑問"],"practiceMeaning":"這是一個棘手的問題。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 quaestio（尋求，詢問），是 quaerere（尋找，詢問）的名詞形式。核心概念是「對未知事物進行詢問」。","definition":"1. a sentence worded or expressed so as to elicit information; 2. a doubt or dispute concerning a matter","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Do you have any questions?\",\n    \"ch\": \"你有什麼問題嗎？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"That's a tricky question.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是一個棘手的問題。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The question of his honesty is still debated.\",\n    \"ch\": \"關於他是否誠實的問題仍在爭論中。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這是一個棘手的問題。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5800,"wordRef":"字彙王::u60::questionnaire::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We will send out a ____ to gather customer feedback.","expectedAnswer":"questionnaire","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We will send out a ____ to gather customer feedback.","clozeAnswer":"questionnaire","exampleTranslation":"我們將發送一份問卷來收集客戶意見。","reference":{"eng":"questionnaire","kk":"ˌkwɛstʃəˈnɛr","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"問卷\"  ],  [    \"調查表\"  ]]","chEntries":["問卷","調查表"],"practiceMeaning":"我們將發送一份問卷來收集客戶意見。","analysis":"此字為名詞，源自法語questionnaire，是question（問題）的指小詞或名詞形式。question源自拉丁語quaestio，意為「詢問；搜查」，來自quaerere（尋找；詢問）。核心語義是指「一組用於收集訊息或意見的書面問題」。語意演變上，由「問題」的概念，發展為「收集問題的表格」這一具體物品。","definition":"1. a set of printed or written questions, especially one that is filled out by many people to collect information.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please complete the questionnaire honestly.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請誠實地填寫問卷。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We will send out a questionnaire to gather customer feedback.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們將發送一份問卷來收集客戶意見。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The survey includes a detailed questionnaire on living habits.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該調查包含了一份關於生活習慣的詳細問卷。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們將發送一份問卷來收集客戶意見。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U60"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4433,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::quit::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She ____ her job after only six months.","expectedAnswer":"quit","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She ____ her job after only six months.","clozeAnswer":"quit","exampleTranslation":"她工作了僅六個月就辭職了。","reference":{"eng":"quit","kk":"/kwɪt/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['停止', '放棄'], ['辭職', '離開']]","chEntries":["停止","放棄","辭職","離開"],"practiceMeaning":"她工作了僅六個月就辭職了。","analysis":"詞源自古法語 'quiter'，源自拉丁語 'quietus' (at rest)。核心概念是「停止、結束」，引申為離開工作崗位或停止做某事。","definition":"to stop doing something; to leave your job or school.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He decided to quit smoking.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他決定戒菸。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She quit her job after only six months.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她工作了僅六個月就辭職了。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她工作了僅六個月就辭職了。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5855,"wordRef":"字彙王::u58::radical::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is known for his ____ political views.","expectedAnswer":"radical","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is known for his ____ political views.","clozeAnswer":"radical","exampleTranslation":"他以其激進的政治觀點而聞名。","reference":{"eng":"radical","kk":"ˈrædɪkl","tense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"激進的\"  ],  [    \"根本的\"  ],  [    \"徹底的\"  ],  [    \"主根的\"  ]]","chEntries":["激進的","根本的","徹底的","主根的"],"practiceMeaning":"他以其激進的政治觀點而聞名。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'radicalis'，是 'radix' (root) 的派生詞。'Radix' 指「根」，引申為「基礎」、「起源」。'-al' 是常見的形容詞字尾。'Radical' 的核心語意與「根」相關，指「關於根部的」或「從根源來的」。這引申出「根本的」、「徹底的」意思，表示涉及事物最基本的部分。引申到政治或社會思想，則指追求根本性變革的「激進的」。例如，也可指「極端的」或「全面的」。","definition":"1. Relating to or affecting the fundamental nature of something; far-reaching or thorough.; 2. (of change or action) advocating or based on thorough or complete political or social change.; 3. Relating to the root of a plant or hair follicle.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The proposal calls for radical changes.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這項提議要求進行根本性的改變。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is known for his radical political views.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他以其激進的政治觀點而聞名。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is a radical solution to the problem.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是一個解決問題的徹底方案。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The dentist performed a radical surgery to remove the tumor.\",\n    \"ch\": \"牙醫進行了根除性手術以移除腫瘤。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他以其激進的政治觀點而聞名。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U58"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4494,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::rank::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The situation is ____ with corruption.","expectedAnswer":"rank","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The situation is ____ with corruption.","clozeAnswer":"rank","exampleTranslation":"情況充滿了嚴重的腐敗。","reference":{"eng":"rank","kk":"/ræŋk/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['惡臭的'], ['討厭的'], ['（食物）腐爛的'], ['（情況）嚴重的']]","chEntries":["惡臭的","討厭的","腐爛的","嚴重的"],"practiceMeaning":"情況充滿了嚴重的腐敗。","analysis":"源自古諾爾斯語 rǫkr，意為「黑暗」、「骯髒」。核心語意是「令人不悅的」、「難聞的」。引申為「嚴重的」、「討厭的」。這與名詞/動詞 rank (等級) 是同形異源詞。","definition":"1. Having an offensive smell or taste; not fresh; 2. Very unpleasant or offensive; 3. Extremely bad; severe.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The garbage had a rank smell.\",\n    \"ch\": \"垃圾散發出惡臭。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The situation is rank with corruption.\",\n    \"ch\": \"情況充滿了嚴重的腐敗。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He thought the whole idea was rank.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他認為整個想法都令人厭惡。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"情況充滿了嚴重的腐敗。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3971,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u3::react::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The chemicals will ____ violently if mixed.","expectedAnswer":"react","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The chemicals will ____ violently if mixed.","clozeAnswer":"react","exampleTranslation":"這些化學物質混合後會劇烈反應。","reference":{"eng":"react","kk":"/riˈækt/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['做出反應', '回應'], ['化學上發生反應']]","chEntries":["做出反應","回應","化學上發生反應"],"practiceMeaning":"這些化學物質混合後會劇烈反應。","analysis":"字根：'act' (行動)。字首：'re-' (再次，回)。合起來表示「再次行動」或「回溯行動」，引申為「做出反應」。","definition":"1. to do something in response to a particular action or event; 2. (chemistry) to undergo a chemical reaction.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She didn't react to the news immediately.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她對這個消息沒有立刻做出反應。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The chemicals will react violently if mixed.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這些化學物質混合後會劇烈反應。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這些化學物質混合後會劇烈反應。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4209,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::reasonable::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Her request was ____.","expectedAnswer":"reasonable","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Her request was ____.","clozeAnswer":"reasonable","exampleTranslation":"她的要求是合情合理的。","reference":{"eng":"reasonable","kk":"/ˈriːznəbl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['合理的；公道的'], ['（價格）適中的；不貴的'], ['（行為、要求）合乎情理的']]","chEntries":["合理的","公道的","適中的","不貴的","合乎情理的"],"practiceMeaning":"她的要求是合情合理的。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 rationalis，'ratio'（理性，計算）。'Reasonable' 的核心是與“理性”或“道理”相關。1. “合理的；公道的”指基於邏輯、公平和常識。2. “適中的”指價格或數量不過高，符合實際價值。3. “合乎情理的”強調行為、決策的合理性，易於被接受。","definition":"1. fair and sensible; 2. not too expensive; 3. based on or in accordance with good sense or judgment.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"That's a reasonable price for such a good product.\",\n    \"ch\": \"對於這樣好的產品來說，這是個合理的價格。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her request was reasonable.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她的要求是合情合理的。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to be reasonable about this matter.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們在這件事上必須講道理。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她的要求是合情合理的。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4665,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u16::record-holder::idiom","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She became the youngest ____ in the event.","expectedAnswer":"record holder","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She became the youngest ____ in the event.","clozeAnswer":"record holder","exampleTranslation":"她成為該項目最年輕的紀錄保持者。","reference":{"eng":"record holder","kk":"/ˈrɛkɔːrd ˌhoʊldər/","tense":"idiom","ch":"[['紀錄保持者']]","chEntries":["紀錄保持者"],"practiceMeaning":"她成為該項目最年輕的紀錄保持者。","analysis":"此為固定片語。'Record' (紀錄) + 'holder' (持有者)。指在某項競賽、運動或成就中，擁有最佳成績或最高紀錄的人。","definition":"a person or team that holds the best result or highest achievement in a particular sport or activity.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is the current world record holder in the 100-meter dash.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是目前百米賽跑的世界紀錄保持者。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She became the youngest record holder in the event.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她成為該項目最年輕的紀錄保持者。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她成為該項目最年輕的紀錄保持者。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U16"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5519,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l5::recruit::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She was a valuable ____ to the team.","expectedAnswer":"recruit","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She was a valuable ____ to the team.","clozeAnswer":"recruit","exampleTranslation":"她是隊伍中一個有價值的加入者。","reference":{"eng":"recruit","kk":"rɪˈkruːt","tense":"n.","ch":"[['新兵'], ['新成員'], ['新進人員']]","chEntries":["新兵","新成員","新進人員"],"practiceMeaning":"她是隊伍中一個有價值的加入者。","analysis":"此為動詞 'recruit' 的名詞形式。作為名詞，它指「被招募的人」，特別是軍隊中的新兵，也泛指任何組織中的新成員或新加入者。構詞與語意演變與動詞一致，承襲了「新增加的、新加入的」概念。","definition":"a newly enlisted soldier or other person.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The new recruits underwent rigorous training.\",\n    \"ch\": \"新兵們接受了嚴格的訓練。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She was a valuable recruit to the team.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她是隊伍中一個有價值的加入者。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她是隊伍中一個有價值的加入者。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3926,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u2::reduce::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"This medicine will ____ your pain.","expectedAnswer":"reduce","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This medicine will ____ your pain.","clozeAnswer":"reduce","exampleTranslation":"這種藥可以減輕你的疼痛。","reference":{"eng":"reduce","kk":"/rɪˈdjuːs/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['減少', '降低'], ['使…處於']]","chEntries":["減少","降低","使…處於"],"practiceMeaning":"這種藥可以減輕你的疼痛。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'reducere'，由 're-' (意為「回來、向後」) 和 'ducere' (意為「引導」) 組成。最初的意思是「引導回來」，後引申為「使…回到較小的狀態」，即「減少、降低」；也指「使…處於某種狀態」。","definition":"1. to make something smaller or less in amount, size, importance, etc.; 2. to bring someone or something back to a former condition or place; 3. to bring someone or something into a particular state or condition.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to reduce our expenses.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要削減開支。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This medicine will reduce your pain.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這種藥可以減輕你的疼痛。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company reduced its workforce by 10%.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司裁員了 10%。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這種藥可以減輕你的疼痛。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4360,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::regain-consciousness::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"It took him several minutes to ____ after the accident.","expectedAnswer":"regain consciousness","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"It took him several minutes to ____ after the accident.","clozeAnswer":"regain consciousness","exampleTranslation":"事故發生後，他花了幾分鐘才恢復意識。","reference":{"eng":"regain consciousness","kk":"None","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['恢復意識']]","chEntries":["恢復意識"],"practiceMeaning":"事故發生後，他花了幾分鐘才恢復意識。","analysis":"此為片語分析。'regain' (v.) 源自古法語 're-' (again) + 'gaigner' (to gain)，意為『重新獲得』。'consciousness' (n.) 源自拉丁語 'conscientia'，指『意識、知覺』。兩者結合，表示失去意識後『重新恢復知覺』。","definition":"to become conscious again after being unconscious","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The patient slowly began to regain consciousness.\",\n    \"ch\": \"病人慢慢開始恢復意識。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It took him several minutes to regain consciousness after the accident.\",\n    \"ch\": \"事故發生後，他花了幾分鐘才恢復意識。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"事故發生後，他花了幾分鐘才恢復意識。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3186,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::rejection::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ of his proposal angered her.","expectedAnswer":"rejection","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ of his proposal angered her.","clozeAnswer":"rejection","exampleTranslation":"他的提議被駁回激怒了她。","reference":{"eng":"rejection","kk":"/rɪˈdʒɛkʃn/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['拒絕；駁回'], ['（尤指因求職、求愛等而被）拒絕；被冷落']]","chEntries":["拒絕","駁回","被冷落"],"practiceMeaning":"他的提議被駁回激怒了她。","analysis":"名詞，源自動詞 'reject'。'Rejection' 指的是拒絕接受、承認或考慮某人或某物。這可以是拒絕提議、請求、申請，或是因為不喜歡、不合適而被拒絕。它常常會帶來失落、沮喪或被排斥的感受。","definition":"1. the act of rejecting or refusing to accept, consider, believe, etc.; 2. the state of being rejected; 3. the dismissive or contemptuous treatment of someone.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He felt devastated by the rejection of his job application.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他對工作申請被拒感到非常沮喪。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The rejection of his proposal angered her.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的提議被駁回激怒了她。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She experienced feelings of rejection after the breakup.\",\n    \"ch\": \"分手後她經歷了被拒絕的感覺。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他的提議被駁回激怒了她。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U40"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4473,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::relax::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The government decided to ____ the travel restrictions.","expectedAnswer":"relax","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The government decided to ____ the travel restrictions.","clozeAnswer":"relax","exampleTranslation":"政府決定放寬旅行限制。","reference":{"eng":"relax","kk":"/rɪˈlæks/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['放鬆'], ['減輕（緊張、約束等）'], ['（肌肉、金屬等）鬆弛']]","chEntries":["放鬆","減輕","鬆弛"],"practiceMeaning":"政府決定放寬旅行限制。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 relaxare，意為「伸展」、「放鬆」。re- (回) + laxare (放鬆，來自 laxus, 寬鬆的)。核心語意是「從緊張狀態恢復到鬆弛狀態」。","definition":"1. To make or become less tense or anxious; 2. To make or become less strict; 3. To make or become less tight or firm.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I like to relax by reading a book.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我喜歡通過閱讀書籍來放鬆。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The government decided to relax the travel restrictions.\",\n    \"ch\": \"政府決定放寬旅行限制。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"After exercise, it's important to relax your muscles.\",\n    \"ch\": \"運動後，放鬆肌肉很重要。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"政府決定放寬旅行限制。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4412,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::release::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The band's new album ____ is scheduled for Friday.","expectedAnswer":"release","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The band's new album ____ is scheduled for Friday.","clozeAnswer":"release","exampleTranslation":"樂團的新專輯發布日期定在週五。","reference":{"eng":"release","kk":"/rɪˈliːs/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['釋放', '解放'], ['發布', '公開'], ['緩解', '解除']]","chEntries":["釋放","解放","發布","公開","緩解","解除"],"practiceMeaning":"樂團的新專輯發布日期定在週五。","analysis":"承襲動詞的語意，指釋放、發布或緩解的行為或事件。","definition":"the act of freeing someone or something; the act of making something known or available to the public; the act of relieving pressure or tension.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The release of the hostages was broadcast live.\",\n    \"ch\": \"人質獲釋的畫面進行了現場直播。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The band's new album release is scheduled for Friday.\",\n    \"ch\": \"樂團的新專輯發布日期定在週五。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"樂團的新專輯發布日期定在週五。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5439,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l3::relieve::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The government is trying to ____ poverty in the region.","expectedAnswer":"relieve","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The government is trying to ____ poverty in the region.","clozeAnswer":"relieve","exampleTranslation":"政府正試圖緩解該地區的貧困問題。","reference":{"eng":"relieve","kk":"rɪˈliːv","tense":"v.","ch":"[['緩解'], ['減輕'], ['解除'], ['安慰'], ['換班']]","chEntries":["緩解","減輕","解除","安慰","換班"],"practiceMeaning":"政府正試圖緩解該地區的貧困問題。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 \"relever\"，意為\"再次提起\"、\"舉起\"、\"減輕\"。其拉丁語詞源為 \"relevare\"，由 \"re-\" (再次) 和 \"levare\" (減輕，與 \"levis\" 意為\"輕\"有關) 構成。構詞上，\"re-\" 提供了「恢復」或「再次」的語意，\"levare\" 提供了「減輕」或「變輕」的核心語意。因此，\"relieve\" 的核心語義是「使某種負擔、痛苦或壓力變輕」，即「緩解」、「減輕」。引申用法包括「解除」某種義務或憂慮，以及「安慰」某人，使其痛苦減輕，還有「換班」以減輕他人負擔。","definition":"to lessen or remove pain, discomfort, or other suffering; to free someone from a burden or obligation; to provide comfort or reassurance to someone; to take over from someone who has been on duty.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This medicine will relieve your headache.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這種藥會緩解你的頭痛。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The government is trying to relieve poverty in the region.\",\n    \"ch\": \"政府正試圖緩解該地區的貧困問題。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A fresh pair of eyes can often relieve you of a difficult task.\",\n    \"ch\": \"換一對新的眼睛來看待，常常能幫你減輕處理艱難任務的壓力。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"政府正試圖緩解該地區的貧困問題。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5059,"wordRef":"字彙王::u59::reminder::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The flowers served as a ____ of their trip.","expectedAnswer":"reminder","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The flowers served as a ____ of their trip.","clozeAnswer":"reminder","exampleTranslation":"那些花讓人們回想起他們的旅行。","reference":{"eng":"reminder","kk":"rɪˈmaɪndər","tense":"n.","ch":"[['提醒物'], ['提醒（通知）']]","chEntries":["提醒物","提醒"],"practiceMeaning":"那些花讓人們回想起他們的旅行。","analysis":"此字由動詞 remind（提醒）加上名詞化字尾 -er（表示人或物）構成。remind 源自古英語 myndgian，與 mind（心智）同源。reminder 的核心語意是「使某人記起某事的東西或行為」。它可以是實物（如備忘錄），也可以是通知或提示。OCR 掃描時可能將 'r' 誤判為 'n'，或 'd' 誤判為 'cl'。此處修正為 reminder。","definition":"1. a thing that causes someone to remember something or to be aware of something; 2. a note or message that reminds someone to do something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This note is a reminder to pay the bill.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這張紙條是付款提醒。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The flowers served as a reminder of their trip.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那些花讓人們回想起他們的旅行。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"那些花讓人們回想起他們的旅行。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U59"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5423,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l3::replacement::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We are looking for a suitable ____ for the outgoing employee.","expectedAnswer":"replacement","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We are looking for a suitable ____ for the outgoing employee.","clozeAnswer":"replacement","exampleTranslation":"我們正在為離職的員工尋找合適的接替人。","reference":{"eng":"replacement","kk":"rɪˈpleɪsmənt","tense":"n.","ch":"[['取代'], ['替換'], ['替代品'], ['接替者'], ['歸還'], ['放回原處']]","chEntries":["取代","替換","替代品","接替者","歸還","放回原處"],"practiceMeaning":"我們正在為離職的員工尋找合適的接替人。","analysis":"此字為派生詞，由動詞 \"replace\" 加上名詞化字尾 \"-ment\" 構成。\"replace\" 由字首 \"re-\" (再次、向後) 和動詞 \"place\" (放置) 構成，原始語義為「再次放置」或「放回原處」，引申為「取代」、「替換」。字尾 \"-ment\" 將動詞的「取代」、「替換」行為轉化為抽象名詞，表示「取代的行為或過程」、「被取代的事物」或「用來取代的事物」。因此，\"replacement\" 指的是將舊的換成新的、用一個事物代替另一個事物的動作、結果，或者指用來替代的物品或人。","definition":"the act of replacing someone or something; something or someone that replaces another; a substitute.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The doctor ordered a replacement for the damaged hip joint.\",\n    \"ch\": \"醫生訂購了一個人工髖關節來替換受損的關節。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We are looking for a suitable replacement for the outgoing employee.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們正在為離職的員工尋找合適的接替人。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The replacement of parts is a common maintenance task.\",\n    \"ch\": \"零件更換是常見的維護工作。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們正在為離職的員工尋找合適的接替人。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4402,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::republic::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The president addressed the nation on ____ Day.","expectedAnswer":"Republic","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The president addressed the nation on ____ Day.","clozeAnswer":"Republic","exampleTranslation":"總統在國慶日向全國發表講話。","reference":{"eng":"republic","kk":"/rɪˈpʌblɪk/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['共和國'], ['（共和制）國家']]","chEntries":["共和國","國家"],"practiceMeaning":"總統在國慶日向全國發表講話。","analysis":"詞源自拉丁語 'res publica'，'res' (thing, matter) + 'publica' (public)。意為「公眾事務」。指一種政治體制，其中國家元首由選舉產生，而非世襲，且權力來自人民。","definition":"a country that is governed by elected representatives and in which there is no king or queen; a state in which supreme power is held by the people and their elected representatives, and which has an elected or nominated president rather than a monarch.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"France is a republic.\",\n    \"ch\": \"法國是一個共和國。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The president addressed the nation on Republic Day.\",\n    \"ch\": \"總統在國慶日向全國發表講話。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"總統在國慶日向全國發表講話。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4401,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::request::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He made a special ____ to see the files.","expectedAnswer":"request","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He made a special ____ to see the files.","clozeAnswer":"request","exampleTranslation":"他提出了一個查看檔案的特別請求。","reference":{"eng":"request","kk":"/rɪˈkwest/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['請求', '要求']]","chEntries":["請求","要求"],"practiceMeaning":"他提出了一個查看檔案的特別請求。","analysis":"承襲動詞的語意，指提出的願望或要求。","definition":"an act of asking for something to be given or done, especially formally or politely.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The request for more information was granted.\",\n    \"ch\": \"增加更多資訊的要求獲得了批准。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He made a special request to see the files.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他提出了一個查看檔案的特別請求。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他提出了一個查看檔案的特別請求。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4564,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u11::reserve::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"They ____ some food for the guests.","expectedAnswer":"reserve","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"They ____ some food for the guests.","clozeAnswer":"reserve","exampleTranslation":"他們為客人們保留了一些食物。","reference":{"eng":"reserve","kk":"/rɪˈzɜːrv/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['預訂', '保留'], ['儲備', '貯藏'], ['（在心中）保留（想法、意見）']]","chEntries":["預訂","保留","儲備","貯藏"],"practiceMeaning":"他們為客人們保留了一些食物。","analysis":"動詞用法源自名詞。\n    1. 預訂、保留：為將來或特定的人而留存。\n    2. 儲備、貯藏：將物品保存起來以備日後使用。\n    3. 保留想法：指不立即表達或做出決定，將其留待以後處理。","definition":"1. keep (something) for future use or a particular purpose.; 2. book (accommodation, a seat, etc.) in advance.; 3. keep one's thoughts or feelings to oneself.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Can you reserve a seat for me?\",\n    \"ch\": \"你能為我保留一個座位嗎？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They reserve some food for the guests.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們為客人們保留了一些食物。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He reserves judgment until he has all the facts.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他會等掌握所有事實後再做判斷。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他們為客人們保留了一些食物。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U11"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4582,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u11::reservoir::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The oil ____ is deep underground.","expectedAnswer":"reservoir","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The oil ____ is deep underground.","clozeAnswer":"reservoir","exampleTranslation":"油藏在地底下。","reference":{"eng":"reservoir","kk":"/ˈrɛzəvwɑːr/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['水庫', '蓄水池'], ['儲藏處', '儲備']]","chEntries":["水庫","蓄水池","儲藏處","儲備"],"practiceMeaning":"油藏在地底下。","analysis":"源自法語 'réservoir'，'réserver' (to reserve - 保留、儲藏) 的名詞形式。\n    1. 水庫、蓄水池：指為儲存水而建造的人工湖或設施。\n    2. 儲藏處、儲備：泛指任何用於儲存某種物質（如石油、氣體）或數據的場所或系統。","definition":"1. a large natural or artificial lake used as a source of water supply.; 2. a place where something is kept or stored in large quantities.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The city's water supply comes from the nearby reservoir.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這座城市的水源來自附近的が水庫。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The oil reservoir is deep underground.\",\n    \"ch\": \"油藏在地底下。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"油藏在地底下。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、字彙王","unitName":"C3U11、U60"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3109,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::resign::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"They had to ____ themselves to the loss.","expectedAnswer":"resign","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"They had to ____ themselves to the loss.","clozeAnswer":"resign","exampleTranslation":"他們不得不聽任損失的發生。","reference":{"eng":"resign","kk":"/rɪˈzaɪn/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['辭職；放棄（職位）'], ['順從；聽任']]","chEntries":["辭職","放棄","順從","聽任"],"practiceMeaning":"他們不得不聽任損失的發生。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'resignare'，'re-' (back) + 'signare' (to sign)。核心意義是「撤銷簽署」或「放棄」。\n1. 辭職；放棄（職位）：指正式退出一個職位或工作。\n2. 順從；聽任：指接受某個不愉快的局面或命運，不再反抗。","definition":"1. to leave your job officially; 2. to accept that something unpleasant must happen.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He decided to resign from his position as manager.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他決定辭去經理職位。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They had to resign themselves to the loss.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們不得不聽任損失的發生。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他們不得不聽任損失的發生。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U39"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4530,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u11::resist::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"It's hard to ____ temptation.","expectedAnswer":"resist","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"It's hard to ____ temptation.","clozeAnswer":"resist","exampleTranslation":"很難抗拒誘惑。","reference":{"eng":"resist","kk":"/rɪˈzɪst/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['抵抗', '抵制'], ['忍耐', '抗拒']]","chEntries":["抵抗","抵制","忍耐","抗拒"],"practiceMeaning":"很難抗拒誘惑。","analysis":"詞根 'sist' 或 'sister' 源自拉丁語 'sistere'，意為 'to stand' (站立)。字首 're-' 表示 'back' (向後) 或 'against' (反對)。因此 'resist' 的核心意思是 'to stand against' (站立對抗)，引申為抵抗、抵制、不屈服。","definition":"1. to withstand the action or effect of.; 2. to oppose or fight against.; 3. to keep from doing, accepting, or yielding to.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The army was ordered to resist the enemy invasion.\",\n    \"ch\": \"軍隊奉命抵抗敵軍入侵。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It's hard to resist temptation.\",\n    \"ch\": \"很難抗拒誘惑。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The material resists wear and tear.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這種材料耐磨損。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"很難抗拒誘惑。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U11、L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5391,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l2::resistance::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The metal showed high ____ to heat.","expectedAnswer":"resistance","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The metal showed high ____ to heat.","clozeAnswer":"resistance","exampleTranslation":"這種金屬對高溫顯示出高阻力。","reference":{"eng":"resistance","kk":"rɪˈzɪstəns","tense":"n.","ch":"[['抵抗'], ['阻力'], ['反抗'], ['（電）電阻']]","chEntries":["抵抗","阻力","反抗","電阻"],"practiceMeaning":"這種金屬對高溫顯示出高阻力。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 resistentia，是動詞 'resistere' (抵抗) 的名詞形式。'-ia' 是名詞字尾。核心語意是「抵抗的行為、狀態或能力」。因此，'resistance' 指「對抗、反對、不順從」的行為，也可以是「物體或力量所產生的阻力」，例如物理學中的電阻。","definition":"1. the refusal to accept or comply with something; 2. the attempt to prevent something by action or argument; 3. the opposition to a force or effect.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There was strong resistance to the new law.\",\n    \"ch\": \"對新法律有強烈的抵抗。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The metal showed high resistance to heat.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這種金屬對高溫顯示出高阻力。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這種金屬對高溫顯示出高阻力。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5389,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l2::resistant::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The population became ____ to the antibiotic.","expectedAnswer":"resistant","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The population became ____ to the antibiotic.","clozeAnswer":"resistant","exampleTranslation":"該族群對這種抗生素產生了抗藥性。","reference":{"eng":"resistant","kk":"rɪˈzɪstənt","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['抵抗的'], ['耐受的'], ['有抵抗力的']]","chEntries":["抵抗的","耐受的","有抵抗力的"],"practiceMeaning":"該族群對這種抗生素產生了抗藥性。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 resistens，是動詞 'resistere' (抵抗、站立、反抗) 的現在分詞。're-' (back, against) + sistere (to stand)。核心語意是「站立對抗，不屈服」。因此，'resistant' 形容「能夠抵禦外力、影響或損害」，例如抵抗疾病、抵抗壓力、抵抗化學物質等。","definition":"1. offering or showing resistance; 2. not affected or harmed by something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This fabric is resistant to stains.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這種布料抗污漬。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The population became resistant to the antibiotic.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該族群對這種抗生素產生了抗藥性。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"該族群對這種抗生素產生了抗藥性。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4160,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::resources::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We need to manage our ____ wisely.","expectedAnswer":"resources","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We need to manage our ____ wisely.","clozeAnswer":"resources","exampleTranslation":"我們需要明智地管理我們的資源。","reference":{"eng":"resources","kk":"/ˈriːsɔːrsɪz/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['資源']]","chEntries":["資源"],"practiceMeaning":"我們需要明智地管理我們的資源。","analysis