死亡」。'starvation' 作為名詞，指「挨餓」的狀態或「餓死」的結果。它是一個抽象名詞，描述了極度缺乏食物的嚴重狀況。","definition":"the state or condition of suffering or dying from lack of food.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The war led to widespread starvation in the region.\",\n    \"ch\": \"戰爭導致該地區普遍挨餓。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Many children are dying of starvation.\",\n    \"ch\": \"許多兒童正因飢餓而死亡。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"許多兒童正因飢餓而死亡。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4148,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::steep::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"There has been a ____ rise in inflation.","expectedAnswer":"steep","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"There has been a ____ rise in inflation.","clozeAnswer":"steep","exampleTranslation":"通貨膨脹急劇上升。","reference":{"eng":"steep","kk":"/stiːp/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['陡峭的', '險峻的'], ['（價格、增長等）急劇的'], ['（要求、期望）過高的'], ['（學習）艱深的']]","chEntries":["陡峭的","險峻的","急劇的","過高的","艱深的"],"practiceMeaning":"通貨膨脹急劇上升。","analysis":"源自古英語 steap（高聳的，陡峭的）。核心概念是「極度傾斜」或「高度」。引申為物理上的陡峭、數量上的急劇變化、要求過高，或學習曲線的陡峭。","definition":"1. rising or falling sharply; 2. (of a price or amount) very high; 3. (of a task or idea) demanding or difficult","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The path up the mountain was very steep.\",\n    \"ch\": \"上山的路非常陡峭。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There has been a steep rise in inflation.\",\n    \"ch\": \"通貨膨脹急劇上升。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The tuition fees are very steep.\",\n    \"ch\": \"學費非常高昂。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"通貨膨脹急劇上升。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4488,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::stir::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She gave the mixture a quick ____.","expectedAnswer":"stir","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She gave the mixture a quick ____.","clozeAnswer":"stir","exampleTranslation":"她快速地攪拌了一下混合物。","reference":{"eng":"stir","kk":"/stɜːr/","tense":