 '麥稈'], ['吸管'], ['細梗，草莖']]","chEntries":["稻草","麥稈","吸管","細梗，草莖"],"practiceMeaning":"他用吸管喝蘇打水。","analysis":"詞源自古英語 'strēaw'。指乾燥的植物莖，特別是穀物的莖。也引申為用於吸取液體的管子。","definition":"dried stalks of grain, used for animal bedding or thatching; a tube made of plastic, paper, or straw, used for sucking liquid into the mouth.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The roof was made of straw.\",\n    \"ch\": \"屋頂是用稻草做的。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He drank his soda through a straw.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他用吸管喝蘇打水。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他用吸管喝蘇打水。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5621,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l7::strict::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is very ____ with his children.","expectedAnswer":"strict","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is very ____ with his children.","clozeAnswer":"strict","exampleTranslation":"他對他的孩子要求很嚴厲。","reference":{"eng":"strict","kk":"strɪkt","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['嚴格的'], ['嚴厲的'], ['精確的'], ['嚴謹的']]","chEntries":["嚴格的","嚴厲的","精確的","嚴謹的"],"practiceMeaning":"他對他的孩子要求很嚴厲。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'strictus'，是動詞 'stringere'（拉緊、緊束、約束）的過去分詞。構詞學上，'strin-'/'strict-' 是「拉緊」、「緊密」的詞根，'-us' 是過去分詞後綴。原始語意是「被拉緊的」、「被約束的」。從「緊繃」、「不受鬆懈」引申出「嚴格的」、「嚴厲的」（指規則、紀律、對待方式）以及「精確的」、「嚴謹的」（指方法、定義）。","definition":"1. (Of a rule or discipline) demanding exact compliance; 2. (Of a person or their manner) severe and unsparing in the giving or exacting of discipline, conditions, or the like; 3. Precisely accurate; exact.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The teacher has strict rules about homework.\",\n    \"ch\": \"老師對家庭作業有嚴格的規定。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is very strict with his children.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他對他的孩子要求很嚴厲。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The measurement must be strict.\",\n    \"ch\": \"測量必須精確。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他對他的孩子要求很嚴厲。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5147,"wordRef":"字彙王::u62::submit::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The defeated army was forced to ____.","expectedAnswer":"submit","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The defeated army was forced to ____.","clozeAnswer":"submit","exampleTranslation":"戰敗的軍隊被迫投降。","reference":{"eng":"submit","kk":"səbˈmɪt","tense":"v.","ch":"[['提交'], ['屈服'], ['呈遞']]","chEntries":["提交","屈服","呈遞"],"practiceMeaning":"戰敗的軍隊被迫投降。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 submittere，由 sub-（在…下面、服從）+ mittere（派遣、發送）組成。mittere 來自印歐語系 *s(w)ei-（綑綁、指引）。核心語意是「在某人權威之下發送或放置」。引申為「屈服於權威、順從」，以及「呈遞文件、提交申請」。","definition":"accept or yield to a superior force or to another's authority; present (a proposal, application, or other document) to a person or body for consideration or judgment.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"You must submit your application by Friday.\",\n    \"ch\": \"你必須在星期五前提交你的申請。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The defeated army was forced to submit.\",\n    \"ch\": \"戰敗的軍隊被迫投降。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"戰敗的軍隊被迫投降。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U62"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5148,"wordRef":"字彙王::u62::subsequent::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The first chapter is followed by ____ ones.","expectedAnswer":"subsequent","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The first chapter is followed by ____ ones.","clozeAnswer":"subsequent","exampleTranslation":"第一章之後是隨後的章節。","reference":{"eng":"subsequent","kk":"ˈsʌbsɪkwənt","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['隨後的'], ['後來的'], ['依序的']]","chEntries":["隨後的","後來的","依序的"],"practiceMeaning":"第一章之後是隨後的章節。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 subsequens，是 subsequi（接著、隨後跟上）的現在分詞。由 sub-（在…下面、其次）+ sequi（跟隨）組成。sequi 來自印歐語系 *sekʷ-（跟隨）。核心語意是「跟隨在後面的、順序在後」。","definition":"coming after something in time; following; later.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Subsequent events proved him wrong.\",\n    \"ch\": \"後來的事件證明他是錯的。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The first chapter is followed by subsequent ones.\",\n    \"ch\": \"第一章之後是隨後的章節。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"第一章之後是隨後的章節。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U62"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4330,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::substance::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The report lacks ____ and is full of vague statements.","expectedAnswer":"substance","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The report lacks ____ and is full of vague statements.","clozeAnswer":"substance","exampleTranslation":"這份報告缺乏實質內容，充滿了含糊不清的陳述。","reference":{"eng":"substance","kk":"/ˈsʌbstəns/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['物質；材料'], ['實質；要旨'], ['（論點、計畫等的）重要性；意義'], ['（非法）藥物']]","chEntries":["物質","材料","實質","要旨","重要性","意義","藥物"],"practiceMeaning":"這份報告缺乏實質內容，充滿了含糊不清的陳述。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'substantia'，意為 'being, essence, material'，來自 'subsistere' (to stand under, to exist)，由 'sub-' (under) 和 'sistere' (to stand) 構成。核心意為『立足於下』、『存在』。1. 指『物質、材料』，有形的、構成事物的東西。2. 指事物的『實質、要旨』，內在的內容而非形式。3. 指『重要性、意義』，有實質內容，有價值。4. 指具有精神作用的『藥物』，強調其作為一種『物質』對人的影響。","definition":"a type of solid liquid, or gas that is made of a particular combination of atoms and that makes up all matter; the most important part of something; importance or value","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Water is a chemical substance.\",\n    \"ch\": \"水是一種化學物質。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The report lacks substance and is full of vague statements.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這份報告缺乏實質內容，充滿了含糊不清的陳述。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He had a substance abuse problem.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他有藥物濫用問題。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His argument has a lot of substance.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的論點很有分量。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這份報告缺乏實質內容，充滿了含糊不清的陳述。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3258,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::sue::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He threatened to ____ if they didn't pay him back.","expectedAnswer":"sue","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He threatened to ____ if they didn't pay him back.","clozeAnswer":"sue","exampleTrans