]]","chEntries":["最小的","極小的","最低限度的"],"practiceMeaning":"這位藝術家使用了極簡的調色盤。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 minimus，是 parvus（小的）的最高級，意為「最小的」。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根。作形容詞時，指數量、程度或大小極小，是可能的最低水平。中文翻譯為「最小的；極小的；最低限度的」。","definition":"1. the smallest possible amount or degree; 2. very small.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The cost of the repairs was minimal.\",\n    \"ch\": \"維修費用是極小的。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to make minimal changes to the design.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們只需要對設計做最低限度的修改。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The artist used a minimal color palette.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位藝術家使用了極簡的調色盤。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這位藝術家使用了極簡的調色盤。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U67"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6232,"wordRef":"字彙王::u67::minimize::vt","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Don't ____ the importance of this issue.","expectedAnswer":"minimize","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Don't ____ the importance of this issue.","clozeAnswer":"minimize","exampleTranslation":"不要輕視這個問題的重要性。","reference":{"eng":"minimize","kk":"ˈmɪnɪmaɪz","tense":"vt.","ch":"[  [    \"使最小化\"  ],  [    \"減到最低\"  ],  [    \"輕視\"  ],  [    \"低估\"  ]]","chEntries":["使最小化","減到最低","輕視","低估"],"practiceMeaning":"不要輕視這個問題的重要性。","analysis":"此字由形容詞 minimal（最小的）加上動詞字尾 -ize（使…）構成。minimal 源自拉丁語 minimus。字尾 -ize 將形容詞轉為動詞，表示「使達到最小的程度」。核心語義是將某事物（如成本、損失、影響、風險）減少到可能的最少程度，或低估其重要性。此及物動詞義必須接受詞，例如 minimize costs、minimize risk、minimize damage。中文翻譯為「使最小化；減到最低；輕視；低估」。","definition":"1. to reduce something to the smallest possible amount or degree; 2. to treat or regard something as unimportant.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We should try to minimize our environmental impact.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們應該盡量減少我們的環境影響。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company is working to minimize losses.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家公司正努力將損失減到最低。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Don't minimize the importance of this issue.\",\n    \"ch\": \"不要輕視這個問題的重要性。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"不要輕視這個問題的重要性。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U67"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4132,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::motor::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We heard the sound of the ____ starting up.","expectedAnswer":"motor","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We heard the sound of the ____ starting up.","clozeAnswer":"motor","exampleTranslation":"我們聽到了馬達發動的聲音。","reference":{"eng":"motor","kk":"/ˈməʊtər/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['馬達', '電動機'], ['（汽車的）引擎']]","chEntries":["馬達","電動機","引擎"],"practiceMeaning":"我們聽到了馬達發動的聲音。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 motor（推動者），是動詞 movere（移動）的名詞形式。核心概念是「產生運動的裝置」。","definition":"1. a machine that produces motion or power for something; 2. an internal combustion engine","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The electric motor is very quiet.\",\n    \"ch\": \"電動馬達非常安靜。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The motor of the car needs repair.\",\n    \"ch\": \"汽車的引擎需要修理。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We heard the sound of the motor starting up.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們聽到了馬達發動的聲音。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們聽到了馬達發動的聲音。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3998,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u3::naked::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The tree was ____ in winter.","expectedAnswer":"naked","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The tree was ____ in winter.","clozeAnswer":"naked","exampleTranslation":"樹在冬天光禿禿的。","reference":{"eng":"naked","kk":"/ˈneɪkɪd/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['裸體的', '赤裸的'], ['沒有掩飾的', '明顯的'], ['（植物）無保護的']]","chEntries":["裸體的","赤裸的","沒有掩飾的","明顯的","無保護的"],"practiceMeaning":"樹在冬天光禿禿的。","analysis":"詞源：古英語 'nacod'。指沒有穿衣服的，或沒有任何遮蓋、保護的。","definition":"1. (of a person) not wearing clothes; 2. without any covering or protection; 3. obvious and unconcealed.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He was found naked in the street.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他被發現時赤身裸體地躺在街上。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The naked truth is hard to accept.\",\n    \"ch\": \"赤裸的真相很難接受。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The tree was naked in winter.\",\n    \"ch\": \"樹在冬天光禿禿的。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"樹在冬天光禿禿的。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3179,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::namely::adv","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We are planning a trip to Europe, ____ France and Italy.","expectedAnswer":"namely","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We are planning a trip to Europe, ____ France and Italy.","clozeAnswer":"namely","exampleTranslation":"我們正計畫一次歐洲旅行，也就是法國和意大利。","reference":{"eng":"namely","kk":"/ˈneɪmlɪ/","tense":"adv.","ch":"[['即；也就是說']]","chEntries":["即","也就是說"],"practiceMeaning":"我們正計畫一次歐洲旅行，也就是法國和意大利。","analysis":"由 'name'（名字）+ 'ly'（副詞後綴）組成，字面意思是「以名字命名」。'Namely' 用於引出對前面所說內容的具體說明、解釋或列舉。它相當於「也就是說」或「即」，用於將一個普遍的陳述細化到具體的項目。","definition":"used when you are going to give more details about something you have just mentioned.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There is one person I want to thank, namely my mother.\",\n    \"ch\": \"有一位我特別想感謝的人，也就是我的母親。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The report focused on two main issues, namely budget deficits and unemployment.\",\n    \"ch\": \"報告集中討論了兩個主要問題，即預算赤字和失業。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We are planning a trip to Europe, namely France and Italy.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們正計畫一次歐洲旅行，也就是法國和意大利。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們正計畫一次歐洲旅行，也就是法國和意大利。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U40"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5636,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l8::narrow::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He has very ____ views on social issues.","expectedAnswer":"narrow","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He has very ____ views on social issues.","clozeAnswer":"narrow","exampleTranslation":"他在社會議題上有著非常狹隘的觀點。","reference":{"eng":"narrow","kk":"ˈnæroʊ","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['狹窄的'], ['狹小的'], ['（範圍、機會等）有限的'], ['（視野、思想等）狹隘的'], ['（聲音）尖銳的']]","chEntries":["狹窄的","狹小的","有限的","狹隘的","尖銳的"],"practiceMeaning":"他在社會議題上有著非常狹隘的觀點。","analysis":"此字源自中古英語 narow，可能來自古英語 nearu，意為「窄的」。其詞源與原始日耳曼語 *nauraz（窄）相關，更上溯至原始印歐語 *ner-（左；左邊；在左邊）或 *en-（在內）。此字的核心語義是「空間上的狹窄」，並由此引申出範圍、機會、思想、視野的「有限」或「狹隘」。構詞上，此字為單一詞根，無明顯字首字尾。此處為形容詞用法，描述名詞的空間、範圍、程度或性質。","definition":"limited in width; small in distance from one side to the other; restricted in scope, opportunity, or vision; sharp or high-pitched in sound.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We walked down a narrow alley.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們走過一條狹窄的巷子。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company faces narrow profit margins.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家公司面臨著狹窄的利潤空間。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He has very narrow views on social issues.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在社會議題上有著非常狹隘的觀點。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他在社會議題上有著非常狹隘的觀點。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4159,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::natural::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"It's ____ to feel nervous before an exam.","expectedAnswer":"natural","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"It's ____ to feel nervous before an exam.","clozeAnswer":"natural","exampleTranslation":"考試前感到緊張是正常的。","reference":{"eng":"natural","kk":"/ˈnætʃərəl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['自然的', '天然的'], ['天生的', '固有的'], ['正常的', '符合常理的']]","chEntries":["自然的","天然的","天生的","固有的","正常的","符合常理的"],"practiceMeaning":"考試前感到緊張是正常的。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 naturalis（符合天性的），由 natura（天性）而來。核心概念是「由自然產生，非人造」。引申為天生的特質、符合常規的狀態。","definition":"1. existing in or derived from nature; not made or caused by humankind; 2. born with a particular quality or skill; 3. normal or expected","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is a beautiful natural landscape.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是美麗的自然景觀。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She has a natural talent for music.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她有音樂上的天賦。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It's natural to feel nervous before an exam.\",\n    \"ch\": \"考試前感到緊張是正常的。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"考試前感到緊張是正常的。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5792,"wordRef":"字彙王::u60::notify::vt","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"You must ____ the bank of any suspicious transactions.","expectedAnswer":"notify","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"You must ____ the bank of any suspicious transactions.","clozeAnswer":"notify","exampleTranslation":"您必須向銀行報告任何可疑交易。","reference":{"eng":"notify","kk":"ˈnoʊtɪˌfaɪ","tense":"vt.","ch":"[  [    \"通知\"  ],  [    \"告知\"  ],  [    \"警告\"  ]]","chEntries":["通知","告知","警告"],"practiceMeaning":"您必須向銀行報告任何可疑交易。","analysis":"此字為及物動詞，源自拉丁語notificare，由nota（標記；標誌）+facere（製作；使）組成。notus是notare（標記）的過去分詞。核心語義是「用標記或訊息告知某人」。語意演變上，從「做標記」的概念，引申為「透過某種方式（書面、口頭）告知某人事實或訊息」。","definition":"1. to inform someone about something formally or officially; 2. to give notice of something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please notify us if you plan to change your address.\",\n    \"ch\": \"如果您打算更改地址，請通知我們。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The authorities notified the public about the upcoming storm.\",\n    \"ch\": \"當局向公眾發布了關於即將到來的風暴的通知。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"You must notify the bank of any suspicious transactions.\",\n    \"ch\": \"您必須向銀行報告任何可疑交易。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"您必須向銀行報告任何可疑交易。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U60"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5606,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l7::nursery::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We bought several saplings from the garden ____.","expectedAnswer":"nursery","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We bought several saplings from the garden ____.","clozeAnswer":"nursery","exampleTranslation":"我們從花園苗圃買了好幾棵樹苗。","reference":{"eng":"nursery","kk":"ˈnɜrsəri","tense":"n.","ch":"[['育嬰室'], ['托兒所'], ['苗圃'], ['（植物）繁殖場']]","chEntries":["育嬰室","托兒所","苗圃","繁殖場"],"practiceMeaning":"我們從花園苗圃買了好幾棵樹苗。","analysis":"此字源自中古英語 'nursen'（哺乳、照料），而 'nursen' 又源於古法語 'nourrir'（餵養、滋養），最終可追溯至拉丁語 'nutrire'（餵養、滋養）。構詞學上，核心是與「餵養」、「照料」相關的詞根，加上名詞化後綴 '-ery'。'-ery' 字尾常指「地方」、「場所」、「行業」或「收藏」。因此，'nursery' 最初意為「照料嬰兒的地方」，引申為「托兒所」或「育嬰室」。同時，由於「滋養」的概念也適用於植物，故引申出「苗圃」或「繁殖場」的用法。","definition":"1. A room in a house or apartment in which a baby sleeps or plays; 2. A place where children are cared for during the day; 3. A place where young plants are grown for sale.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The baby slept soundly in the nursery.\",\n    \"ch\": \"嬰兒在育嬰室裡睡得很香。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She enrolled her child in a local nursery school.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她為她的孩子報名了一所當地的托兒所。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We bought several saplings from the garden nursery.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們從花園苗圃買了好幾棵樹苗。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們從花園苗圃買了好幾棵樹苗。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3190,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::object::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"In the sentence 'He kicked the ball', 'ball' is the direct ____.","expectedAnswer":"object","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"In the sentence 'He kicked the ball', 'ball' is the direct ____.","clozeAnswer":"object","exampleTranslation":"在句子「他踢了球」中，「球」是直接賓語。","reference":{"eng":"object","kk":"/ˈɒbdʒɪkt/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['物體；物品'], ['（名詞、動詞等的）賓語'], ['目的；目標']]","chEntries":["物體","物品","賓語","目的","目標"],"practiceMeaning":"在句子「他踢了球」中，「球」是直接賓語。","analysis":"詞源來自拉丁語 'obiectum'，意為「被提出來的東西」。'Object' 作名詞時，有幾個主要含義：一是物理上可見、可觸摸的「物體」。二是語言學上，句子中承受動作的「賓語」。三是引申義，指某事的「目標」、「目的」或「對象」。這三個意思都圍繞著「被感知、被處理或被指向」的概念。","definition":"1. a material thing that can be seen and touched; 2. a person, thing, or idea that is the subject of an action or feeling; 3. (grammar) a word or phrase naming the person or thing that is affected by the action of a verb.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The police found a strange object at the scene of the crime.\",\n    \"ch\": \"警方在犯罪現場發現了一個奇怪的物體。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her main object in life is to help others.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她人生的主要目標是幫助他人。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"In the sentence 'He kicked the ball', 'ball' is the direct object.\",\n    \"ch\": \"在句子「他踢了球」中，「球」是直接賓語。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"在句子「他踢了球」中，「球」是直接賓語。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U40"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4215,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::office::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She was elected to public ____.","expectedAnswer":"office","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She was elected to public ____.","clozeAnswer":"office","exampleTranslation":"她當選擔任公職。","reference":{"eng":"office","kk":"/ˈɒfɪs/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['辦公室；辦事處'], ['（公職）職位；當局']]","chEntries":["辦公室","辦事處","職位","當局"],"practiceMeaning":"她當選擔任公職。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 officium，意為“職責，義務，公職”，'opus'（工作）+ 'facere'（做）。核心是“工作的場所”或“執行的職責”。1. “辦公室”指從事商業或行政工作的場所。2. “職位；當局”指履行特定職責的公職或權力機構。","definition":"1. a room or building in which people work at desks; 2. a position of authority or responsibility, especially in government.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He works in a small office on the third floor.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在三樓的一個小辦公室工作。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The president's office is in the White House.\",\n    \"ch\": \"總統的辦公室在白宮。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She was elected to public office.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她當選擔任公職。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她當選擔任公職。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4156,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::old-fashioned::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"They prefer ____ values.","expectedAnswer":"old-fashioned","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"They prefer ____ values.","clozeAnswer":"old-fashioned","exampleTranslation":"他們偏愛傳統的價值觀。","reference":{"eng":"old-fashioned","kk":"/ˌəʊldˈfæʃənd/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['老式的', '過時的']]","chEntries":["老式的","過時的"],"practiceMeaning":"他們偏愛傳統的價值觀。","analysis":"由 old（老的）+ fashioned（有...式樣的，引申為有風格的）組成。核心概念是「遵循舊的風格或方式」，通常帶有不現代或過時的意味。","definition":"1. not modern; belonging to or characteristic of an earlier period; 2. out of date","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is an old-fashioned telephone.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是一部老式電話。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her ideas are a bit old-fashioned.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她的想法有點老派。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They prefer old-fashioned values.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們偏愛傳統的價值觀。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他們偏愛傳統的價值觀。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5590,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l6::on-time::adv","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is always ____ for meetings.","expectedAnswer":"on time","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is always ____ for meetings.","clozeAnswer":"on time","exampleTranslation":"他開會總是準時。","reference":{"eng":"on time","kk":"ɒn taɪm","tense":"adv.","ch":"[['準時']]","chEntries":["準時"],"practiceMeaning":"他開會總是準時。","analysis":"此片語由介詞 \"on\" 和名詞 \"time\" 組成。 \"on\" 在這裡表示「基於、根據」的意思，而 \"time\" 指「預定的時間」。 \"on time\" 是一個固定的慣用語，意思是「在預定的或預期的時間內，沒有延遲」。它強調的是準確性，而不是「及時」或「提早」。","definition":"1. Punctually; at the agreed or scheduled time; 2. Not late.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The train arrived on time.\",\n    \"ch\": \"火車準時到達了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please ensure all deliveries are made on time.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請確保所有送貨都準時送達。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is always on time for meetings.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他開會總是準時。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他開會總是準時。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3892,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u1::painter::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He bought a painting by a famous French ____.","expectedAnswer":"painter","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He bought a painting by a famous French ____.","clozeAnswer":"painter","exampleTranslation":"他買了一幅著名法國畫家的畫作。","reference":{"eng":"painter","kk":"/ˈpeɪntər/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['畫家'], ['油漆工']]","chEntries":["畫家","油漆工"],"practiceMeaning":"他買了一幅著名法國畫家的畫作。","analysis":"由 'paint' (油漆/繪畫) 加上名詞後綴 '-er' (從事某事的人) 組成。核心是「使用顏料的人」。可指進行藝術創作的畫家，或從事油漆粉刷工作的工人。","definition":"1. an artist who paints pictures. 2. a person whose job is to paint buildings, rooms, etc.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is a talented painter.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她是一位有天賦的畫家。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The painter is painting the walls white.\",\n    \"ch\": \"油漆工正在把牆粉刷成白色。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He bought a painting by a famous French painter.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他買了一幅著名法國畫家的畫作。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他買了一幅著名法國畫家的畫作。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4147,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::passage::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"With the ____ of time, things will change.","expectedAnswer":"passage","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"With the ____ of time, things will change.","clozeAnswer":"passage","exampleTranslation":"隨著時間的流逝，事情會改變。","reference":{"eng":"passage","kk":"/ˈpæsɪdʒ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['通道', '走廊'], ['（書籍、文章等的）段落', '樂句'], ['（時間）流逝'], ['通過', '通行']]","chEntries":["通道","走廊","段落","樂句","流逝","通過","通行"],"practiceMeaning":"隨著時間的流逝，事情會改變。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 passus（步伐），是動詞 pandere（擴展，打開）的過去分詞。核心概念是「前進」或「被打開的路徑」。引申為物理上的通道、時間的流逝、口頭或書面表達的一部分，以及通過的行為。","definition":"1. a narrow area or route that connects one place to another; 2. a portion of a written work or musical composition; 3. the act or process of moving through, under, over, or past something; 4. the continuous passing of time","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The narrow passage led to a hidden room.\",\n    \"ch\": \"狹窄的通道通往一個隱藏的房間。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please read the following passage carefully.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請仔細閱讀以下段落。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"With the passage of time, things will change.\",\n    \"ch\": \"隨著時間的流逝，事情會改變。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They had difficulty in passage through the mountains.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們在穿越山脈時遇到了困難。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"隨著時間的流逝，事情會改變。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6085,"wordRef":"字彙王::u64::petition::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"A ____ was signed by hundreds of residents.","expectedAnswer":"petition","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"A ____ was signed by hundreds of residents.","clozeAnswer":"petition","exampleTranslation":"數百名居民簽署了一份請願書。","reference":{"eng":"petition","kk":"pəˈtɪʃən","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"請願書\"  ],  [    \"請願\"  ],  [    \"申請\"  ]]","chEntries":["請願書","請願","申請"],"practiceMeaning":"數百名居民簽署了一份請願書。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 petitio，是 petere（to seek, to ask for, to aim at）的結果名詞。Petere 最終來源於 proto-Indo-European *pet-「to fall, to fly」。核心語義是「尋求」或「請求」。作為名詞，petition 指的是正式的書面請求或懇求，通常簽署有許多人的名字，以表達對某個機構或個人的訴求。","definition":"a formal written request, typically signed by many people, appealing to an authority with respect to a particular cause.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They submitted a petition to the government demanding action.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們向政府提交了一份要求採取行動的請願書。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The students organized a petition to protest the tuition increase.\",\n    \"ch\": \"學生們組織了一場請願，抗議學費上漲。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A petition was signed by hundreds of residents.\",\n    \"ch\": \"數百名居民簽署了一份請願書。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"數百名居民簽署了一份請願書。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U64"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3893,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u1::photographer::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is a freelance ____.","expectedAnswer":"photographer","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is a freelance ____.","clozeAnswer":"photographer","exampleTranslation":"他是一位自由攝影師。","reference":{"eng":"photographer","kk":"/fəˈtɑːɡrəfər/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['攝影師']]","chEntries":["攝影師"],"practiceMeaning":"他是一位自由攝影師。","analysis":"由 'photo-' (光) + 'grapher' (書寫/繪圖者) 組成，源自希臘語 'phos' (light) + 'graphein' (to write)。核心是「用光線繪圖的人」。指專業拍攝照片的人。","definition":"a person who takes photographs, especially professionally.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The photographer captured a beautiful sunset.\",\n    \"ch\": \"攝影師捕捉到了一個美麗的日落。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She hired a photographer for her wedding.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她聘請了一位攝影師來拍攝她的婚禮。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is a freelance photographer.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是一位自由攝影師。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他是一位自由攝影師。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6129,"wordRef":"字彙王::u65::pickup::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"There was a ____ in the stock market.","expectedAnswer":"pickup","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"There was a ____ in the stock market.","clozeAnswer":"pickup","exampleTranslation":"股市出現了回升。","reference":{"eng":"pickup","kk":"ˈpɪkˌʌp","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"皮卡車\"  ],  [    \"接載\"  ],  [    \"撿起\"  ],  [    \"改良\"  ],  [    \"氣氛\"  ],  [    \"搭便車\"  ]]","chEntries":["皮卡車","接載","撿起","改良","氣氛","搭便車"],"practiceMeaning":"股市出現了回升。","analysis":"此字由動詞片語 pick up 構成的名詞。pick 的核心語義是「挑選；選擇」，up 是方向副詞，表示「向上」。pick up 的核心語義是「向上拾起」，引申為「接載；撿起；改良；改善；學會」。此名詞 captures 這些不同的義項。例如，a pickup truck（皮卡車）；give someone a pickup（接載某人）；a pickup in sales（銷售的提升）；a pickup in atmosphere（氣氛的活躍）。因此，此名詞涵蓋了動詞片語的多種義項。","definition":"1. a small truck with low sides and an open back, used for carrying goods; 2. the act of collecting someone or something; 3. a device for picking up sound or signals; 4. an improvement in speed, activity, or mood.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He drove a red pickup truck.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他開了一輛紅色皮卡車。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I'll give you a pickup on my way home.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我回家路上會順道載你。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There was a pickup in the stock market.\",\n    \"ch\": \"股市出現了回升。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"股市出現了回升。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U65"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4196,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::pigeon::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The carrier ____ delivered the message safely.","expectedAnswer":"pigeon","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The carrier ____ delivered the message safely.","clozeAnswer":"pigeon","exampleTranslation":"信鴿安全地送達了訊息。","reference":{"eng":"pigeon","kk":"/ˈpɪdʒən/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['鴿子'], ['（比喻）容易受騙的人；目標']]","chEntries":["鴿子","容易受騙的人","目標"],"practiceMeaning":"信鴿安全地送達了訊息。","analysis":"源自古法語 pijon，意為“幼鴿”。詞源可能來自拉丁語 pipio，意為“雛鳥，吱吱叫的鳥”。核心是“鴿子”。引申義“容易受騙的人”或“目標”來自於鴿子常被用作信鴿（容易被捕捉或被利用），或在賭博中作為較弱的對象。","definition":"1. a bird with a small head, short neck, and slender beak, known for its cooing sound, often domesticated and used for carrying messages; 2. a person who is easily deceived or exploited.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A flock of pigeons flew overhead.\",\n    \"ch\": \"一群鴿子從頭頂飛過。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He's an easy pigeon for con artists.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是騙子們輕易得手的目標。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The carrier pigeon delivered the message safely.\",\n    \"ch\": \"信鴿安全地送達了訊息。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"信鴿安全地送達了訊息。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6130,"wordRef":"字彙王::u65::pipeline::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ ensures a steady supply of natural gas.","expectedAnswer":"pipeline","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ ensures a steady supply of natural gas.","clozeAnswer":"pipeline","exampleTranslation":"這條管線確保了天然氣的穩定供應。","reference":{"eng":"pipeline","kk":"ˈpaɪplaɪn","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"管道\"  ],  [    \"管線\"  ],  [    \"輸出管道\"  ],  [    \"輸送系統\"  ]]","chEntries":["管道","管線","輸出管道","輸送系統"],"practiceMeaning":"這條管線確保了天然氣的穩定供應。","analysis":"此字為複合詞，由 pipeline（水管）和 line（線）組成。pipe 意為「管子」，line 意為「線；管道」。因此，pipeline 的核心語義是「輸送液體或氣體的管道」。modern 用法常引申為「生產線」、「供應鏈」或「預備供應的來源」，尤指項目、產品或資源正在發展或輸送中。","definition":"1. a long pipe, typically underground, for transporting liquids or gases over long distances; 2. a system or process through which something is conveyed or transmitted; a channel for conveying information or resources.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company is building a new oil pipeline.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司正在建造新的輸油管道。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We have several new projects in the pipeline.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們有幾個新項目正在籌備中。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The pipeline ensures a steady supply of natural gas.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這條管線確保了天然氣的穩定供應。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這條管線確保了天然氣的穩定供應。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U65"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6131,"wordRef":"字彙王::u65::pirate::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The book tells the story of a famous ____.","expectedAnswer":"pirate","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The book tells the story of a famous ____.","clozeAnswer":"pirate","exampleTranslation":"這本書講述了一位著名海盜的故事。","reference":{"eng":"pirate","kk":"ˈpaɪrət","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"海盜\"  ],  [    \"盜版者\"  ]]","chEntries":["海盜","盜版者"],"practiceMeaning":"這本書講述了一位著名海盜的故事。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 pīrāta，來自希臘語 peiratēs，意為「襲擊者；掠奪者」，源自 peiran（試圖；攻擊）。因此，pirate 的核心語義是「襲擊者，特別是海上襲擊者」。modern 用法指在海上搶劫船隻的人，或引申為非法複製和散佈受版權保護的材料（盜版者）。其語意演變是從「襲擊者」到「海上掠奪者」，再到「盜版者」。","definition":"1. a person who attacks and robs ships at sea; 2. a person who reproduces or distributes copyrighted material without permission.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The ship was attacked by pirates.\",\n    \"ch\": \"船隻遭到海盜襲擊。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He was accused of pirate software.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他被指控盜版軟體。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The book tells the story of a famous pirate.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這本書講述了一位著名海盜的故事。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這本書講述了一位著名海盜的故事。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U65"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3924,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u2::playful::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The music had a ____, lighthearted quality.","expectedAnswer":"playful","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The music had a ____, lighthearted quality.","clozeAnswer":"playful","exampleTranslation":"這音樂具有一種活潑、輕鬆的特質。","reference":{"eng":"playful","kk":"/ˈpleɪfəl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['愛玩的', '嬉戲的'], ['戲謔的'], ['有趣的']]","chEntries":["愛玩的","嬉戲的","戲謔的","有趣的"],"practiceMeaning":"這音樂具有一種活潑、輕鬆的特質。","analysis":"源自古英語 'plæġful'，由 'plæġa' (意為「遊戲」) 和 '-ful' (形容詞後綴) 組成。指喜歡玩耍、嬉戲的；也可指以戲弄、開玩笑的態度，或形容事物活潑有趣。","definition":"1. fond of games and fun; full of playfulness; 2. (of a person or their behavior) light-hearted and not serious; 3. (of an animal) energetic and lively.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The playful puppy chased its tail.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那隻愛玩的幼犬追著自己的尾巴。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He made a playful remark about her new hairstyle.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他對她的新髮型開了個玩笑。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The music had a playful, lighthearted quality.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這音樂具有一種活潑、輕鬆的特質。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這音樂具有一種活潑、輕鬆的特質。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4455,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::poll::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The exit ____ indicated who would win the election.","expectedAnswer":"poll","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The exit ____ indicated who would win the election.","clozeAnswer":"poll","exampleTranslation":"出口民調預示了誰將贏得選舉。","reference":{"eng":"poll","kk":"/pol/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['民意測驗'], ['投票'], ['（總）票數'], ['（在一處）民意調查']]","chEntries":["民意測驗","投票","票數","民意調查"],"practiceMeaning":"出口民調預示了誰將贏得選舉。","analysis":"源自古英語 pūl，意為「頭」、「頭顱」。後來在16世紀演變成「公眾的意見」或「選舉」。語意從「頭」（代表個人）引申為「許多人的意見總和」，即「民意」。也可以指「投票」的行為或結果。","definition":"1. A survey of public opinion; 2. The process of voting in an election; 3. The total number of votes cast in an election.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The latest poll shows a significant shift in public opinion.\",\n    \"ch\": \"最新的民意測驗顯示公眾意見有顯著轉變。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The poll will be held next Tuesday.\",\n    \"ch\": \"投票將在下週二舉行。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The exit poll indicated who would win the election.\",\n    \"ch\": \"出口民調預示了誰將贏得選舉。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"出口民調預示了誰將贏得選舉。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4133,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::portion::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"A ____ of the profits will be donated to charity.","expectedAnswer":"portion","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"A ____ of the profits will be donated to charity.","clozeAnswer":"portion","exampleTranslation":"部分利潤將捐贈給慈善機構。","reference":{"eng":"portion","kk":"/ˈpɔːrʃn/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['一份', '一部分'], ['（食物的）份量'], ['（財產的）一份', '繼承份']]","chEntries":["一份","一部分","份量","繼承份"],"practiceMeaning":"部分利潤將捐贈給慈善機構。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 portio（一部分，份額），由 pars（部分）的變格形式派生。核心概念是「可分割的部分」或「分配到的份額」。","definition":"1. a part of a whole; 2. an amount of food given to one person at a meal; 3. a share of an inheritance or property","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He ate a large portion of the cake.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他吃了很大一份蛋糕。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please divide the inheritance in equal portions.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請將遺產平均分配。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A portion of the profits will be donated to charity.\",\n    \"ch\": \"部分利潤將捐贈給慈善機構。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"部分利潤將捐贈給慈善機構。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4187,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::practical::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She is very ____ and good at managing household affairs.","expectedAnswer":"practical","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She is very ____ and good at managing household affairs.","clozeAnswer":"practical","exampleTranslation":"她非常務實，很擅長管理家務。","reference":{"eng":"practical","kk":"/ˈpræktɪkl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['實際的；實用的'], ['傾向於做的；合乎實際的'], ['（有）實際經驗的']]","chEntries":["實際的","實用的","傾向於做的","合乎實際的","實際經驗的"],"practiceMeaning":"她非常務實，很擅長管理家務。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 practicus，意為“實踐的，活躍的”，來自希臘語 prassein，意為“做”。核心概念是與“做”或“行動”相關。1. “實際的”強調與理論相對，基於實際情況，具有實用價值。2. “合乎實際的”強調可行性，不脫離現實。3. “有實際經驗的”強調親身實踐的知識，而非僅僅理論。","definition":"1. concerned with the actual doing or using of something rather than with theory and ideas; 2. sensible and realistic in dealing with matters; 3. having or involving practical knowledge or skill.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is a practical solution to the problem.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是解決問題的一個實際的方案。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need a practical approach, not just theories.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要一種實用的方法，而不僅僅是理論。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is very practical and good at managing household affairs.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她非常務實，很擅長管理家務。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她非常務實，很擅長管理家務。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U6、L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6188,"wordRef":"字彙王::u66::practitioner::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is a seasoned ____ of negotiation.","expectedAnswer":"practitioner","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is a seasoned ____ of negotiation.","clozeAnswer":"practitioner","exampleTranslation":"他是一位經驗豐富的談判實踐者。","reference":{"eng":"practitioner","kk":"prækˈtɪʃənər","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"執業者\"  ],  [    \"從業人員\"  ],  [    \"實踐者\"  ]]","chEntries":["執業者","從業人員","實踐者"],"practiceMeaning":"他是一位經驗豐富的談判實踐者。","analysis":"此字由 practice（實踐、執業）加上 -er 結尾構成。practice 源自古法語 practique，最終源自拉丁語 praxis，意為「實踐、行為」。此字在現代英語中可視為由 practice 派生而來，practice 本身由 practice (verb) 演變而來，其詞源核心為希臘語 prassein「做、行動」。作為名詞，其核心語義是指「從事某種職業或活動的人」，特別是醫學、法律等專業領域的執業者。此義項由「實踐」的動作引申為「從事該實踐的人」。","definition":"1. a person engaged in the practice of a profession, especially medicine or law; 2. a person who regularly does something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is 