ual or collaborative enterprise that is carefully planned and designed to achieve a particular aim; 2. a planned piece of work that has a specific purpose.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The construction project is expected to be completed by next year.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個建築項目預計將在明年完工。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is working on a research project for her thesis.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她正在為她的論文進行一個研究項目。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The government has launched a new infrastructure project.\",\n    \"ch\": \"政府啟動了一個新的基礎設施項目。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"政府啟動了一個新的基礎設施項目。","sourceName":"字彙王、龍騰課本","unitName":"U40、L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4319,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::promote::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The festival aims to ____ local culture.","expectedAnswer":"promote","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The festival aims to ____ local culture.","clozeAnswer":"promote","exampleTranslation":"這個節日旨在推廣本地文化。","reference":{"eng":"promote","kk":"/prəˈmoʊt/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['促進；推動'], ['晉升；提升（職位）'], ['推銷；宣傳']]","chEntries":["促進","推動","晉升","提升","推銷","宣傳"],"practiceMeaning":"這個節日旨在推廣本地文化。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'promovere'，意為 'to move forward, advance'，由 'pro-' (forward) 和 'movere' (to move) 構成。字面意思是『向前移動』，引申出多重含義：1.『向前移動』，促進事物的發展，即『促進；推動』。2.『向前移動』到更高位置，即『晉升；提升』。3.『向前推動』產品或理念，使其被更多人接受，即『推銷；宣傳』。","definition":"to help or encourage to develop or grow; to raise someone to a higher rank or more important position; to encourage the popularity, sale, or acceptance of","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The government is trying to promote economic growth.\",\n    \"ch\": \"政府正試圖促進經濟增長。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She was promoted to manager last year.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她去年被晉升為經理。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The festival aims to promote local culture.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個節日旨在推廣本地文化。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這個節日旨在推廣本地文化。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3182,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::prosperity::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The industrial revolution brought great ____ to many cities.","expectedAnswer":"prosperity","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The industrial revolution brought great ____ to many cities.","clozeAnswer":"prosperity","exampleTranslation":"工業革命為許多城市帶來了巨大的繁榮。","reference":{"eng":"prosperity","kk":"/prɒˈspɛrɪtɪ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['繁榮；昌盛'], ['興旺；成功']]","chEntries":["繁榮","昌盛","興旺","成功"],"practiceMeaning":"工業革命為許多城市帶來了巨大的繁榮。","analysis":"名詞，源自形容詞 'prosperous'。指「繁榮」、「昌盛」或「興旺」的狀態，通常指經濟上的富裕、成功和順遂。它代表著一個國家、地區、企業或個人處於良好發展和成功的時期，生活富足。","definition":"1. the state of being successful, especially in making money; 2. wealth and success.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The nation enjoyed a period of economic prosperity.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個國家經歷了一段經濟繁榮時期。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We wish you health, happiness, and prosperity in the New Year.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們祝您在新的一年裡健康、快樂、興旺。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The industrial revolution brought great prosperity to many cities.\",\n    \"ch\": \"工業革命為許多城市帶來了巨大的繁榮。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"工業革命為許多城市帶來了巨大的繁榮。","sourceName":"字彙王、龍騰課本","unitName":"U40、L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3181,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::prosperous::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She lives in a ____ neighborhood.","expectedAnswer":"prosperous","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She lives in a ____ neighborhood.","clozeAnswer":"prosperous","exampleTranslation":"她住在一處富裕的社區。","reference":{"eng":"prosperous","kk":"/ˈprɒspərəs/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['繁榮的；興旺的'], ['富裕的']]","chEntries":["繁榮的","興旺的","富裕的"],"practiceMeaning":"她住在一處富裕的社區。","analysis":"形容詞，源自動詞 'prosper'。表示處於興旺、繁榮、成功或富裕的狀態。可以用來形容國家、城市、企業或個人，指他們在經濟上或整體狀況上取得了良好的發展，通常伴隨著財富和安逸。","definition":"1. successful in material terms; flourishing financially; 2. characterized by success and good fortune.","example":"[\n