g\": \"Tell me about your trip.\",\n    \"ch\": \"跟我說說你的旅行。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It's about ten o'clock.\",\n    \"ch\": \"大約十點鐘了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The children were playing about the room.\",\n    \"ch\": \"孩子們在房間裡玩耍。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"跟我說說你的旅行。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5426,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l3::abundant::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Fresh fruits are ____ in summer.","expectedAnswer":"abundant","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Fresh fruits are ____ in summer.","clozeAnswer":"abundant","exampleTranslation":"夏季水果供應充足。","reference":{"eng":"abundant","kk":"əˈbʌndənt","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['豐富的'], ['充裕的'], ['大量的'], ['充足的']]","chEntries":["豐富的","充裕的","大量的","充足的"],"practiceMeaning":"夏季水果供應充足。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 \"abundans\"，是動詞 \"abundare\" 的現在分詞，意為\"充溢\"、\"豐富\"。\"abundare\" 由 \"ab-\" (離開、遠離，在此表示\"過多\"或\"溢出\") 和 \"undare\" (波浪般流動) 構成，\"undare\" 又源於 \"unda\" (波浪)。構詞上，\"ab-\" 提供了「過量」的語意，\"undare\" 提供了「流動」的圖像，整體表示「如波浪般湧出、充溢」。\"Abundant\" 作形容詞，描述某物「極其豐富」、「充裕」或「大量存在」，遠超過所需。","definition":"existing or available in large quantities; plentiful; more than enough.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Fresh fruits are abundant in summer.\",\n    \"ch\": \"夏季水果供應充足。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The forest provides abundant opportunities for hiking.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這片森林提供了豐富的健行機會。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Natural gas is abundant in this region.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個地區天然氣儲量豐富。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"夏季水果供應充足。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3967,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u2::academic-performance::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Her ____ was excellent throughout her university years.","expectedAnswer":"academic performance","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Her ____ was excellent throughout her university years.","clozeAns