is":"此字由 active（活躍的）加上名詞後綴 -ist（從事某種活動或信仰的人）構成。Active 源自拉丁語 activus，意為「活動的，活躍的」，本身來自 act-（to do, to act）。Activist 指的是一個積極參與某項政治或社會事業，並採取實際行動來推動變革的人。核心語義是「積極採取行動去倡導或反對某事的人」。","definition":"a person who campaigns to bring about political or social change, especially through direct action.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is a well-known environmental activist.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她是一位知名的環保活動家。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The group of activists staged a protest.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那群活動家發起了抗議。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He became a peace activist after the war.\",\n    \"ch\": \"戰後他成為了一名和平主義者。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她是一位知名的環保活動家。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U64"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4006,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u3::additional::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"You may need ____ blankets.","expectedAnswer":"additional","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"You may need ____ blankets.","clozeAnswer":"additional","exampleTranslation":"你可能需要額外的毯子。","reference":{"eng":"additional","kk":"/əˈdɪʃənl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['額外的', '附加的']]","chEntries":["額外的","附加的"],"practiceMeaning":"你可能需要額外的毯子。","analysis":"由 'add' (增加) 和 '-itional' (形容詞詞尾) 組成。指在原有基礎上增加的、額外的。","definition":"added to an existing or usual amount or number; extra.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"You may need additional blankets.\",\n    \"ch\": \"你可能需要額外的毯子。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"你可能需要額外的毯子。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U3、L7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3978,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u3::advantage::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Her height gives her an ____ in basketball.","expectedAnswer":"advantage","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Her height gives her an ____ in basketball.","clozeAnswer":"advantage","exampleTranslation":"她的身高讓她在籃球上佔有優勢。","reference":{"eng":"advantage","kk":"/ədˈvæntɪdʒ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['優勢', '有利條件'], ['好處']]","chEntries":["優勢","有利條件","好處"],"practiceMeaning":"她的身高讓她在籃球上佔有優勢。","analysis":"詞源：古法語 'avantage' (優勢)，來自拉丁文 'ab-' (離開) 和 'vantage' (有利的地位)。引申為「使人處於有利地位」或「因處於有利地位而獲得的好處」。","definition":"1. a condition or circumstance that puts one in a stronger position relative to others; 2. a condition or situation that is favourable or gives one a lead.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her height gives her an advantage in basketball.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她的身高讓她在籃球上佔有優勢。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The advantage of this plan is its simplicity.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個計畫的好處在於它的簡單性。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她的身高讓她在籃球上佔有優勢。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4313,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::advertise::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The company decided to ____ its new product on social media.","expectedAnswer":"advertise","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company decided to ____ its new product on social media.","clozeAnswer":"advertise","exampleTranslation":"該公司決定在社群媒體上推銷其新產品。","reference":{"eng":"advertise","kk":"/ˈædvərtaɪz/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['為…做廣告；宣傳'], ['通知；公佈']]","chEntries":["為…做廣告","宣傳","通知","公佈"],"practiceMeaning":"該公司決定在社群媒體上推銷其新產品。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'advertere'，意為 'turn towards'，由 'ad-' (to, towards) 和 'vertere' (to turn) 構成。最初的意思是『引起注意』、『使轉向』。引申至商業領域，就是『引起公眾對產品或服務的注意』，因此有了『做廣告』、『宣傳』的意思。也可用於『公開宣布』、『通知』。","definition":"to make something known to many people, for example by putting an advertisement in a newspaper or magazine or on television or the internet; to make something known publicly","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company decided to advertise its new product on social media.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司決定在社群媒體上推銷其新產品。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They advertised for a new secretary.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們招聘新秘書。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He advertised his intention to resign.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他公開宣布了他辭職的意圖。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"該公司決定在社群媒體上