nitName":"C3U17"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5504,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l5::agent::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She works as a literary ____ for several famous authors.","expectedAnswer":"agent","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She works as a literary ____ for several famous authors.","clozeAnswer":"agent","exampleTranslation":"她擔任幾位著名作家文學經紀人。","reference":{"eng":"agent","kk":"ˈeɪdʒənt","tense":"n.","ch":"[['代理人'], ['經紀人'], ['特工'], ['情報員'], ['媒介物'], ['動因']]","chEntries":["代理人","經紀人","特工","情報員","媒介物","動因"],"practiceMeaning":"她擔任幾位著名作家文學經紀人。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'agens' (genitive 'agentis')，意為 'doing' 或 'acting'，是動詞 'agere' (to do, to act) 的現在分詞。構詞上，'ag-' 提供核心動詞語意，'-ent' 是拉丁語主詞字尾，指代執行動作的人或事物。原始語義是「做者」或「行動者」。在現代英語中，'agent' 演變出多個義項：指代代表他人或團體行事的人（代理人、經紀人），在情報領域指從事秘密活動的特工或情報員，在科學或哲學領域指能夠引起變化或產生影響的媒介物或動因。這些義項都圍繞著「採取行動」或「產生影響」的核心概念展開。","definition":"a person who acts or does business for another; a person or thing that has the power to influence or act; a secret agent.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She works as a literary agent for several famous authors.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她擔任幾位著名作家文學經紀人。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The spy was identified as a foreign agent.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該間諜被確認為一名外國情報員。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Water is a powerful agent of erosion.\",\n    \"ch\": \"水是侵蝕作用的強大媒介。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她擔任幾位著名作家文學經紀人。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3995,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u3::agriculture::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The country's economy relies heavily on ____.","expectedAnswer":"agriculture","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The country's economy relies heavily on ____.","clozeAnswer":"agriculture","exampleTranslation":"該國經濟嚴重依賴農業。","reference":{"eng":"agriculture","kk":"/ˈæɡrɪkʌltʃər/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['農業']]","chEntries":["農業"],"practiceMeaning":"該國經濟嚴重依賴農業。","analysis":"詞源：拉丁文