為「土堆、堤道」。在古英語中演變為 æscel、æsel，與「梁、柱」有關。在現代英語中，aisle 主要指「座位之間或兩旁之間的通道」，尤其在教堂、劇院、飛機、火車等場所。其語意演變可能與早期建築中用於分隔空間或作為通道的「梁、柱」結構有關，或是從「堤道」引申而來。 OCR 掃描時可能將 'l' 誤判為 'i' 或 '1'，或將 's' 誤判。此處修正為 aisle，其發音 /aɪl/ 與拼寫皆為標準用法。","definition":"1. a passage between rows of seats in a church, theatre, airplane, or other building; 2. a long passageway between rows of seats or shelves in a supermarket or other large building.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please walk down the aisle to your seat.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請沿著走道走到您的座位。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The bride walked down the aisle.\",\n    \"ch\": \"新娘走過紅毯（教堂通道）。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"請沿著走道走到您的座位。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U59"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4556,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u11::ambassador::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He was appointed ____ to France.","expectedAnswer":"ambassador","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He was appointed ____ to France.","clozeAnswer":"ambassador","exampleTranslation":"他被任命為駐法國大使。","reference":{"eng":"ambassador","kk":"/æmˈbæsədər/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['大使'], ['（非官方的）代表，使者']]","chEntries":["大使","代表，使者"],"practiceMeaning":"他被任命為駐法國大使。","analysis":"源自古法語 'ambassadeur'，源於日耳曼語。核心概念是代表某人或某國進行外交事務。\n    1. 大使：國家派駐外國的最高外交代表。\n    2. 代表、使者：引申為在任何場合代表某團體、機構或理念的人。","definition":"1. a diplomatic minister of the highest rank accredited to another country or sovereign.; 2. a person who represents a particular organization or country, especially in a ceremonial capacity.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He was appointed ambassador to France.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他被任命為駐法國大使。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She served as an ambassador for peace.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她以和平使者的身份服務。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他被任命為駐法國大使。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U11"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4149,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::ambulance::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ arrived quickly.","expectedAnswer":"ambulance","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ arrived quickly.","clozeAnswer":"ambulance","exampleTranslation":"救護車很快就到了。","reference":{"eng":"ambulance","kk":"/ˈæmbjʊləns/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['救護車', ' ambulancia (拉丁文：行走）']]","chEntries":["救護車","ambulancia (拉丁文：行走）"],"practiceMeaning":"救護車很快就到了。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 ambulare（行走）。最初指可移動的野戰醫院，後來引申為載運病患的車輛。","definition":"a vehicle equipped for taking sick or injured people to and from the hospital","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The ambulance arrived quickly.\",\n    \"ch\": \"救護車很快就到了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Call an ambulance immediately.\",\n    \"ch\": \"立刻叫救護車。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The injured player was taken to the hospital by ambulance.\",\n    \"ch\": \"受傷的運動員被救護車送往醫院。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"救護車很快就到了。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U5、L5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4032,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u3::an-original-idea::n-phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"That was ____ that no one had thought of before.","expectedAnswer":"an original idea","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"That was ____ that no one had thought of before.","clozeAnswer":"an original idea","exampleTranslation":"那是一個獨創的想法，以前沒有人想過。","reference":{"eng":"an original idea","kk":"/ən əˈrɪdʒɪnəl aɪˈdiːə/","tense":"n. phrase","ch":"[['一個獨創的想法']]","chEntries":["一個獨創的想法"],"practiceMeaning":"那是一個獨創的想法，以前沒有人想過。","analysis":"結合冠詞 'an', 形容詞 'original' (獨創的) 和名詞 'idea' (想法)。指前所未有、非模仿而來的想法。","definition":"a new and creative thought or concept.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"That was an original idea that no one had thought of before.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那是一個獨創的想法，以前沒有人想過。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"那是一個獨創的想法，以前沒有人想過。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4097,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u4::an-overseas-student::phrase","mod