Translation":"公司將於明天公布其季度收益。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4192,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::anyhow::adv","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"I don't know what to do, but I'll finish it ____.","expectedAnswer":"anyhow","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"I don't know what to do, but I'll finish it ____.","clozeAnswer":"anyhow","exampleTranslation":"我不知道該怎麼做，但我總之會完成它。","reference":{"eng":"anyhow","kk":"/ˈeniˌhaʊ/","tense":"adv.","ch":"[['不管怎樣；總之'], ['隨便地；雜亂地']]","chEntries":["不管怎樣","總之","隨便地","雜亂地"],"practiceMeaning":"我不知道該怎麼做，但我總之會完成它。","analysis":"複合詞，由 'any' 和 'how' 組成。'Any' 源自古英語 ænig，'how' 源自古英語 hū。'Anyhow' 的核心是“任何方式”，引申為：1. “不管怎樣”，表示儘管有困難或情況，仍然會發生或去做某事。2. “隨便地”，指沒有特殊的方法或秩序，任意而為。","definition":"1. in any way or manner; 2. in any case; nevertheless; 3. carelessly or untidily.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I don't know what to do, but I'll finish it anyhow.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我不知道該怎麼做，但我總之會完成它。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He threw his clothes down anyhow on the chair.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他隨便地把衣服扔在椅子上。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It's raining, but we'll go out anyhow.\",\n    \"ch\": \"下著雨，但我們還是要出去。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我不知道該怎麼做，但我總之會完成它。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4152,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::apologize::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"I want to ____ for my mistake.","expectedAnswer":"apologize","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"I want to ____ for my mistake.","clozeAnswer":"apologize","exampleTranslation":"我想為我的錯誤道歉。","reference":{"eng":"apologize","kk":"/əˈpɒlədʒaɪz/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['道歉']]","chEntries":["道歉"],"practiceMeaning":"我想為我的錯誤道歉。","analysis":"源自希臘語 apologeisthai（為自己辯護，道歉），由 apo-（遠離）+ logos（言論）組成，原意是「為自己辯解」。後來引申為為錯誤感到抱歉並向對方道歉。","definition":"express one's regret, typically for wronging someone or for some failure","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I want to apologize for my mistake.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我想為我的錯誤道歉。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He apologized to her for being late.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他為遲到向她道歉。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please accept my sincere apologies.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請接受我誠摯的道歉。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我想為我的錯誤道歉。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5681,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l9::appoint::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The committee will ____ a new chairman.","expectedAnswer":"appoint","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The committee will ____ a new chairman.","clozeAnswer":"appoint","exampleTranslation":"委員會將任命一位新主席。","reference":{"eng":"appoint","kk":"əˈpɔɪnt","tense":"v.","ch":"[['任命'], ['指派'], ['委派'], ['約定'], ['確定']]","chEntries":["任命","指派","委派","約定","確定"],"practiceMeaning":"委員會將任命一位新主席。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 apointier，由 a-（表示『向……』，來自拉丁語 ad-）+ point（點，來自拉丁語 pungere，意為『刺，戳，使之明確』）組成。構詞上，'a-' 表示方向，'point' 則暗示了『確定一個點』或『明確指定』。核心語意是「明確指向某人或某事，並使其處於特定位置或狀態」。由此引申出「任命、指派」在職位上，「委派」於任務上，以及「約定」時間或地點。語意演變路徑為：從『明確指向』到『指定（人）』，再到『安排（事）』。","definition":"to choose someone for a particular job or position; to decide on a time or place for something to happen.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The committee will appoint a new chairman.\",\n    \"ch\": \"委員會將任命一位新主席。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They appointed a meeting for next Tuesday.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們約定了下週二開會。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"委員會將任命一位新主席。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3200,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::aquarium::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We visited the city ____ last weekend.","expectedAnswer":"aquarium","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We visited the city ____ last weekend.","clozeAnswer":"aquarium","exampleTranslation":"我們上週末參觀了市裡的水族館。","reference":{"eng":"aquarium","kk":"/əˈkwɛəriəm/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['水族館'], ['養魚缸']]","chEntries":["水族館","養魚缸"],"practiceMeaning":"我們上週末參觀了市裡的水族館。","analysis":"詞源來自拉丁文 'aquarium'，意為 'water-vessel'，來自 'aqua' (water)。最初指盛水的容器，後來引申為展示水生生物的場所。","definition":"1. a transparent tank of water in which fish and other water creatures are kept; 2. a building or establishment where aquatic animals are exhibited.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We visited the city aquarium last weekend.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們上週末參觀了市裡的水族館。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He has a small aquarium with several goldfish.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他有一個小型養魚缸，裡面有幾條金魚。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們上週末參觀了市裡的水族館。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U41"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5361,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l1::around-the-clock::adv","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The rescue team worked ____ to find the missing hikers.","expectedAnswer":"around the clock","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The rescue team worked ____ to find the missing hikers.","clozeAnswer":"around the clock","exampleTranslation":"救援隊日以繼夜地工作，以尋找失蹤的登山者。","reference":{"eng":"around the clock","kk":"əˈraʊnd ðə ˈklɑːk","tense":"adv.","ch":"[['日以繼夜地'], ['全天候地']]","chEntries":["日以繼夜地","全天候地"],"practiceMeaning":"救援隊日以繼夜地工作，以尋找失蹤的登山者。","analysis":"此片語直譯為「繞著時鐘」。時鐘以 12 小時或 24 小時計，繞一圈代表一整天的時間。因此，around the clock 的意思就是「一天 24 小時不間斷地」，強調時間上的連續性與不停止。常用來描述工作、活動或監控的持續時間。","definition":"all day and all night; continuously.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The rescue team worked around the clock to find the missing hikers.\",\n    \"ch\": \"救援隊日以繼夜地工作，以尋找失蹤的登山者。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The factory operates around the clock.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家工廠全天候運營。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"救援隊日以繼夜地工作，以尋找失蹤的登山者。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5071,"wordRef":"字彙王::u61::array::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The data was stored in a two-dimensional ____.","expectedAnswer":"array","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The data was stored in a two-dimensional ____.","clozeAnswer":"array","exampleTranslation":"這些數據被儲存在一個二維陣列中。","reference":{"eng":"array","kk":"əˈreɪ","tense":"n.","ch":"[['陣列'], ['一系列'], ['隊伍']]","chEntries":["陣列","一系列","隊伍"],"practiceMeaning":"這些數據被儲存在一個二維陣列中。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'array'，意為 '排列、部署'。在數學與電腦科學中，它特指一種線性數據結構，其中元素以索引順序存儲。這個概念從早期的軍事部署、列隊訓練延伸到現代計算機科學中的組織化數據集合，強調了其結構化和有序性。","definition":"1. An ordered series or arrangement of things; a collection of items arranged in a particular order.; 2. (Computing) A data structure that stores a collection of elements of the same type, typically in contiguous memory locations, and can be accessed using an index.; 3. A formation of troops or ships drawn up in order of battle.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The data was stored in a two-dimensional array.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這些數據被儲存在一個二維陣列中。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She presented an impressive array of arguments.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她提出了一系列令人印象深刻的論點。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這些數據被儲存在一個二維陣列中。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U61"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5685,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l9::assault::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The suspect was arrested for ____.","expectedAnswer":"assault","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The suspect was arrested for ____.","clozeAnswer":"assault","exampleTranslation":"嫌疑人因襲擊罪被逮捕。","reference":{"eng":"assault","kk":"əˈsɔːlt","tense":"v.","ch":"[['攻擊'], ['襲擊'], ['猛烈批評']]","chEntries":["攻擊","襲擊","猛烈批評"],"practiceMeaning":"嫌疑人因襲擊罪被逮捕。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 assaut（攻擊，衝擊），由 a-（來自拉丁語 ad-，表示『向……』）+ salt（跳，來自拉丁語 saltus，意為『跳躍』）構成。構詞上，'a-' 表示方向，'salt' 則強調『跳躍』或『衝擊』的動作。核心語意是「突然的、猛烈的攻擊或衝擊」。語意演變路徑為：從『跳躍、衝擊』到『身體上的攻擊』，再引申到『語言上的猛烈批評』。","definition":"to make a physical attack on someone; to criticize someone or something forcefully.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The suspect was arrested for assault.\",\n    \"ch\": \"嫌疑人因襲擊罪被逮捕。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The politician launched a fierce assault on the government's policy.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位政治家對政府的政策發動了猛烈抨擊。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"嫌疑人因襲擊罪被逮捕。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3061,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::association::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is a member of the national writers' ____.","expectedAnswer":"association","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is a member of the national writers' ____.","clozeAnswer":"association","exampleTranslation":"他是國家作家協會的成員。","reference":{"eng":"association","kk":"/əˌsoʊsiˈeɪʃn/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['協會；聯盟'], ['聯想；聯繫'], ['交往；夥伴關係']]","chEntries":["協會","聯盟","聯想","聯繫","交往","夥伴關係"],"practiceMeaning":"他是國家作家協會的成員。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'associatio'，由 'associatus' (companion) 演變而來，意為「連結」或「連結在一起的群體」。\n1. 協會；聯盟：指為共同目的而組成的團體或組織。\n2. 聯想；聯繫：指思想或觀念之間的連結，或將兩個事物聯繫起來的行為。\n3. 交往；夥伴關係：指與他人建立的聯繫或夥伴關係。","definition":"1. an organization of people with a common purpose; 2. a connection or relationship between things; 3. the process of connecting things or people.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is a member of the national writers' association.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是國家作家協會的成員。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The smell of cinnamon has a strong association with Christmas for me.\",\n    \"ch\": \"肉桂的味道對我來說強烈地讓人聯想到聖誕節。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Their association lasted for many years.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們的夥伴關係持續了很多年。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他是國家作家協會的成員。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U39"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4464,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::assume::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We can ____ that the results will be similar.","expectedAnswer":"assume","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We can ____ that the results will be similar.","clozeAnswer":"assume","exampleTranslation":"我們可以假設結果會相似。","reference":{"eng":"assume","kk":"/əˈsjum/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['假設'], ['假定'], ['承擔（責任、權力等）'], ['採取（姿勢、外觀等）'], ['（尤指不恰當地）認為，認為某事是真的']]","chEntries":["假設","假定","承擔","採取","認為，認為某事是真的"],"practiceMeaning":"我們可以假設結果會相似。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 assumere，意為「拿取」、「接受」。as- (朝向) + sumere (拿取)。核心語意是「將某事物納入自己」。引申為「接受某事物作為既定事實」（假設），「承擔某種責任或角色」，「採取某種外表或姿態」。","definition":"1. To suppose to be true without proof; 2. To take upon oneself; undertake; 3. To take on or adopt (a manner, appearance, posture, etc.).","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We can assume that the results will be similar.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們可以假設結果會相似。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He assumed control of the company after his father's death.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他父親去世後，他接管了公司的控制權。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She assumed an air of confidence.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她擺出一副自信的樣子。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們可以假設結果會相似。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3062,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::assure::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"I can ____ you that the package will arrive on time.","expectedAnswer":"assure","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"I can ____ you that the package will arrive on time.","clozeAnswer":"assure","exampleTranslation":"我可以向您保證包裹會準時送達。","reference":{"eng":"assure","kk":"/əˈʃʊər/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['向…保證；使…確信'], ['確保；保證（某事發生）']]","chEntries":["向…保證","使…確信","確保","保證"],"practiceMeaning":"我可以向您保證包裹會準時送達。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'securus' (safe, secure)，經由古法語 'asseurer' 演變而來。核心意為「使安全」或「使確定」。\n1. 向…保證；使…確信：透過言語或行動，讓某人放下疑慮，相信某事會發生或為真。\n2. 確保；保證（某事發生）：採取行動以確保某個結果的實現，使其變得確定。","definition":"1. to tell someone that something will definitely happen or is true, so that they stop worrying; 2. to make certain that something will happen or be done.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I can assure you that the package will arrive on time.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我可以向您保證包裹會準時送達。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The government must assure the safety of its citizens.\",\n    \"ch\": \"政府必須確保其公民的安全。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":