），介詞 'to'，名詞 'bottom'（底部）構成。原始語義是指「從最高處到最低處」，描述一個垂直的空間範圍。隨著語意發展，它引申為「徹底地」、「全面地」、「從根本上」的意思，強調檢查、清潔或改變的範圍涵蓋整個對象，不留死角。此處的 OCR 掃描文本可能暗示的是「徹底地」進行某事，例如檢查或清潔。","definition":"completely and thoroughly; from the highest part to the lowest part.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The house was cleaned from top to bottom.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這房子被徹底打掃了一遍。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The inspector examined the engine from top to bottom.\",\n    \"ch\": \"檢查員從上到下檢查了引擎。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這房子被徹底打掃了一遍。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4442,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::frozen::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He was ____ with fear when he saw the bear.","expectedAnswer":"frozen","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He was ____ with fear when he saw the bear.","clozeAnswer":"frozen","exampleTranslation":"看到熊時，他嚇得動彈不得。","reference":{"eng":"frozen","kk":"/ˈfrəʊzən/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['凍僵的', '嚇呆的']]","chEntries":["凍僵的","嚇呆的"],"practiceMeaning":"看到熊時，他嚇得動彈不得。","analysis":"過去分詞 'freeze' 的形容詞用法。形容因寒冷或恐懼而身體僵硬、無法動彈的狀態。","definition":"made rigid or motionless, typically with cold or fear.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He was frozen with fear when he saw the bear.\",\n    \"ch\": \"看到熊時，他嚇得動彈不得。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"看到熊時，他嚇得動彈不得。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4321,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::fuel::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The car runs on unleaded ____.","expectedAnswer":"fuel","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The car runs on unleaded ____.","clozeAnswer":"fuel","exampleTranslation":"這輛車使用無鉛燃料。","reference":{"eng":"fuel","kk":"/ˈfjuːəl/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['燃料；燃燒物'], ['（助長）動力；食糧']]","chEntries":["燃料","燃燒物","動力","食糧"],"practiceMeaning":"這輛車使用無鉛燃料。","analysis":"源自古法語 'fouail'，意為 'firewood'，來自拉丁語 'foculus'，意為『壁爐』，最終源自 'focus' (hearth, fire)。最初指用於生火的物質，如木柴。引