": \"事故的消息令人沮喪。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He had a grim expression on his face.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他臉上表情嚴肅。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The future looks grim for the company.\",\n    \"ch\": \"公司的未來前景嚴峻。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"事故的消息令人沮喪。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U59"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5127,"wordRef":"字彙王::u62::gross::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The company reported a ____ profit of $1 million.","expectedAnswer":"gross","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company reported a ____ profit of $1 million.","clozeAnswer":"gross","exampleTranslation":"公司報告了 100 萬美元的毛利。","reference":{"eng":"gross","kk":"ɡroʊs","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['總的'], ['毛的'], ['嚴重的'], ['令人噁心的']]","chEntries":["總的","毛的","嚴重的","令人噁心的"],"practiceMeaning":"公司報告了 100 萬美元的毛利。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 gros，意為「大、肥胖、總的」，來自拉丁語 grossus（粗大的）。核心語意是「大的、不精細的」。引申出「總收入」（毛收入，gross income）、「總重量」（毛重，gross weight）等含義。在另一語義發展線上，gross 也引申為「極端的、嚴重的」（gross negligence）以及「令人噁心的、非常討厭的」（gross behavior）。","definition":"without any deductions; total; extremely unpleasant or disgusting; very bad or serious.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company reported a gross profit of $1 million.\",\n    \"ch\": \"公司報告了 100 萬美元的毛利。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His gross lack of manners was offensive.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他極其粗魯的無禮行為令人反感。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The smell was absolutely gross.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這氣味真是太噁心了。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"公司報告了 100 萬美元的毛利。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U62"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5356,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l1::guilt::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He felt a deep sense of ____ for his actions.","expectedAnswer":"guilt","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He felt a deep sense of ____ for his actions.","clozeAnswer":"guilt","exampleTranslation":"他對自己的行為感到深深的內疚。","reference":{"eng":"guilt","kk":"ɡɪlt","tense":"n.","ch":"[['罪惡感'], ['內疚'], ['罪責']]","chEntries":["罪惡感","內疚","罪責"],"practiceMeaning":"他對自己的行為感到深深的內疚。","analysis":"此字源自古英語 gylt，來自原始日耳曼語 *gulthiz，可能與原始印歐語 *ghel-（獎賞、償還）有關，但語意演變複雜。核心概念是「欠下的債」或「應受的懲罰」。構詞上，gult- 是字根，表示「債務、應受」。原始語意指向「因行為不當而應受的懲罰或責任」。現代語意主要指「犯罪的行為」或「知道自己做錯事而產生的內疚感」。","definition":"the fact of having committed a specified offence or crime; a feeling of having done something wrong or failed to do something that one can properly be blamed for.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He felt a deep sense of guilt for his actions.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他對自己的行為感到深深的內疚。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The evidence confirmed his guilt.\",\n    \"ch\": \"證據證實了他的罪責。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他對自己的行為感到深深的內疚。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5357,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l1::guilty::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The jury found the defendant ____.","expectedAnswer":"guilty","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The jury found the defendant ____.","clozeAnswer":"guilty","exampleTranslation":"陪審團裁定被告有罪。","reference":{"eng":"guilty","kk":"ˈɡɪlti","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['有罪的'], ['內疚的'], ['罪惡的']]","chEntries":["有罪的","內疚的","罪惡的"],"practiceMeaning":"陪審團裁定被告有罪。","analysis":"此字由名詞 guilt 加上形容詞字尾 -y 構成。guilt 源自古英語 gylt，意為「罪惡感、罪責」。-y 是常見的形容詞字尾，表示「充滿……的」。因此，guilty 的核心語意為「充滿罪惡感或罪責的」，引申為「已被判定有罪」或「感覺自己做錯事」。","definition":"responsible for or legally liable for a criminal offense; feeling or showing guilt.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The jury found the defendant guilty.\",\n    \"ch\": \"陪審團裁定被告有罪。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He looked guilty when the teacher asked him who broke the window.\",\n    \"ch\": \"當老師問是誰打破窗戶時，他顯得很內疚。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"陪審團裁定被告有罪。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3163,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::gulf::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ship sailed across the ____ of Mexico.","expectedAnswer":"Gulf","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ship sailed across the ____ of Mexico.","clozeAnswer":"Gulf","exampleTranslation":"船隻航行穿越墨西哥灣。","reference":{"eng":"gulf","kk":"/ɡʌlf/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['（海洋、湖泊的）灣；海灣'], ['（意見、情況等的）巨大差異；鴻溝']]","chEntries":["灣","海灣","巨大差異","鴻溝"],"practiceMeaning":"船隻航行穿越墨西哥灣。","analysis":"詞源來自希臘語 'kolpos'，意為「灣」。'Gulf' 可以指地理上的地理特徵，即大海或湖泊伸入陸地的寬闊水域。它也可以比喻性地指兩種事物之間（如觀點、情感、地位）的巨大差異、隔閡或鴻溝，這種差異難以跨越。","definition":"1. a deep inlet of the sea almost surrounded by land, with a narrow mouth; 2. a profound difference between people or things.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The ship sailed across the Gulf of Mexico.\",\n    \"ch\": \"船隻航行穿越墨西哥灣。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There is a wide gulf between their political views.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們的政治觀點之間存在著巨大的差異。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The economic gulf between the rich and the poor continues to widen.\",\n    \"ch\": \"貧富之間的經濟鴻溝持續擴大。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"船隻航行穿越墨西哥灣。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U40"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4150,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::handkerchief::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He took out a ____ to wipe his brow.","expectedAnswer":"handkerchief","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He took out a ____ to wipe his brow.","clozeAnswer":"handkerchief","exampleTranslation":"他拿出了一塊手帕擦了擦額頭。","reference":{"eng":"handkerchief","kk":"/ˈhæŋkərtʃɪf/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['手帕']]","chEntries":["手帕"],"practiceMeaning":"他拿出了一塊手帕擦了擦額頭。","analysis":"由 hand（手）+ kerchief（頭巾，源自古法語 couvrechef，意為「遮蓋頭部」）組成。最初指放在手裡或頭上的布，後來特指擦拭用的小方巾。","definition":"a piece of cloth for wiping the nose or tears or used by women to cover the head","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He took out a handkerchief to wipe his brow.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他拿出了一塊手帕擦了擦額頭。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She blew her nose with a handkerchief.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她用紙巾擤了鼻涕。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他拿出了一塊手帕擦了擦額頭。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitNam