\\*hithran（這裡）+ \\\\*efn-（相等）。它是一個連接詞，用於引出結果或推論。核心語義是用來連接原因與結果，表明後者是前者的必然結果。語意演變上，從「因此處」或「由這點」引申為「基於此原因」。","definition":"1. used to introduce the result of something that has been mentioned; 2. from this time; from now.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The weather forecast predicted rain, hence the event was cancelled.\",\n    \"ch\": \"天氣預報預測有雨，因此活動被取消了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He broke his leg, hence he cannot attend the game.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他摔斷了腿，所以他不能參加比賽。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is the main reason; hence, we must act now.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是主要原因；因此，我們必須現在採取行動。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"天氣預報預測有雨，因此活動被取消了。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U60"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3900,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u1::hire::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The company decided to ____ new staff.","expectedAnswer":"hire","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company decided to ____ new staff.","clozeAnswer":"hire","exampleTranslation":"公司決定僱用新員工。","reference":{"eng":"hire","kk":"/ˈhaɪər/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['僱用', '聘請'], ['租用']]","chEntries":["僱用","聘請","租用"],"practiceMeaning":"公司決定僱用新員工。","analysis":"源自古英語 'hyrian'，意為「僱用」。核心是「給予報酬以使用某人或某物」。引申為支付工資僱用員工，或支付租金使用物品。","definition":"1. to pay someone for their services. 2. to pay for the use of something for a period of time.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company decided to hire new staff.\",\n    \"ch\": \"公司決定僱用新員工。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We hired a car for our trip.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們為了這次旅行租了一輛車。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They are looking to hire a qualified manager.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們正在尋找一位合格的經理來聘用。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"公司決定僱用新員工。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4444,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::hold-the-opposite-view::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"I respect your opinion, but I ____.","expectedAnswer"