hing or thrusting; 2. to start or set in motion; 3. to introduce (a new product or service) to the market.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They plan to launch a new missile next month.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們計劃下個月發射一枚新導彈。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company will launch a new advertising campaign.\",\n    \"ch\": \"公司將啟動一個新的廣告活動。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The ship was launched yesterday.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這艘船昨天被下水了。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他們計劃下個月發射一枚新導彈。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4664,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u16::let-out-a-sigh::idiom","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He ____ of relief when he saw the results.","expectedAnswer":"let out a sigh","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He ____ of relief when he saw the results.","clozeAnswer":"let out a sigh","exampleTranslation":"看到結果時，他如釋重負地嘆了口氣。","reference":{"eng":"let out a sigh","kk":"/lɛt aʊt ə saɪ/","tense":"idiom","ch":"[['嘆了口氣']]","chEntries":["嘆了口氣"],"practiceMeaning":"看到結果時，他如釋重負地嘆了口氣。","analysis":"此為固定片語。'Let out' (放出、發出) + 'a sigh' (一次嘆息)。描述一個人深長地呼氣，通常表示疲倦、寬慰、失望或滿足等情緒。","definition":"to breathe out audibly, typically to express an emotion such as relief, sadness, or tiredness.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He let out a sigh of relief when he saw the results.\",\n    \"ch\": \"看到結果時，他如釋重負地嘆了口氣。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She let out a sigh of disappointment.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她失望地嘆了口氣。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"看到結果時，他如釋重負地嘆了口氣。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U16"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4246,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u7::lettuce::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The salad contained fresh ____, tomatoes, and cucumbers.","expectedAnswer":"lettuce","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The salad contained fresh ____, tomatoes, and cucumbers.","clozeAnswer":"lettuce","exampleTranslation":"沙拉裡有新鮮的生菜、番茄和黃瓜。","r