2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5457,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l3::make-way-for::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The construction company is clearing the site to ____ the new building.","expectedAnswer":"make way for","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The construction company is clearing the site to ____ the new building.","clozeAnswer":"make way for","exampleTranslation":"建築公司正在清理工地，為新建築騰出空間。","reference":{"eng":"make way for","kk":"ˈmeɪk weɪ fɔːr","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['為……讓路'], ['為……騰出空間']]","chEntries":["為……讓路","為……騰出空間"],"practiceMeaning":"建築公司正在清理工地，為新建築騰出空間。","analysis":"此片語由動詞 \"make\" (製作、使)、名詞 \"way\" (道路、方式) 和介系詞 \"for\" (為了) 組成。\"way\" 源自古英語 \"weg\"。此片語意指「為某人或某事創造空間或機會」，使之能夠前進或出現。","definition":"to create an opportunity or space for something to happen or for someone to advance.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The construction company is clearing the site to make way for the new building.\",\n    \"ch\": \"建築公司正在清理工地，為新建築騰出空間。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"New ideas must be allowed to make way for progress.\",\n    \"ch\": \"必須允許新思想的出現，為進步讓路。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"建築公司正在清理工地，為新建築騰出空間。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4281,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u7::marker::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Please use a permanent ____ to write on the plastic.","expectedAnswer":"marker","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Please use a permanent ____ to write on the plastic.","clozeAnswer":"marker","exampleTranslation":"請用簽字筆在塑膠上書寫。","reference":{"eng":"marker","kk":"/ˈmɑːrkər/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['標記'], ['標誌'], ['記號'], ['（用於標記的）筆、板']]","chEntries":["標記","標誌","記號","筆、板"],"practiceMeaning":"請用簽字筆在塑膠上書寫。","analysis":"源自動詞 'mark'（標記）。'Marker' 是指「用來標記或標示某物」的工具或物品。它可以是物理的記號，也可以是能夠留下記號的工具。","definition":"a person or thing that marks or is used for marking; a symbol or sign.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Pleas