ked basic ____.","expectedAnswer":"material comforts","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The refugees lacked basic ____.","clozeAnswer":"material comforts","exampleTranslation":"難民們缺乏基本的物質享受。","reference":{"eng":"material comforts","kk":"None","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['物質享受；物質上的舒適']]","chEntries":["物質享受","物質上的舒適"],"practiceMeaning":"難民們缺乏基本的物質享受。","analysis":"此為片語分析。'material' (adj.) 源自拉丁語 'materialis'，意為『物質的』，指與『精神、形式』相對。'comforts' (n. pl.) 源自 'comfort' (n.)，指『舒適、便利』。兩者結合，指生活中與身體享受、便利有關的『物質上的滿足』。","definition":"things such as comfortable housing, good food, and warm clothes that make life pleasant","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The refugees lacked basic material comforts.\",\n    \"ch\": \"難民們缺乏基本的物質享受。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He has always enjoyed the material comforts of life.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他一直享受著物質上的舒適生活。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"難民們缺乏基本的物質享受。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4694,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u17::mathematical::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He has a strong ____ aptitude.","expectedAnswer":"mathematical","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He has a strong ____ aptitude.","clozeAnswer":"mathematical","exampleTranslation":"他有很強的數學天賦。","reference":{"eng":"mathematical","kk":"/ˌmæθəˈmætɪkəl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['數學的'], ['精確的'], ['（非正式）按部就班的，有規律的']]","chEntries":["數學的","精確的","按部就班的，有規律的"],"practiceMeaning":"他有很強的數學天賦。","analysis":"源自希臘語 *mathēmatikós*，意為「學習的」、「學術的」，後指與數學相關的。核心是關於數字、數量、空間、結構和變化的科學。引申為精確、有條理，如同數學公式般規律。","definition":"1. Relating to or concerned with mathematics. 2. Precise or exact. 3. (informal) Methodical; systematic.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He has a strong mathematical aptitude.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他有很強的數學天賦。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The results were mathematically proven.\",\n    \"ch\": \"結果已經數學上證明了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her daily routine was mathematical.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她日常的作息非常規律。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他有很強的數學天賦。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U17"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3096,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::maximum::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The room has a ____ capacity of 50 people.","expectedAnswer":"maximum","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The room has a ____ capacity of 50 people.","clozeAnswer":"maximum","exampleTranslation":"這房間的最大容量是50人。","reference":{"eng":"maximum","kk":"/ˈmæksɪməm/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['最大的；最高的']]","chEntries":["最大的","最高的"],"practiceMeaning":"這房間的最大容量是50人。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'maximus' (greatest)。核心意義是「最大」。\n1. 最大的；最高的：指數量、程度、或尺寸上的最大可能值。","definition":"1. the greatest possible amount or degree; 2. the largest amount or number.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The room has a maximum capacity of 50 people.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這房間的最大容量是50人。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please do not exceed the maximum speed limit.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請勿超過最高限速。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這房間的最大容量是50人。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U39、U40"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4640,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u16::means::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"What is the best ____ to achieve this goal?","expectedAnswer":"means","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"What is the best ____ to achieve this goal?","clozeAnswer":"means","exampleTranslation":"達到這個目標的最佳方法是什麼？","reference":{"eng":"means","kk":"/miːnz/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['方法'], ['手段'], ['財富'], ['（數）平均數']]","chEntries":["方法","手段","財富","平均數"],"practiceMeaning":"達到這個目標的最佳方法是什麼？","analysis":"源自古英語 'mæġen' (力量、能力)。最初指達成目的的手段或力量。現代用法非常廣泛，可以指到達某個結果的方式（方法、手段），也可以指財富（especially plural \"means\"），在數學中則指平均值。","definition":"a method, course of action, or instrument by which something can be achieved; wealth or financial resources; the average of a set of numbers.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"What is the best means to achieve this goal?\",\n    \"ch\": \"達到