測量'], ['度量'], ['尺寸'], ['測量結果']]","chEntries":["測量","度量","尺寸","測量結果"],"practiceMeaning":"房間的尺寸是 3 米乘以 4 米。","analysis":"此字由 measure（測量）+ -ment（名詞字尾）構成。measure 源自拉丁語 mensura（測量）。-ment 是常見的名詞字尾，表示「動作」、「狀態」或「結果」。構詞上，measure 提供核心的「測量」概念，-ment 將其名詞化。核心語義為「測量的行為」、「測量結果」或「測量的尺寸」。此處為名詞用法，指代「測量」的動作、過程或結果。","definition":"the action of measuring something; a quantity or the size, amount, or degree of something as measured.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The measurement of the room was 3 meters by 4 meters.\",\n    \"ch\": \"房間的尺寸是 3 米乘以 4 米。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Accurate measurement is crucial in science.\",\n    \"ch\": \"精確的測量在科學中至關重要。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"房間的尺寸是 3 米乘以 4 米。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3961,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u2::meet-expectations::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The company's profits did not ____.","expectedAnswer":"meet expectations","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company's profits did not ____.","clozeAnswer":"meet expectations","exampleTranslation":"公司的利潤未能達到預期。","reference":{"eng":"meet expectations","kk":"None","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['達到預期', '符合預期']]","chEntries":["達到預期","符合預期"],"practiceMeaning":"公司的利潤未能達到預期。","analysis":"動詞 'meet' (達到) 加上名詞 'expectations' (預期)。表示達到或符合人們的期望。","definition":"to achieve what you were expected to achieve.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company's profits did not meet expectations.\",\n    \"ch\": \"公司的利潤未能達到預期。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His performance met our expectations.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的表現符合我們的預期。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"公司的利潤未能達到預期。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4554,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u11::melt::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The snow began to ____ in the spring sunshine.","expectedAnswer":"melt","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The snow began to ____ in the spring sunshine.","clozeAnswer":"melt","exampleTranslation":"春日的陽光下，雪開始融化。","reference":{"eng":"melt","kk":"/mɛlt/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['融化', '熔化'], ['（情感）軟化', '感動'], ['（冰雪、大霧等）消散', '消失']]","chEntries":["融化","熔化","軟化","感動","消散","消失"],"practiceMeaning":"春日的陽光下，雪開始融化。","analysis":"源自古英語 'meltan'，意為 'to liquefy by heat' (通過加熱液化)。\n    1. 融化、熔化：指固體變為液體，如 'ice melts' (冰融化)。\n    2. 軟化、感動：指堅硬的情感變得柔和，或因感動而落淚，如 'her heart melted' (她的心軟化了)。\n    3. 消散、消失：指事物逐漸消失，如 'the fog melted away' (霧消散了)。","definition":"1. become liquefied by heat.; 2. become or cause to become soft, weak, or sentimental.; 3. disappear or cause to disappear gradually.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The snow began to melt in the spring sunshine.\",\n    \"ch\": \"春日的陽光下，雪開始融化。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He has a heart of stone, but he melts when he sees a puppy.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他鐵石心腸，但看到小狗就會心軟。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The crowd melted away as the rain started.\",\n    \"ch\": \"雨開始下後，人群就漸漸散去。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"春日的陽光下，雪開始融化。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U11"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4204,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::mend::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Can you ____ this torn shirt?","expectedAnswer":"mend","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Can you ____ this torn shirt?","clozeAnswer":"mend","exampleTranslation":"你能把這件破了的襯衫補好嗎？","reference":{"eng":"mend","kk":"/mend/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['修補；縫補'], ['（使）恢復；（使）好轉']]","chEntries":["修補","縫補","恢復","好轉"],"practiceMeaning":"你能把這件破了的襯衫補好嗎？","analysis":"源自古英語 mendan，意為“改善，加強”，後來與法語 demente（破壞）的反義詞 'amender'（改正）混合。核心是“修復，使其回到更好的狀態”。1. “修補”指恢復物體的完整性。2. “恢復；好轉”指恢復健康、關係或狀況。","definition":"1. to repair something that is broken or damaged; 2. to get better or to make something better after a problem or illness.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Can you mend this torn shirt?\",\n    \"ch\": \"你能把這件破了的襯衫補好嗎？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is recovering and will soon mend.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他正在康復，很快就會好起來。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The two countries are trying to mend their relations.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這兩個國家正試圖修復它們的關係。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"你能把這件破了的襯衫補好嗎？","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4417,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::mental::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"____ health is as important as physical health.","expectedAnswer":"Mental","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"____ health is as important as physical health.","clozeAnswer":"Mental","exampleTranslation":"心理健康與身體健康同等重要。","reference":{"eng":"mental","kk":"/ˈmentl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['精神上的', '心理上的'], ['智力的', '腦力的'], ['（尤指兒童）精神失常的']]","chEntries":["精神上的","心理上的","智力的","腦力的","精神失常的"],"practiceMeaning":"心理健康與身體健康同等重要。","analysis":"詞源自拉丁語 'mentalis'，'mens' (mind)。指與思想、心理狀態或智力相關的。","definition":"relating to the mind; relating to or affecting the intellect; informal, often offensive: having a serious mental illness.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Mental health is as important as physical health.\",\n    \"ch\": \"心理健康與身體健康同等重要。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He suffered from mental fatigue after hours of studying.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他經過數小時的學習後感到精神疲憊。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"心理健康與身體健康同等重要。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U9、L1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4436,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::mental-problem::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He has been dealing with a ____ for years.","expectedAnswer":"mental problem","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He has been dealing with a ____ for years.","clozeAnswer":"mental problem","exampleTranslation":"他多年來一直在處理精神問題。","reference":{"eng":"mental problem","kk":"/ˈmentl ˈprɒbləm/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['精神問題', '心理問題']]","chEntries":["精神問題","心理問題"],"practiceMeaning":"他多年來一直在處理精神問題。","analysis":"複合名詞。'mental' (精神的) + 'problem' 