ary","kk":"ˈmɪʃəˌnɛri","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"傳教士\"  ],  [    \"宣教士\"  ]]","chEntries":["傳教士","宣教士"],"practiceMeaning":"這位傳教士不懈地工作，以向當地居民傳播信仰。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 missio，意為「派遣」，是 mittere（派遣）的名詞。字尾 -ary 表示「與…相關的人」。因此，missionary 指被派遣出去傳播宗教信仰的人，特別是基督宗教。中文翻譯為「傳教士；宣教士」。","definition":"a person sent to spread religious beliefs in a foreign country.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The missionary worked tirelessly to convert the local population.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位傳教士不懈地工作，以向當地居民傳播信仰。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She became a missionary in Africa.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她成為了非洲的一名宣教士。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The organization supports missionaries in several countries.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該組織支持在幾個國家的傳教士。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這位傳教士不懈地工作，以向當地居民傳播信仰。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U67"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4711,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u17::monk::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ meditated in the quiet temple.","expectedAnswer":"monk","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ meditated in the quiet temple.","clozeAnswer":"monk","exampleTranslation":"僧侶在寧靜的寺廟中打坐。","reference":{"eng":"monk","kk":"/ˈmʌŋk/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['僧侶'], ['（尤指）佛教僧人']]","chEntries":["僧侶","佛教僧人"],"practiceMeaning":"僧侶在寧靜的寺廟中打坐。","analysis":"源自希臘語 *mónakhos*，意為「獨居者」、「隱士」。原指過著獨居、禁慾生活的人。後來主要指在宗教團體中，遵守特定戒律、過著集體或半集體生活的男性信徒。","definition":"1. A member of a religious community of men, typically living under vows of poverty, chastity, and obedience.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The monk meditated in the quiet temple.\",\n    \"ch\": \"僧侶在寧靜的寺廟中打坐。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Buddhist monks are known for their saffron robes.\",\n    \"ch\": \"佛教僧侶以其橘黃色的僧袍而聞名。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"僧侶在寧靜的寺廟中打坐。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U17"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5090,"wordRef":"字彙王::u61::monopoly::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The company has a ____ on the production of rare minerals.","expectedAnswer":"monopoly","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company has a ____ on the production of rare minerals.","clozeAnswer":"monopoly","exampleTranslation":"這家公司獨佔了稀有礦物的生產。","reference":{"eng":"monopoly","kk":"məˈnɒpəli","tense":"n.","ch":"[['壟斷'], ['獨佔'], ['專賣權']]","chEntries":["壟斷","獨佔","專賣權"],"practiceMeaning":"這家公司獨佔了稀有礦物的生產。","analysis":"此字源自希臘語 'monos' (single) + 'polein' (to sell)。'Monopoly' 指的是一家公司或個人對某種商品或服務擁有 '獨一無二的銷售權'，不受競爭影響。這意味著他們可以控制價格和供應。引申開來，它也可以指對任何事物（如權力、資源）的 '獨佔' 或 '壟斷' 狀態。","definition":"1. The exclusive possession or control of the supply of or trade in a commodity or service.; 2. A company or group having exclusive control of a commodity or service.; 3. Exclusive possession or control.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company has a monopoly on the production of rare minerals.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家公司獨佔了稀有礦物的生產。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The government is trying to break up the monopoly.\",\n    \"ch\": \"政府正試圖打破壟斷。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This game is about building a real estate monopoly.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個遊戲是關於建立房地產壟斷的。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這家公司獨佔了稀有礦物的生產。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U61"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3973,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u3::moral::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ of the story is to always be kind.","expectedAnswer":"moral","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ of the story is to always be kind.","clozeAnswer":"moral","exampleTranslation":"這個故事的寓意是永遠都要善良。","reference":{"eng":"moral","kk":"/ˈmɔːrəl/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['道德', '品德'], ['寓意']]","chEntries":["道德","品德","寓意"],"practiceMeaning":"這個故事的寓意是永遠都要善良。","analysis":"詞源：同上。作為名詞，指一套關於對錯的原則或信念。","definition":"1. a lesson, especially one concerning what is right or prudent, that can be derived from a story, a piece of information, or an experience; 2. a person's standards of behavior or beliefs concerning what is and is not acceptable for them to do.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The moral of the story is to always be kind.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個故事的寓意是永遠都要善良。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He has a strong sense of moral.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他有強烈的道德感。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這個故事的寓意是永遠都要善良。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5706,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l9::morality::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The story explored themes of ____ and redemption.","expectedAnswer":"morality","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The story explored themes of ____ and redemption.","clozeAnswer":"morality","exampleTranslation":"這個故事探討了道德和救贖的主題。","reference":{"eng":"morality","kk":"məˈræləti","tense":"n.","ch":"[['道德'], ['品德'], ['道德性']]","chEntries":["道德","品德","道德性"],"practiceMeaning":"這個故事探討了道德和救贖的主題。","analysis":"此字由形容詞 'moral' 加上名詞化後綴 '-ity' 構成。'moral' 源自拉丁語 moralis（關於習俗、品格的）。'-ity' 後綴用於將形容詞轉化為抽象名詞，表示「……的狀態、性質或品質」。因此，'morality' 指的就是「道德的狀態、品質或體系」，即「道德」或「品德」。核心語意是「關於是非對錯的準則、原則或體系」。","definition":"a set of principles of right and wrong behavior; the degree to which something is morally good or bad.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The story explored themes of morality and redemption.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個故事探討了道德和救贖的主題。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His personal morality was questioned.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的個人品德受到了質疑。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這個故事探討了道德和救贖的主題。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3101,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::motivate::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Good teachers should be able to ____ their students.","expectedAnswer":"motivate","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Good teachers should be able to ____ their students.","clozeAnswer":"motivate","exampleTranslation":"好老師應該能夠激勵他們的學生。","reference":{"eng":"motivate","kk":"/ˈmoʊtɪveɪt/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['激勵；促使'], ['激發…的興趣；引起…的動機']]","chEntries":["激勵","促使","激發…的興趣","引起…的動機"],"practiceMeaning":"好老師應該能夠激勵他們的學生。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'motivus' (moving)，'movere' (to move)。核心意義是「推動」或「引起行動」。\n1. 激勵；促使：指給予某人動力，使其採取行動或努力工作。\n2. 激發…的興趣；引起…的動機：指引發某人對某事產生興趣或行動的理由。","definition":"1. to give someone a reason for doing something; 2. to make someone interested and want to work hard.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Good teachers should be able to motivate their students.\",\n    \"ch\": \"好老師應該能夠激勵他們的學生。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"What motivated you to choose this career path?\",\n    \"ch\": \"什麼促使您選擇這條職業道路？\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"好老師應該能夠激勵他們的學生。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U39"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4132,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::motor::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The electric ____ is very quiet.","expectedAnswer":"motor","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The electric ____ is very quiet.","clozeAnswer":"motor","exampleTranslation":"電動馬達非常安靜。","reference":{"eng":"motor","kk":"/ˈməʊtər/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['馬達', '電動機'], ['（汽車的）引擎']]","chEntries":["馬達","電動機","引擎"],"practiceMeaning":"電動馬達非常安靜。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 motor（推動者），是動詞 movere（移動）的名詞形式。核心概念是「產生運動的裝置」。","definition":"1. a machine that produces motion or power for something; 2. an internal combustion engine","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The electric motor is very quiet.\",\n    \"ch\": \"電動馬達非常安靜。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The motor of the car needs repair.\",\n    \"ch\": \"汽車的引擎需要修理。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We heard the sound of the motor starting up.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們聽到了馬達發動的聲音。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"電動馬達非常安靜。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5379,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l2::mud::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The heavy rain turned the field into a sea of ____.","expectedAnswer":"mud","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The heavy rain turned the field into a sea of ____.","clozeAnswer":"mud","exampleTranslation":"連日大雨把田野變成了泥沼。","reference":{"eng":"mud","kk":"mʌd","tense":"n.","ch":"[['泥'], ['泥漿'], ['（俚語）鞋子']]","chEntries":["泥","泥漿","鞋子"],"practiceMeaning":"連日大雨把田野變成了泥沼。","analysis":"此字源自古英語 mudde。其詞源不甚清晰，但可能與「軟的、濕的」等概念有關。核心語意是「一種由土壤和水混合而成的柔軟、濕黏的物質」。它可以用於描述自然界的泥土，也指人造的泥漿，或比喻「困難、困境」（stuck in the mud）。","definition":"1. wet soil or earth; 2. a soft, sticky matter resulting from the mixing of earth or sand with water.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The heavy rain turned the field into a sea of mud.\",\n    \"ch\": \"連日大雨把田野變成了泥沼。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He got his shoes covered in mud.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的鞋子沾滿了泥。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"連日大雨把田野變成了泥沼。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5378,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l2::muddy::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The children came in with ____ boots.","expectedAnswer":"muddy","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The children came in with ____ boots.","clozeAnswer":"muddy","exampleTranslation":"孩子們穿著沾滿泥的靴子進來了。","reference":{"eng":"muddy","kk":"ˈmʌdi","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['泥濘的'], ['沾滿泥的'], ['渾濁的']]","chEntries":["泥濘的","沾滿泥的","渾濁的"],"practiceMeaning":"孩子們穿著沾滿泥的靴子進來了。","analysis":"此字源自名詞 'mud' (泥)。'-y' 是形容詞字尾，表示「充滿……的」。'mud' 源自古英語 mudde。核心語意是「充滿泥土」。因此，'muddy' 形容「被泥土覆蓋」或「充滿泥漿」的狀態，常用於描述地面、水或物體。","definition":"1. covered or full of mud; 2. (of water) containing mud or silt.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The children came in with muddy boots.\",\n    \"ch\": \"孩子們穿著沾滿泥的靴子進來了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The river water was muddy after the heavy rain.\",\n    \"ch\": \"大雨過後，河水變得渾濁。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"孩子們穿著沾滿泥的靴子進來了。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5344,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l1::murderer::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ was apprehended by the police.","expectedAnswer":"murderer","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ was apprehended by the police.","clozeAnswer":"murderer","exampleTranslation":"謀殺犯被警方逮捕了。","reference":{"eng":"murderer","kk":"ˈmɜːrdərər","tense":"n.","ch":"[['謀殺犯'], ['兇手']]","chEntries":["謀殺犯","兇手"],"practiceMeaning":"謀殺犯被警方逮捕了。","analysis":"此字由名詞 murder 加上人稱字尾 -er 構成。murder 源自古英語 morthor，意為「謀殺」。-er 是常見的人稱字尾，表示「從事某行為的人」。因此，murderer 的核心語意是「進行謀殺行為的人」。","definition":"a person who has murdered someone.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The murderer was apprehended by the police.\",\n    \"ch\": \"謀殺犯被警方逮捕了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He was identified as the murderer.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他被確認為兇手。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"謀殺犯被警方逮捕了。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3998,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u3::naked::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He was found ____ in the street.","expectedAnswer":"naked","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He was found ____ in the street.","clozeAnswer":"naked","exampleTranslation":"他被發現時赤身裸體地躺在街上。","reference":{"eng":"naked","kk":"/ˈneɪkɪd/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['裸體的', '赤裸的'], ['沒有掩飾的', '明顯的'], ['（植物）無保護的']]","chEntries":["裸體的","赤裸的","沒有掩飾的","明顯的","無保護的"],"practiceMeaning":"他被發現時赤身裸體地躺在街上。","analysis":"詞源：古英語 'nacod'。指沒有穿衣服的，或沒有任何遮蓋、保護的。","definition":"1. (of a person) not wearing clothes; 2. without any covering or protection; 3. obvious and unconcealed.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He was found naked in the street.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他被發現時赤身裸體地躺在街上。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The naked truth is hard to accept.\",\n    \"ch\": \"赤裸的真相很難接受。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The tree was naked in winter.\",\n    \"ch\": \"樹在冬天光禿禿的。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他被發現時赤身裸體地躺在街上。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4739,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u17::name-tag::n","mode":"cloze_en","questio