 \"階段\"  ],  [    \"時期\"  ],  [    \"（月亮、行星的）相位\"  ]]","chEntries":["階段","時期","相位"],"practiceMeaning":"這個項目正處於最後階段。","analysis":"此字源自希臘語 phasis（appearance, manifestation, phase），來自 phainō（to appear, to show）。核心語義是「出現」或「顯現」。引申為事物發展過程中的一個「階段」或「時期」。在天文學中，指天體可見部分的變化，即「相位」。","definition":"1. a distinct period or stage in a process of change or forming; 2. each of the shapes of the moon or a planet seen from the earth.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The project is in its final phase.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個項目正處於最後階段。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The moon is in its waxing phase.\",\n    \"ch\": \"月亮處於其上弦階段。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We are going through a difficult phase.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們正經歷一段艱難時期。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這個項目正處於最後階段。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U64"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6129,"wordRef":"字彙王::u65::pickup::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He drove a red ____ truck.","expectedAnswer":"pickup","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He drove a red ____ truck.","clozeAnswer":"pickup","exampleTranslation":"他開了一輛紅色皮卡車。","reference":{"eng":"pickup","kk":"ˈpɪkˌʌp","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"皮卡車\"  ],  [    \"接載\"  ],  [    \"撿起\"  ],  [    \"改良\"  ],  [    \"氣氛\"  ],  [    \"搭便車\"  ]]","chEntries":["皮卡車","接載","撿起","改良","氣氛","搭便車"],"practiceMeaning":"他開了一輛紅色皮卡車。","analysis":"此字由動詞片語 pick up 構成的名詞。pick 的核心語義是「挑選；選擇」，up 是方向副詞，表示「向上」。pick up 的核心語義是「向上拾起」，引申為「接載；撿起；改良；改善；學會」。此名詞 captures 這些不同的義項。例如，a pickup truck（皮卡車）；give someone a pickup（接載某人）；a pickup in sales（銷售的提升）；a pickup in atmosphere（氣氛的活躍）。因此，此名詞涵蓋了動詞片語的多種義項。","definition":"1. a small truck with low sides and an open back, used for carrying goods; 2. the act of collecting someone or something; 3. a device for picking up sound or signals; 4. an improvement in speed, activity, or mood.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He drove a red pickup truck.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他開了一輛紅色皮卡車。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I'll give you a pickup on my way home.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我回家路上會順道載你。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There was a pickup in the stock market.\",\n    \"ch\": \"股市出現了回升。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他開了一輛紅色皮卡車。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U65"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5054,"wordRef":"字彙王::u59::pier::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We walked along the ____ and watched the ships.","expectedAnswer":"pier","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We walked along the ____ and watched the ships.","clozeAnswer":"pier","exampleTranslation":"我們沿著碼頭散步，看著船隻。","reference":{"eng":"pier","kk":"pɪər","tense":"n.","ch":"[['碼頭'], ['橋墩'], ['（伸入海或湖中的）突堤']]","chEntries":["碼頭","橋墩","突堤"],"practiceMeaning":"我們沿著碼頭散步，看著船隻。","analysis":"此字源自古法語per, pire，可能來自拉丁語pertica（長桿、欄杆），或與古英語perh（圍欄）有關。原意指「支撐物、欄杆」。在現代英語中，pier 主要指「建在水中的結構，用於供船隻停靠、遊客散步或支撐橋樑」，如碼頭、橋墩。OCR 掃描時可能將 'p' 誤判為 'r'，或 'i' 誤判為 'l'。此處修正為 pier。","definition":"1. a platform built out from the shore into the sea or a lake, used as a landing stage for boats and ferries; 2. a structure built out into the sea, typically supported by piles or pillars, used as a promenade or landing stage.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We walked along the pier and watched the ships.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們沿著碼頭散步，看著船隻。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The bridge is supported by several concrete piers.\",\n    \"ch\": \"橋樑由數個混凝土橋墩支撐。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們沿著碼頭散步，看著船隻。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U59"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4252,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u7::pile::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Please ____ the clean laundry on the bed.","expectedAnswer":"pile","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Please ____ the clean laundry on the bed.","clozeAnswer":"pile","exampleTranslation":"請把洗乾淨的衣服堆在床上。","reference":{"eng":"pile","kk":"/paɪl/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['堆積'], ['堆疊']]","chEntries":["堆積","堆疊"],"practiceMeaning":"請把洗乾淨的衣服堆在床上。","analysis":"由名