放置","安插","職位安排","安置"],"practiceMeaning":"家具的擺放","analysis":"此字由動詞 place（放置）加上名詞後綴 -ment（表示動作、狀態或結果）構成。place 源自古法語 plaser，意為「地方」，向上可追溯至拉丁語 platea（廣場；街道）。因此，placement 的核心語義是「放置的行為或結果」。此名詞表示將某物放置在特定位置的動作，或指人被安排到某個職位、場所或情況。其語意演變是從具體的「放置」到抽象的「安排、安置」。","definition":"1. the action, process, or result of placing something or someone in a particular position or situation; 2. the arrangement of something in a particular position.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"the placement of the furniture\",\n    \"ch\": \"家具的擺放\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The school helps with job placement.\",\n    \"ch\": \"學校協助學生安排工作職位。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"children's placement in foster homes\",\n    \"ch\": \"兒童被安置在寄養家庭\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"家具的擺放","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U65"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5056,"wordRef":"字彙王::u59::plea::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She made a ____ for help.","expectedAnswer":"plea","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She made a ____ for help.","clozeAnswer":"plea","exampleTranslation":"她懇求幫助。","reference":{"eng":"plea","kk":"pliː","tense":"n.","ch":"[['懇求'], ['請求'], ['（法律）辯護陳述']]","chEntries":["懇求","請求","辯護陳述"],"practiceMeaning":"她懇求幫助。","analysis":"此字源自古法語plait，來自拉丁語placitum，意為「有利」、「判決」。最初意指「申訴、爭論」。在英語中，plea 主要指「懇切的請求或懇求」，尤指在困境中或為了得到幫助。在法律語境中，指「被告的辯護陳述」（如 guilty plea）。其核心語意是「強烈的請求或為自己辯護」。OCR 掃描時可能將 'p' 誤判為 'r'。此處修正為 plea。","definition":"1. an earnest or emotional request; 2. a formal statement by or on behalf of a defendant admitting guilt or expressing innocence.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She made a plea for help.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她懇求幫助。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The defendant entered a plea of not guilty.\",\n    \"ch\": \"被告聲稱無罪。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她懇求幫助。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U59"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4213,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::police::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ are investigating the crime.","expectedAnswer":"police","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ are investigating the crime.","clozeAnswer":"police","exampleTranslation":"警方正在調查這起罪案。","reference":{"eng":"police","kk":"/pəˈliːs/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['警察；警務人員'], ['（尤指）警察部隊；警局']]","chEntries":["警察","警務人員","警察部隊","警局"],"practiceMeaning":"警方正在調查這起罪案。","analysis":"源自古法語 police，意為“政府，管理，公民事務”，來自拉丁語 politia，'polis'（城市）。原指政府的組織或行政機構。在17世紀，'police' 開始指維持公共秩序的機構，即警察。'Police' 作為集合名詞，指整個警察隊伍。","definition":"The civil force of a state, responsible for the maintenance of public order, the prevention and detection of crime, etc.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The police are investigating the crime.\",\n    \"ch\": \"警方正在調查這起罪案。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He reported the incident to the police.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他向警方報告了該事件。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The police headquarters is located downtown.\",\n    \"ch\": \"警察總部設在市中心。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"警方正在調查這起罪案。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3909,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u1::politics::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is very interested in ____.","expectedAnswer":"politics","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is very interested in ____.","clozeAnswer":"politics","exampleTranslation":"他對政治很感興趣。","reference":{"eng":"politics","kk":"/ˈpɑːlɪtɪks/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['政治']]","chEntries":["政治"],"practiceMeaning":"他對政治很感興趣。","analysis":"源自古希臘 'politika'，'polis' (city, state) 的複數形式。指關於政府、國家、權力、政策等事務的學問或活動。","definition":"the activities associated with the governance of a country or other area, especially the debate or conflict among individuals or parties having or hoping to achieve power.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is very interested in politics.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他對政治很感興趣。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The election results will have a significant impact on the country's politics.\",\n  