人民），經由古法語 'pople' 進入中古英語。構詞上，'population' 是由詞根 'popul-'（人民）加上名詞化字尾 '-ation' 所組成。'-ation' 字尾通常將動詞轉換為名詞，表示狀態、過程或結果。在此字中，它表示「人民的總體」或「人口的狀態」。原始語意指向「人民」，後來演變為指「居住在特定地區的所有居民的總數」。","definition":"1. All the inhabitants of a particular place; 2. The action or process of forming or being formed into a group, body, or community.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The population of the city has grown rapidly in recent years.\",\n    \"ch\": \"近年來，這座城市的人口快速增長。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The survey aims to gather data on the entire adult population.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這項調查旨在收集有關所有成年居民的數據。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"近年來，這座城市的人口快速增長。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6187,"wordRef":"字彙王::u66::porch::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"They sat on the ____ watching the rain.","expectedAnswer":"porch","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"They sat on the ____ watching the rain.","clozeAnswer":"porch","exampleTranslation":"他們坐在門廊上看著雨。","reference":{"eng":"porch","kk":"pɔrtʃ","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"門廊\"  ],  [    \"陽台\"  ],  [    \"走廊\"  ]]","chEntries":["門廊","陽台","走廊"],"practiceMeaning":"他們坐在門廊上看著雨。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 porche，最終源自拉丁語 porticus，意為「有柱子的走廊、迴廊」，與 porta「門」相關。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根。作為名詞，其核心語義是指「房屋入口處有頂的、開放式的區域」。詞源中的「門」和「走廊」概念直接體現了此義。","definition":"1. a covered shelter projecting in front of the entrance of a building; 2. a veranda or balcony.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They sat on the porch watching the rain.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們坐在門廊上看著雨。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The house had a wide front porch.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這房子有一個寬敞的前門廊。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He stood on the porch, waiting for her.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他站在門廊上等她。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The porch swing was comfortable.\",\n    \"ch\": \"門廊的吊椅很舒服。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他們坐在門廊上看著雨。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U66"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4133,