在現代英語中可視為由 practice 派生而來，practice 本身由 practice (verb) 演變而來，其詞源核心為希臘語 prassein「做、行動」。作為名詞，其核心語義是指「從事某種職業或活動的人」，特別是醫學、法律等專業領域的執業者。此義項由「實踐」的動作引申為「從事該實踐的人」。","definition":"1. a person engaged in the practice of a profession, especially medicine or law; 2. a person who regularly does something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is a well-known medical practitioner.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她是一位知名的執業醫師。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The law requires that only qualified practitioners offer advice.\",\n    \"ch\": \"法律要求只有合格的從業人員才能提供建議。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is a seasoned practitioner of negotiation.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是一位經驗豐富的談判實踐者。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The seminar attracted many legal practitioners.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這次研討會吸引了許多法律從業人員。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她是一位知名的執業醫師。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U66"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6238,"wordRef":"字彙王::u67::premature::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The baby was born ____.","expectedAnswer":"premature","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The baby was born ____.","clozeAnswer":"premature","exampleTranslation":"這個嬰兒是早產的。","reference":{"eng":"premature","kk":"ˈprɛməˌtjʊr","tense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"過早的\"  ],  [    \"premature\"  ]]","chEntries":["過早的","premature"],"practiceMeaning":"這個嬰兒是早產的。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 præmaturus，由 præ-（在…之前）和 maturus（成熟的）組成，意為「過早成熟的」。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根。作形容詞時，指在應有的時間或正常時間之前發生、出現或完成，可能是不適當或有不良後果的。中文翻譯為「過早的； premature」。","definition":"happening or occurring too soon or before the normal or expected time.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The baby was born premature.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個嬰兒是早產的。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Making a decision prematurely can lead to mistakes.\",\n    \"ch\": \"過早做出決定可能導致錯誤。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The project was launched prematurely.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個項目過早啟動了。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這個嬰兒是早產的。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U67"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4229,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::preparation::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ for the exam took weeks.","expectedAnswer":"preparation","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ for the exam took weeks.","clozeAnswer":"preparation","exampleTranslation":"考試的準備工作持續了數週。","reference":{"eng":"preparation","kk":"/ˌprepəˈreɪʃn/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['準備；預備'], ['（尤指食物的）準備工作；烹調']]","chEntries":["準備","預備","準備工作","烹調"],"practiceMeaning":"考試的準備工作持續了數週。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 praeparatio，'prae-'（預先）+ 'parare'（準備）。核心是“預先做好準備”。1. “準備；預備”是最廣泛的意義，指為某事發生或進行而提前採取行動。2. “準備工作；烹調”是烹飪領域的特定用法，指烹製食物的過程。","definition":"1. the action or process of making ready or being ready for use or consideration; 2. the process of cooking or making food ready to eat.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The preparation for the exam took weeks.\",\n    \"ch\": \"考試的準備工作持續了數週。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Make all necessary preparations before you leave.\",\n    \"ch\": \"在你離開前做好一切必要的準備。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The preparation of the meal was simple.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這頓飯的準備過程很簡單。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"考試的準備工作持續了數週。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5415,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l3::preserve::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We must ____ our cultural heritage for future generations.","expectedAnswer":"preserve","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We must ____ our cultural heritage for future generations.","clozeAnswer":"preserve","exampleTranslation":"我們必須為子孫後代保護我們的文化遺產。","reference":{"eng":"preserve","kk":"prɪˈzɜːrv","tense":"v.","ch":"[['保存'], ['保護'], ['維護'], ['醃製']]","chEntries":["保存","保護","維護","醃製"],"practiceMeaning":"我們必須為子孫後代保護我們的文化遺產。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 \"preserver\"，其拉丁語詞源為 \"praeservare\"，意為\"事先保存\"。其中 \"prae-\" 是表示\"事先\"、\"在前面\"的字首，\"servare\" 則是\"保存\"、\"守護\"的意思。構詞上，\"prae-\" 提供了時間上的預防性，\"servare\" 提供了核心的\"保護\"與\"守護\"語意。原始語義是