慢慢開始恢復意識。","analysis":"此為片語分析。'regain' (v.) 源自古法語 're-' (again) + 'gaigner' (to gain)，意為『重新獲得』。'consciousness' (n.) 源自拉丁語 'conscientia'，指『意識、知覺』。兩者結合，表示失去意識後『重新恢復知覺』。","definition":"to become conscious again after being unconscious","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The patient slowly began to regain consciousness.\",\n    \"ch\": \"病人慢慢開始恢復意識。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It took him several minutes to regain consciousness after the accident.\",\n    \"ch\": \"事故發生後，他花了幾分鐘才恢復意識。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"病人慢慢開始恢復意識。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3186,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::rejection::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He felt devastated by the ____ of his job application.","expectedAnswer":"rejection","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He felt devastated by the ____ of his job application.","clozeAnswer":"rejection","exampleTranslation":"他對工作申請被拒感到非常沮喪。","reference":{"eng":"rejection","kk":"/rɪˈdʒɛkʃn/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['拒絕；駁回'], ['（尤指因求職、求愛等而被）拒絕；被冷落']]","chEntries":["拒絕","駁回","被冷落"],"practiceMeaning":"他對工作申請被拒感到非常沮喪。","analysis":"名詞，源自動詞 'reject'。'Rejection' 指的是拒絕接受、承認或考慮某人或某物。這可以是拒絕提議、請求、申請，或是因為不喜歡、不合適而被拒絕。它常常會帶來失落、沮喪或被排斥的感受。","definition":"1. the act of rejecting or refusing to accept, consider, believe, etc.; 2. the state of being rejected; 3. the dismissive or contemptuous treatment of someone.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He felt devastated by the rejection of his job application.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他對工作申請被拒感到非常沮喪。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The rejection of his proposal angered her.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的提議被駁回激怒了她。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She experienced feelings of rejection after the breakup.\",\n    \"ch\": \"分手後她經歷了被拒絕的感覺。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他對工作申請被拒感到非常沮喪。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U40"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5439,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l3::relieve::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"This medicine will ____ your headache.","expectedAnswer":"relieve","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This medicine will ____ your headache.","clozeAnswer":"relieve","exampleTranslation":"這種藥會緩解你的頭痛。","reference":{"eng":"relieve","kk":"rɪˈliːv","tense":"v.","ch":"[['緩解'], ['減輕'], ['解除'], ['安慰'], ['換班']]","chEntries":["緩解","減輕","解除","安慰","換班"],"practiceMeaning":"這種藥會緩解你的頭痛。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 \"relever\"，意為\"再次提起\"、\"舉起\"、\"減輕\"。其拉丁語詞源為 \"relevare\"，由 \"re-\" (再次) 和 \"levare\" (減輕，與 \"levis\" 意為\"輕\"有關) 構成。構詞上，\"re-\" 提供了「恢復」或「再次」的語意，\"levare\" 提供了「減輕」或「變輕」的核心語意。因此，\"relieve\" 的核心語義是「使某種負擔、痛苦或壓力變輕」，即「緩解」、「減輕」。引申用法包括「解除」某種義務或憂慮，以及「安慰」某人，使其痛苦減輕，還有「換班」以減輕他人負擔。","definition":"to lessen or remove pain, discomfort, or other suffering; to free someone from a burden or obligation; to provide comfort or reassurance to someone; to take over from someone who has been on duty.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This medicine will relieve your headache.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這種藥會緩解你的頭痛。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The government is trying to relieve poverty in the region.\",\n    \"ch\": \"政府正試圖緩解該地區的貧困問題。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A fresh pair of eyes can often relieve you of a difficult task.\",\n    \"ch\": \"換一對新的眼睛來看待，常常能幫你減輕處理艱難任務的壓力。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這種藥會緩解你的頭痛。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4239,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u7::remind::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Please ____ me to buy milk on the way home.","expectedAnswer":"remind","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Please ____ me to buy milk on the way home.","clozeAnswer":"remind","exampleTranslation":"請提醒我回家路上買牛奶。","reference":{"eng":"remind","kk":"/rɪˈmaɪnd/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['提醒'], ['使想起']]","chEntries":["提醒","使想起"],"practiceMeaning":"請提醒我回家路上買牛奶。","analysis":"源自古法語 'remonstrer'，由 're-'（再次）+ 'monester'（勸告，受拉丁語 'monere' 影響）組成。'Remind' 意為「再次使某人想起或通知某人」。詞根 'mind' 在此與「意識、記憶」相關，透過「再次」的動作，使之回到意識中。","definition":"to cause someone to remember something; to make someone aware of something","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please remind me to buy milk on the way home.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請提醒我回家路上買牛奶。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This song reminds me of my childhood.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這首歌讓我想起了我的童年。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"請提醒我回家路上買牛奶。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5059,"wordRef":"字彙王::u59::reminder::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"This note is a ____ to pay the bill.","expectedAnswer":"reminder","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This note is a ____ to pay the bill.","clozeAnswer":"reminder","exampleTranslation":"這張紙條是付款提醒。","reference":{"eng":"reminder","kk":"rɪˈmaɪndər","tense":"n.","ch":"[['提醒物'], ['提醒（通知）']]","chEntries":["提醒物","提醒"],"practiceMeaning":"這張紙條是付款提醒。","analysis":"此字由動詞 remind（提醒）加上名詞化字尾 -er（表示人或物）構成。remind 源自古英語 myndgian，與 mind（心智）同源。reminder 的核心語意是「使某人記起某事的東西或行為」。它可以是實物（如備忘錄），也可以是通知或提示。OCR 掃描時可能將 'r' 誤判為 'n'，或 'd' 誤判為 'cl'。此處修正為 reminder。","definition":"1. a thing that causes someone to remember something or to be aware of something; 2. a note or message that reminds someone to do something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This note is a reminder to pay the bill.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這張紙條是付款提醒。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The flowers served as a reminder of their trip.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那些花讓人們回想起他們的旅行。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這張紙條是付款提醒。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U59"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5657,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l8::rent::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We decided to ____ a car for our trip.","expectedAnswer":"rent","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We decided to ____ a car for our trip.","clozeAnswer":"rent","exampleTranslation":"我們決定租一輛車去旅行。","reference":{"eng":"rent","kk":"rɛnt","tense":"v.","ch":"[['出租'], ['租用'], ['賃借']]","chEntries":["出租","租用","賃借"],"practiceMeaning":"我們決定租一輛車去旅行。","analysis":"此字源自中古英語 rent(en)，來自古法語 rente，意為「年貢、收入」，再追溯至拉丁語 reditus，意為「歸還、收入」，是 reddere（歸還，to give back）的動名詞。redd- 來自原始印歐語 *do-（給予）。核心語義為「定期支付的金額」或「歸還的價值」。構詞上，此字直接來自拉丁語中的「歸還」、「收入」概念。此處為動詞用法，表示「租用」某物（支付租金）或「出租」某物（收取租金）。","definition":"to pay money to use a building, vehicle, or piece of equipment; to allow someone to use your property or possessions in return for money.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We decided to rent a car for our trip.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們決定租一輛車去旅行。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She rents out rooms in her house.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她把她房子裡的房間出租。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們決定租一輛車去旅行。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4041,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u4::replace::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We need to ____ the old battery with a new one.","expectedAnswer":"replace","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We need to ____ the old battery with a new one.","clozeAnswer":"replace","exampleTranslation":"我們需要用一個新的電池來替換舊電池。","reference":{"eng":"replace","kk":"/rɪˈpleɪs/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['取代', '替換'], ['歸還', '放回原處']]","chEntries":["取代","替換","歸還","放回原處"],"practiceMeaning":"我們需要用一個新的電池來替換舊電池。","analysis":"源自古法語 'replacer'，由 're-' (back) + 'placer' (to place) 構成。核心意思是「再次放置」。第一個義項「取代」、「替換」是指用新的東西放到原來的東西所在的位置，或讓一個人或物接替另一個。第二個義項「歸還」、「放回原處」則強調將某物放回它原本的位置，是一種特殊的「替換」情境，即將其「放回」原位。","definition":"1. to take the place of something or someone; 2. to put something back in the place where it was before","example":"[\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要用一個新的電池來替換舊電池。\",\n    \"eng\": \"We need to replace the old battery with a new one.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"她把書放回書架上。\",\n    \"eng\": \"She replaced the book on the shelf.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"你能把這個罐子的蓋子蓋回去嗎？\",\n    \"eng\": \"Can you replace the lid on this jar?\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們需要用一個新的電池來替換舊電池。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U4、L3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5423,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l3::replacement::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The doctor ordered a ____ for the damaged hip joint.","expectedAnswer":"replacement","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The doctor ordered a ____ for the damaged hip joint.","clozeAnswer":"replacement","exampleTranslation":"醫生訂購了一個人工髖關節來替換受損的關節。","reference":{"eng":"replacement","kk":"rɪˈpleɪsmənt","tense":"n.","ch":"[['取代'], ['替換'], ['替代品'], ['接替者'], ['歸還'], ['放回原處']]","chEntries":["取代","替換","替代品","接替者","歸還","放回原處"],"practiceMeaning":"醫生訂購了一個人工髖關節來替換受損的關節。","analysis":"此字為派生詞，由動詞 \"replace\" 加上名詞化字尾 \"-ment\" 構成。\"replace\" 由字首 \"re-\" (再次、向後) 和動詞 \"place\" (放置) 構成，原始語義為「再次放置」或「放回原處」，引申為「取代」、「替換」。字尾 \"-ment\" 將動詞的「取代」、「替換」行為轉化為抽象名詞，表示「取代的行為或過程」、「被取代的事物」或「用來取代的事物」。因此，\"replacement\" 指的是將舊的換成新的、用一個事物代替另一個事物的動作、結果，或者指用來替代的物品或人。","definition":"the act of replacing someone or something; something or someone that replaces another; a substitute.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The doctor ordered a replacement for the damaged hip joint.\",\n    \"ch\": \"醫生訂購了一個人工髖關節來替換受損的關節。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We are looking for a suitable replacement for the outgoing employee.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們正在為離職的員工尋找合適的接替人。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The replacement of parts is a common maintenance task.\",\n    \"ch\": \"零件更換是常見的維護工作。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"醫生訂購了一個人工髖關節來替換受損的關節。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3939,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u2::represent::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She was chosen to ____ her country at the conference.","expectedAnswer":"represent","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She was chosen to ____ her country at the conference.","clozeAnswer":"represent","exampleTranslation":"她被選派代表她的國家參加會議。","reference":{"eng":"represent","kk":"/ˌreprɪˈzent/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['代表', '象徵'], ['表示', '說明'], ['描繪']]","chEntries":["代表","象徵","表示","說明","描繪"],"practiceMeaning":"她被選派代表她的國家參加會議。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'representare'，由 're-' (意為「再次」) 和 'presentare' (意為「呈現」) 組成。指「再次呈現」某人或某物，引申為「代表」、「象徵」、「表示」或「描繪」。","definition":"1. to be or act as an official delegate for (a group, country, etc.); 2. to be a sign or symbol of (something); 3. to describe or portray someone or something in a particular way.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She was chosen to represent her country at the conference.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她被選派代表她的國家參加會議。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This symbol represents peace.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個符號代表和平。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The painting represents a historical event.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這幅畫描繪了一個歷史事件。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她被選派代表她的國家參加會議。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4402,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::republic::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"France is a ____.","expectedAnswer":"republic","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"France is a ____.","clozeAnswer":"republic","exampleTranslation":"法國是一個共和國。","reference":{"eng":"republic","kk":"/rɪˈpʌblɪk/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['共和國'], ['（共和制）國家']]","chEntries":["共和國","國家"],"practiceMeaning":"法國是一個共和國。","analysis":"詞源自拉丁語 'res publica'，'res' (thing, matter) + 'publica' (public)。意為「公眾事務」。指一種政治體制，其中國家元首由選舉產生，而非世襲，且權力來自人民。","definition":"a country that is governed by elected representatives and in which there is no king or queen; a state in which supreme power is held by the people and their elected representatives, and which has an elected or nominated president rather than a monarch.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"France is a republic.\",\n    \"ch\": \"法國是一個共和國。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The president addressed the nation on Republic Day.\",\n    \"ch\": \"總統在國慶日向全國發表講話。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"法國是一個共和國。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4401,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::request::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ for more information was granted.","expectedAnswer":"request","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ for more information was granted.","clozeAnswer":"request","exampleTranslation":"增加更多資訊的要求獲得了批准。","reference":{"eng":"request","kk":"/rɪˈkwest/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['請求', '要求']]","chEntries":["請求","要求"],"practiceMeaning":"增加更多資訊的要求獲得了批准。","analysis":"承襲動詞的語意，指提出的願望或要求。","definition":"an act of asking for something to be given or done, especially formally or politely.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The request for more information was granted.\",\n    \"ch\": \"增加更多資訊的要求獲得了批准。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He made a special request to see the files.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他提出了一個查看檔案的特別請求。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"增加更多資訊的要求獲得了批准。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4582,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u11::reservoir::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The city's water supply comes from the nearby ____.","expectedAnswer":"reservoir","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The city's water supply comes from the nearby ____.","clozeAnswer":"reservoir","exampleTranslation":"這座城市的水源來自附近的が水庫。","reference":{"eng":"reservoir","kk":"/ˈrɛzəvwɑːr/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['水庫', '蓄水池'], ['儲藏處', '儲備']]","chEntries":["水庫","蓄水池","儲藏處","儲備"],"practiceMeaning":"這座城市的水源來自附近的が水庫。","analysis":"源自法語 'réservoir'，'réserver' (to reserve - 保留、儲藏) 的名詞形式。\n    1. 水庫、蓄水池：指為儲存水而建造的人工湖或設施。\n    2. 儲藏處、儲備：泛指任何用於儲存某種物質（如石油、氣體）或數據的場所或系統。","definition":"1. a large natural or artificial lake used as a source of water supply.; 2. a place where something is kept or stored in large quantities.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The city's water supply comes from the nearby reservoir.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這座城市的水源來自附近的が水庫。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The oil reservoir is deep underground.\",\n    \"c