ed a scientific approach to solve this problem.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要一個科學的方法來解決這個問題。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他們進行了一項科學實驗。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4702,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u17::seal::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Please ____ the envelope before mailing it.","expectedAnswer":"seal","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Please ____ the envelope before mailing it.","clozeAnswer":"seal","exampleTranslation":"請在寄出前封好信封。","reference":{"eng":"seal","kk":"/ˈsil/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['密封'], ['封鎖'], ['（印章）蓋印']]","chEntries":["密封","封鎖","蓋印"],"practiceMeaning":"請在寄出前封好信封。","analysis":"動詞形式，與名詞意義對應。指用封條、密封物或印章來關閉、固定或認證。引申至軍事或警察行動中的封鎖區域。","definition":"1. To close something securely or tightly. 2. To fasten or secure something with a seal. 3. To close off an area to prevent entry or exit.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please seal the envelope before mailing it.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請在寄出前封好信封。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The police sealed off the crime scene.\",\n    \"ch\": \"警方封鎖了犯罪現場。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The contract was sealed with a handshake.\",\n    \"ch\": \"合約在握手時被確認了。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"請在寄出前封好信封。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U17、L5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4171,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::secret::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He spilled the ____ about the party.","expectedAnswer":"secret","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He spilled the ____ about the party.","clozeAnswer":"secret","exampleTranslation":"他洩露了派對的秘密。","reference":{"eng":"secret","kk":"/ˈsiːkrət/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['秘密']]","chEntries":["秘密"],"practiceMeaning":"他洩露了派對的秘密。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 secretum（秘密，隱藏之物），是動詞 secernere（分開，隱藏）的中性過去分詞。核心概念是「被隱藏、不為人知的事物」。","definition":"a thing that is kept or meant to be kept unknown or unseen by others","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \