ence":{"eng":"security","kk":"/sɪˈkjʊrəti/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['安全', '保安'], ['保障', '保證'], ['證券', '股票']]","chEntries":["安全","保安","保障","保證","證券","股票"],"practiceMeaning":"這家旅館為客人提供優良的保安服務。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'securitas'，由 'se-' (without) + 'cura' (care, anxiety) 構成，字面意思是「沒有憂慮」。核心是「安全」、「沒有危險」。因此，'security' 指「安全」的狀態，也指「保障」和「安全措施」。第四個義項「證券」則是由「保障」、「保證」延伸而來，指能提供價值保障的財產證明，如股票、債券。","definition":"1. the state of being safe and protected from harm or danger; 2. measures taken to ensure safety; 3. the confidence that something is safe or certain; 4. a person or thing that provides safety or protection; 5. a document showing that a person has a right to claim a sum of money or property","example":"[\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"這家旅館為客人提供優良的保安服務。\",\n    \"eng\": \"The hotel provides excellent security for its guests.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要確保我們數據的安全。\",\n    \"eng\": \"We need to ensure the security of our data.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"他投資了股票和證券。\",\n    \"eng\": \"He invested in stocks and securities.\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這家旅館為客人提供優良的保安服務。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5542,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l5::selfless::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Her ____ dedication to the cause inspired many.","expectedAnswer":"selfless","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Her ____ dedication to the cause inspired many.","clozeAnswer":"selfless","exampleTranslation":"她對事業的無私奉獻激勵了許多人。","reference":{"eng":"selfless","kk":"ˈselfles","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['無私的'], ['忘我的']]","chEntries":["無私的","忘我的"],"practiceMeaning":"她對事業的無私奉獻激勵了許多人。","analysis":"此字由 'self' (自己) 加上否定字尾 '-less' 構成。'-less' 源自古英語，表示「沒有……」。'self' 是指「自我、個人」。因此，'selfless' 的構詞結構清晰地表明其含義是「沒有自我意識的」、「不考慮自己的」。語意上，它描述了一種將他人福祉置於自己利益之上的品質，強調利他主義和忘我精神。","definition":"not thinking of yourself first; unselfish.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her selfless dedication to the cause inspired many.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她對事業的無私奉獻激勵了許多人。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The volunteer performed selfless acts of kindness.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位志願者做出了忘我的善舉。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她對事業的無私奉獻激勵了許多人。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3922,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u2::semester::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The fall ____ begins in September.","expectedAnswer":"semester","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The fall ____ begins in September.","clozeAnswer":"semester","exampleTranslation":"秋季學期於九月開始。","reference":{"eng":"semester","kk":"/səˈmestər/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['學期']]","chEntries":["學期"],"practiceMeaning":"秋季學期於九月開始。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'semestris'，由 'sex' (意為「六」) 和 'mensis' (意為「月」) 組成，意為「六個月」。最初指六個月的時期，後特指學術機構中的一個學期。","definition":"either of the two periods of time in a school year, at the end of which there are holidays.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The fall semester begins in September.\",\n    \"ch\": \"秋季學期於九月開始。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is taking a leave of absence for one semester.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她將休學一個學期。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Final exams will be held at the end of the semester.\",\n    \"ch\": \"期末考試將在學期末舉行。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"秋季學期於九月開始。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5314,"wordRef":"字彙王::u63::senator::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ gave a speech on national security.","expectedAnswer":"senator","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ gave a speech on national security.","clozeAnswer":"senator","exampleTranslation":"參議員就國家安全發表了演講。","reference":{"eng":"senator","kk":"ˈsɛnətər","tense":"n.","ch":"[['參議員']]","chEntries":["參議員"],"practiceMeaning":"參議員就國家安全發表了演講。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'senator'（參議員），來自 'senex'（老的，長者）。構詞上，'sen-' 為詞根，'-ator' 為表示「人」的後綴。核心語意指「長者」，引申為在古代羅馬元老院或現代議會中的「參議員」，因其通常是較有經驗或地位較高的人士。","definition":"a member of a senate, especially the upper house of the United States Congress.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The senator gave a speech on national security.\",\n    \"ch\": \"參議員就國家安全發表了演講。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She was elected as a senator.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她被選為參議員。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"參議員就國家安全發表了演講。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U63"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5406,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l2::severe::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The patient is suffering from a ____ infection.","expectedAnswer":"severe","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The patient is suffering from a ____ infection.","clozeAnswer":"severe","exampleTranslation":"這名病人正在遭受嚴重的感染。","reference":{"eng":"severe","kk":"sɪˈvɪər","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['嚴重的'], ['嚴峻的'], ['劇烈的'], ['嚴格的']]","chEntries":["嚴重的","嚴峻的","劇烈的","嚴格的"],"practiceMeaning":"這名病人正在遭受嚴重的感染。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 severus，意為「嚴肅的、嚴格的、嚴厲的」。核心語意是「程度極高，超出一般標準，令人難以承受」。因此，'severe' 用於描述天氣、疾病、損害、懲罰、批評等，表示其程度非常嚴重，可能造成重大影響。","definition":"1. (of something bad or unpleasant) intense or serious; 2. (of a person or their manner) strict or harsh.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The patient is suffering from a severe infection.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這名病人正在遭受嚴重的感染。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company faced severe criticism for its environmental policies.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司因其環境政策而面臨嚴厲批評。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這名病人正在遭受嚴重的感染。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4087,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u4::sexual-discrimination::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"____ is illegal in many countries.","expectedAnswer":"Sexual discrimination","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"____ is illegal in many countries.","clozeAnswer":"Sexual discrimination","exampleTranslation":"性別歧視在許多國家都是非法的。","reference":{"eng":"sexual discrimination","kk":"/ˈsɛkʃuəl dɪˌskrɪmɪˈneɪʃən/","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['性別歧視']]","chEntries":["性別歧視"],"practiceMeaning":"性別歧視在許多國家都是非法的。","analysis":"'Sexual' (性別的) 源自拉丁語 'sexus' (sex)。'Discrimination' (歧視) 源自拉丁語 'discriminare' (to distinguish, to separate)，意為「區別對待」。'Sexual discrimination' 指基於性別而產生的不公平對待。","definition":"unfair treatment of someone based on their sex or gender","example":"[\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"性別歧視在許多國家都是非法的。\",\n    \"eng\": \"Sexual discrimination is illegal in many countries.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"她在工作場所經歷過性別歧視。\",\n    \"eng\": \"She has experienced sexual discrimination in the workplace.\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"性別歧視在許多國家都是非法的。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4088,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u4::sexual-harassment::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The company has a strict policy against ____.","expectedAnswer":"sexual harassment","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company has a strict policy against ____.","clozeAnswer":"sexual harassment","exampleTranslation":"公司有嚴格的反性騷擾政策。","reference":{"eng":"sexual harassment","kk":"/ˈsɛkʃuəl həˈræsmənt/","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['性騷擾']]","chEntries":["性騷擾"],"practiceMeaning":"公司有嚴格的反性騷擾政策。","analysis":"'Sexual' (性別的) 源自拉丁語 'sexus' (sex)。'Harassment' (騷擾) 源自古法語 'haras' (a stud farm)，後來引申為「煩擾」、「侵擾」。'Sexual harassment' 指任何不受歡迎的、與性有關的行為，會冒犯或侮辱他人。","definition":"unwelcome sexual advances, requests for sexual favors, and other verbal or physical conduct of a sexual nature","example":"[\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"公司有嚴格的反性騷擾政策。\",\n    \"eng\": \"The company has a strict policy against sexual harassment.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"她舉報了性騷擾事件。\",\n    \"eng\": \"She reported the incident of sexual harassment.\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"公司有嚴格的反性騷擾政策。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5477,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l4::shallow::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The children played in the ____ end of the pool.","expectedAnswer":"shallow","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The children played in the ____ end of the pool.","clozeAnswer":"shallow","exampleTranslation":"孩子們在泳池的淺水區玩耍。","reference":{"eng":"shallow","kk":"ˈʃæloʊ","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['淺的'], ['淺薄的'], ['膚淺的']]","chEntries":["淺的","淺薄的","膚淺的"],"practiceMeaning":"孩子們在泳池的淺水區玩耍。","analysis":"此字源自中古英語 'schalowe'，可能與古英語 'sceald'（淺水）有關，詞源不太確定，但與「淺」的概念緊密聯繫。'Shallow' 作形容詞，最基本的意思是指「水、容器等深度不大」，與 'deep'（深的）相對。引申義則用於形容「思想、情感、性格等缺乏深度」，即「膚淺的、淺薄的」，這是一種比喻用法，將「水淺」的物理概念類比到「思想不深」的抽象概念。","definition":"1. (Of a body of water or the landscape beneath it)<bos> of little depth.; 2. Not showing any intellectual or emotional depth.; 3. Superficial.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The children played in the shallow end of the pool.\",\n    \"ch\": \"孩子們在泳池的淺水區玩耍。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His arguments were shallow and lacked evidence.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的論點很膚淺，缺乏證據。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She found his interest in fashion to be rather shallow.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她覺得他對時尚的興趣相當膚淺。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"孩子們在泳池的淺水區玩耍。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5805,"wordRef":"字彙王::u60::shed::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He keeps his gardening tools in the ____.","expectedAnswer":"shed","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He keeps his gardening tools in the ____.","clozeAnswer":"shed","exampleTranslation":"他把園藝工具放在棚屋裡。","reference":{"eng":"shed","kk":"ʃɛd","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"小屋\"  ],  [    \"棚屋\"  ],  [    \"簡陋的建築\"  ]]","chEntries":["小屋","棚屋","簡陋的建築"],"practiceMeaning":"他把園藝工具放在棚屋裡。","analysis":"此字為名詞，與動詞同源。核心語義是指「一個簡單、臨時或用於儲存物品的建築物」。通常是獨立的、簡陋的結構，例如工具棚、自行車棚、飼料棚等。語意演變上，從「脫落」或「分離」引申為「與主建築分離的、簡單的附屬建築」。","definition":"1. a simple structure, typically of wood or metal, built for storage or shelter.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He keeps his gardening tools in the shed.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他把園藝工具放在棚屋裡。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The old shed was falling apart.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那個舊棚屋快要散架了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They used the shed as a workshop.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們把棚屋當作工作室。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他把園藝工具放在棚屋裡。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U60"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4465,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::shiny::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The car was parked in the sun, its surface ____.","expectedAnswer":"shiny","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The car was parked in the sun, its surface ____.","clozeAnswer":"shiny","exampleTranslation":"汽車停在陽光下，車身閃閃發光。","reference":{"eng":"shiny","kk":"/ˈʃaɪni/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['閃亮的'], ['光澤的']]","chEntries":["閃亮的","光澤的"],"practiceMeaning":"汽車停在陽光下，車身閃閃發光。","analysis":"源自 shine (發光)。加上 -y (形容詞後綴)。核心語意是「發出光線」、「有光澤的」。","definition":"1. Giving out or reflecting much light; 2. Bright and polished.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The car was parked in the sun, its surface shiny.\",\n    \"ch\": \"汽車停在陽光下，車身閃閃發光。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She had shiny, dark hair.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她有著烏黑光澤的頭髮。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"汽車停在陽光下，車身閃閃發光。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4081,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u4::shrimp::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"I ordered a plate of grilled ____.","expectedAnswer":"shrimp","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"I ordered a plate of grilled ____.","clozeAnswer":"shrimp","exampleTranslation":"我點了一盤烤蝦。","reference":{"eng":"shrimp","kk":"/ʃrɪmp/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['蝦'], ['矮子', '瘦小的人']]","chEntries":["蝦","矮子","瘦小的人"],"practiceMeaning":"我點了一盤烤蝦。","analysis":"第一個義項「蝦」的詞源有爭議，可能與斯堪地那維亞語有關，指一種小的水生動物。第二個義項「矮子」、「瘦小的人」則是比喻用法，形容身材矮小、瘦弱，類似蝦的體型。","definition":"1. a small sea creature with ten legs and a shell, that has a long body and tail and is eaten as food; 2. a small or thin person","example":"[\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"我點了一盤烤蝦。\",\n    \"eng\": \"I ordered a plate of grilled shrimp.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"跟他哥哥比起來，他只是個小矮子。\",\n    \"eng\": \"He's just a shrimp compared to his older brother.\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我點了一盤烤蝦。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4629,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u16::shrink::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"This sweater will ____ if you wash it in hot water.","expectedAnswer":"shrink","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This sweater will ____ if you wash it in hot water.","clozeAnswer":"shrink","exampleTranslation":"這件毛衣如果用熱水洗就會縮水。","reference":{"eng":"shrink","kk":"/ʃrɪŋk/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['收縮'], ['縮小'], ['退縮'], ['畏縮']]","chEntries":["收縮","縮小","退縮","畏縮"],"practiceMeaning":"這件毛衣如果用熱水洗就會縮水。","analysis":"源自古英語 'scrincan'，意為「萎縮、乾枯」。核心概念是尺寸、體積或數量的減少。可以是物理上的收縮（如衣物縮水），也可以是抽象的退縮（如因恐懼而畏縮）。","definition":"to become smaller in size, amount, or number; to move back or away from someone or something because of fear or disgust.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This sweater will shrink if you wash it in hot water.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這件毛衣如果用熱水洗就會縮水。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He shrunk back from the aggressive dog.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他因那隻兇猛的狗而畏縮後退。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company's profits have shrunk this year.\",\n    \"ch\": \"公司今年的利潤縮水了。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這件毛衣如果用熱水洗就會縮水。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U16"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6198,"wordRef":"字彙王::u66::siege::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The city was under ____ for months.","expectedAnswer":"siege","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The city was under ____ for months.","clozeAnswer":"siege","exampleTranslation":"這座城市被圍攻了數月。","reference":{"eng":"siege","kk":"siːdʒ","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"圍攻\"  ],  [    \"包圍\"  ],  [    \"圍困\"  ]]","chEntries":["圍攻","包圍","圍困"],"practiceMeaning":"這座城市被圍攻了數月。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 siege，意為「座位、場所、圍攻」，最終源自拉丁語 sedes「座位」，與 sedēre「坐」相關。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根，但 sedēre「坐」是其核心語意來源。作為名詞，其核心語義是「軍隊包圍並試圖佔領一個設防城鎮或據點的軍事行動」。詞源中的「座位」引申為「佔據」，進而發展為「圍攻」的意義。","definition":"1. a military blockade of a city or fortress with the intention of capturing it by assault or starvation; 2. a prolonged period of difficulty or hardship.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The city was under siege for months.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這座城市被圍攻了數月。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The siege ended with the enemy's surrender.\",\n    \"ch\": \"圍攻在敵軍投降後結束。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The prolonged siege tested the defenders' resolve.\",\n    \"ch\": \"漫長的圍困考驗了守軍的決心。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The castle endured a long siege.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這座城堡經受了漫長的圍攻。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這座城市被圍攻了數月。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U66"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5511,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l5::sigh::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He let out a long ____.","expectedAnswer":"sigh","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He let out a long ____.","clozeAnswer":"sigh","exampleTranslation":"他發出了一聲長長的嘆息。","reference":{"eng":"sigh","kk":"saɪ","tense":"n.","ch":"[['嘆息'], ['嘆氣聲']]","chEntries":["嘆息","嘆氣聲"],"practiceMeaning":"他發出了一聲長長的嘆息。","analysis":"此為動詞 'sigh' 的名詞形式。作為名詞，它指「嘆氣」這個動作或由此發出的聲音。構詞與語意演變與動詞一致，承襲了「表達情緒的呼氣」的概念。","definition":"an audible exhalation expressing sadness, relief, tiredness, or similar emotion.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He let out a long sigh.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他發出了一聲長長的嘆息。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her sigh conveyed her disappointment.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她的嘆息傳達了她的失望。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他發出了一聲長長的嘆息。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4144,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::significant::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"There has been a ____ increase in sales.","expectedAnswer":"significant","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"There has been a ____ increase in sales.","clozeAnswer":"significant","exampleTranslation":"銷售額有了顯著增長。","reference":{"eng":"significant","kk":"/sɪɡˈnɪfɪkənt/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['顯著的', '重要的'], ['（數量）相當大的'], ['意味深長的']]","chEntries":["顯著的","重要的","相當大的","意味深長的"],"practiceMeaning":"銷售額有了顯著增長。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 significare（意指，表示），由 signum（標誌）+ facere（製造）組成。核心概念是「有重要意義」或「值得注意」。引申為數量上的重大、影響力的強大，或內涵的豐富。","definition":"1. sufficiently great or important to be worthy of attention; noteworthy; 2. having a particular meaning; indicative; 3. large or noticeable","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There has been a significant increase in sales.\",\n    \"ch\": \"銷售額有了顯著增長。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is a significant development in the field.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是該領域的一項重要發展。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her contribution played a significant role in the project's success.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她的貢獻在項目的成功中起到了重要作用。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"銷售額有了顯著增長。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4458,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::similarity::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"There is a striking ____ between the two paintings.","expectedAnswer":"similarity","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"There is a striking ____ between the two paintings.","clozeAnswer":"similarity","exampleTranslation":"這兩幅畫之間有著驚人的相似之處。","reference":{"eng":"similarity","kk":"/ˌsɪməˈlæriti/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['相似']]","chEntries":["相似"],"practiceMeaning":"這兩幅畫之間有著驚人的相似之處。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 similis，意為「相似的」。加上 -ity (名詞後綴)。核心語意是「兩個或多個事物之間共同的特徵或性質」。","definition":"1. The state or fact of being similar; 2. A point or feature that is shared by two or more things.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There is a striking similarity between the two paintings.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這兩幅畫之間有著驚人的相似之處。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The similarity of their voices made it difficult to tell them apart.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們聲音的相似之處使得很難