04,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u7::slave-away-at::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He had to ____ his studies to pass the exam.","expectedAnswer":"slave away at","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He had to ____ his studies to pass the exam.","clozeAnswer":"slave away at","exampleTranslation":"他必須刻苦學習才能通過考試。","reference":{"eng":"slave away at","kk":"/sleɪv ˈeɪˈweɪ æt/","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['辛勤地（從事某項工作）'], ['埋頭苦幹（做某事）']]","chEntries":["辛勤地","埋頭苦幹"],"practiceMeaning":"他必須刻苦學習才能通過考試。","analysis":"由動詞 'slave'（像奴隸一樣工作）和副詞片語 'away at'（專注於、持續地做）組成。'Slave away at' 表示「長時間、非常辛苦地、不間斷地從事某項工作」，強調勞動的艱辛和投入。","definition":"to work very hard for a long time, especially at a difficult or boring task.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He had to slave away at his studies to pass the exam.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他必須刻苦學習才能通過考試。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She spent years slaving away at her first novel.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她花了多年時間埋頭苦幹寫她的第一本小說。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他必須刻苦學習才能通過考試。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6243,"wordRef":"字彙王::u67::slot::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The coin fell through the ____ in the machine.","expectedAnswer":"slot","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The coin fell through the ____ in the machine.","clozeAnswer":"slot","exampleTranslation":"硬幣掉進了機器上的狹縫裡。","reference":{"eng":"slot","kk":"slɑt","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"狹縫\"  ],  [    \"狹長孔\"  ],  [    \"時段\"  ],  [    \"位置\"  ],  [    \"名額\"  ]]","chEntries":["狹縫","狹長孔","時段","位置","名額"],"practiceMeaning":"硬幣掉進了機器上的狹縫裡。","analysis":"此字源自荷蘭語 slet，意為「開口，狹縫」。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根。名詞義指狹長的開口、縫隙，或引申為特定的時間段、位置或名額。中文翻譯為「狹縫；狹長孔；時段；位置；名額」。","definition":"1. a long, narrow opening; 2. a period of time allocated for a particular purpose; 3. a position or place in a particular list or system.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The coin fell through the slot in the machine.\",\n    \"ch\": \"硬幣掉進了