ict","kk":"strɪkt","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['嚴格的'], ['嚴厲的'], ['精確的'], ['嚴謹的']]","chEntries":["嚴格的","嚴厲的","精確的","嚴謹的"],"practiceMeaning":"老師對家庭作業有嚴格的規定。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'strictus'，是動詞 'stringere'（拉緊、緊束、約束）的過去分詞。構詞學上，'strin-'/'strict-' 是「拉緊」、「緊密」的詞根，'-us' 是過去分詞後綴。原始語意是「被拉緊的」、「被約束的」。從「緊繃」、「不受鬆懈」引申出「嚴格的」、「嚴厲的」（指規則、紀律、對待方式）以及「精確的」、「嚴謹的」（指方法、定義）。","definition":"1. (Of a rule or discipline) demanding exact compliance; 2. (Of a person or their manner) severe and unsparing in the giving or exacting of discipline, conditions, or the like; 3. Precisely accurate; exact.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The teacher has strict rules about homework.\",\n    \"ch\": \"老師對家庭作業有嚴格的規定。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is very strict with his children.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他對他的孩子要求很嚴厲。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The measurement must be strict.\",\n    \"ch\": \"測量必須精確。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"老師對家庭作業有嚴格的規定。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5147,"wordRef":"字彙王::u62::submit::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"You must ____ your application by Friday.","expectedAnswer":"submit","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"You must ____ your application by Friday.","clozeAnswer":"submit","exampleTranslation":"你必須在星期五前提交你的申請。","reference":{"eng":"submit","kk":"səbˈmɪt","tense":"v.","ch":"[['提交'], ['屈服'], ['呈遞']]","chEntries":["提交","屈服","呈遞"],"practiceMeaning":"你必須在星期五前提交你的申請。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 submittere，由 sub-（在…下面、服從）+ mittere（派遣、發送）組成。mittere 來自印歐語系 *s(w)ei-（綑綁、指引）。核心語意是「在某人權威之下發送或放置」。引申為「屈服於權威、順從」，以及「呈遞文件、提交申請」。","definition":"accept or yield to a superior force or to another's authority; present (a proposal, application, or other document) to a person or body for consideration or judgment.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"You must submit your application by Friday.\",\n    \"ch\": \"你必須在星期五前提交你的申請。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The defeated army was forced to submit.\",\n    \"ch\": \"戰敗的軍隊