:"suspect","exampleTranslation":"警方懷疑他犯了竊盜罪。","reference":{"eng":"suspect","kk":"/səˈspɛkt/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['懷疑；不信任'], ['認為…可能是；猜想']]","chEntries":["懷疑","不信任","認為…可能是","猜想"],"practiceMeaning":"警方懷疑他犯了竊盜罪。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'suspicere'，意為 'look up at, distrust, surmise'，由 'sub-' (under) 和 'specere' (to look) 構成。字面意思是『從下方仰望』，引申為『偷偷看』，進而產生『猜疑』、『懷疑』、『覺得有問題』的意思。也可表示『猜測』某事為真，但證據不確鑿。","definition":"to think that someone is guilty of a crime or that something bad has happened or is going to happen; to believe that something is probably true","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The police suspect him of theft.\",\n    \"ch\": \"警方懷疑他犯了竊盜罪。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I suspect it will rain later.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我猜待會可能會下雨。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She suspected that he was not telling the truth.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她懷疑他沒有說實話。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"警方懷疑他犯了竊盜罪。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5862,"wordRef":"字彙王::u58::sustainable::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We need to develop ____ energy sources.","expectedAnswer":"sustainable","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We need to develop ____ energy sources.","clozeAnswer":"sustainable","exampleTranslation":"我們需要發展可持續能源。","reference":{"eng":"sustainable","kk":"səˈsteɪnəbl","tense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"可持續的\"  ],  [    \"可維持的\"  ],  [    \"能長久支持的\"  ],  [    \"不會枯竭的\"  ]]","chEntries":["可持續的","可維持的","能長久支持的","不會枯竭的"],"practiceMeaning":"我們需要發展可持續能源。","analysis":"此字由動詞 'sustain' 加上形容詞字尾 '-able' 構成。'Sustain' 源自拉丁語 'sustinere' (to hold up, support)。'-able' 字尾表示「能夠……的」。'Sustainable' 的核心語意是「能夠被維持」、「能夠長期存在或進行」。它特別強調在滿足當前需求的同時，不損害後代滿足其自身需求的發展模式，常用於環境、經濟和社會領域。例如，也可指「不會枯竭的」資源。","definition":"1. Able to be maintained at a certain rate or level.; 2. Relating to or being development that meets the needs of the present without compromising the ability of future generations to meet their own needs.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to develop sustainable energy sources.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要發展可持續能源。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This farming method is more sustainable.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這種耕作方法更具可持續性。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company aims for sustainable growth.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司旨在實現可持續增長。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The renewable resources are sustainable.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這些可再生資源是可持續的。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們需要發展可持續能源。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U58"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4618,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u16::swell::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"His ankle started to ____ after the injury.","expectedAnswer":"swell","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"His ankle started to ____ after the injury.","clozeAnswer":"swell","exampleTranslation":"受傷後，他的腳踝開始腫脹。","reference":{"eng":"swell","kk":"/swɛl/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['腫脹'], ['膨脹'], ['（水位、聲量）上漲、增大'], ['（情緒）高漲、激動']]","chEntries":["腫脹","膨脹","上漲、增大","高漲、激動"],"practiceMeaning":"受傷後，他的腳踝開始腫脹。","analysis":"源自古英語 'swellan'，意為「膨脹、腫起」。核心概念是體積、尺寸或強度的增加，通常是由於內部壓力、液體積聚或情感的擴張。可以是物理上的，也可以是抽象的（如驕傲、波浪）。","definition":"to become larger or rounder in size, often because of pressure from inside or an accumulation of fluid; to increase in size, volume, or intensity; to become more extreme in strength or emotion.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His ankle started to swell after the injury.\",\n    \"ch\": \"受傷後，他的腳踝開始腫脹。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The sound of the music began to swell.\",\n    \"ch\": \"音樂的聲響開始變大。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her heart swelled with pride at his achievement.\",\n    \"ch\": \"看到他的成就，她的心充滿了驕傲。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"受傷後，他的腳踝開始腫脹。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U16"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5566,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l6::swiftly::adv","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The news spread ____ through the town.","expectedAnswer":"swiftly","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The news spread ____ through the town.","clozeAnswer":"swiftly","exampleTranslation":"消息迅速傳遍了整個城鎮。","reference":{"eng":"swiftly","kk":"ˈswɪftli","tense":"adv.","ch":"[['迅速地'], ['快速地']]","chEntries":["迅速地","快速地"],"practiceMeaning":"消息迅速傳遍了整個城鎮。","analysis":"此字由形容詞 \"swift\" 加上副詞字尾 \"-ly\" 構成。\"swift\" 源自古英語 \"swift\"，與荷蘭語 \"swift\"、德語 \"sch(w)ift\" 同源，最終可追溯至原始印歐語 \\*swep-（to go, to flow，去，流動）。其核心語義是「快速、敏捷」。因此，\"swiftly\" 作為副詞，用來描述動作或事件發生的速度非常快，強調其敏捷性、即時性，沒有延遲。","definition":"1. At a great speed; very quickly; 2. Without delay; promptly.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The news spread swiftly through the town.\",\n    \"ch\": \"消息迅速傳遍了整個城鎮。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She replied swiftly to his question.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她迅速回答了他的問題。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The rescue team worked swiftly to save the stranded hikers.\",\n    \"ch\": \"救援隊迅速行動，營救了受困的登山者。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"消息迅速傳遍了整個城鎮。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5863,"wordRef":"字彙王::u58::tackle::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We need to ____ the issue of climate change.","expectedAnswer":"tackle","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We need to ____ the issue of climate change.","clozeAnswer":"tackle","exampleTranslation":"我們需要著手解決氣候變遷的問題。","reference":{"eng":"tackle","kk":"ˈtækl","tense":"v.","ch":"[  [    \"處理\"  ],  [    \"應對\"  ],  [    \"解決\"  ],  [    \"阻截\"  ],  [    \"對付\"  ]]","chEntries":["處理","應對","解決","阻截","對付"],"practiceMeaning":"我們需要著手解決氣候變遷的問題。","analysis":"此字源自古英語 'tæcel' (a snare, noose) 或相關動詞，可能與「抓住」、「纏繞」有關。'Tackle' 的核心語意是「抓住並設法控制或處理」。在體育運動中（如足球、橄欖球），指「阻截」對手，使其無法前進。引申至一般語境，指「主動地面對並試圖解決一個困難的問題或挑戰」。它強調的是一種積極、直接的介入和處理方式。例如，也可指「對付」困難局面。","definition":"1. To make vigorous and determined attempts to deal with (a problem or difficult task).; 2. To (in sports) obstruct (an opponent).","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to tackle the issue of climate change.\"