s":[],"clozeSentence":"____ and try to relax.","clozeAnswer":"Take a deep breath","exampleTranslation":"深吸一口氣，試著放鬆。","reference":{"eng":"take a deep breath","kk":"/teɪk ə diːp brɛθ/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['深吸一口氣']]","chEntries":["深吸一口氣"],"practiceMeaning":"深吸一口氣，試著放鬆。","analysis":"動詞片語。'take a deep breath' (深吸一口氣)。常在面臨壓力、緊張或需要冷靜時使用。","definition":"to inhale deeply, often to calm oneself or prepare for something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Take a deep breath and try to relax.\",\n    \"ch\": \"深吸一口氣，試著放鬆。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"深吸一口氣，試著放鬆。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4017,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u3::take-advantage-of::v-phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We should ____ this sunny weather to go hiking.","expectedAnswer":"take advantage of","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We should ____ this sunny weather to go hiking.","clozeAnswer":"take advantage of","exampleTranslation":"我們應該利用這個晴朗的天氣去爬山。","reference":{"eng":"take advantage of","kk":"/teɪk ədˈvæntɪdʒ ɒv/","tense":"v. phrase","ch":"[['利用', '佔...的便宜'], ['利用（機會）']]","chEntries":["利用","佔...的便宜"],"practiceMeaning":"我們應該利用這個晴朗的天氣去爬山。","analysis":"結合動詞 'take' (拿), 名詞 'advantage' (優勢) 和介詞 'of' (的)。表示利用某人的弱點或某個有利情況來達到自己的目的。有時帶有負面含義 (佔便宜)，有時則為中性 (利用機會)。","definition":"1. make good use of (an opportunity); 2. exploit (a situation or person) to one's own advantage.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We should take advantage of this sunny weather to go hiking.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們應該利用這個晴朗的天氣去爬山。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He took advantage of her kindness.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他佔了她善良的便宜。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們應該利用這個晴朗的天氣去爬山。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5676,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l8::take-down::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Please ____ the poster from the wall.","expectedAnswer