 \"We have had many good tenants over the years.\",\n    \"ch\": \"多年來我們有過許多好房客。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"房東負責維修，而不是租戶。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4063,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u4::tend::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Children ____ to be curious.","expectedAnswer":"tend","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Children ____ to be curious.","clozeAnswer":"tend","exampleTranslation":"孩子們往往是好奇的。","reference":{"eng":"tend","kk":"/tɛnd/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['傾向於', '往往會'], ['照料', '看護']]","chEntries":["傾向於","往往會","照料","看護"],"practiceMeaning":"孩子們往往是好奇的。","analysis":"第一個義項「傾向於」源自古法語 'tendre'，來自拉丁語 'tendere' (to stretch, to aim, to be devoted to)。核心是「伸展」、「朝向」。引申為「有某種傾向」、「常常會」。第二個義項「照料」則有不同的詞源，可能與古英語 'tēonian' (to blame, to reproach) 或 'tænan' (to nurse, to care for) 有關，強調「看護」、「照顧」的動作。","definition":"1. to be likely to behave in a particular way or have a particular characteristic or outcome; 2. to care for or look after someone or something","example":"[\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"孩子們往往是好奇的。\",\n    \"eng\": \"Children tend to be curious.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"她在人多時 tends to be quiet。\",\n    \"eng\": \"She tends to be quiet in large groups.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"他每天照料他的花園。\",\n    \"eng\": \"He tends his garden every day.\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"孩子們往往是好奇的。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4248,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u7::tent::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We pitched our ____ by the lake.","expectedAnswer":"tent","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We pitched our ____ by the lake.","clozeAnswer":"tent","exampleTranslation":"我們在湖邊搭起了帳篷。","reference":{"eng":"tent","kk":"/tɛnt/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['帳篷'], ['帳棚']]","chEntries":["帳篷","帳棚"],"practiceMeaning":"我們在湖邊搭起了帳篷。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'tendere'（伸展、展開）。'Tent' 最初指「伸展起來的結構」，後來專指用於戶外露營、保護免受天氣影響的可移動遮蔽物。詞源與「伸展」