eName":"字彙王","unitName":"U59"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5067,"wordRef":"字彙王::u59::therapy::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is undergoing radiation ____ for cancer.","expectedAnswer":"therapy","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is undergoing radiation ____ for cancer.","clozeAnswer":"therapy","exampleTranslation":"他正在接受癌症放射治療。","reference":{"eng":"therapy","kk":"ˈθɛrəpi","tense":"n.","ch":"[['治療'], ['療法'], ['（心理）諮詢']]","chEntries":["治療","療法","諮詢"],"practiceMeaning":"他正在接受癌症放射治療。","analysis":"此字源自希臘語therapeia，意為「治療、醫治」，來自therapeuein（治療、醫治）。therapy 指「用於治癒疾病或減輕疼痛、痛苦的一種方法或過程」。涵蓋範圍廣泛，包括醫學治療、心理治療（如諮詢）、物理治療等。OCR 掃描時可能將 'th' 誤判為 'f'，或 'p' 誤判為 'r'。此處修正為 therapy。","definition":"1. the treatment of disease or disorders by physical, chemical, or psychological means; 2. a course of treatment designed to help a person recover from illness or injury.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is undergoing radiation therapy for cancer.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他正在接受癌症放射治療。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Cognitive behavioral therapy is a common form of psychotherapy.\",\n    \"ch\": \"認知行為療法是一種常見的心理治療形式。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他正在接受癌症放射治療。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U59"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4599,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u11::think-highly-of::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"I ____ her intelligence and dedication.","expectedAnswer":"think highly of","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"I ____ her intelligence and dedication.","clozeAnswer":"think highly of","exampleTranslation":"我高度評價她的智慧和奉獻精神。","reference":{"eng":"think highly of","kk":"/θɪŋk ˈhaɪli əv/","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['高度評價', '非常賞識']]","chEntries":["高度評價","非常賞識"],"practiceMeaning":"我高度評價她的智慧和奉獻精神。","analysis":"此片語由 'think' (認為), 'highly' (高度地) 和 'of' (關於) 組成。 'highly' 是 'high' 的副詞形式，在此表示程度高。此片語表示對某人或某事有非常高的評價、尊敬或欣賞。","definition":"1. to have a very good opinion of someone or someth