": \"銀行家批准了這筆貸款。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is a wealthy investment banker.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是一位富有的投資銀行家。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他是一位富有的投資銀行家。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3265,"wordRef":"字彙王::u42::bankruptcy::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"____ can have long-term consequences for a person's financial future.","expectedAnswer":"Bankruptcy","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"____ can have long-term consequences for a person's financial future.","clozeAnswer":"Bankruptcy","exampleTranslation":"破產可能對個人的財務未來產生長期影響。","reference":{"eng":"bankruptcy","kk":"/ˈbæŋkrʌpsi/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['破產；倒閉']]","chEntries":["破產","倒閉"],"practiceMeaning":"破產可能對個人的財務未來產生長期影響。","analysis":"由 'bankrupt' 加上 '-cy' (狀態，性質) 後綴構成。指破產的狀態或法律程序。","definition":"the state of being bankrupt; the legal process of dealing with the debts of a person or company that cannot pay what they owe.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The firm filed for bankruptcy protection.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司申請了破產保護。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Bankruptcy can have long-term consequences for a person's financial future.\",\n    \"ch\": \"破產可能對個人的財務未來產生長期影響。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"破產可能對個人的財務未來產生長期影響。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U42"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4288,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u7::basic-necessities::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The relief efforts focused on providing ____ to the displaced families.","expectedAnswer":"basic necessities","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The relief efforts focused on providing ____ to the displaced families.","clozeAnswer":"basic necessities","exampleTranslation":"救濟工作集中為流離失所的家庭提供基本生活必需品。","reference":{"eng":"basic necessities","kk":"/ˈbeɪsɪk nəˈsɛsətiːz/","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['基本生活必需品']]","chEntries":["基本生活必需品"],"practiceMeaning":"救濟工作集中為流離失所的家庭提供基本生活必需品。","analysis":"結