behavior or character; valor.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His bravery in the face of danger was remarkable.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在危險面前的勇敢令人矚目。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The medal recognized her acts of bravery during the war.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這枚獎章表彰了她在戰爭期間的英勇行為。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這枚獎章表彰了她在戰爭期間的英勇行為。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4358,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::breast-cancer::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She is raising awareness about ____.","expectedAnswer":"breast cancer","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She is raising awareness about ____.","clozeAnswer":"breast cancer","exampleTranslation":"她正在提高人們對乳腺癌的認識。","reference":{"eng":"breast cancer","kk":"None","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['乳腺癌']]","chEntries":["乳腺癌"],"practiceMeaning":"她正在提高人們對乳腺癌的認識。","analysis":"此為片語分析。'breast' (n.) 指『乳房』。'cancer' (n.) 源自拉丁語 'cancer' (crab)，指『癌症』。兩者結合，指發生在女性（偶爾也有男性）乳腺組織的惡性腫瘤。","definition":"a type of cancer that starts in the cells of the breast","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Early detection can improve the prognosis for breast cancer.\",\n    \"ch\": \"早期發現可以改善乳腺癌的預後。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is raising awareness about breast cancer.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她正在提高人們對乳腺癌的認識。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她正在提高人們對乳腺癌的認識。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4393,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::breath::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The cold air burned his ____.","expectedAnswer":"breath","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The cold air burned his ____.","clozeAnswer":"breath","exampleTranslation":"寒冷的空氣讓他的氣息灼痛。","reference":{"eng":"breath","kk":"/brɛθ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['呼吸（的動作）'], ['氣息', '呼吸的空氣']]","chEntries":["呼吸","氣息","呼吸的空氣"],"practiceMeaning":"寒冷的空氣讓他的氣息灼痛。","analysis":"詞源自古英語 'bræth'，與 'breathe' 同源。指吸入和呼出的動作，以及呼出的氣體。注意與動詞 'breathe' (/briːð/) 的發音差異