詞 \"back\"（向後，回來）組成。\"bring\" 源自古英語 \"bringan\"，最終可追溯至原始印歐語 \\*breng-（to bring, carry，帶來，搬運）。\"back\" 則表示方向。\"bring back\" 的核心語義是「將某物或某人帶到原來的地點或回到過去的狀態」。具體語義包括：物理上的「帶回」（return something or someone）；「恢復」（restore something to its previous state）；「喚起」（recall a memory or feeling）。","definition":"1. Return something or someone to a place; 2. Restore something to its former state; 3. Cause someone to remember something; 4. Reintroduce something that was previously used or popular.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please bring back the book when you're finished.\",\n    \"ch\": \"看完書後請把它帶回來。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The new policy aims to bring back economic stability.\",\n    \"ch\": \"新政策旨在恢復經濟穩定。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The smell of the sea brought back childhood memories.\",\n    \"ch\": \"海的味道喚起了童年的回憶。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"新政策旨在恢復經濟穩定。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4472,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::bullet::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Please list your suggestions as ____ points.","expectedAnswer":"bullet","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Please list your suggestions as ____ points.","clozeAnswer":"bullet","exampleTranslation":"請將你的建議列成項目符號。","reference":{"eng":"bullet","kk":"/ˈbʊlɪt/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['子彈'], ['（列表或講稿的）項目符號']]","chEntries":["子彈","項目符號"],"practiceMeaning":"請將你的建議列成項目符號。","analysis":"源自古法語 boulette，意為「小球」。早期用於指彈藥中的圓形彈丸。後來演變成現代的子彈。引申指列表或文件中的項目標記，因其形狀常為圓點，類似小球。","definition":"1. A small metal projectile, typically cylindrical, fired from a gun; 2. A short phrase or sentence on a list.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The hunter fired a bullet at the target.\",\n    \"ch\": \"獵人朝目標射了一發子彈。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please list your suggestions as bullet points.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請將你的建議列成項目符號。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"請將你的建議列成項目符號。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4501,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::bulletin::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We received a weather ____.","expectedAnswer":"bulletin","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We received a weather ____.","clozeAnswer":"bulletin","exampleTranslation":"我們收到了一份天氣快報。","reference":{"eng":"bulletin","kk":"/ˈbʊlɪtɪn/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['公告'], ['簡報'], ['（體育比賽的）即時比分'], ['（天氣）快報']]","chEntries":["公告","簡報","即時比分","快報"],"practiceMeaning":"我們收到了一份天氣快報。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 bulla，意為「氣泡」、「印章」。後來指「密封的文件」或「官方聲明」。演變成「正式的公告」或「簡要的報告」。","definition":"1. A short statement or announcement of important news; 2. A periodical publication; 3. A brief report of current events.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The hospital issued a bulletin on the patient's condition.\",\n    \"ch\": \"醫院發布了關於病人情況的公告。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We received a weather bulletin.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們收到了一份天氣快報。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The news bulletin reported on the latest developments.\",\n    \"ch\": \"新聞簡報報導了最新的進展。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們收到了一份天氣快報。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4522,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::burden::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He felt the ____ of his responsibilities.","expectedAnswer":"burden","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He felt the ____ of his responsibilities.","clozeAnswer":"burden","exampleTranslation":"他感到自己責任的重擔。","reference":{"eng":"burden","kk":"/ˈbɜːrdn/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['負擔'], ['重擔']]","chEntries":["負擔","重擔"],"practiceMeaning":"他感到自己責任的重擔。","analysis":"源自古法語 burdon，意為「手杖」、「沉重的東西」。核心語意是「沉重物」。引申為「責任」、「憂慮」等沉重的事物。","definition":"1. A heavy load, whether literal or metaphorical; 2. A source of distress, anxiety, or oppression.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The burden of proof lies with the prosecution.\",\n    \"ch\": \"舉證責任在檢方。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He felt the burden of his responsibilities.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他感到自己責任的重擔。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他感到自己責任的重擔。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4716,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u17::bush::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He grew up in the ____, far from any city.","expectedAnswer":"bush","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He grew up in the ____, far from any city.","clozeAnswer":"bush","exampleTranslation":"他在偏遠地區長大，離任何城市都很遠。","reference":{"eng":"bush","kk":"/ˈbʊʃ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['灌木'], ['灌木叢'], ['（非正式）偏遠地區']]","chEntries":["灌木","灌木叢","偏遠地區"],"practiceMeaning":"他在偏遠地區長大，離任何城市都很遠。","analysis":"源自古英語 *busc*，與日耳曼語系其他語言詞彙同源，指較小的、多莖的、經常是低矮的木本植物。引申至形容人跡罕至、偏遠的地區，特別是澳大利亞內陸。","definition":"1. A shrub or clump of shrubs with stems of wood, trailing or growing in the form of a shrub. 2. (informal, chiefly Australian) An area of undeveloped country, especially that lying beyond the settled suburbs of a town or city.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A bird suddenly flew out of the bush.\",\n    \"ch\": \"一隻鳥突然從灌木叢中飛了出來。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He grew up in the bush, far from any city.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在偏遠地區長大，離任何城市都很遠。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他在偏遠地區長大，離任何城市都很遠。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U17"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5363,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l1::by-no-means::adv","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"This is ____ the end of the story.","expectedAnswer":"by no means","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This is ____ the end of the story.","clozeAnswer":"by no means","exampleTranslation":"這絕不是故事的結局。","reference":{"eng":"by no means","kk":"baɪ ˈnoʊ miːnz","tense":"adv.","ch":"[['絕不'], ['一點也不']]","chEntries":["絕不","一點也不"],"practiceMeaning":"這絕不是故事的結局。","analysis":"此片語由 by（藉由）+ no（沒有）+ means（方法、手段）組成。字面意思是「沒有任何方法」。其功能是加強否定語氣，表達「絕對不可能」、「絕不」的意思。與 not by any means 語意相同，用來強調否定。","definition":"not at all in any way; under no circumstances.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is by no means a perfect student.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他絕不是一個完美的學生。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is by no means the end of the story.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這絕不是故事的結局。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這絕不是故事的結局。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3204,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::cabinet::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She keeps her china in a glass-fronted ____.","expectedAnswer":"cabinet","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She keeps her china in a glass-fronted ____.","clozeAnswer":"cabinet","exampleTranslation":"她把瓷器放在一個玻璃門櫥櫃裡。","reference":{"eng":"cabinet","kk":"/ˈkæbɪnət/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['內閣'], ['櫥櫃'], ['陳列櫃'], ['（照片）相框']]","chEntries":["內閣","櫥櫃","陳列櫃","相框"],"practiceMeaning":"她把瓷器放在一個玻璃門櫥櫃裡。","analysis":"詞源來自拉丁文 'capanna' (hut) 和 'capa' (head covering)，後演變成中古法語 'cabane' (cabin)。早期指小房間或私人空間，進而引申為存放物品的櫃子，以及政治上聚集重要人物的「小房間」（內閣）。","definition":"1. a group of ministers or other senior government officials; 2. a piece of furniture with shelves or drawers for storing things; 3. a small cupboard or cabinet, especially one used for display.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The president appointed new members to the cabinet.\",\n    \"ch\": \"總統任命了新的內閣成員。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She keeps her china in a glass-fronted cabinet.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她把瓷器放在一個玻璃門櫥櫃裡。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He opened the antique cabinet to show the precious vase.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他打開古董陳列櫃，展示了那個珍貴的花瓶。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她把瓷器放在一個玻璃門櫥櫃裡。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U41"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3205,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::calorie::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She is counting her daily ____ intake.","expectedAnswer":"calorie","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She is counting her daily ____ intake.","clozeAnswer":"calorie","exampleTranslation":"她在計算她每天的卡路里攝取量。","reference":{"eng":"calorie","kk":"/ˈkæləri/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['卡路里'], ['卡']]","chEntries":["卡路里","卡"],"practiceMeaning":"她在計算她每天的卡路里攝取量。","analysis":"源自法文 'calorie'，最終來自拉丁文 'calor'，意為 'heat'。它是一種能量單位，最初定義為將一克水提升一度所需的熱量，後用於測量食物中的能量。","definition":"a unit of energy, especially the amount of heat needed to raise the temperature of one gram of water by one degree Celsius; a unit of energy produced by food when metabolized.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This chocolate bar contains 200 calories.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這塊巧克力棒含有 200 卡路里。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is counting her daily calorie intake.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她在計算她每天的卡路里攝取量。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她在計算她每天的卡路里攝取量。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U41"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5427,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l3::campaign::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The presidential ____ will intensify next month.","expectedAnswer":"campaign","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The presidential ____ will intensify next month.","clozeAnswer":"campaign","exampleTranslation":"總統競選活動將於下個月加劇。","reference":{"eng":"campaign","kk":"kæmˈpeɪn","tense":"n.","ch":"[['活動'], ['運動'], ['競選活動'], ['戰役']]","chEntries":["活動","運動","競選活動","戰役"],"practiceMeaning":"總統競選活動將於下個月加劇。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 \"campagne\"，意為\"田野\"、\"平原\"，引申為\"軍隊在田野中作戰\"，即\"戰役\"。其拉丁語詞源為 \"campania\"，意為\"平坦的土地\"，與 \"campus\" ( campo) 意為\"田野\"有關。構詞上，沒有明顯的字首、字根或字尾可拆解，應視為一個整體詞源的演變。原始語義是指在開闊的場地進行軍事行動。後來引申至政治上的「競選活動」，以及為了達成特定目標而組織的、有時限的「活動」或「運動」，如環保運動、公益活動等。","definition":"an organized course of action to achieve a particular goal; a series of coordinated activities designed to achieve a particular objective; a political campaign; a military operation.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The environmental campaign aims to reduce plastic waste.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個環保運動旨在減少塑膠廢棄物。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The presidential campaign will intensify next month.\",\n    \"ch\": \"總統競選活動將於下個月加劇。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The troops prepared for a new campaign in the north.\",\n    \"ch\": \"部隊準備在北方展開新的戰役。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"總統競選活動將於下個月加劇。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3209,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::cargo::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Smugglers were caught with illegal ____.","expectedAnswer":"cargo","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Smugglers were caught with illegal ____.","clozeAnswer":"cargo","exampleTranslation":"走私者被抓獲時攜帶了非法貨物。","reference":{"eng":"cargo","kk":"/ˈkɑːrɡoʊ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['貨物'], ['載貨']]","chEntries":["貨物","載貨"],"practiceMeaning":"走私者被抓獲時攜帶了非法貨物。","analysis":"詞源來自西班牙文 'cargo'，意為 'load, burden'，來自拉丁文 'carricare'，意為 'to load a cart'。指船、飛機、火車等運輸工具所載的貨物。","definition":"goods carried on a ship, aircraft, or vehicle.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The ship is carrying a large cargo of grain.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這艘船載有大量穀物貨物。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Smugglers were caught with illegal cargo.\",\n    \"ch\": \"走私者被抓獲時攜帶了非法貨物。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"走私者被抓獲時攜帶了非法貨物。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U41"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5121,"wordRef":"字彙王::u62::carnival::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Children enjoyed the rides at the ____.","expectedAnswer":"carnival","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Children enjoyed the rides at the ____.","clozeAnswer":"carnival","exampleTranslation":"孩子們在遊樂場裡玩得很開心。","reference":{"eng":"carnival","kk":"ˈkɑːrnəvl","tense":"n.","ch":"[['嘉年華'], ['狂歡節'], ['（臨時）遊樂場']]","chEntries":["嘉年華","狂歡節","遊樂場"],"practiceMeaning":"孩子們在遊樂場裡玩得很開心。","analysis":"此字源自中古法語 carnavale，意為「告別肉類」。詞源可追溯至中世紀拉丁語 carnis levale，即「取消肉類」的意思，與基督教的四旬齋（Lent）前的慶祝活動有關。核心語意為「節日、慶典」，尤指節日期間的熱鬧、歡樂活動，包括遊行、表演、娛樂等。","definition":"a public festival, especially one held outdoors with amusements, processions, and music; a period of celebration, often before Lent.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The city holds a vibrant carnival every year.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這座城市每年都會舉辦熱鬧的嘉年華。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Children enjoyed the rides at the carnival.\",\n    \"ch\": \"孩子們在遊樂場裡玩得很開心。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"孩子們在遊樂場裡玩得很開心。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U62"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4371,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::cast-a-shadow-on::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"His illness ____ their otherwise happy holiday.","expectedAnswer":"cast a shadow on","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"His illness ____ their otherwise happy holiday.","clozeAnswer":"cast a shadow on","exampleTranslation":"他的生病給本來愉快的假期蒙上了一層陰影。","reference":{"eng":"cast a shadow on","kk":"None","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['對…蒙上陰影；損害…的聲譽']]","chEntries":["對…蒙上陰影","損害…的聲譽"],"practiceMeaning":"他的生病給本來愉快的假期蒙上了一層陰影。","analysis":"此為片語分析。'cast' (v.) 指『投射』。'a shadow' (n.) 指『一個陰影』。'on' (prep.) 指『在…上』。這個片語是一個比喻，指某事或某人對另一個事物、情況或聲譽產生了負面、不好的影響，使其變得不那麼美好或受人質疑。","definition":"to have a bad effect on something, or to make something seem less good or happy","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The scandal cast a shadow on the company's reputation.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這起醜聞損害了公司的聲譽。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His illness cast a shadow on their otherwise happy holiday.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的生病給本來愉快的假期蒙上了一層陰影。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他的生病給本來愉快的假期蒙上了一層陰影。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3268,"wordRef":"字彙王::u42::catalogue::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We need to ____ all the books in the archive.","expectedAnswer":"catalogue","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We need to ____ all the books in the archive.","clozeAnswer":"catalogue","exampleTranslation":"我們需要將檔案館裡所有的書籍編入目錄。","reference":{"eng":"catalogue","kk":"/ˈkætəlɔːɡ/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['將...編入目錄'], ['將...分類記載']]","chEntries":["將...編入目錄","將...分類記載"],"practiceMeaning":"我們需要將檔案館裡所有的書籍編入目錄。","analysis":"動詞形式，指將物品或資訊系統地記錄或編入目錄。與名詞的「目錄」概念相符。","definition":"to make a list of (items) in a systematic way.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The museum is cataloguing its new acquisitions.\",\n    \"ch\": \"博物館正在為其新購藏品編目。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to catalogue all the books in the archive.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要將檔案館裡所有的書籍編入目錄。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們需要將檔案館裡所有的書籍編入目錄。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U42"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4325,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::cattle::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"There are many heads of ____ on the ranch.","expectedAnswer":"cattle","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"There are many heads of ____ on the ranch.","clozeAnswer":"cattle","exampleTranslation":"牧場裡有很多頭牛。","reference":{"eng":"cattle","kk":"/ˈkætl/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['牛（總稱，不可數）']]","chEntries":["牛"],"practiceMeaning":"牧場裡有很多頭牛。","analysis":"源自古英語 'catol'，與古諾爾斯語 'kötull' 同源，但其詞源較不確定。這個詞用於統稱牛，特別是指牛群，無論是公牛、母牛還是小牛。它是一個集合名詞，通常用作不可數名詞，與單數名詞 'cow' 或 'ox' 不同，涵蓋了整個類別。","definition":"cows and bulls, considered together as farm animals","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The farmer herds his cattle into the stable.\",\n    \"ch\": \"農夫將他的牛群趕進牛棚。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There are many heads of cattle on the ranch.\",\n    \"ch\": \"牧場裡有很多頭牛。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The price of cattle has increased.\",\n    \"ch\": \"牛的價格上漲了。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"牧場裡有很多頭牛。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5286,"wordRef":"字彙王::u63::certainty::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ of her victory was never in doubt.","expectedAnswer":"certainty","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ of her victory was never in doubt.","clozeAnswer":"certainty","exampleTranslation":"她獲勝是確定的，毫無疑問。","reference":{"eng":"certainty","kk":"ˈsɜːrtənti","tense":"n.","ch":"[['確定', '無疑'], ['確定的事物', '必然發生的事']]","chEntries":["確定","無疑","確定的事物","必然發生的事"],"practiceMeaning":"她獲勝是確定的，毫無疑問。","analysis":"此字由形容詞 'certain' 加上抽象名詞後綴 '-ty' 構成。'certain' 源自拉丁語 'certus'（確定的，來自 'cernere'，意為「分辨、確定」）。'certainty' 的核心語意是「確定性」、「無可懷疑的狀態」。它可以指一種心理狀態（確信），也可以指客觀的事實（確定之事）。","definition":"the state of being free from doubt; something that is sure to happen or be the case.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There is no certainty that he will come.\",\n    \"ch\": \"不能確定他是否會來。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The certainty of her victory was never in doubt.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她獲勝是確定的，毫無疑問。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她獲勝是確定的，毫無疑問。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U63"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5620,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l7::certificate::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She needs to present her birth ____.","expectedAnswer":"certificate","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She needs to present her birth ____.","clozeAnswer":"certificate","exampleTranslation":"她需要出示她的出生證明。","reference":{"eng":"certificate","kk":"sərˈtɪfɪkət","tense":"n.","ch":"[['證書'], ['證明書']]","chEntries":["證書","證明書"],"practiceMeaning":"她需要出示她的出生證明。","analysis":"此字源自中世紀拉丁語 'certificatum'，意為「證明」，由 'certus'（確定的）和 'facere'（做）組成，'certus' 本身源自 'cernere'（分辨）。構詞學上，'cert-' 是「確定的」、「真實的」的詞根，'-i-' 是連接母音，'fic-'（來自 'facere'）是「做」、「使」的詞根，'-ate' 是動詞化後綴，'-um' 標示中性名詞。'certificare' 意為「使確定」，'certificatum' 則指「被證明的事物」。因此，'certificate' 指「用以證明某事或某人資格的文件」。","definition":"1. A document confirming the fact of something; 2. A qualification awarded for successfully completing a course of study or examination.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He received a certificate of completion for the course.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他收到了課程的結業證書。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She needs to present her birth certificate.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她需要出示她的出生證明。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她需要出示她的出生證明。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4226,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::change::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Do you have ____ for a dollar?","expectedAnswer":"change","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Do you have ____ for a dollar?","clozeAnswer":"change","exampleTranslation":"你有零錢換一美元嗎？","reference":{"eng":"change","kk":"/tʃeɪndʒ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['變化；變更'], ['零錢'], ['（一次）交換']]","chEntries":["變化","變更","零錢","交換"],"practiceMeaning":"你有零錢換一美元嗎？","analysis":"源自古法語 changier，意為“改變”，來自拉丁語 cambiare（交換，改變）。核心是“從一種狀態轉變為另一種狀態”。1. “變化；變更”指事物狀態、性質、形式等的改變。2. “零錢”是指貨幣面額較小的部分。3. “交換”指兩方之間互換物品或資訊。","definition":"1. the act or instance of making or becoming different; 2. coins, as opposed to banknotes; 3. an act of giving one thing and receiving another in return.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There have been dramatic changes in technology.\",\n    \"ch\": \"科技發生了戲劇性的變化。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Do you have change for a dollar?\",\n    \"ch\": \"你有零錢換一美元嗎？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We made a change to the original plan.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們對原計劃進行了修改。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"你有零錢換一美元嗎？","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4733,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u17::chaos::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"After the earthquake, the city was in a state of ____.","expectedAnswer":"chaos","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"After the earthquake, the city was in a state of ____.","clozeAnswer":"chaos","exampleTranslation":"地震後，這座城市一片混亂。","reference":{"eng":"chaos","kk":"/ˈkeɪɑs/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['混亂'], ['無秩序']]","chEntries":["混亂","無秩序"],"practiceMeaning":"地震後，這座城市一片混亂。","analysis":"源自希臘語 *khaos*，原指宇宙創生前一片混亂、無序的狀態。核心是完全的無秩序、雜亂無章。","definition":"1. Complete disorder and confusion.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The stock market crash plunged the economy into chaos.\",\n    \"ch\": \"股市崩潰使經濟陷入混亂。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"After the earthquake, the city was in a state of chaos.\",\n    \"ch\": \"地震後，這座城市一片混亂。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"地震後，這座城市一片混亂。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、字彙王、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U17、U63、L7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5288,"wordRef":"字彙王::u63::chapel::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"There is a small ____ in the hospital for patients and visitors.","expectedAnswer":"chapel","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"There is a small ____ in the hospital for patients and visitors.","clozeAnswer":"chapel","exampleTranslation":"醫院裡有一個小禮拜堂，供病人和訪客使用。","reference":{"eng":"chapel","kk":"ˈtʃæpəl","tense":"n.","ch":"[['小教堂', '禮拜堂'], ['（尤指附屬於較大建築物的）禮拜堂', '（某些組織或團體的）祈禱室']]","chEntries":["小教堂","禮拜堂","祈禱室"],"practiceMeaning":"醫院裡有一個小禮拜堂，供病人和訪客使用。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 'chapele'，意為「斗篷，後來指聖馬丁的斗篷，再後來指存放聖物的聖殿」。'chapele' 又來自中古拉丁語 'cappella'，指「聖馬丁的斗篷」或「關於斗篷的小教堂」。'cappella' 本身是 'cappa'（斗篷）的小型化。核心語意從「與聖物相關的場所」演變為「小型的宗教場所」。","definition":"a small church or a room used for private worship, especially in a large institution such as a school, prison, or hospital.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The wedding ceremony will be held in the college chapel.\",\n    \"ch\": \"婚禮將在學院的禮拜堂舉行。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There is a small chapel in the hospital for patients and visitors.\",\n    \"ch\": \"醫院裡有一個小禮拜堂，供病人和訪客使用。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"醫院裡有一個小禮拜堂，供病人和訪客使用。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U63"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3272,"wordRef":"字彙王::u42::chemical::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The spill involved a hazardous ____ substance.","expectedAnswer":"chemical","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The spill involved a hazardous ____ substance.","clozeAnswer":"chemical","exampleTranslation":"洩漏涉及一種危險的化學物質。","reference":{"eng":"chemical","kk":"/ˈkɛmɪkl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['化學的；化學上的']]","chEntries":["化學的","化學上的"],"practiceMeaning":"洩漏涉及一種危險的化學物質。","analysis":"由 'chemistry' 加上 '-al' (形容詞後綴) 構成。指與化學有關的。","definition":"relating to or concerning chemistry.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They are studying the chemical composition of the new compound.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們正在研究新化合物的化學成分。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The spill involved a hazardous chemical substance.\",\n    \"ch\": \"洩漏涉及一種危險的化學物質。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"洩漏涉及一種危險的化學物質。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U42"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3271,"wordRef":"字彙王::u42::chemistry::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"There was an instant ____ between the two actors.","expectedAnswer":"chemistry","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"There was an instant ____ between the two actors.","clozeAnswer":"chemistry","exampleTranslation":"這兩位演員之間有立即的來電。","reference":{"eng":"chemistry","kk":"/ˈkɛmɪstri/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['化學；化學作用'], ['（人際關係中的）來電；契合度']]","chEntries":["化學","化學作用","來電","契合度"],"practiceMeaning":"這兩位演員之間有立即的來電。","analysis":"源自中世紀拉丁語 'chymia'，最終可能來自希臘語 'khemia' (埃及的術法)。最初指煉金術，後發展為研究物質組成、結構、性質及其變化的科學。引申義指人與人之間或事物之間的良好互動與契合。","definition":"1. the scientific study of the structure of substances, their properties, and how they react with other substances; 2. a quality of understanding and liking between two people.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is majoring in chemistry at university.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在大學主修化學。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There was an instant chemistry between the two actors.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這兩位演員之間有立即的來電。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這兩位演員之間有立即的來電。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U42"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4091,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u4::civil-rights::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Protecting ____ is a government's duty.","expectedAnswer":"civil rights","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Protecting ____ is a government's duty.","clozeAnswer":"civil rights","exampleTranslation":"保護公民權利是政府的職責。","reference":{"eng":"civil rights","kk":"/ˈsɪvəl raɪts/","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['公民權利']]","chEntries":["公民權利"],"practiceMeaning":"保護公民權利是政府的職責。","analysis":"'Civil' (公民的) 源自拉丁語 'civilis' (of a citizen)。'Rights' (權利) 源自古法語 'droiture' (justice, right)。'Civil rights' 指公民在法律上應享有的基本權利，例如不受歧視和壓迫的權利。","definition":"the rights that citizens are entitled to by law, especially the right to be treated equally","example":"[\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"該運動為所有人爭取公民權利。\",\n    \"eng\": \"The movement fought for civil rights for all people.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"保護公民權利是政府的職責。\",\n    \"eng\": \"Protecting civil rights is a government's duty.\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"保護公民權利是政府的職責。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5330,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l1::claim::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"You can ____ compensation for your losses.","expectedAnswer":"claim","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"You can ____ compensation for your losses.","clozeAnswer":"claim","exampleTranslation":"你可以要求賠償你的損失。","reference":{"eng":"claim","kk":"kleɪm","tense":"v.","ch":"[['聲稱'], ['要求'], ['主張'], ['領取']]","chEntries":["聲稱","要求","主張","領取"],"practiceMeaning":"你可以要求賠償你的損失。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 clamer，來自拉丁語 clamare（喊叫、請求），再追溯至原始印歐語 *kelh₂-（呼喊、召喚）。構詞上，clam- 是字根，表示「呼喊」或「大聲說」。原始語意為「呼喊以求」或「大聲宣告」。現代語意發展為「對某事物提出權利主張」、「要求」或「聲稱擁有」。當動詞使用時，指「聲稱」、「要求」或「主張」的行為。","definition":"to state that something is true, even though it has not been proved; to demand something as one's right.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He claims to be the best chef in town.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他聲稱是鎮上最好的廚師。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"You can claim compensation for your losses.\",\n    \"ch\": \"你可以要求賠償你的損失。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"你可以要求賠償你的損失。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6067,"wordRef":"字彙王::u64::clarity::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ of the water allowed us to see the fish.","expectedAnswer":"clarity","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ of the water allowed us to see the fish.","clozeAnswer":"clarity","exampleTranslation":"水的清澈度使我們能夠看到魚。","reference":{"eng":"clarity","kk":"ˈklærəti","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"清晰\"  ],  [    \"清楚\"  ],  [    \"明晰\"  ],  [    \"透明\"  ]]","chEntries":["清晰","清楚","明晰","透明"],"practiceMeaning":"水的清澈度使我們能夠看到魚。","analysis":"此字由 clear（清晰的）加上名詞後綴 -ity（表示狀態或性質）構成。Clear 源自古法語 cler，來自拉丁語 clarus（clear, bright, famous）。Clarus 最終來源於 proto-Indo-European *kelh₂-「呼喚，聲音」，引申為「響亮的，清晰的」。Clarity 的核心語義是「清晰的狀態或性質」。它可以用來描述聲音、視覺、理解、表達或物質的清晰度。","definition":"1. the quality of being clear and easy to understand; 2. the quality of being easy to see or hear; 3. the quality of being transparent.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The clarity of his explanation was remarkable.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他解釋的清晰度令人矚目。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The clarity of the water allowed us to see the fish.\",\n    \"ch\": \"水的清澈度使我們能夠看到魚。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please speak with more clarity.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請講得更清楚些。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"水的清澈度使我們能夠看到魚。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U64"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5585,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l6::classical::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"____ physics provides a framework for understanding motion.","expectedAnswer":"Classical","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"____ physics provides a framework for understanding motion.","clozeAnswer":"Classical","exampleTranslation":"古典物理學為理解運動提供了框架。","reference":{"eng":"classical","kk":"ˈklæsɪkl","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['古典的'], ['經典的'], ['正規的'], ['傳統的']]","chEntries":["古典的","經典的","正規的","傳統的"],"practiceMeaning":"古典物理學為理解運動提供了框架。","analysis":"此字是 \"classic\" 的形容詞形式，加上形容詞字尾 \"-al\"。 \"classic\" 源自拉丁語 \"classicus\"，意為 \"of or belonging to the highest class, first-class\"（屬於最高級別的，一流的）。\"-al\" 是常見的形容詞字尾。\"classical\" 主要有兩層核心語義：一是指「古希臘羅馬時期」的，例如 \"classical literature\"、\"classical music\"；二是與 \"classic\" 相似，指「傳統的、正規的、代表性的」，與「現代的」或「非正規的」相對，例如 \"classical economics\"、\"classical ballet\"。","definition":"1. Relating to or belonging to the ancient Greek or Roman tradition, especially in art or literature; 2. Traditionally or typically, rather than modern or experimental; 3. Relating to or characteristic of the formal or artistic traditions of the past.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She studied classical music at university.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她在大學學習古典音樂。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Classical physics provides a framework for understanding motion.\",\n    \"ch\": \"古典物理學為理解運動提供了框架。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Classical ballet requires years of rigorous training.\",\n    \"ch\": \"古典芭蕾需要多年的嚴格訓練。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"古典物理學為理解運動提供了框架。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5456,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l3::clear-out::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The police told the crowd to ____.","expectedAnswer":"clear out","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The police told the crowd to ____.","clozeAnswer":"clear out","exampleTranslation":"警方要求人群散開。","reference":{"eng":"clear out","kk":"ˈklɪər aʊt","tense":"v.","ch":"[['清理'], ['清除'], ['搬空'], ['離去']]","chEntries":["清理","清除","搬空","離去"],"practiceMeaning":"警方要求人群散開。","analysis":"此片語由形容詞 \"clear\" (清晰的、乾淨的) 和介詞 \"out\" (出去、外面) 組成。\"clear\" 源自拉丁語 \"clarus\"。在此作為動詞，\"clear out\" 表示「將某處徹底清理乾淨，移走所有不需要的東西」，或是「使某處騰空」，引申為「迅速離開」。","definition":"to remove everything from a place; to make a place empty by removing its contents; to leave a place quickly.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to clear out the garage before winter.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要在冬天來臨前清理車庫。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The police told the crowd to clear out.\",\n    \"ch\": \"警方要求人群散開。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They had to clear out their old apartment before moving.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們搬家前必須清空舊公寓。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"警方要求人群散開。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6116,"wordRef":"字彙王::u65::cocaine::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"____ addiction is a serious problem.","expectedAnswer":"Cocaine","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"____ addiction is a serious problem.","clozeAnswer":"Cocaine","exampleTranslation":"古柯鹼成癮是一個嚴重的問題。","reference":{"eng":"cocaine","kk":"koʊˈkeɪn","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"古柯鹼\"  ],  [    \"可卡因\"  ]]","chEntries":["古柯鹼","可卡因"],"practiceMeaning":"古柯鹼成癮是一個嚴重的問題。","analysis":"此字源自西班牙語 coca，指南美洲的一種植物，加上後綴 -ine，用以表示化學物質。Coca 源自蓋丘亞語 kuka。Cocaine 是從古柯樹葉提取的一種興奮劑和局部麻醉劑。此名詞指這種特定的化學物質。其語意演變是從植物名到從植物中提取的物質名。","definition":"A powerful illegal stimulant drug, derived from the coca plant.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The smugglers were caught with a large amount of cocaine.\",\n    \"ch\": \"走私者被抓到時攜帶了大量古柯鹼。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Cocaine addiction is a serious problem.\",\n    \"ch\": \"古柯鹼成癮是一個嚴重的問題。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"古柯鹼成癮是一個嚴重的問題。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U65"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6162,"wordRef":"字彙王::u66::collective::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The farm operated as a ____.","expectedAnswer":"collective","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The farm operated as a ____.","clozeAnswer":"collective","exampleTranslation":"這個農場作為一個合作社運營。","reference":{"eng":"collective","kk":"kəˈlɛktɪv","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"集體\"  ],  [    \"組織\"  ],  [    \"合作社\"  ]]","chEntries":["集體","組織","合作社"],"practiceMeaning":"這個農場作為一個合作社運營。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 collectīvus，是動詞 colligere「收集、聚集」的衍生形容詞。colligere 由 com- (together) + legere (to gather) 組成。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根，但 com-「一起」和 legere「收集」是其核心語意來源。作為名詞，其核心語義是「一個由多個個體組成的團體，共同行動或共享」。詞源中的「一起收集」概念引申為「聚集在一起的群體」。此義項由形容詞「集體的」名詞化而來。","definition":"1. a group of people or things functioning as a single unit; 2. a cooperative association.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The workers formed a collective to improve their conditions.\",\n    \"ch\": \"工人們組成了一個集體來改善他們的處境。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The farm operated as a collective.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個農場作為一個合作社運營。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The artist collective displayed their latest works.\",\n    \"ch\": \"藝術家集體展示了他們最新的作品。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They are part of a writers' collective.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們是一個作家團體的成員。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這個農場作為一個合作社運營。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U66"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4555,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u11::colony::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The petri dish contained a ____ of bacteria.","expectedAnswer":"colony","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The petri dish contained a ____ of bacteria.","clozeAnswer":"colony","exampleTranslation":"培養皿裡有一團細菌菌落。","reference":{"eng":"colony","kk":"/ˈkɒləni/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['殖民地'], ['（細菌、細胞等的）菌落，培養物'], ['（植物、動物的）群落，棲息地']]","chEntries":["殖民地","菌落，培養物","群落，棲息地"],"practiceMeaning":"培養皿裡有一團細菌菌落。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'colonia'，意為 'settlement, possession' (定居點、領地)。\n    1. 殖民地：指由一國人民在異國建立並由其管轄的地區。\n    2. 菌落、培養物：指在培養基上生長繁殖的一群微生物。\n    3. 群落、棲息地：指一群同種動植物聚集在一起的生活區域。","definition":"1. a country or area under the full or partial political control of another country, typically a distant one, and occupied by settlers from that country.; 2. a group of people of one nationality or ethnic group living in a particular country or city.; 3. a mass of microorganisms, such as bacteria or yeast, grown in or on a solid culture medium.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"India was once a British colony.\",\n    \"ch\": \"印度曾是英國的殖民地。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The petri dish contained a colony of bacteria.\",\n    \"ch\": \"培養皿裡有一團細菌菌落。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Penguins live in large colonies on the coast.\",\n    \"ch\": \"企鵝棲息在海岸的大群落中。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"培養皿裡有一團細菌菌落。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U11"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3979,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u3::column::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He writes a weekly ____ on finance.","expectedAnswer":"column","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He writes a weekly ____ on finance.","clozeAnswer":"column","exampleTranslation":"他寫一篇關於金融的每週專欄。","reference":{"eng":"column","kk":"/ˈkɒləm/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['圓柱', '柱子'], ['專欄'], ['（隊伍、行列中的）縱隊', '一欄']]","chEntries":["圓柱","柱子","專欄","縱隊","一欄"],"practiceMeaning":"他寫一篇關於金融的每週專欄。","analysis":"詞源：拉丁文 'columna' (柱子)。核心意義是垂直的、支撐結構。引申為報紙或雜誌中固定由一人撰寫的定期文章 (專欄)，以及表格或列表中的垂直部分 (一欄)。","definition":"1. a vertical architectural support of stone, typically cylindrical or rectangular in cross section; 2. a regular feature in a newspaper or magazine, typically one expressing the writer's opinions or discussing a particular subject; 3. a vertical section of a table or spreadsheet.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The ancient temple had many marble columns.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這座古廟有許多大理石柱子。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He writes a weekly column on finance.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他寫一篇關於金融的每週專欄。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please enter your name in the first column.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請在第一欄輸入您的名字。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他寫一篇關於金融的每週專欄。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6211,"wordRef":"字彙王::u67::columnist::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She is a renowned food ____ for a popular magazine.","expectedAnswer":"columnist","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She is a renowned food ____ for a popular magazine.","clozeAnswer":"columnist","exampleTranslation":"她是某本受歡迎雜誌的著名美食專欄作家。","reference":{"eng":"columnist","kk":"ˈkɒləmɪst","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"專欄作家\"  ],  [    \"專欄作者\"  ]]","chEntries":["專欄作家","專欄作者"],"practiceMeaning":"她是某本受歡迎雜誌的著名美食專欄作家。","analysis":"此字由名詞 column（專欄）加上字尾 -ist（表示人或從事某種職業的人）構成。column 源自拉丁語 columna，意為「柱子，石柱」，引申為報紙或雜誌的「專欄」。字尾 -ist 標示從事該事物的個人。因此，columnist 指在報紙、雜誌或網站上定期撰寫專欄文章的人。中文翻譯為「專欄作家；專欄作者」。","definition":"a person who writes a regular column for a newspaper, magazine, or website.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The newspaper hired a new political columnist.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家報紙聘請了一位新的政治專欄作家。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is a renowned food columnist for a popular magazine.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她是某本受歡迎雜誌的著名美食專欄作家。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The columnist offered his opinion on the latest event.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位專欄作家就最新事件發表了他的看法。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她是某本受歡迎雜誌的著名美食專欄作家。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U67"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5630,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l7::come-to-a-standstill::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The peace talks have ____.","expectedAnswer":"come to a standstill","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The peace talks have ____.","clozeAnswer":"come to a standstill","exampleTranslation":"和平談判已經停滯不前。","reference":{"eng":"come to a standstill","kk":"kʌm tu ə ˈstændˌstɪl","tense":"v.","ch":"[['停滯不前'], ['停止'], ['停頓']]","chEntries":["停滯不前","停止","停頓"],"practiceMeaning":"和平談判已經停滯不前。","analysis":"此片語由動詞 'come'（來），介詞 'to'（到），不定冠詞 'a' 和名詞 'standstill'（停止的狀態）組成。'come' 源自古英語 'cuman'；'to' 源自古英語 'tō'；'a' 源自古英語 'ān'；'standstill' 是一個複合詞，由 'stand'（站立）和 'still'（靜止）組成。構詞學上，'standstill' 指「一種站立著不動的狀態」。整個片語 'come to a standstill' 的語意是指「運動或進展被完全停止，達到了靜止的狀態」。","definition":"To stop moving or happening.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Traffic came to a standstill due to the accident.\",\n    \"ch\": \"由於事故，交通完全停滯了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The peace talks have come to a standstill.\",\n    \"ch\": \"和平談判已經停滯不前。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"和平談判已經停滯不前。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5830,"wordRef":"字彙王::u58::comedian::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He dreams of becoming a famous ____.","expectedAnswer":"comedian","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He dreams of becoming a famous ____.","clozeAnswer":"comedian","exampleTranslation":"他夢想成為一位著名的喜劇演員。","reference":{"eng":"comedian","kk":"kəˈmiːdiən","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"喜劇演員\"  ],  [    \"演員\"  ],  [    \"喜劇演員\"  ]]","chEntries":["喜劇演員","演員"],"practiceMeaning":"他夢想成為一位著名的喜劇演員。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'comoedus' (actor in comedy)，該字又源自希臘語 'kōmōidos' (comic actor)，由 'kōmos' (revel, merry procession) 和 'aeidein' (to sing) 構成。'Kōmos' 最初指古代希臘酒神祭祀中的遊行隊伍，後來演變成「喜劇」。'-ian' 是常見的職業或身分字尾，表示「從事……的人」。因此，'comedian' 指「從事喜劇表演的人」，即「喜劇演員」。","definition":"1. A person who tells jokes and makes people laugh as a profession.; 2. An actor in a comedy.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The comedian told a series of hilarious jokes.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位喜劇演員講了一系列搞笑的笑話。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He dreams of becoming a famous comedian.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他夢想成為一位著名的喜劇演員。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The show featured several popular comedians.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該節目邀請了幾位受歡迎的喜劇演員。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他夢想成為一位著名的喜劇演員。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U58"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5512,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l5::compassionate::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The nurse offered ____ care to the patients.","expectedAnswer":"compassionate","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The nurse offered ____ care to the patients.","clozeAnswer":"compassionate","exampleTranslation":"護士對病患提供了充滿關懷的照顧。","reference":{"eng":"compassionate","kk":"kəmˈpæʃənət","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['富同情心的'], ['憐憫的'], ['慈悲的']]","chEntries":["富同情心的","憐憫的","慈悲的"],"practiceMeaning":"護士對病患提供了充滿關懷的照顧。","analysis":"此字由名詞 'compassion' 加上形容詞字尾 '-ate' 構成。'-ate' 是拉丁語來源的字尾，常用於形成形容詞，表示『具有……性質』。'compassion' 源自拉丁語 'compassio'，由 'com-' (together) + 'passio' (suffering) 構成，意為「共同感受痛苦」。因此，'compassionate' 的構詞結構清晰地表明其核心語意為「具有共同感受痛苦的能力」，即「富同情心的」。語意上，它描述了一種能體諒他人苦難並願意施予幫助的情感特質。","definition":"feeling or showing sympathy and concern for others.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He was a kind and compassionate leader.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是一位善良且富有同情心的領導者。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The nurse offered compassionate care to the patients.\",\n    \"ch\": \"護士對病患提供了充滿關懷的照顧。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"護士對病患提供了充滿關懷的照顧。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4490,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::compete::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She will ____ in the Olympic Games.","expectedAnswer":"compete","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She will ____ in the Olympic Games.","clozeAnswer":"compete","exampleTranslation":"她將參加奧運會比賽。","reference":{"eng":"compete","kk":"/kəmˈpiːt/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['競爭'], ['比賽'], ['爭奪']]","chEntries":["競爭","比賽","爭奪"],"practiceMeaning":"她將參加奧運會比賽。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 competere，意為「共同尋求」、「達到」。com- (一起) + petere (尋求)。核心語意是「一起尋求某樣東西（通常是勝利或領先）」。引申為「競爭」、「比賽」。","definition":"1. To strive to win by being the best or by doing better than others; 2. To take part in a contest or competition.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The two companies compete for market share.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這兩家公司爭奪市場份額。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She will compete in the Olympic Games.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她將參加奧運會比賽。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她將參加奧運會比賽。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5034,"wordRef":"字彙王::u59::competent::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The team produced a ____ performance.","expectedAnswer":"competent","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The team produced a ____ performance.","clozeAnswer":"competent","exampleTranslation":"該團隊的表現稱職。","reference":{"eng":"competent","kk":"ˈkɑːmpɪtənt","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['有能力的'], ['稱職的'], ['勝任的']]","chEntries":["有能力的","稱職的","勝任的"],"practiceMeaning":"該團隊的表現稱職。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語competentem（有資格的、夠格的），是動詞 competere 的現在分詞。competere 由 com-（共同、一起）+ petere（尋求、爭取、達到）組成，原意為「共同努力以達成目標」、「相等、適合」。competent 形容詞意指「有足夠能力或資格做某事」，強調的是具備完成任務所需的技能、知識和素質。此形容詞與名詞 competence 緊密相關。","definition":"1. having the necessary ability, knowledge, or skill to do something successfully; 2. sufficient; adequate.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is a competent programmer.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是一位稱職的程式設計師。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The team produced a competent performance.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該團隊的表現稱職。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"該團隊的表現稱職。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U59"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4123,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::confirm::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Please ____ your reservation by phone.","expectedAnswer":"confirm","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Please ____ your reservation by phone.","clozeAnswer":"confirm","exampleTranslation":"請打電話確認您的預訂。","reference":{"eng":"confirm","kk":"/kənˈfɜːrm/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['證實', '確認'], ['批准', '認可']]","chEntries":["證實","確認","批准","認可"],"practiceMeaning":"請打電話確認您的預訂。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 confirmare，由 com-（完全）+ firmare（使堅固）組成。核心概念是「使更加堅定」、「確認無誤」。引申為通過證據或聲明來證實某事，或對某事給予正式批准。","definition":"1. establish the truth or correctness of (something previously believed or suspected); 2. make firm or valid; 3. officially approve or ratify","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The report confirmed our suspicions.\",\n    \"ch\": \"報告證實了我們的懷疑。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please confirm your reservation by phone.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請打電話確認您的預訂。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The appointment was confirmed yesterday.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個任命昨天被確認了。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"請打電話確認您的預訂。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4339,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::confuse::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Don't ____ the issue with irrelevant details.","expectedAnswer":"confuse","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Don't ____ the issue with irrelevant details.","clozeAnswer":"confuse","exampleTranslation":"不要用無關的細節來混淆問題。","reference":{"eng":"confuse","kk":"/kənˈfjuːz/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['使混亂；使困惑'], ['混淆；弄錯']]","chEntries":["使混亂","使困惑","混淆","弄錯"],"practiceMeaning":"不要用無關的細節來混淆問題。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'confundere'，意為 'to pour together, mix up, confuse'，由 'con-' (together) 和 'fundere' (to pour) 構成。字面意思是『一起倒入』，引申為『攪混』，使事物界線不清。1. 指使人『感到混亂、困惑』，無法理解。2. 指將兩種或多種事物『混淆、弄錯』，難以分辨。","definition":"to make someone confused; to mix up two or more things","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The instructions were too complicated and confused me.\",\n    \"ch\": \"說明太複雜了，把我弄糊塗了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Don't confuse the issue with irrelevant details.\",\n    \"ch\": \"不要用無關的細節來混淆問題。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She confused the twins because they look so alike.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她弄錯了這對雙胞胎，因為他們長得很像。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"不要用無關的細節來混淆問題。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4317,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::conscious::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The patient remained ____ throughout the operation.","expectedAnswer":"conscious","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The patient remained ____ throughout the operation.","clozeAnswer":"conscious","exampleTranslation":"病人在手術全程都保持清醒。","reference":{"eng":"conscious","kk":"/ˈkɒnʃəs/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['意識到的；察覺到的'], ['有意識的；清醒的'], ['故意的；蓄意的']]","chEntries":["意識到的","察覺到的","有意識的","清醒的","故意的","蓄意的"],"practiceMeaning":"病人在手術全程都保持清醒。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'conscius'，意為 'sharing knowledge, aware'，由 'con-' (with) 和 'scire' (to know) 構成。字面意思是『一起知道』，引申為『知道某事』、『意識到』。因此，第一個義項是『知道、察覺』。第二個義項是『有知覺、清醒』，與『失去意識』相對。第三個義項是『明知故犯』，強調『有意識地做』。","definition":"aware of something; awake and able to understand what is happening around you; done deliberately","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Are you conscious of the danger?\",\n    \"ch\": \"你意識到危險了嗎？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The patient remained conscious throughout the operation.\",\n    \"ch\": \"病人在手術全程都保持清醒。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It was a conscious effort to improve his grades.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是為了提高他成績而付出的有意識的努力。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"病人在手術全程都保持清醒。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5527,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l5::convince::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The evidence was enough to ____ the jury.","expectedAnswer":"convince","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The evidence was enough to ____ the jury.","clozeAnswer":"convince","exampleTranslation":"證據足以讓陪審團信服。","reference":{"eng":"convince","kk":"kənˈvɪns","tense":"v.","ch":"[['說服'], ['使信服']]","chEntries":["說服","使信服"],"practiceMeaning":"證據足以讓陪審團信服。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'convincere'，由 'com-' (together, with) + 'vincere' (to conquer, to overcome) 構成。原始語義是「徹底克服」或「征服」，引申為「通過論證使對方信服」。構詞上，'com-' 表示「徹底地」或「共同」，'vinc-' 是 'vincere' 的詞幹，意為「克服、戰勝」。'convince' 的核心語意是「通過說理或證據，使人相信某事或某觀點」。它強調的是說服的過程和使對方產生認知上的轉變。","definition":"to cause (someone) to believe firmly in the truth of something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He tried to convince her that he was telling the truth.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他試圖說服她他所說的是實話。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The evidence was enough to convince the jury.\",\n    \"ch\": \"證據足以讓陪審團信服。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"證據足以讓陪審團信服。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3303,"wordRef":"字彙王::u42::cosmetic::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Critics argued that the changes were merely ____ and did not solve the real problems.","expectedAnswer":"cosmetic","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Critics argued that the changes were merely ____ and did not solve the real problems.","clozeAnswer":"cosmetic","exampleTranslation":"批評者認為這些改變僅僅是表面功夫，並未解決實際問題。","reference":{"eng":"cosmetic","kk":"/kɒzˈmɛtɪk/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['美容的；化妝用的'], ['（通常指）美化門面的；表面上的；無關緊要的']]","chEntries":["美容的","化妝用的","美化門面的","表面上的","無關緊要的"],"practiceMeaning":"批評者認為這些改變僅僅是表面功夫，並未解決實際問題。","analysis":"源自希臘語 'kosmetikos'，由 'kosmos' (秩序，裝飾) 演變而來。主要指用於改善外觀、使之更美觀的。","definition":"1. used to make a person's body more attractive; 2. intended to improve the appearance of something but not its underlying structure.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She uses a variety of cosmetic products.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她使用各種美容產品。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Critics argued that the changes were merely cosmetic and did not solve the real problems.\",\n    \"ch\": \"批評者認為這些改變僅僅是表面功夫，並未解決實際問題。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"批評者認為這些改變僅僅是表面功夫，並未解決實際問題。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U42"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4394,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::cotton::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"____ is grown in many parts of the world.","expectedAnswer":"Cotton","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"____ is grown in many parts of the world.","clozeAnswer":"Cotton","exampleTranslation":"棉花在世界許多地方都有種植。","reference":{"eng":"cotton","kk":"/ˈkɒtn/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['棉花'], ['棉線', '棉布']]","chEntries":["棉花","棉線","棉布"],"practiceMeaning":"棉花在世界許多地方都有種植。","analysis":"詞源來自阿拉伯語 'quṭun'，經由土耳其語傳入歐洲語言。指棉花植物的絨毛，及其製成的纖維、線或布料。","definition":"a plant that produces a soft, white substance like wool that grows around the seeds of the plant, or the substance itself, which is used to make cloth; cloth made from cotton.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This shirt is made of 100% cotton.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這件襯衫是百分之百純棉製成的。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Cotton is grown in many parts of the world.\",\n    \"ch\": \"棉花在世界許多地方都有種植。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"棉花在世界許多地方都有種植。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4462,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::county::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ council is responsible for local services.","expectedAnswer":"county","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ council is responsible for local services.","clozeAnswer":"county","exampleTranslation":"郡議會負責當地的公共服務。","reference":{"eng":"county","kk":"/ˈkaʊnti/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['郡'], ['縣']]","chEntries":["郡","縣"],"practiceMeaning":"郡議會負責當地的公共服務。","analysis":"源自古法語 conte，來自拉丁語 comitatus，意為「陪伴」，後來指「伯爵的領地」。在英語國家，常作為行政區劃單位。在英國和美國，是重要的地理和行政分區。","definition":"1. A division of a country, especially a large one in England or the US, forming an administrative and sometimes judicial district; 2. An administrative region in various countries.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He grew up in a small town in the next county.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在鄰縣的一個小鎮長大。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The county council is responsible for local services.\",\n    \"ch\": \"郡議會負責當地的公共服務。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"郡議會負責當地的公共服務。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5534,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l5::courageous::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"It takes a ____ person to admit their mistakes.","expectedAnswer":"courageous","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"It takes a ____ person to admit their mistakes.","clozeAnswer":"courageous","exampleTranslation":"承認錯誤需要一個有勇氣的人。","reference":{"eng":"courageous","kk":"kəˈreɪdʒəs","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['勇敢的'], ['有膽量的']]","chEntries":["勇敢的","有膽量的"],"practiceMeaning":"承認錯誤需要一個有勇氣的人。","analysis":"此字由名詞 'courage' 加上形容詞字尾 '-ous' 構成。'-ous' 是源自拉丁語的字尾，常用於形成形容詞，表示「充滿……」、「具有……性質」。'courage' 源自古法語 'corage'，來自拉丁語 'cor' (heart)。原始語義是「有心（勇敢的）」，引申為「內心的力量、勇氣」。'courageous' 的構詞結構清晰地表明其含義是「充滿勇氣的、勇敢的」。它描述了一種面對危險、困難或痛苦時表現出的堅毅與無畏。","definition":"showing no fear in the face of danger or pain; brave.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The courageous firefighter rescued the child from the burning building.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位勇敢的消防員從燃燒的建築中救出了孩子。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It takes a courageous person to admit their mistakes.\",\n    \"ch\": \"承認錯誤需要一個有勇氣的人。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"承認錯誤需要一個有勇氣的人。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5078,"wordRef":"字彙王::u61::coverage::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"What is the ____ of your car insurance?","expectedAnswer":"coverage","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"What is the ____ of your car insurance?","clozeAnswer":"coverage","exampleTranslation":"你的汽車保險的保險範圍是什麼？","reference":{"eng":"coverage","kk":"ˈkʌvərɪdʒ","tense":"n.","ch":"[['報導'], ['覆蓋範圍'], ['保險範圍']]","chEntries":["報導","覆蓋範圍","保險範圍"],"practiceMeaning":"你的汽車保險的保險範圍是什麼？","analysis":"此字由 'cover' (覆蓋) + '-age' (名詞化後綴) 構成。'-age' 常用於形成名詞，表示狀態、行為、總量或集合，如 'storage', 'carriage'。'Coverage' 的核心語義是 '被覆蓋的程度或範圍'。這引申為新聞媒體對事件的 '報導範圍'，保險條款對風險的 '保障範圍'，以及資訊或訊號的 '傳播範圍'。","definition":"1. The extent to which something is covered or protected.; 2. The amount of information about an event or subject that is included in newspapers, television programmes, etc.; 3. The amount of protection that an insurance policy gives you.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The news coverage of the election was extensive.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這次選舉的新聞報導十分廣泛。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"What is the coverage of your car insurance?\",\n    \"ch\": \"你的汽車保險的保險範圍是什麼？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The remote area has poor mobile phone coverage.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那個偏遠地區的手機訊號覆蓋很差。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"你的汽車保險的保險範圍是什麼？","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U61"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4422,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::creative::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The company is looking for ____ talent.","expectedAnswer":"creative","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company is looking for ____ talent.","clozeAnswer":"creative","exampleTranslation":"這家公司正在尋找有創造力的才能。","reference":{"eng":"creative","kk":"/kriˈeɪtɪv/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['有創造力的', '創新的']]","chEntries":["有創造力的","創新的"],"practiceMeaning":"這家公司正在尋找有創造力的才能。","analysis":"詞源自拉丁語 'creare' (to create)。指具備想像力和原創性的能力，能夠產生新的想法或事物。","definition":"relating to or involving the imagination or original ideas, especially in the production of an artistic work; having the ability to create things.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She has a very creative approach to problem-solving.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她對解決問題有非常有創意的做法。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company is looking for creative talent.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家公司正在尋找有創造力的才能。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這家公司正在尋找有創造力的才能。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3075,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::critic::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The film ____ gave the movie a glowing review.","expectedAnswer":"critic","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The film ____ gave the movie a glowing review.","clozeAnswer":"critic","exampleTranslation":"電影評論家給這部電影寫了極高的評價。","reference":{"eng":"critic","kk":"/ˈkrɪtɪk/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['批評者'], ['評論家；評論員'], ['（古希臘）法官；裁判']]","chEntries":["批評者","評論家","評論員","法官","裁判"],"practiceMeaning":"電影評論家給這部電影寫了極高的評價。","analysis":"源自希臘語 'kritēs' (judge)。原意為「裁判」或「判斷者」，後發展為對事物進行評價和判斷的人。\n1. 批評者：指對某人或某事提出批評意見的人。\n2. 評論家；評論員：指在特定領域（如文學、藝術、電影、音樂）進行專業評論的人。\n3. （古希臘）法官；裁判：指在古代希臘負責判斷或裁決事務的人。","definition":"1. a person who expresses an unfavorable opinion of something; 2. a person who is qualified to judge and make comments about the quality of something, especially books, films, or art; 3. a person who expresses a reasoned analysis of the merits and faults of a work of literature or art.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is a well-known critic of government policy.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是政府政策的知名批評者。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The film critic gave the movie a glowing review.\",\n    \"ch\": \"電影評論家給這部電影寫了極高的評價。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The critic's decision was final.\",\n    \"ch\": \"裁判的決定是最終的。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"電影評論家給這部電影寫了極高的評價。","sourceName":"字彙王、龍騰課本","unitName":"U39、L9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4277,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u7::crop::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"This year's ____ of strawberries is excellent.","expectedAnswer":"crop","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This year's ____ of strawberries is excellent.","clozeAnswer":"crop","exampleTranslation":"今年的草莓收成非常好。","reference":{"eng":"crop","kk":"/krɑːp/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['農作物'], ['收成'], ['（短髮）齊髮尾的']]","chEntries":["農作物","收成","齊髮尾的"],"practiceMeaning":"今年的草莓收成非常好。","analysis":"源自古英語 'crop'，意為「莖、嫩芽」。'Crop' 指「一年生長的植物，尤指穀物」，也可以指「一次收成的總量」。引申為「短髮齊髮尾的」樣式，可能與植物被一次性收割的形象相似。","definition":"a cultivated plant that is grown on a large scale to provide food, animal fodder, or other products; the amount of a plant that is gathered.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The farmer surveyed his healthy wheat crop.\",\n    \"ch\": \"農夫檢查他健康的小麥收成。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This year's crop of strawberries is excellent.\",\n    \"ch\": \"今年的草莓收成非常好。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"今年的草莓收成非常好。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3132,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::crush::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He admitted he had a ____ on his classmate.","expectedAnswer":"crush","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He admitted he had a ____ on his classmate.","clozeAnswer":"crush","exampleTranslation":"他承認他傾心於他的女同學。","reference":{"eng":"crush","kk":"/krʌʃ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['擠；擠壓；壓碎'], ['（愛情上的）迷戀；傾心'], ['（人群等的）擁擠']]","chEntries":["擠","擠壓","壓碎","迷戀","傾心","擁擠"],"practiceMeaning":"他承認他傾心於他的女同學。","analysis":"名詞用法，來自動詞 'crush'。指「壓碎」的動作或狀態，或是被壓碎的結果。在愛情語境下，'a crush' 指的是強烈的、短暫的迷戀或傾心。'Crush' 也可以形容人群的擁擠和壓力，與動詞的「擠壓」概念相關聯。","definition":"1. the act or process of crushing or being crushed; 2. a strong but usually temporary romantic infatuation; 3. a crowd of people or things pressing together.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The accident resulted in the crush of the victim's vehicle.\",\n    \"ch\": \"事故導致了受害者的車輛被壓毀。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He admitted he had a crush on his classmate.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他承認他傾心於他的女同學。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There was a dangerous crush of fans trying to get close to the singer.\",\n    \"ch\": \"粉絲們為了接近歌手而發生了危險的擁擠。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他承認他傾心於他的女同學。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U40"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3135,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::cube::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Please add a ____ of butter to the pan.","expectedAnswer":"cube","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Please add a ____ of butter to the pan.","clozeAnswer":"cube","exampleTranslation":"請在鍋裡加一塊黃油。","reference":{"eng":"cube","kk":"/kjuːb/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['立方體；立方塊'], ['（尤指食品）塊；方糖']]","chEntries":["立方體","立方塊","塊","方糖"],"practiceMeaning":"請在鍋裡加一塊黃油。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'cubus'，再追溯至希臘語 'kybos'，意為「骰子，立方體」。'Cube' 的基本幾何概念是一個三維的、有六個相等正方形面的物體。語意延伸至任何具有立方體或塊狀形狀的物體，特別是切割成規則塊狀的食品，如方糖、冰塊、肉塊等。","definition":"1. a solid body with six equal square sides; 2. a piece of food cut into a cube; 3. a sugar cube.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The magician made the rabbit disappear inside a large cube.\",\n    \"ch\": \"魔術師讓兔子在一個大立方體裡面消失了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please add a cube of butter to the pan.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請在鍋裡加一塊黃油。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He dropped a sugar cube into his tea.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他往茶裡丟了一塊方糖。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"請在鍋裡加一塊黃油。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U40"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3277,"wordRef":"字彙王::u42::cue::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Her sudden silence was a ____ for me to change the subject.","expectedAnswer":"cue","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Her sudden silence was a ____ for me to change the subject.","clozeAnswer":"cue","exampleTranslation":"她突然的沉默是個提示，讓我換個話題。","reference":{"eng":"cue","kk":"/kjuː/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['提示；暗示']