,"exampleTranslation":"這處房產是一座美麗的鄉間莊園。","reference":{"eng":"estate","kk":"ɪˈsteɪt","tense":"n.","ch":"[['財產'], ['房地產'], ['（尤指大塊的）土地'], ['（某人或某群體的）狀況']]","chEntries":["財產","房地產","土地","狀況"],"practiceMeaning":"這處房產是一座美麗的鄉間莊園。","analysis":"此字源自古法語estat，來自拉丁語status，意為「狀態、地位」。最初指「財產」、「財富」。引申為「財產，尤指大片土地及其建築」，如「莊園」(country estate)。在法律語境中，指「遺產」(estate of a deceased person) 或「財產權」(real estate)。其核心語意圍繞著「擁有的財產或地位」。OCR 掃描時可能將 's' 誤判為 '5'。此處修正為 estate。","definition":"1. all the money and property owned by a particular person or company; 2. a large area of land in the country, often with a large house on it; 3. the total property, especially land, owned by someone.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He inherited a large estate from his uncle.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他從叔叔那裡繼承了一大筆財產。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The property is a beautiful country estate.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這處房產是一座美麗的鄉間莊園。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Real estate prices have been rising.\",\n    \"ch\": \"房地產價格一直在上漲。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這處房產是一座美麗的鄉間莊園。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U59"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3081,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::ethnic::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She enjoys exploring different ____ cuisines.","expectedAnswer":"ethnic","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She enjoys exploring different ____ cuisines.","clozeAnswer":"ethnic","exampleTranslation":"她喜歡探索不同的民族風味美食。","reference":{"eng":"ethnic","kk":"/ˈeθnɪk/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['種族的；民族的'], ['有異國情調的；非西方風格的']]","chEntries":["種族的","民族的","有異國情調的","非西方風格的"],"practiceMeaning":"她喜歡探索不同的民族風味美食。","analysis":"源自希臘語 'ethnikos' (pertaining to a people or nation)，'ethnos' (nation, people)。核心意義是「與民族或群體相關」。\n1. 種族的；民族的：指與特定的種族或民族群體及其文化、特徵相關。\n2. 有異國情調的；非西方風格的：常用來描述來自不同文化或國家，具有獨特風格的事物。","definition":"1. relating to a population subgroup with a common national or cultural tradition; 2. relating to a particular race of people.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The country has a diverse ethnic population.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個國家擁有多元的種族人口。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She enjoys exploring different ethnic cuisines.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她喜歡探索不同的民族風味美食。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她喜歡探索不同的民族風味美食。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U39"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5587,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l6::excellent::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He gave an ____ presentation.","expectedAnswer":"excellent","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He gave an ____ presentation.","clozeAnswer":"excellent","exampleTranslation":"他做了一個出色的報告。","reference":{"eng":"excellent","kk":"ˈɛksələnt","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['優秀的'], ['卓越的'], ['極好的'], ['出色的']]","chEntries":["優秀的","卓越的","極好的","出色的"],"practiceMeaning":"他做了一個出色的報告。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 \"excellēns\"，是 \"excellere\"（to be eminent, surpass, excel，卓越，超越）的現在分詞。\"excellere\" 由 \"ex-\"（out）和 \"cellere\"（to rise, to be eminent，上升，卓越）組成，意為「突出，超越眾人」。因此，\"excellent\" 的核心語義是「非常出色、品質極高、超越一般水準」。它用來形容人、物、表現或情況，表示其達到了極高的標準。","definition":"1. Extremely good; outstanding; 2. Very high in quality or degree.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"That was an excellent meal!\",\n    \"ch\": \"那是一頓極好的餐點！\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He gave an excellent presentation.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他做了一個出色的報告。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The team achieved excellent results.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這支隊伍取得了優異的成績。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他做了一個出色的報告。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4203,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::exchange::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We had a brief ____ of views.","expectedAnswer":"exchange","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We had a brief ____ of views.","clozeAnswer":"exchange","exampleTranslation":"我們就此交換了簡短的看法。","reference":{"eng":"exchange","kk":"/ɪksˈtʃeɪndʒ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['交換；兌換'], ['交流；談話'], ['（股票、貨幣等的）交易所']]","chEntries":["交換","兌換","交流","談話","交易所"],"practiceMeaning":"我們就此交換了簡短的看法。","analysis":"名詞形式源自動詞 'exchange'。1. “交換；兌換”指交換的行為或結果。2. “交流；談話”指思想、資訊的相互傳遞過程。3. “交易所”是特定場所的名稱，指進行金融商品交換的機構。","definition":"1. the act of giving one thing and receiving another in return; 2. conversation; 3. a place where shares or other securities are bought and sold.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The exchange of gifts is common at Christmas.\",\n    \"ch\": \"交換禮物在聖誕節很常見。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We had a brief exchange of views.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們就此交換了簡短的看法。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He works at the stock exchange.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在證券交易所工作。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們就此交換了簡短的看法。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5535,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l5::execution::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ of the prisoner took place at dawn.","expectedAnswer":"execution","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ of the prisoner took place at dawn.","clozeAnswer":"execution","exampleTranslation":"囚犯的處決於黎明時進行。","reference":{"eng":"execution","kk":"ˌeksɪˈkjuːʃən","tense":"n.","ch":"[['執行'], ['處決'], [' تنفيذ'], ['技術']]","chEntries":["執行","處決","تنفيذ","技術"],"practiceMeaning":"囚犯的處決於黎明時進行。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'executio'，由 'ex-' (out) + 'sequi' (to follow) 構成，意思是「跟隨、執行」。'execute' 是其動詞形式，意為「執行」。構詞上，'ex-' 表示「完成、結束」，'secut-' 是 'sequi' 的詞幹，意為「跟隨」。'execution' 作名詞，指「執行」的動作或過程，包括執行法律判決（處決）、履行職責或完成計劃。在技術或藝術領域，它也指「技藝的熟練程度」或「表現」。多個義項都圍繞著「完成、實施、執行」的核心概念。","definition":"the carrying out of a plan, order, or course of action; the act of putting a condemned person to death; technical skill or performance.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The execution of the plan was successful.\",\n    \"ch\": \"計劃的執行很成功。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The execution of the prisoner took place at dawn.\",\n    \"ch\": \"囚犯的處決於黎明時進行。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her execution of the piano piece was flawless.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她演奏的鋼琴曲無懈可擊。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"囚犯的處決於黎明時進