observe the law","kk":"/əbˈzɜːrv ðə lɔː/","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['遵守法律']]","chEntries":["遵守法律"],"practiceMeaning":"該公司承諾在其所有營運中遵守法律。","analysis":"結合了動詞 'observe'（遵守、觀察）和名詞片語 'the law'（法律）。'Observe the law' 的意思是「依循、遵守法律規定，不違反法律」。","definition":"to obey and follow the rules and regulations of the law.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"All citizens are expected to observe the law.\",\n    \"ch\": \"所有公民都被期望遵守法律。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company pledged to observe the law in all its operations.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司承諾在其所有營運中遵守法律。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"該公司承諾在其所有營運中遵守法律。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4362,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::odorless-substance::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Scientists are studying this new ____.","expectedAnswer":"odorless substance","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Scientists are studying this new ____.","clozeAnswer":"odorless substance","exampleTranslation":"科學家們正在研究這種新的無味物質。","reference":{"eng":"odorless substance","kk":"None","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['無味的物質']]","chEntries":["無味的物質"],"practiceMeaning":"科學家們正在研究這種新的無味物質。","analysis":"此為片語分析。'odorless' (adj.) 源自 'odor' (n.) + '-less' (suffix)，意為『沒有氣味的』。'substance' (n.) 源自拉丁語 'substantia'，指『物質』。兩者結合，指『沒有氣味』的『物質』。","definition":"a material that does not have a smell","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The cleaning product is an odorless substance.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這種清潔劑是一種無味的物質。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Scientists are studying this new odorless substance.\",\n    \"ch\": \"科學家們正在研究這種新的無味物質。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"科學家們正在研究這種新的無味物質。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4505,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::of::prep","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is afraid ____ the dark.","expectedAnswer":"of","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is afraid ____ the dark.","clozeAnswer":"of","exampleTranslation":"他害怕黑暗。","reference":{"eng":"of","kk":"/əv/, /ɒv/","tense":"prep.","ch":"[['...的'], ['關於'], ['屬於'], ['在...之中']]","chEntries":["...的","關於","屬於","在...之中"],"practiceMeaning":"他害怕黑暗。","analysis":"源自古英語 of。是一個極其常見且語意複雜的介詞。核心功能是表示「從...分離」、「來源」或「屬於」。引申義極廣，包括所有格、部分、來源、原因、組成等。","definition":"1. Expressing the relationship between a part and a whole; 2. Expressing the relationship between a ruler and those ruled; 3. Expressing the relationship between a subject and its object; 4. Expressing the relationship between an author and his work; 5. Expressing the origin or cause of something; 6. Denoting belonging or a close connection.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The cover of the book is blue.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這本書的封面是藍色的。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is afraid of the dark.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他害怕黑暗。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A group of students arrived.\",\n    \"ch\": \"一群學生抵達了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is a piece of cake.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是一塊蛋糕。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他害怕黑暗。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4215,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::office::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The president's ____ is in the White House.","expectedAnswer":"office","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The president's ____ is in the White House.","clozeAnswer":"office","exampleTranslation":"總統的辦公室在白宮。","reference":{"eng":"office","kk":"/ˈɒfɪs/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['辦公室；辦事處'], ['（公職）職位；當局']]","chEntries":["辦公室","辦事處","職位","當局"],"practiceMeaning":"總統的辦公室在白宮。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 officium，意為“職責，義務，公職”，'opus'（工作）+ 'facere'（做）。核心是“工作的場所”或“執行的職責”。1. “辦公室”指從事商業或行政工作的場所。2. “職位；當局”指履行特定職責的公職或權力機構。","definition":"1. a room or building in which people work at desks; 2. a position of authority or responsibility, especially in government.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He works in a small office on the third floor.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在