  2. 分發完畢：指某物品被分發到所有人，沒有剩餘。","definition":"1. lose consciousness; faint.; 2. to distribute or give out something until none is left.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He drank too much and passed out.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他喝太多了，就昏倒了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The doctor was worried that she might pass out.\",\n    \"ch\": \"醫生擔心她可能會昏倒。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They passed out the invitations to everyone.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們將邀請函發給了所有人。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"醫生擔心她可能會昏倒。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U11"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5304,"wordRef":"字彙王::u63::pastry::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"This recipe requires a good quality ____.","expectedAnswer":"pastry","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This recipe requires a good quality ____.","clozeAnswer":"pastry","exampleTranslation":"這個食譜需要優質的酥皮。","reference":{"eng":"pastry","kk":"ˈpeɪstri","tense":"n.","ch":"[['糕點'], ['（製作糕點用的）酥皮，糕點麵團']]","chEntries":["糕點","酥皮，糕點麵團"],"practiceMeaning":"這個食譜需要優質的酥皮。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 'paste'，意為「麵團、餡餅」，最終來自拉丁語 'pasta'（麵團）。'pastry' 最初指「餡餅」，後來演變為製作餡餅、派或甜點所用的「酥皮麵團」，以及由此製成的「糕點」。","definition":"a mixture of flour, fat, and water or milk, used to make the crust of pies and other dishes; food made with this mixture, especially sweet dishes.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She loves baking pies and pastries.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她喜歡烘烤派和糕點。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This recipe requires a good quality pastry.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個食譜需要優質的酥皮。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這個食譜需要優質的酥皮。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U63"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5853,"wordRef":"字彙王::u58::patrol::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The military began to ____ the border.","expectedAnswer":"patrol","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The military began to ____ the border.","clozeAnswer":"patrol","exampleTranslation":"軍隊開始巡邏邊境。","reference":{"eng":"patrol","kk":"pəˈtroʊl","tense":"v.","ch":"[  [    \"巡邏\"  ],  [    \"巡視\"  ],  [    \"守衛\"  ]]","chEntries":["巡邏","巡視","守衛"],"practiceMeaning":"軍隊開始巡邏邊境。","analysis":"此動詞形式與名詞形式同源。其核心語意是「進行例行的移動以監控或保護某區域」。'Patrol' 作動詞時，指警察、士兵或安全人員在特定區域進行定期檢查或監視。這通常是為了防止犯罪、確保安全或維持秩序。語源上，與「巡視」、「守衛」的概念相關。例如，也可指「在（某區域）進行巡邏」。","definition":"1. To move around an area in order to keep it under surveillance or guard it.; 2. To act as a guard or watchman.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The guards patrol the grounds day and night.\",\n    \"ch\": \"守衛日夜巡邏園區。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The military began to patrol the border.\",\n    \"ch\": \"軍隊開始巡邏邊境。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She patrolled the aisles of the supermarket.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她巡視著超市的貨架通道。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The police patrolled the neighborhood looking for the suspect.\",\n    \"ch\": \"警方在社區巡邏尋找嫌犯。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"軍隊開始巡邏邊境。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U58"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4647,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u16::peak::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Sales are expected to ____ next quarter.","expectedAnswer":"peak","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Sales are expected to ____ next quarter.","clozeAnswer":"peak","exampleTranslation":"預計下個季度銷售額將達到頂峰。","reference":{"eng":"peak","kk":"/piːk/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['山頂'], ['頂峰'], ['最高點'], ['達到頂峰']]","chEntries":["山頂","頂峰","最高點","達到頂峰"],"practiceMeaning":"預計下個季度銷售額將達到頂峰。","analysis":"源自古英語 'pician' (尖、頂)，與「尖銳」有關。指山峰的頂端，或任何事物發展的最高點。引申義也可指達到某種狀態的最高水平。","definition":"the pointed top of a mountain; the highest point or level of something; to reach the highest level or point.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The climber stood at the peak of the mountain.\",\n    \"ch\": \"登山者站在山峰之巔。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Sales are expected to peak next quarter.\",\n    \"ch\": \"預計下個季度銷售額將達到頂峰。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"預計下個季度銷售額將達到頂峰。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U16"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4064,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u4::peanut::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"____ butter is a popular spread.","expectedAnswer":"Peanut","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"____ butter is a popular spread.","clozeAnswer":"Peanut","exampleTranslation":"花生醬是一種受歡迎的抹醬。","reference":{"eng":"peanut","kk":"/ˈpinʌt/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['花生']]","chEntries":["花生"],"practiceMeaning":"花生醬是一種受歡迎的抹醬。","analysis":"由 'pea' (豌豆) + 'nut' (堅果) 組合而成。因其形狀和種植方式（根部結的果實）類似豌豆，且屬於堅果類，故名 'peanut'。","definition":"a nut that grows underground on a leguminous plant, used for food","example":"[\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"我對花生過敏。\",\n    \"eng\": \"I am allergic to peanuts.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"花生醬是一種受歡迎的抹醬。\",\n    \"eng\": \"Peanut butter is a popular spread.\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"花生醬是一種受歡迎的抹醬。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5052,"wordRef":"字彙王::u59::pedestrian::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The city center is now ____-friendly, with many car-free zones.","expectedAnswer":"pedestrian","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The city center is now ____-friendly, with many car-free zones.","clozeAnswer":"pedestrian","exampleTranslation":"市中心現在對行人友好，有許多禁車區。","reference":{"eng":"pedestrian","kk":"pəˈdɛstriən","tense":"n.","ch":"[['行人'], ['步行者']]","chEntries":["行人","步行者"],"practiceMeaning":"市中心現在對行人友好，有許多禁車區。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語pedester，意為「步行」。pedester 又來自pes, pedis（腳）。pedester 的形容詞形式為pedestrian，原意是「用腳走的、步行的」。此名詞用法指「在路上步行的人」，與「汽車」等交通工具相對。OCR 掃描時可能將 'd' 誤判為 'cl'，或 'e' 誤判為 'c'。此處修正為 pedestrian。","definition":"a person who walks across a road or through a town.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Drivers must yield to pedestrians in the crosswalk.\",\n    \"ch\": \"駕駛員在人行橫道上必須禮讓行人。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The city center is now pedestrian-friendly, with many car-free zones.\",\n    \"ch\": \"市中心現在對行人友好，有許多禁車區。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"市中心現在對行人友好，有許多禁車區。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U59"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4195,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::penguin::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ waddled awkwardly on land but swam gracefully.","expectedAnswer":"penguin","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ waddled awkwardly on land but swam gracefully.","clozeAnswer":"penguin","exampleTranslation":"企鵝在陸地上笨拙地搖擺，但在水中游得十分優雅。","reference":{"eng":"penguin","kk":"/ˈpeŋɡwɪn/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['企鵝']]","chEntries":["企鵝"],"practiceMeaning":"企鵝在陸地上笨拙地搖擺，但在水中游得十分優雅。","analysis":"詞源有爭議，一說來自威爾斯語 pengwyn，意為“白頭”（pen 'head' + gwyn 'white'），原指海雀（auk），後被誤用於企鵝。另一說可能來自拉丁語 pinguis，意為“肥胖的”。主要指一種不會飛但善於游泳的海鳥。沒有廣泛的引申義。","definition":"A large flightless seabird of the southern hemisphere, with a black and white plumage and flipper-like wings.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We saw many penguins on the Antarctic shore.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們在南極海岸看到了許多企鵝。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The penguin waddled awkwardly on land but swam gracefully.\",\n    \"ch\": \"企鵝在陸地上笨拙地搖擺，但在水中游得十分優雅。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"企鵝在陸地上笨拙地搖擺，但在水中游得十分優雅。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6087,"wordRef":"字彙王::u64::petty::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He's too ____ to forgive such a small mistake.","expectedAnswer":"petty","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He's too ____ to forgive such a small mistake.","clozeAnswer":"petty","exampleTranslation":"他太小氣了，無法原諒這樣一個小錯誤。","reference":{"eng":"petty","kk":"ˈpɛti","tense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"瑣碎的\"  ],  [    \"小氣的\"  ],  [    \"次要的\"  ],  [    \"輕微的\"  ]]","chEntries":["瑣碎的","小氣的","次要的","輕微的"],"practiceMeaning":"他太小氣了，無法原諒這樣一個小錯誤。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 petitement（in a small way），來自 petit（small）。核心語義是「小的」。引申為「瑣碎的」、「不重要的」、「次要的」；或形容人「心胸狹窄」、「小氣」；或形容罪行、傷害「輕微的」。","definition":"1. of little importance; trivial; 2. characterized by or showing a lack of tolerance or generosity; mean-spirited; 3. (of a crime or offense) minor.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Don't argue over such petty details.\",\n    \"ch\": \"不要為了這麼瑣碎的細節爭論。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He's too petty to forgive such a small mistake.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他太小氣了，無法原諒這樣一個小錯誤。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The police investigated a petty theft.\",\n    \"ch\": \"警方調查了一起盜竊案。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他太小氣了，無法原諒這樣一個小錯誤。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U64"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3893,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u1::photographer::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She hired a ____ for her wedding.","expectedAnswer":"photographer","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She hired a ____ for her wedding.","clozeAnswer":"photographer","exampleTranslation":"她聘請了一位攝影師來拍攝她的婚禮。","reference":{"eng":"photographer","kk":"/fəˈtɑːɡrəfər/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['攝影師']]","chEntries":["攝影師"],"practiceMeaning":"她聘請了一位攝影師來拍攝她的婚禮。","analysis":"由 'photo-' (光) + 'grapher' (書寫/繪圖者) 組成，源自希臘語 'phos' (light) + 'graphein' (to write)。核心是「用光線繪圖的人」。指專業拍攝照片的人。","definition":"a person who takes photographs, especially professionally.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The photographer captured a beautiful sunset.\",\n    \"ch\": \"攝影師捕捉到了一個美麗的日落。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She hired a photographer for her wedding.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她聘請了一位攝影師來拍攝她的婚禮。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is a freelance photographer.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是一位自由攝影師。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她聘請了一位攝影師來拍攝她的婚禮。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4196,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::pigeon::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He's an easy ____ for con artists.","expectedAnswer":"pigeon","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He's an easy ____ for con artists.","clozeAnswer":"pigeon","exampleTranslation":"他是騙子們輕易得手的目標。","reference":{"eng":"pigeon","kk":"/ˈpɪdʒən/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['鴿子'], ['（比喻）容易受騙的人；目標']]","chEntries":["鴿子","容易受騙的人","目標"],"practiceMeaning":"他是騙子們輕易得手的目標。","analysis":"源自古法語 pijon，意為“幼鴿”。詞源可能來自拉丁語 pipio，意為“雛鳥，吱吱叫的鳥”。核心是“鴿子”。引申義“容易受騙的人”或“目標”來自於鴿子常被用作信鴿（容易被捕捉或被利用），或在賭博中作為較弱的對象。","definition":"1. a bird with a small head, short neck, and slender beak, known for its cooing sound, often domesticated and used for carrying messages; 2. a person who is easily deceived or exploited.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A flock of pigeons flew overhead.\",\n    \"ch\": \"一群鴿子從頭頂飛過。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He's an easy pigeon for con artists.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是騙子們輕易得手的目標。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The carrier pigeon delivered the message safely.\",\n    \"ch\": \"信鴿安全地送達了訊息。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他是騙子們輕易得手的目標。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5055,"wordRef":"字彙王::u59::pillar::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is a ____ of the community.","expectedAnswer":"pillar","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is a ____ of the community.","clozeAnswer":"pillar","exampleTranslation":"他是社區的支柱。","reference":{"eng":"pillar","kk":"ˈpɪlər","tense":"n.","ch":"[['柱子'], ['支柱'], ['（引申）重要人物、支柱']]","chEntries":["柱子","支柱","重要人物、支柱"],"practiceMeaning":"他是社區的支柱。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語pillaris，是動詞pilare（用柱子支撐）的形容詞形式，來自pila（柱子）。pila的詞源不明，但與古英語pil（柱、樁）同源。pillar 的核心語意是「用於支撐建築物上方結構的垂直構件」。引申指「重要的人物、支柱」，比喻為支撐某事物（家庭、組織、國家）的重要力量。OCR 掃描時可能將 'll' 誤判為 'm'。此處修正為 pillar。","definition":"1. a tall vertical structure of stone, metal, or wood, typically used to support a building or as a decoration; 2. a person or thing that is strong and reliable.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The temple was supported by massive stone pillars.\",\n    \"ch\": \"寺廟由巨大的石柱支撐。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is a pillar of the community.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是社區的支柱。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他是社區的支柱。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U59"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6130,"wordRef":"字彙王::u65::pipeline::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We have several new projects in the ____.","expectedAnswer":"pipeline","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We have several new projects in the ____.","clozeAnswer":"pipeline","exampleTranslation":"我們有幾個新項目正在籌備中。","reference":{"eng":"pipeline","kk":"ˈpaɪplaɪn","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"管道\"  ],  [    \"管線\"  ],  [    \"輸出管道\"  ],  [    \"輸送系統\"  ]]","chEntries":["管道","管線","輸出管道","輸送系統"],"practiceMeaning":"我們有幾個新項目正在籌備中。","analysis":"此字為複合詞，由 pipeline（水管）和 line（線）組成。pipe 意為「管子」，line 意為「線；管道」。因此，pipeline 的核心語義是「輸送液體或氣體的管道」。modern 用法常引申為「生產線」、「供應鏈」或「預備供應的來源」，尤指項目、產品或資源正在發展或輸送中。","definition":"1. a long pipe, typically underground, for transporting liquids or gases over long distances; 2. a system or process through which something is conveyed or transmitted; a channel for conveying information or resources.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company is building a new oil pipeline.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司正在建造新的輸油管道。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We have several new projects in the pipeline.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們有幾個新項目正在籌備中。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The pipeline ensures a steady supply of natural gas.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這條管線確保了天然氣的穩定供應。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們有幾個新項目正在籌備中。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U65"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6131,"wordRef":"字彙王::u65::pirate::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He was accused of ____ software.","expectedAnswer":"pirate","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He was accused of ____ software.","clozeAnswer":"pirate","exampleTranslation":"他被指控盜版軟體。","reference":{"eng":"pirate","kk":"ˈpaɪrət","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"海盜\"  ],  [    \"盜版者\"  ]]","chEntries":["海盜","盜版者"],"practiceMeaning":"他被指控盜版軟體。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 pīrāta，來自希臘語 peiratēs，意為「襲擊者；掠奪者」，源自 peiran（試圖；攻擊）。因此，pirate 的核心語義是「襲擊者，特別是海上襲擊者」。modern 用法指在海上搶劫船隻的人，或引申為非法複製和散佈受版權保護的材料（盜版者）。其語意演變是從「襲擊者」到「海上掠奪者」，再到「盜版者」。","definition":"1. a person who attacks and robs ships at sea; 2. a person who reproduces or distributes copyrighted material without permission.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The ship was attacked by pirates.\",\n    \"ch\": \"船隻遭到海盜襲擊。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He was accused of pirate software.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他被指控盜版軟體。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The book tells the story of a famous pirate.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這本書講述了一位著名海盜的故事。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他被指控盜版軟體。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U65"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4173,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::play::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He can ____ the piano.","expectedAnswer":"play","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He can ____ the piano.","clozeAnswer":"play","exampleTranslation":"他會彈鋼琴。","reference":{"eng":"play","kk":"/pleɪ/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['扮演（角色）'], ['演奏（樂器）'], ['玩耍'], ['演出（戲劇）']]","chEntries":["扮演","演奏","玩耍","演出"],"practiceMeaning":"他會彈鋼琴。","analysis":"源自古英語 plegian（玩耍，運動）。核心概念是「從事活動，尤其是為了娛樂或展現」。引申為扮演角色、演奏樂器、進行遊戲、演出戲劇等。","definition":"1. engage in activity for enjoyment and recreation rather than a serious or practical purpose; 2. perform (a part) in a theatrical production; 3. perform on a musical instrument; 4. have a part in; fulfill a role","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She plays a significant role in the company.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她在公司中扮演著重要的角色。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He can play the piano.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他會彈鋼琴。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The children are playing in the park.\",\n    \"ch\": \"孩子們正在公園裡玩耍。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他會彈鋼琴。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3924,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u2::playful::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He made a ____ remark about her new hairstyle.","expectedAnswer":"playful","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He made a ____ remark about her new hairstyle.","clozeAnswer":"playful","exampleTranslation":"他對她的新髮型開了個玩笑。","reference":{"eng":"playful","kk":"/ˈpleɪfəl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['愛玩的', '嬉戲的'], ['戲謔的'], ['有趣的']]","chEntries":["愛玩的","嬉戲的","戲謔的","有趣的"],"practiceMeaning":"他對她的新髮型開了個玩笑。","analysis":"源自古英語 'plæġful'，由 'plæġa' (意為「遊戲」) 和 '-ful' (形容詞後綴) 組成。指喜歡玩耍、嬉戲的；也可指以戲弄、開玩笑的態度，或形容事物活潑有趣。","definition":"1. fond of games and fun; full of playfulness; 2. (of a person or their behavior) light-hearted and not serious; 3. (of an animal) energetic and lively.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The playful puppy chased its tail.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那隻愛玩的幼犬追著自己的尾巴。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He made a playful remark about her new hairstyle.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他對她的新髮型開了個玩笑。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The music had a playful, lighthearted quality.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這音樂具有一種活潑、輕鬆的特質。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他對她的新髮型開了個玩笑。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5057,"wordRef":"字彙王::u59::plead::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The lawyer will ____ the case in court.","expectedAnswer":"plead","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The lawyer will ____ the case in court.","clozeAnswer":"plead","exampleTranslation":"律師將在法庭上辯護此案。","reference":{"eng":"plead","kk":"pliːd","tense":"v.","ch":"[['懇求'], ['請求'], ['（法律）辯護']]","chEntries":["懇求","請求","辯護"],"practiceMeaning":"律師將在法庭上辯護此案。","analysis":"此字源自古法語plaidier，來自拉丁語placitum，意為「有利」、「判決」。最初意指「申訴、爭論」。動詞 plead 意為「懇切地請求或懇求」，尤指在困境中。在法律語境中，指「進行辯護」或「提出（某種）辯護」。此動詞語意直接來源於名詞 plea，表示「進行懇求」或「提出辯護」的動作。","definition":"1. to make an earnest or emotional appeal; 2. to ask for something in a very emotional way; 3. (in court) to state formally in defence whether one admits guilt or denies guilt.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He pleaded with his captors for mercy.\",\n    \"ch\": 