ted into a socket to make an electrical connection. 2. A piece of material used to stop up a hole or opening. 3. (informal) An act of advertising or promoting something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Make sure the TV plug is firmly in the socket.\",\n    \"ch\": \"確保電視插頭牢固地插在插座裡。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He put a plug in the hole to stop the leak.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他用塞子堵住洞以阻止洩漏。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The movie had a lot of product plugs.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這部電影有很多產品置入性行銷。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他用塞子堵住洞以阻止洩漏。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U17"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6186,"wordRef":"字彙王::u66::poke::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"A quick ____ of his finger was all it took.","expectedAnswer":"poke","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"A quick ____ of his finger was all it took.","clozeAnswer":"poke","exampleTranslation":"他手指輕輕一戳就夠了。","reference":{"eng":"poke","kk":"poʊk","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"戳\"  ],  [    \"捅\"  ]]","chEntries":["戳","捅"],"practiceMeaning":"他手指輕輕一戳就夠了。","analysis":"此字源自中古英語 pokien，可能是擬聲詞。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根。作為名詞，是動詞 poke「戳、捅」的名詞化。其核心語義是指「用手指或尖物輕輕觸碰、戳或捅的動作」。","definition":"1. an act of poking someone or something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He gave me a poke in the arm.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他戳了我一下手臂。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A quick poke of his finger was all it took.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他手指輕輕一戳就夠了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The poke of the stick startled the animal.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那根棍子的戳弄驚嚇到了動物。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他手指輕輕一戳就夠了。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U66"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4527,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::polled::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The residents were ____ on their preferred building materials.","expectedAnswer":"polled","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The residents were ____ on their preferred building materials.","clozeAnswe