lse}},{"wordId":4300,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u7::pose-a-threat-to::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The new policy may ____ small businesses.","expectedAnswer":"pose a threat to","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The new policy may ____ small businesses.","clozeAnswer":"pose a threat to","exampleTranslation":"這項新政策可能對小型企業構成威脅。","reference":{"eng":"pose a threat to","kk":"/poʊz ə ˈθrɛt tuː/","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['對...構成威脅']]","chEntries":["對...構成威脅"],"practiceMeaning":"這項新政策可能對小型企業構成威脅。","analysis":"結合了動詞 'pose'（構成、擺出）和名詞片語 'a threat to'（對...的威脅）。'Pose a threat to' 的意思是「成為一個潛在的危險或造成不良影響」，指出某事物可能對另一事物造成傷害或不利後果。","definition":"to present a danger or risk to someone or something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Climate change poses a threat to global ecosystems.\",\n    \"ch\": \"氣候變遷對全球生態系統構成威脅。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The new policy may pose a threat to small businesses.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這項新政策可能對小型企業構成威脅。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這項新政策可能對小型企業構成威脅。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4345,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::pour::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"It started to ____ rain heavily.","expectedAnswer":"pour","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"It started to ____ rain heavily.","clozeAnswer":"pour","exampleTranslation":"大雨傾盆而下。","reference":{"eng":"pour","kk":"/pɔːr/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['傾倒；倒（液體）'], ['（雨、雪等）傾瀉；（人、物）湧現']]","chEntries":["傾倒","倒","傾瀉","湧現"],"practiceMeaning":"大雨傾盆而下。","analysis":"源自古法語 'porer'，意為 'to let flow, to pour'，可能來自拉丁語 'perponere' (to set through)，或直接與『流動』相關。1. 指將液體從一個容器轉移到另一個容器，『傾倒』。2. 形容雨雪等『大量、迅速地落下』，或形容人、物『大量地、不斷地湧入』。","definition":"to flow rapidly in a steady stream; to flow rapidly and in large quantities","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please pour me a cup of tea.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請倒一杯茶給我。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It started to pour rain heavily.\",\n    \"ch\": \"大雨傾盆而下。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The crowds poured into the stadium.\",\n    \"ch\": \"人群湧入體育場。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He poured the milk into the bowl.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他把牛奶倒進碗裡。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"大雨傾盆而下。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4187,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::practical::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We need a ____ approach, not just theories.","expectedAnswer":"practical","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We need a ____ approach, not just theories.","clozeAnswer":"practical","exampleTranslation":"我們需要一種實用的方法，而不僅僅是理論。","reference":{"eng":"practical","kk":"/ˈpræktɪkl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['實際的；實用的'], ['傾向於做的；合乎實際的'], ['（有）實際經驗的']]","chEntries":["實際的","實用的","傾向於做的","合乎實際的","實際經驗的"],"practiceMeaning":"我們需要一種實用的方法，而不僅僅是理論。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 practicus，意為“實踐的，活躍的”，來自希臘語 prassein，意為“做”。核心概念是與“做”或“行動”相關。1. “實際的”強調與理論相對，基於實際情況，具有實用價值。2. “合乎實際的”強調可行性，不脫離現實。3. “有實際經驗的”強調親身實踐的知識，而非僅僅理論。","definition":"1. concerned with the actual doing or using of something rather than with theory and ideas; 2. sensible and realistic in dealing with matters; 3. having or involving practical knowledge or skill.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is a practical solution to the problem.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是解決問題的一個實際的方案。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need a practical approach, not just theories.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要一種實用的方法，而不僅僅是理論。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is very practical and good at managing household affairs.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她非常務實，很擅長管理家務。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們需要一種實用的方法，而不僅僅是理論。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U6、L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6235,"wordRef":"字彙王::u67::predator::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The company was accused of being a corporate ____.","expectedAnswer":"predator","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company was accused of being a corporate ____.","clozeAnswer":"predator","exampleTranslation":"這家公司被指控為企業掠食者。","reference":{"eng":"predator","kk":"ˈprɛdətər","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"掠食者\"  ],  [    \"捕食者\"  ],  [    \"侵略者\"  ]]","chEntries":["掠食者","捕食者","侵略者"],"practiceMeaning":"這家公司被指控為企業掠食者。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 prædator，是 prædari（掠奪）的名詞，向上可追溯至 præda（戰利品，獵物）。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根。名詞義指在自然界中以其他動物為食的動物，也引申指利用、剝削或攻擊他人或組織的個人或團體。中文翻譯為「掠食者；捕食者；侵略者」。","definition":"1. an animal that hunts and kills other animals for food; 2. a person or group that harms or takes advantage of others.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Lions are predators that hunt zebras.\",\n    \"ch\": \"獅子是捕食斑馬的掠食者。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company was accused of being a corporate predator.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家公司被指控為企業掠食者。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Sharks are apex predators in the ocean.\",\n    \"ch\": \"鯊魚是海洋中的頂級捕食者。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這家公司被指控為企業掠食者。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U67"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6239,"wordRef":"字彙王::u67::premier::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ issue facing the country is unemployment.","expectedAnswer":"premier","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ issue facing the country is unemployment.","clozeAnswer":"premier","exampleTranslation":"這個國家面臨的首要問題是失業。","reference":{"eng":"premier","kk":"ˈprɛmɪər","tense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"首先的\"  ],  [    \"最重要的\"  ],  [    \"第一的\"  ]]","chEntries":["首先的","最重要的","第一的"],"practiceMeaning":"這個國家面臨的首要問題是失業。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 primarius，意為「第一的，主要的」。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根。作形容詞時，指在時間、順序或重要性上居於首位，最重要的。中文翻譯為「首先的；最重要的；第一的」。","definition":"1. first in importance, order, or status; 2. most important; 3. first; earliest.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is the premier dancer in the company.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她是公司裡最重要的舞者。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The premier issue facing the country is unemployment.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個國家面臨的首要問題是失業。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The 