此字由 'president' (總統) + '-cy' (名詞化後綴，表示職位、狀態、權力) 構成。'-cy' 常用於形成表示職位或狀態的名詞，如 'democracy', 'agency'。'Presidency' 指的是 '擔任總統的職位' 或 '總統的任期'，以及在此期間所擁有的 '權力' 和 '職責'。","definition":"1. The office or position of president.; 2. The period of time during which someone is president.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His presidency was marked by economic reforms.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他的總統任期以經濟改革為標誌。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The next presidency faces many challenges.\",\n    \"ch\": \"下一個總統任期面臨許多挑戰。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"下一個總統任期面臨許多挑戰。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U61"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5095,"wordRef":"字彙王::u61::presidential::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He gave a ____ address to the nation.","expectedAnswer":"presidential","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He gave a ____ address to the nation.","clozeAnswer":"presidential","exampleTranslation":"他向全國發表了總統講話。","reference":{"eng":"presidential","kk":"ˌprezɪˈdenʃl","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['總統的'], ['總統制的']]","chEntries":["總統的","總統制的"],"practiceMeaning":"他向全國發表了總統講話。","analysis":"此字由 'president' (總統) + '-ial' (形容詞化後綴，表示相關的、屬於……的) 構成。'-ial' 後綴將名詞轉換為形容詞，表明事物與 'president' 或 'presidency' 有關。因此，'presidential' 指的是 '與總統有關的'，例如 'presidential election' (總統選舉) 或 'presidential decree' (總統的命令)。它也可用來形容體制，如 'presidential system' (總統制)。","definition":"1. Relating to or characteristic of a president or the office of president.; 2. Relating to or suitable for a president.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The presidential election will be held next year.\",\n    \"ch\": \"總統選舉將於明年舉行。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He gave a presidential address to the nation.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他向全國發表了總統講話。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The hotel suite is very presidential.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這間酒店套房非常豪華，有總統級的氣派。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他向全國發表了總統講話。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U61"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3929,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u2::prevent::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Regular exercise can help ____ heart disease.","expectedAnswer":"prevent","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Regular exercise can help ____ heart disease.","clozeAnswer":"prevent","exampleTranslation":"規律運動有助於預防心臟病。","reference":{"eng":"prevent","kk":"/prɪˈvent/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['阻止', '預防'], ['防止']]","chEntries":["阻止","預防","防止"],"practiceMeaning":"規律運動有助於預防心臟病。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'praevenire'，由 'prae-' (意為「在…之前」) 和 'venire' (意為「來」) 組成。最初的意思是「預先到達」，引申為「預防、阻止某事發生」。","definition":"1. to stop someone from doing something or to stop something from happening; 2. to take action to stop something from happening or to stop someone from doing something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The police were unable to prevent the robbery.\",\n    \"ch\": \"警方未能阻止這場搶劫。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Regular exercise can help prevent heart disease.\",\n    \"ch\": \"規律運動有助於預防心臟病。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She wears gloves to prevent her hands from getting dry.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她戴手套以防止手部乾燥。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"規律運動有助於預防心臟病。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5438,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l3::priceless::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Her contribution to the team was ____.","expectedAnswer":"priceless","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Her contribution to the team was ____.","clozeAnswer":"priceless","exampleTranslation":"她對團隊的貢獻是無價的。","reference":{"eng":"priceless","kk":"ˈpraɪsləs","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['無價的'], ['極其珍貴的']]","chEntries":["無價的","極其珍貴的"],"practiceMeaning":"她對團隊的貢獻是無價的。","analysis":"此字為派生詞，由名詞 \"price\" (價格) 加上否定字尾 \"-less\" 構成。\"price\" 源自古法語 \"pris\"，最終可追溯至拉丁語 \"pretium\" (價值)。\"-less\" 是常見的否定字尾，表示「沒有」、「缺乏」。構詞上，\"price\" 提供了核心的「價格」或「價值」概念，\"-less\" 表示「沒有」。因此，\"priceless\" 的字面意思是「沒有價格的」，引申為「其價值無法估量」，即「無價的」、「極其珍貴的」。","definition":"so valuable that its price cannot be measured; extremely precious or valuable.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The ancient vase is a priceless artifact.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這件古老的瓷瓶是一件無價的藝術品。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her contribution to the team was priceless.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她對團隊的貢獻是無價的。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她對團隊的貢獻是無價的。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5485,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l4::private::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"This is a ____ matter, not for public discussion.","expectedAnswer":"private","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This is a ____ matter, not for public discussion.","clozeAnswer":"private","exampleTranslation":"這是私人事務，不宜公開討論。","reference":{"eng":"private","kk":"ˈpraɪvət","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['私人的'], ['私有的'], ['秘密的']]","chEntries":["私人的","私有的","秘密的"],"practiceMeaning":"這是私人事務，不宜公開討論。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'privatus'，是 'privare'（使失去、剝奪）的過去分詞。'Privare' 來自 'privus'（個人的、缺乏的）。'Privatus' 原意是「不屬於公職的」，引申為「屬於個人的、不公開的、私有的」。核心語意是「不屬於公眾、不公開、僅限於個人」。","definition":"1. Belonging to or for the use of one particular person or group rather than for public or general use.; 2. Not intended to be known or seen by the public.; 3. (Of a person) not employed in government or public service.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He prefers to keep his personal life private.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他傾向於保守個人隱私。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is a private matter, not for public discussion.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是私人事務，不宜公開討論。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She owns a private company.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她擁有一家私人公司。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這是私人事務，不宜公開討論。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5393,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l2::productive::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"It was a very ____ meeting; we made several key decisions.","expectedAnswer":"productive","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"It was a very ____ meeting; we made several key decisions.","clozeAnswer":"productive","exampleTranslation":"那是一次非常有成果的會議；我們做出了幾項關鍵決定。","reference":{"eng":"productive","kk":"prəˈdʌktɪv","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['生產的'], ['多產的'], ['有成果的'], ['富饒的']]","chEntries":["生產的","多產的","有成果的","富饒的"],"practiceMeaning":"那是一次非常有成果的會議；我們做出了幾項關鍵決定。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 productivus，是動詞 'producere' (生產、引出) 的派生詞。'pro-' (forward) + ducere (to lead)。核心語意是「能夠引導、產生」。因此，'productive' 形容「能夠產生大量成果、有效率」的，或「產出豐富的、富饒的」。","definition":"1. producing or able to produce large amounts of goods, crops, or wealth; 2. achieving a significant amount or result.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The farm was highly productive, yielding large harvests.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個農場生產力很高，產量豐富。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It was a very productive meeting; we made several key decisions.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那是一次非常有成果的會議；我們做出了幾項關鍵決定。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"那是一次非常有成果的會議；我們做出了幾項關鍵決定。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5096,"wordRef":"字彙王::u61::productivity::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The new software improved our team's ____.","expectedAnswer":"productivity","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The new software improved our team's ____.","clozeAnswer":"productivity","exampleTranslation":"這款新軟體提高了我們團隊的生產力。","reference":{"eng":"productivity","kk":"ˌproʊdʌkˈtɪvəti","tense":"n.","ch":"[['生產力'], ['生產率'], ['產出量']]","chEntries":["生產力","生產率","產出量"],"practiceMeaning":"這款新軟體提高了我們團隊的生產力。","analysis":"此字由 'produce' (生產) + '-tivity' (名詞化後綴，表示性質、狀態) 構成。'-tivity' 後綴常與詞根結合成表示性質或能力的抽象名詞，如 'activity', 'creativity'。'Productivity' 的核心語義是 '生產的效率和能力'，即 '在一定時間內能夠生產出多少產品或服務'。它衡量的是投入（勞動力、資源）與產出之間的關係，強調的是生產的效益。","definition":"1. The rate at which goods are produced or work is done.; 2. The state or quality of being productive.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Increased productivity can lead to economic growth.\",\n    \"ch\": \"提高生產力可以促進經濟成長。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The new software improved our team's productivity.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這款新軟體提高了我們團隊的生產力。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這款新軟體提高了我們團隊的生產力。","sourceName":"字彙王、龍騰課本","unitName":"U61、L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3881,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u1::professor::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ delivered an engaging lecture.","expectedAnswer":"professor","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ delivered an engaging lecture.","clozeAnswer":"professor","exampleTranslation":"教授做了一場引人入勝的演講。","reference":{"eng":"professor","kk":"/prəˈfɛsər/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['教授']]","chEntries":["教授"],"practiceMeaning":"教授做了一場引人入勝的演講。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'profiteri' (to declare, to profess)，其根源是 'pro-' (forward) + 'fateri' (to confess, acknowledge)。核心是「公開聲明」或「宣稱」。最初指相信某種宗教或哲學的人，後演變為大學中傳授知識、享有較高學術地位的教師。","definition":"a teacher of the highest rank in a college or university.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is a professor of history at Oxford University.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她是牛津大學的歷史學教授。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The professor delivered an engaging lecture.\",\n    \"ch\": \"教授做了一場引人入勝的演講。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He hopes to become a full professor one day.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他希望有一天能成為正教授。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"教授做了一場引人入勝的演講。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5412,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l3::progress::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Technological ____ has been rapid.","expectedAnswer":"progress","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Technological ____ has been rapid.","clozeAnswer":"progress","exampleTranslation":"科技進步一直很迅速。","reference":{"eng":"progress","kk":"ˈprɑːɡres","tense":"n.","ch":"[['進步'], ['進展'], ['進行']]","chEntries":["進步","進展","進行"],"practiceMeaning":"科技進步一直很迅速。","analysis":"此字源自古英語 \"progres\"，進一步可追溯至拉丁語 \"progressus\"，意為\"向前行\"。其中 \"pro-\" 是表示\"向前\"、\"在前面\"的字首，\"gressus\" 則是拉丁語 \"gradi\" (行走) 的過去分詞詞幹。構詞上，\"pro-\" 提供了方向性，\"gressus\" 則提供了核心的\"行走\"或\"移動\"語意，共同構成「向前移動」的概念，進而引申為「進步」或「進展」。最初的語義指物理上的前進，後來演變成抽象的「進步」或「發展」。","definition":"movement toward a destination; forward movement; forward movement in development or advancement; a series of events or actions that follow each other; the act of moving forward or advancing; the forward movement of something or someone.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The project is making good progress.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個計畫進展良好。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Technological progress has been rapid.\",\n    \"ch\": \"科技進步一直很迅速。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We witnessed the slow progress of the disease.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們見證了疾病的緩慢進展。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"科技進步一直很迅速。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3191,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::project::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The projector will ____ the image onto the screen.","expectedAnswer":"project","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The projector will ____ the image onto the screen.","clozeAnswer":"project","exampleTranslation":"投影機將影像投射到螢幕上。","reference":{"eng":"project","kk":"/prəˈdʒɛkt/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['預測；預計'], ['（光線、聲音等）投射；發射'], ['（尤指建築物）凸出；伸出']]","chEntries":["預測","預計","投射","發射","凸出","伸出"],"practiceMeaning":"投影機將影像投射到螢幕上。","analysis":"詞源來自拉丁語 'proicere'，意為「向前投擲」，由 'pro-'（向前）+ 'jacere'（扔）組成。'Project' 作動詞時，核心概念是「向前延伸」或「向前投射」。它可以指預測未來，將事物（如光線、影像）投射到表面，或指建築結構向前伸出。語意也引申為「展示」、「規劃」或「表現」。","definition":"1. estimate or forecast (something) for the future; 2. extend outwards beyond something else; jut out; 3. extend (light, sound, etc.) in a particular direction.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company projects a 10% increase in profits next year.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司預計明年利潤將增長10%。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The projector will project the image onto the screen.\",\n    \"ch\": \"投影機將影像投射到螢幕上。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The balcony projects over the street below.\",\n    \"ch\": \"陽台懸挑在下方的街道上。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"投影機將影像投射到螢幕上。","sourceName":"字彙王、龍騰課本","unitName":"U40、L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3244,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::promising::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The early results of the experiment are very ____.","expectedAnswer":"promising","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The early results of the experiment are very ____.","clozeAnswer":"promising","exampleTranslation":"實驗的早期結果非常有希望。","reference":{"eng":"promising","kk":"/ˈprɑːmɪsɪŋ/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['有希望的'], ['前景光明的'], ['有前途的']]","chEntries":["有希望的","前景光明的","有前途的"],"practiceMeaning":"實驗的早期結果非常有希望。","analysis":"源自動詞 'promise'，指『展現出好兆頭』或『預示著成功』。強調事物或人具有發展潛力，未來可能表現良好。","definition":"showing signs of future success.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is a promising young scientist.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她是一位有前途的年輕科學家。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The early results of the experiment are very promising.\",\n    \"ch\": \"實驗的早期結果非常有希望。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"實驗的早期結果非常有希望。","sourceName":"字彙王、龍騰課本","unitName":"U41、L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3180,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::prosper::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"May you ____ in all your endeavors.","expectedAnswer":"prosper","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"May you ____ in all your endeavors.","clozeAnswer":"prosper","exampleTranslation":"願你在所有事業上都取得成功。","reference":{"eng":"prosper","kk":"/ˈprɒspər/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['興旺；繁榮；成功']]","chEntries":["興旺","繁榮","成功"],"practiceMeaning":"願你在所有事業上都取得成功。","analysis":"詞源來自拉丁語 'prosperus'，意為「順利的，成功的」。'Prosper' 指的是在事業、財富、健康或生活方面取得成功，變得興旺和繁榮。它強調的是一種積極的發展和成功的趨勢，通常伴隨著財富的增加或幸福感的提升。","definition":"succeed financially; be fortunate or successful.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Businesses that adapt to new technology tend to prosper.\",\n    \"ch\": \"適應新技術的企業往往會興旺發達。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"May you prosper in all your endeavors.\",\n    \"ch\": \"願你在所有事業上都取得成功。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The city has prospered since the new industry arrived.\",\n    \"ch\": \"自從新產業進駐以來，這座城市就開始繁榮起來。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"願你在所有事業上都取得成功。","sourceName":"字彙王、龍騰課本","unitName":"U40、L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3182,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::prosperity::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We wish you health, happiness, and ____ in the New Year.","expectedAnswer":"prosperity","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We wish you health, happiness, and ____ in the New Year.","clozeAnswer":"prosperity","exampleTranslation":"我們祝您在新的一年裡健康、快樂、興旺。","reference":{"eng":"prosperity","kk":"/prɒˈspɛrɪtɪ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['繁榮；昌盛'], ['興旺；成功']]","chEntries":["繁榮","昌盛","興旺","成功"],"practiceMeaning":"我們祝您在新的一年裡健康、快樂、興旺。","analysis":"名詞，源自形容詞 'prosperous'。指「繁榮」、「昌盛」或「興旺」的狀態，通常指經濟上的富裕、成功和順遂。它代表著一個國家、地區、企業或個人處於良好發展和成功的時期，生活富足。","definition":"1. the state of being successful, especially in making money; 2. wealth and success.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The nation enjoyed a period of economic prosperity.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個國家經歷了一段經濟繁榮時期。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We wish you health, happiness, and prosperity in the New Year.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們祝您在新的一年裡健康、快樂、興旺。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The industrial revolution brought great prosperity to many cities.\",\n    \"ch\": \"工業革命為許多城市帶來了巨大的繁榮。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們祝您在新的一年裡健康、快樂、興旺。","sourceName":"字彙王、龍騰課本","unitName":"U40、L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4310,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::protection::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The spy wore a bulletproof vest for ____.","expectedAnswer":"protection","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The spy wore a bulletproof vest for ____.","clozeAnswer":"protection","exampleTranslation":"這名間諜穿了防彈背心以求保護。","reference":{"eng":"protection","kk":"/prəˈtɛkʃən/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['保護；庇護'], ['防護；防禦'], ['保護費；保護性措施']]","chEntries":["保護","庇護","防護","防禦","保護費","保護性措施"],"practiceMeaning":"這名間諜穿了防彈背心以求保護。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'protectio'，意為 'cover, shelter'。由 'pro-' (forward, in front of) 和 'tegere' (to cover) 構成。'pro-' 強化了『向前』、『前方』的動作，而 'tegere' 則指『遮蓋』，兩者結合即為『在前方遮蓋以保護』，引申為各種形式的保護、防衛、安全措施。","definition":"the action of protecting someone or something, or the state of being protected; a measure taken to protect someone or something","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The children are under the protection of their parents.\",\n    \"ch\": \"孩子們在父母的保護之下。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The spy wore a bulletproof vest for protection.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這名間諜穿了防彈背心以求保護。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to implement stronger data protection measures.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要實施更強力的數據保護措施。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這名間諜穿了防彈背心以求保護。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5596,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l7::protest::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The students' ____ was met with a strong police response.","expectedAnswer":"protest","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The students' ____ was met with a strong police response.","clozeAnswer":"protest","exampleTranslation":"學生的抗議活動遭到了警方強硬的回應。","reference":{"eng":"protest","kk":"ˈproʊtɛst","tense":"n.","ch":"[['抗議'], ['抗議活動'], ['反對聲明']]","chEntries":["抗議","抗議活動","反對聲明"],"practiceMeaning":"學生的抗議活動遭到了警方強硬的回應。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'protestari'，意為「公開聲明，作證」，由 'pro-'（公開地）和 'testari'（證明，作證）組成，後者又源於 'testis'（證人）。在構詞學上，此名詞形式是從動詞 'protest' 派生而來，透過零轉換 (zero derivation) 或內部構詞變化。詞源核心是「公開表明反對」。原始語意是「公開的聲明」，後來專指「公開表達不滿、反對的集體行動或聲明」。這與動詞形式的語意高度相關，但作為名詞，它指的是該行為或事件本身。","definition":"1. An expression of objection, disapproval, or dissent, often in opposition to something or someone; 2. A public demonstration of objection to an idea or course of action.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Thousands joined the protest against the government's policies.\",\n    \"ch\": \"數千人加入了抗議政府政策的遊行。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The students' protest was met with a strong police response.\",\n    \"ch\": \"學生的抗議活動遭到了警方強硬的回應。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"學生的抗議活動遭到了警方強硬的回應。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3183,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::psychology::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Understanding the ____ of consumers is crucial for marketing.","expectedAnswer":"psychology","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Understanding the ____ of consumers is crucial for marketing.","clozeAnswer":"psychology","exampleTranslation":"理解消費者的心理對於市場營銷至關重要。","reference":{"eng":"psychology","kk":"/saɪˈkɒlədʒɪ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['心理學']]","chEntries":["心理學"],"practiceMeaning":"理解消費者的心理對於市場營銷至關重要。","analysis":"源自希臘語 'psyche'（靈魂，心靈）+ 'logia'（學科）。'Psychology' 是一門科學，研究人類和動物的行為、思想過程、情感以及潛意識。它旨在理解和解釋人類的心理活動和行為模式。","definition":"the scientific study of the human mind and its functions, especially those affecting behavior in a given context.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is studying psychology at university.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她在大學裡攻讀心理學。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Understanding the psychology of consumers is crucial for marketing.\",\n    \"ch\": \"理解消費者的心理對於市場營銷至關重要。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The course covers various aspects of human psychology.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這門課程涵蓋了人類心理學的各個方面。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"理解消費者的心理對於市場營銷至關重要。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U40"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3247,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::publicity::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The charity event generated significant ____.","expectedAnswer":"publicity","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The charity event generated significant ____.","clozeAnswer":"publicity","exampleTranslation":"慈善活動產生了顯著的公眾關注。","reference":{"eng":"publicity","kk":"/pʌbˈlɪsəti/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['宣傳'], ['推廣'], [' publicity（公眾的注意）']]","chEntries":["宣傳","推廣","publicity"],"practiceMeaning":"慈善活動產生了顯著的公眾關注。","analysis":"源自 'public' (公眾的)，強調使某事物獲得公眾的『注意』和『知曉』。通常是通過廣告、新聞報導等方式。","definition":"attention or awareness given to someone or something by the media or other public sources.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The new movie is receiving a lot of publicity.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這部新電影正在獲得大量宣傳。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The charity event generated significant publicity.\",\n    \"ch\": \"慈善活動產生了顯著的公眾關注。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"慈善活動產生了顯著的公眾關注。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U41"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4225,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::puppetry::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The children were fascinated by the colorful ____ show.","expectedAnswer":"puppetry","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The children were fascinated by the colorful ____ show.","clozeAnswer":"puppetry","exampleTranslation":"孩子們被多彩的木偶戲表演迷住了。","reference":{"eng":"puppetry","kk":"/ˈpʌpətri/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['木偶戲；傀儡戲']]","chEntries":["木偶戲","傀儡戲"],"practiceMeaning":"孩子們被多彩的木偶戲表演迷住了。","analysis":"由 'puppet'（木偶）加上後綴 '-ry' 構成。'Puppet' 源自古法語 popet，意為“小教皇”，後引申為“玩偶”，來自拉丁語 pupa（女孩，玩偶）。'Puppetry' 指操縱木偶進行表演的藝術或實踐。","definition":"The art of making and manipulating puppets.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Glove puppetry is a traditional form of entertainment.\",\n    \"ch\": \"手套木偶戲是一種傳統的娛樂形式。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The children were fascinated by the colorful puppetry show.\",\n    \"ch\": \"孩子們被多彩的木偶戲表演迷住了。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"孩子們被多彩的木偶戲表演迷住了。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4336,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::pure::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She has a ____ heart.","expectedAnswer":"pure","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She has a ____ heart.","clozeAnswer":"pure","exampleTranslation":"她有一顆純潔的心。","reference":{"eng":"pure","kk":"/pjʊər/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['純粹的；純淨的'], ['（品質、味道等）完全的；不含雜質的'], ['（人）純潔的；無辜的'], ['（僅僅）純粹的；絕對的']]","chEntries":["純粹的","純淨的","完全的","不含雜質的","純潔的","無辜的","絕對的"],"practiceMeaning":"她有一顆純潔的心。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'purus'，意為 'clean, pure'。核心意為『沒有混合物』、『沒有污染』。1. 指物質『沒有雜質』，純淨。2. 指『品質、味道』等是原來的、未被稀釋或改變的。3. 指道德上『純潔、無辜』，未受污染。4. 作為副詞的用法（較少見），表示『僅僅、完全』，強調『純粹』的某種狀態。","definition":"not mixed with any other substances or chemicals and therefore not contaminated or polluted; having no negative qualities; without any bad or unwanted elements","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is pure gold.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是純金。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She has a pure heart.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她有一顆純潔的心。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The artist insisted on using pure colors.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位藝術家堅持使用純色。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It was pure luck that he found the keys.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他找到鑰匙純粹是運氣。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她有一顆純潔的心。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4170,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::put::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"____ yourself in my shoes.","expectedAnswer":"Put","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"____ yourself in my shoes.","clozeAnswer":"Put","exampleTranslation":"設身處地為我著想。","reference":{"eng":"put","kk":"/pʊt/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['放置', '擺放'], ['使處於（某種狀態）'], ['提出（問題、建議）'], ['演出（戲劇）']]","chEntries":["放置","擺放","使處於","提出","演出"],"practiceMeaning":"設身處地為我著想。","analysis":"源自古英語 potente（放置）。核心概念是「將某物移到特定位置或狀態」。用途極廣，涵蓋物理移動、狀態改變、提議、表演等多種意思。","definition":"1. move to or place in a particular position; 2. cause to be in a specified state or condition; 3. express (an idea or proposal) in a particular way; 4. stage or present (a play or other entertainment)","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He put the book on the table.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他把書放在桌子上。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Put yourself in my shoes.\",\n    \"ch\": \"設身處地為我著想。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They put on a great show.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們演了一場精彩的演出。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"設身處地為我著想。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3250,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::quilt::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ is thick and warm.","expectedAnswer":"quilt","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ is thick and warm.","clozeAnswer":"quilt","exampleTranslation":"這床被子厚實而溫暖。","reference":{"eng":"quilt","kk":"/kwɪlt/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['被子'], ['絎縫被']]","chEntries":["被子","絎縫被"],"practiceMeaning":"這床被子厚實而溫暖。","analysis":"詞源來自拉丁文 'quilta'，意為『用繩子縫製』。指一種由兩層布料中間填充隔熱材料（如棉花、羽絨）並通過絎縫（縫製圖案）固定的被褥。","definition":"a warm bed covering made of two layers of cloth with a layer of padding, such as cotton or down, in between, held in place by decorative lines of stitching.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She made a beautiful handmade quilt.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她製作了一張精美的純手工絎縫被。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The quilt is thick and warm.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這床被子厚實而溫暖。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這床被子厚實而溫暖。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U41"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3233,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::race::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The company developed a new ____ of dogs.","expectedAnswer":"race","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company developed a new ____ of dogs.","clozeAnswer":"race","exampleTranslation":"該公司培育了一個新品種的狗。","reference":{"eng":"race","kk":"/reɪs/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['種族'], ['品種']]","chEntries":["種族","品種"],"practiceMeaning":"該公司培育了一個新品種的狗。","analysis":"詞源來自古意大利語 'razza'，意為『家系』、『品種』。指因基因、生理特徵（如膚色、髮色）而區分的人群，或動植物的特定類別。","definition":"1. a group of people who share the same characteristic, such as skin color or origin; 2. a variety of animal or plant.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The debate on racial equality continues.\",\n    \"ch\": \"關於種族平等的辯論仍在繼續。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company developed a new race of dogs.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該公司培育了一個新品種的狗。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"該公司培育了一個新品種的狗。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U41"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4612,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u16::racial::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"____ tensions have been rising in the city.","expectedAnswer":"Racial","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"____ tensions have been rising in the city.","clozeAnswer":"Racial","exampleTranslation":"種族緊張局勢在這座城市不斷加劇。","reference":{"eng":"racial","kk":"/ˈreɪʃəl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['種族的'], ['人種的']]","chEntries":["種族的","人種的"],"practiceMeaning":"種族緊張局勢在這座城市不斷加劇。","analysis":"由 'race' (種族) + '-ial' (形容詞後綴) 組成。'Race' 源自義大利語 'razza'，其詞源不確定，但指基於共同遺傳特徵、歷史或文化的群體。此字用於描述與特定人種或種族群體相關的事物。","definition":"relating to or affecting a race of people.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company has policies against racial discrimination.\",\n    \"ch\": \"公司有反種族歧視的政策。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Racial tensions have been rising in the city.\",\n    \"ch\": \"種族緊張局勢在這座城市不斷加劇。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"種族緊張局勢在這座城市不斷加劇。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U16"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3251,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::rage::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The crowd's ____ was directed at the politicians.","expectedAnswer":"rage","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The crowd's ____ was directed at the politicians.","clozeAnswer":"rage","exampleTranslation":"人群的憤怒指向了政客。","reference":{"eng":"rage","kk":"/reɪdʒ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['狂怒'], ['盛怒']]","chEntries":["狂怒","盛怒"],"practiceMeaning":"人群的憤怒指向了政客。","analysis":"詞源來自古法語 'rage'，意為『憤怒』，最終來自拉丁文 'rabies' (madness)。指強烈、難以控制的憤怒情緒，通常表現為暴烈的行為。","definition":"violent, uncontrollable anger.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He flew into a rage when he heard the news.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他聽聞消息後勃然大怒。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The crowd's rage was directed at the politicians.\",\n    \"ch\": \"人群的憤怒指向了政客。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"人群的憤怒指向了