used a digital recorder to capture the lecture.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他使用數位錄音機來錄下講座。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The historian acted as the recorder of events.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位歷史學家擔任了事件的紀錄者。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She played the recorder beautifully.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她演奏的直笛非常優美。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這位歷史學家擔任了事件的紀錄者。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U17"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5518,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l5::recruit::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"They are trying to ____ volunteers for the event.","expectedAnswer":"recruit","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"They are trying to ____ volunteers for the event.","clozeAnswer":"recruit","exampleTranslation":"他們正試圖為活動招募志願者。","reference":{"eng":"recruit","kk":"rɪˈkruːt","tense":"v.","ch":"[['招募'], ['招聘'], ['新兵'], ['新成員'], ['新成員']]","chEntries":["招募","招聘","新兵","新成員"],"practiceMeaning":"他們正試圖為活動招募志願者。","analysis":"此字源自法語 'recruter'，意為 'to enroll, to muster troops'。後者源自拉丁語 'recrescere'，由 're-' (again) + 'crescere' (to grow) 構成，意為「重新生長」。構詞上，'re-' 表示「再次」，'crut'（或 'cresc'）是 'crescere' 的詞幹，意為「生長、增加」。原始語義是指「使軍隊再次增長」或「招募新成員以補充」。現代英語中，'recruit' 擴展為「招募」任何人加入組織（軍隊、公司、團隊等），以及「招募」這個動作本身。","definition":"to enlist (someone) in the armed forces; to obtain (new members) for an organization; to gain (new adherents or supporters).","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company is looking to recruit new graduates.\",\n    \"ch\": \"公司正在尋找招募應屆畢業生。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They are trying to recruit volunteers for the event.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們正試圖為活動招募志願者。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The army recruits young men and women.\",\n    \"ch\": \"軍隊招募年輕男女。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他們正試圖為活動招募志願者。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5058,"wordRef":"字彙王::u59::regardless::adv","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He continued to work, ____ of the difficulties.","expectedAnswer":"regardless","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He continued to work, ____ of the difficulties.","clozeAnswer":"regardless","exampleTranslation":"儘管有困難，他還是繼續工作。","reference":{"eng":"regardless","kk":"rɪˈɡɑːrdləs","tense":"adv.","ch":"[['不管怎樣'], ['不顧一切地'], ['儘管如此']]","chEntries":["不管怎樣","不顧一切地","儘管如此"],"practiceMeaning":"儘管有困難，他還是繼續工作。","analysis":"此字由 regard（考慮、顧及）加上否定字尾 -less（沒有）構成，加上前綴 re-（再次、加強）可能增強語意。其核心語意是「不考慮（某事）、不顧及（某事）」。表示不論情況如何，都要堅持做某事。OCR 掃描時可能將 'r' 誤判為 'n'，或 'g' 誤判為 'l'。此處修正為 regardless。","definition":"without paying attention to the present situation; despite the prevailing circumstances.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She decided to go, regardless of the weather.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她決定去，不管天氣怎樣。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He continued to work, regardless of the difficulties.\",\n    \"ch\": \"儘管有困難，他還是繼續工作。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"儘管有困難，他還是繼續工作。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U59"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4709,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u17::regret::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"There is no point in living with ____.","expectedAnswer":"regret","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"There is no point in living with ____.","clozeAnswer":"regret","exampleTranslation":"活在後悔中毫無意義。","reference":{"eng":"regret","kk":"/rɪˈɡrɛt/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['後悔'], ['遺憾']]","chEntries":["後悔","遺憾"],"practiceMeaning":"活在後悔中毫無意義。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 *regrettere*，由 *re-*（再次）和 *gratus*（愉快的，引申為滿足）構成，字面意思是「不再愉快」。核心是對於過去未能做或已做之事感到惋惜或不滿。這種情感往往伴隨著對未來的擔憂。","definition":"1. A feeling of sadness, repentance, or disappointment over something that has happened or been done.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He expressed deep regret for his actions.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他對自己的行為深感後悔。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There is no point in living with regret.\",\n    \"ch\": \"活在後悔中毫無意義。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"活在後悔中毫無意義。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U17"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3187,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::reject::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She decided to ____ the job offer.","expectedAnswer":"reject","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She decided to ____ the job offer.","clozeAnswer":"reject","exampleTranslation":"她決定拒絕這份工作機會。","reference":{"eng":"reject","kk":"/rɪˈdʒɛkt/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['拒絕；駁回'], ['（不）接受；（不）考慮'], ['（通常因有缺陷）丟棄；廢棄']]","chEntries":["拒絕","駁回","接受","考慮","丟棄","廢棄"],"practiceMeaning":"她決定拒絕這份工作機會。","analysis":"詞源來自拉丁語 'rejicere'，意為「扔回，拋棄」，由 're-'（向後）+ 'jacere'（扔）組成。'Reject' 強調的是明確地拒絕接受、同意或考慮。它可以是對提議、請求、申請的拒絕，也可以是將某物（特別是因有缺陷）視為無用而丟棄。語意延伸至指人們因為不符合標準或期望而被拒絕。","definition":"1. dismiss as inadequate, unacceptable, or faulty; 2. refuse to accept or grant; 3. refuse to consider or accept (a proposal or idea).","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The committee rejected his proposal.\",\n    \"ch\": \"委員會駁回了他的提議。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She decided to reject the job offer.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她決定拒絕這份工作機會。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The factory rejected the defective products.\",\n    \"ch\": \"工廠將有缺陷的產品報廢了。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她決定拒絕這份工作機會。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U40"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4115,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::relief::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"International ____ efforts were mobilized after the earthquake.","expectedAnswer":"relief","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"International ____ efforts were mobilized after the earthquake.","clozeAnswer":"relief","exampleTranslation":"地震發生後，國際救濟行動被迅速調動起來。","reference":{"eng":"relief","kk":"/rɪˈliːf/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['緩解', '減輕'], ['救濟', '援助'], ['解脫', '安慰'], ['（雕塑、繪畫等的）浮雕']]","chEntries":["緩解","減輕","救濟","援助","解脫","安慰","浮雕"],"practiceMeaning":"地震發生後，國際救濟行動被迅速調動起來。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 relevare，由 re-（再次）+ levare（舉起、減輕）組成。核心概念是「減輕負擔」或「解除痛苦」。引申為疾病的緩解、災難的援助、壓力的釋放，甚至藝術中的凸顯效果。","definition":"1. a feeling of reassurance and relaxation following release from anxiety or distress; 2. assistance to people in a sudden emergency or disaster; 3. the easing or alleviation of a pain or symptom; 4. (in art) the projection of a figure or design from its background","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The medicine provided some relief from her pain.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這種藥物減輕了她的疼痛。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"International relief efforts were mobilized after the earthquake.\",\n    \"ch\": \"地震發生後，國際救濟行動被迅速調動起來。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It was a great relief to hear that he was safe.\",\n    \"ch\": \"聽到他安然無恙，我感到鬆了一口氣。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The statue featured intricate relief work.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這座雕像以精緻的浮雕工藝為特色。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"地震發生後，國際救濟行動被迅速調動起來。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U5、L3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3114,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::remain::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She decided to ____ in Paris for another week.","expectedAnswer":"remain","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She decided to ____ in Paris for another week.","clozeAnswer":"remain","exampleTranslation":"她決定在巴黎再逗留一週。","reference":{"eng":"remain","kk":"/rɪˈmeɪn/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['保持（原狀）；仍然是'], ['逗留；留下'], ['剩餘']]","chEntries":["保持","仍然是","逗留","留下","剩餘"],"practiceMeaning":"她決定在巴黎再逗留一週。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'remanere'，'re-' (back) + 'manere' (to stay)。核心意義是「繼續停留」。\n1. 保持（原狀）；仍然是：指在經歷變化後，依然保持原來的狀態或身份。\n2. 逗留；留下：指停留在某個地方，不離開。\n3. 剩餘：指在消耗或使用後，剩下的部分。","definition":"1. to stay in the same place or in the same condition; 2. to continue to be something or someone; 3. to be left when all other parts have gone.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The price of the house remained the same.\",\n    \"ch\": \"房子的價格保持不變。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She decided to remain in Paris for another week.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她決定在巴黎再逗留一週。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Only a few minutes remained.\",\n    \"ch\": \"只剩下幾分鐘了。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她決定在巴黎再