ted.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The monthly rental for the apartment is high.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這間公寓的月租金很高。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We made the booking for the rental online.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們在網上預訂了租賃事宜。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們在網上預訂了租賃事宜。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5442,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l3::resident::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She is a ____ physician at the local hospital.","expectedAnswer":"resident","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She is a ____ physician at the local hospital.","clozeAnswer":"resident","exampleTranslation":"她是當地醫院的住院醫師。","reference":{"eng":"resident","kk":"ˈrezɪdənt","tense":"n.","ch":"[['居民'], ['住戶'], ['住院醫師']]","chEntries":["居民","住戶","住院醫師"],"practiceMeaning":"她是當地醫院的住院醫師。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 \"residens\"，是動詞 \"residere\" (居住、留下) 的現在分詞，意為\"居住者\"。\"residere\" 由 \"re-\" (表示\"回歸\"或\"持續\") 和 \"sedere\" (坐、居住) 構成。構詞上，\"resid-\" 提供了核心的「居住」或「留下」語意，\"-ent\" 是常見的名詞字尾，表示執行該動作的「人」或「物」。因此，\"resident\" 指的是「居住在某地的人」，或是「在某機構（如醫院）長期工作的人」。","definition":"a person who lives in a particular place or area; a person who lives in a particular place for a long time; a doctor receiving specialized training in a hospital after medical school.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The residents of the neighborhood protested the new development.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該社區的居民抗議新的開發計畫。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is a resident physician at the local hospital.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她是當地醫院的住院醫師。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Only registered residents are allowed to vote in local elections.\",\n    \"ch\": \"只有登記在冊的居民才能在地方選舉中投票。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她是當地醫院的住院醫師。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3943,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u2::response::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Her ____ was immediate and helpful.","expectedAnswer":"response","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Her ____ was immediate and helpful.","clozeAnswer":"response","exampleTranslation":"她的回應迅速且有幫助。","reference":{"eng":"response","kk":"/rɪˈspɒns/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['回應', '答覆'], ['反應']]","chEntries":["回應","答覆","反應"],"practiceMeaning":"她的回應迅速且有幫助。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'responsum'，是動詞 'respondere' (意為「回答、回應」) 的過去分詞名詞化。指對某事的回應、回答或反應。","definition":"1. an answer or reaction to something; 2. a reply.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We received a positive response to our advertisement.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們對廣告收到了積極的回應。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her response was immediate and helpful.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她的回應迅速且有幫助。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The body's response to the virus was strong.\",\n    \"ch\": \"身體對病毒的反應很強烈。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她的回應迅速且有幫助。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3918,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u2::responsibility::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He resigned from his position due to personal ____.","expectedAnswer":"responsibility","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He resigned from his position due to personal ____.","clozeAnswer":"responsibility","exampleTranslation":"他因個人責任辭去了職務。","reference":{"eng":"responsibility","kk":"/rɪˌspɒnsəˈbɪləti/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['責任', '職責'], ['負責的能力'], ['應負的責任']]","chEntries":["責任","職責","負責的能力","應負的責任"],"practiceMeaning":"他因個人責任辭去了職務。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'responsus' (動詞 'respondere' 的過去分詞，意為「回答、承擔」)。're-' (意為「再次」) + 'spondere' (意為「承諾、保證」)。原指「承諾」或「回答」，後演變為「應負的責任」或「擔任責任的能力」。","definition":"1. the state or fact of having a duty to deal with something or of having control over someone; 2. the state or fact of being accountable or to blame for something; 3. the opportunity or ability to do something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Taking care of a pet is a big responsibility.\",\n    \"ch\": \"照顧寵物是一項重大的責任。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He resigned from his position due to personal responsibility.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他因個人責任辭去了職務。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She has a strong sense of responsibility.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她有強烈的責任感。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他因個人責任辭去了職務。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3112,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::retain::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"This law will ____ its importance for years to come.","expectedAnswer":"retain","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This law will ____ its importance for years to come.","clozeAnswer":"retain","exampleTranslation":"這項法律在未來幾年仍將保持其重要性。","reference":{"eng":"retain","kk":"/rɪˈteɪn/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['保留；保持'], ['（在記憶中）記住'], ['聘請（律師等）']]","chEntries":["保留","保持","記住","聘請"],"practiceMeaning":"這項法律在未來幾年仍將保持其重要性。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'retinere'，'re-' (back) + 'tenere' (to hold)。核心意義是「再次抓住」或「保持」。\n1. 保留；保持：指繼續擁有、持有或維持某物。\n2. （在記憶中）記住：指能夠記住信息或知識。\n3. 聘請（律師等）：指為獲得某人的專業服務而預付費用，使其隨時待命。","definition":"1. to keep something or continue to have something; 2. to remember information; 3. to keep someone employed by paying them a fee.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She managed to retain her composure during the crisis.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她在危機中設法保持了鎮定。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This law will retain its importance for years to come.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這項法律在未來幾年仍將保持其重要性。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He was retained by the company as a legal advisor.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他被公司聘為法律顧問。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這項法律在未來幾年仍將保持其重要性。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U39"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3116,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::retirement::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The company offers a good ____ plan.","expectedAnswer":"retirement","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The company offers a good ____ plan.","clozeAnswer":"retirement","exampleTranslation":"公司提供良好的退休金計劃。","reference":{"eng":"retirement","kk":"/rɪˈtaɪərmənt/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['退休'], ['退休生活']]","chEntries":["退休","退休生活"],"practiceMeaning":"公司提供良好的退休金計劃。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'retirare' 的名詞形式。指「停止工作」的狀態或過程。\n1. 退休：指停止工作的行為或時期。\n2. 退休生活：指退休後的生活狀態，通常是較為悠閒和放鬆的。","definition":"1. the state of no longer having a job, usually because you have reached an age at which you can stop working; 2. the period of time after you have stopped working.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is looking forward to her retirement.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她期待著她的退休生活。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company offers a good retirement plan.\",\n    \"ch\": \"公司提供良好的退休金計劃。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"公司提供良好的退休金計劃。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U39"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4008,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u3::reveal::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The curtain rose to ____ the stage.","expectedAnswer":"reveal","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The curtain rose to ____ the stage.","clozeAnswer":"reveal","exampleTranslation":"簾幕升起，展示了舞台。","reference":{"eng":"reveal","kk":"/rɪˈviːl/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['揭露', '透露'], ['展示', '顯現']]","chEntries":["揭露","透露","展示","顯現"],"practiceMeaning":"簾幕升起，展示了舞台。","analysis":"詞源：拉丁文 'revelare' (揭開面紗)，由 're-' (再次) 和 'velare' (遮蓋) 組成。意指「移去遮蓋物」，引申為公開秘密或展示事物。","definition":"1. make (previously unknown or secret information) known to others; 2. allow to be seen; display.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The investigation revealed the truth.\",\n    \"ch\": \"調查揭露了真相。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The curtain rose to reveal the stage.\",\n    \"ch\": \"簾幕升起，展示了舞台。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"簾幕升起，展示了舞台。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5619,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l7::revolution::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The discovery of penicillin was a ____ in medicine.","expectedAnswer":"revolution","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The discovery of penicillin was a ____ in medicine.","clozeAnswer":"revolution","exampleTranslation":"盤尼西林的發現是醫學上的一場革命。","reference":{"eng":"revolution","kk":"ˌrɛvəˈluʃən","tense":"n.","ch":"[['革命'], ['變革'], ['（天體）公轉'], ['（循環）']]","chEntries":["革命","變革","公轉"],"practiceMeaning":"盤尼西林的發現是醫學上的一場革命。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'revolutio'，意為「捲回、翻轉」，由動詞 'revolvere'（捲回）派生，'revolvere' 由 're-'（回、再次）和 'volvere'（捲、轉）組成。構詞學上，'re-' 是表示「回」或「再次」的字首，'vol-' 是「捲」或「轉」的詞根，'-ution' 是表示「過程」或「結果」的名詞化後綴。原始語意是「捲回」或「轉動」。從「重複的轉動」（如天體運行）引申為「徹底的變革」（如社會或政治上的）、「循環」。","definition":"1. A forcible overthrow of a government or other social order in favor of a new system; 2. A fundamental change in the way something is done or thought about; 3. The regular and continuous movement of a celestial body in an orbit around another.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The French Revolution had a profound impact on European history.\",\n    \"ch\": \"法國大革命對歐洲歷史產生了深遠的影響。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The discovery of penicillin was a revolution in medicine.\",\n    \"ch\": \"盤尼西林的發現是醫學上的一場革命。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The Earth completes one revolution around the Sun in approximately 365 days.\",\n    \"ch\": \"地球大約需要 365 天完成一次繞太陽的公轉。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"盤尼西林的發現是醫學上的一場革命。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5100,"wordRef":"字彙王::u61::rim::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The bicycle ____ was bent.","expectedAnswer":"rim","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The bicycle ____ was bent.","clozeAnswer":"rim","exampleTranslation":"自行車的輪緣彎了。","reference":{"eng":"rim","kk":"rɪm","tense":"n.","ch":"[['邊緣'], ['輪緣'], ['框']]","chEntries":["邊緣","輪緣","框"],"practiceMeaning":"自行車的輪緣彎了。","analysis":"此字源自古英語 'rim'，意為 '邊緣'，可能與 'rein' (bridle rein) 有關。其核心語義是指一個物體的外圍邊緣，特別是圓形或環狀物體的頂部邊緣。例如，輪胎的輪緣、杯子的邊緣、眼鏡的鏡框。它代表的是物體的外部界限。","definition":"1. The outer, typically circular or oval, edge of something.; 2. The wheel of a motor vehicle or bicycle.; 3. A border or margin.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He dropped his keys over the rim of the well.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他把鑰匙掉進了井緣裡。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The bicycle rim was bent.\",\n    \"ch\": \"自行車的輪緣彎了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She wore glasses with a thin metal rim.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她戴著一副細金屬框眼鏡。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"自行車的輪緣彎了。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U61"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5143,"wordRef":"字彙王::u62::riot::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The garden was a ____ of color in spring.","expectedAnswer":"riot","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The garden was a ____ of color in spring.","clozeAnswer":"riot","exampleTranslation":"春天時，花園裡色彩繽紛。","reference":{"eng":"riot","kk":"ˈraɪət","tense":"n.","ch":"[['騷亂'], ['暴動'], ['（場景、色彩等）繽紛']]","chEntries":["騷亂","暴動","繽紛"],"practiceMeaning":"春天時，花園裡色彩繽紛。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 riote，意為「爭吵、騷動」。詞源不確定，可能與拉丁語 riota（喧鬧）或古英語 rȳt（怒火）有關。核心語意是「群眾的暴力、無秩序的行為」。引申為「極度興奮的狀態」（a riot of color）。","definition":"a violent disturbance of the peace by a crowd; a wildly lively scene or display.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The protest turned into a violent riot.\",\n    \"ch\": \"抗議演變成了一場暴力騷亂。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The garden was a riot of color in spring.\",\n    \"ch\": \"春天時，花園裡色彩繽紛。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"春天時，花園裡色彩繽紛。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U62"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5411,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l2::rise-above::idiom","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"It's important to ____ petty arguments.","expectedAnswer":"rise above","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"It's important to ____ petty arguments.","clozeAnswer":"rise above","exampleTranslation":"重要的是要超越無聊的爭論。","reference":{"eng":"rise above","kk":"ˈraɪz əˈbʌv","tense":"idiom","ch":"[['克服'], ['超越'], ['保持（良好態度），不計較']]","chEntries":["克服","超越","保持，不計較"],"practiceMeaning":"重要的是要超越無聊的爭論。","analysis":"此片語由動詞 'rise' (上升) 和介詞 'above' (在……之上) 組成。核心概念是「向上移動，越過某個水平」。引申義為「超越困難、挑戰、負面情緒或卑劣行為」，保持優越、堅韌或道德上的高標準。","definition":"To overcome difficulties or unpleasant situations; to refuse to be affected by unpleasant or difficult things.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She managed to rise above the criticism and continue her work.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她設法克服了批評，繼續她的工作。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It's important to rise above petty arguments.\",\n    \"ch\": \"重要的是要超越無聊的爭論。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"重要的是要超越無聊的爭論。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4408,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::risk::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He took a ____ by investing in the stock market.","expectedAnswer":"risk","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He took a ____ by investing in the stock market.","clozeAnswer":"risk","exampleTranslation":"他投資股票市場冒了風險。","reference":{"eng":"risk","kk":"/rɪsk/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['風險', '危險']]","chEntries":["風險","危險"],"practiceMeaning":"他投資股票市場冒了風險。","analysis":"詞源自義大利語 'risco' (rock, danger)，可能源自拉丁語 'resca' (a steep rock)。指發生損失、傷害或不利後果的可能性。","definition":"the possibility of something bad happening.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There is a high risk of infection.\",\n    \"ch\": \"感染的風險很高。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He took a risk by investing in the stock market.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他投資股票市場冒了風險。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他投資股票市場冒了風險。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U9、L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5144,"wordRef":"字彙王::u62::risky::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"It was a ____ decision.","expectedAnswer":"risky","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"It was a ____ decision.","clozeAnswer":"risky","exampleTranslation":"這是一個冒險的決定。","reference":{"eng":"risky","kk":"ˈrɪski","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['冒險的'], ['危險的'], ['有風險的']]","chEntries":["冒險的","危險的","有風險的"],"practiceMeaning":"這是一個冒險的決定。","analysis":"此字由 risk（風險）+ -y（形容詞字尾）組成。risk 源自古法語 rische，意為「危險、機會」，可能來自義大利語 rischio，最終來自希臘語 rhiza（礁石、危險）。-y 是常見的形容詞字尾。核心語意為「包含風險、可能造成損失或危險」。","definition":"full of the possibility of danger, failure, or loss.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Investing in startups can be risky.\",\n    \"ch\": \"投資初創公司可能風險很高。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It was a risky decision.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是一個冒險的決定。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這是一個冒險的決定。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U62"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4466,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::rough::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We had a ____ journey through the mountains.","expectedAnswer":"rough","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We had a ____ journey through the mountains.","clozeAnswer":"rough","exampleTranslation":"我們經歷了一趟艱難的山區旅程。","reference":{"eng":"rough","kk":"/rʌf/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['粗糙的'], ['崎嶇的'], ['劇烈的'], ['嚴酷的'], ['（計劃、概念）大致的'], ['粗暴的'], ['（天氣）惡劣的']]","chEntries":["粗糙的","崎嶇的","劇烈的","嚴酷的","大致的","粗暴的","惡劣的"],"practiceMeaning":"我們經歷了一趟艱難的山區旅程。","analysis":"源自古英語 rōh，意為「未加工的」、「粗糙的」。核心語意是「表面不光滑」。引申為「不平坦的」（地形），「不細緻的」（計劃、想法），「激烈的」（動作、天氣），「困難的」（經歷），「粗魯的」（人）等。","definition":"1. Having an uneven or irregular surface; not smooth; 2. Not exact or detailed; 3. Violent or severe; 4. Difficult or unpleasant.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The bark of the tree was rough to the touch.\",\n    \"ch\": \"樹皮摸起來很粗糙。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We had a rough journey through the mountains.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們經歷了一趟艱難的山區旅程。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I only have a rough idea of the cost.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我只有對費用的粗略想法。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The sea was rough today.\",\n    \"ch\": \"今天海浪很大。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們經歷了一趟艱難的山區旅程。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U10、L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5529,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l5::sack::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The workers were given a ____ for their tools.","expectedAnswer":"sack","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The workers were given a ____ for their tools.","clozeAnswer":"sack","exampleTranslation":"工人們得到一個大袋子來裝工具。","reference":{"eng":"sack","kk":"sæk","tense":"n.","ch":"[['麻袋'], ['大袋子'], ['臥鋪（美式俚語）'], ['解僱']]","chEntries":["麻袋","大袋子","臥鋪","解僱"],"practiceMeaning":"工人們得到一個大袋子來裝工具。","analysis":"此字源自古英語 'sacc'，來自拉丁語 'saccus'，後者源自希臘語 'sakkos'，可能源自閃族語。原始語義是「粗麻布袋」。構詞上無明顯字首、字根、字尾。語意上，'sack' 指一種「由粗糙材料製成的、用於裝東西的大袋子」。引申義包括「在體育比賽中，進攻方球員使對方持球者喪失前進動力」（美式足球），或俚語中「解僱」的意思。但最核心的語義是「大袋子」。","definition":"a large bag made of coarse material, used for storing or carrying loose articles; a type of bag used for sleeping in.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He carried a sack of potatoes.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他扛著一袋馬鈴薯。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The workers were given a sack for their tools.\",\n    \"ch\": \"工人們得到一個大袋子來裝工具。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"工人們得到一個大袋子來裝工具。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5857,"wordRef":"字彙王::u58::sacred::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"They believed the river was ____.","expectedAnswer":"sacred","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"They believed the river was ____.","clozeAnswer":"sacred","exampleTranslation":"他們相信這條河是神聖的。","reference":{"eng":"sacred","kk":"ˈseɪkrɪd","tense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"神聖的\"  ],  [    \"聖潔的\"  ],  [    \"宗教的\"  ],  [    \"受尊敬的\"  ]]","chEntries":["神聖的","聖潔的","宗教的","受尊敬的"],"practiceMeaning":"他們相信這條河是神聖的。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'sacer'，意為「神聖的」、「獻給神的」。'-ed' 是形容詞字尾。'Sacer' 的詞源與印歐語根 *sak- (to make holy) 有關。'Sacred' 的核心語意是指「與宗教、神祇或儀式有關的」，因此被視為「神聖的」、「不可褻瀆的」。引申義則指「極受尊敬的」、「神聖不可侵犯的」，用於形容珍貴的事物或權利。","definition":"1. Connected with God or a god or a religious purpose.; 2. Regarded with great respect and affection.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is a sacred site for many religions.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是許多宗教的神聖之地。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They believed the river was sacred.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們相信這條河是神聖的。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \