ntage; well-being.; 2. the purpose of; the reason for.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"For goodness sake, stop that noise!\",\n    \"ch\": \"看在上帝的份上，停止那噪音！\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He sacrificed his career for the sake of his family.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他為了家庭犧牲了自己的事業。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他為了家庭犧牲了自己的事業。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U11"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5310,"wordRef":"字彙王::u63::salmon::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Her favorite color is ____ pink.","expectedAnswer":"salmon","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Her favorite color is ____ pink.","clozeAnswer":"salmon","exampleTranslation":"她最喜歡的顏色是鮭魚粉色。","reference":{"eng":"salmon","kk":"ˈsæmən","tense":"n.","ch":"[['鮭魚', '三文魚'], ['（鮭魚的）淡粉紅色']]","chEntries":["鮭魚","三文魚","淡粉紅色"],"practiceMeaning":"她最喜歡的顏色是鮭魚粉色。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 'saumon'，來自拉丁語 'salamo'，最終可能與拉丁語 'salire'（to leap）有關，指鮭魚跳躍的習性。在英語中，'l' 在此處不發音。核心語意為一種特定的魚類——鮭魚。也可用於描述其獨特的粉紅色。","definition":"a large edible fish that is the<bos>-coloured member of the cod family; a pinkish orange colour.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We had grilled salmon for dinner.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們晚餐吃了烤鮭魚。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Her favorite color is salmon pink.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她最喜歡的顏色是鮭魚粉色。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她最喜歡的顏色是鮭魚粉色。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U63"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5312,"wordRef":"字彙王::u63::scenario::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The film's ____ was praised for its originality.","expectedAnswer":"scenario","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The film's ____ was praised for its originality.","clozeAnswer":"scenario","exampleTranslation":"這部電影的情節因其原創性而受到讚揚。","reference":{"eng":"scenario","kk":"səˈnɑːrioʊ","tense":"n.","ch":"[['情況', '局面'], ['（電影、戲劇等的）劇本', '情節'], ['設想的場景、方案']]","chEntries":["情況","局面","劇本","情節","設想的場景、方案"],"practiceMeaning":"這部電影的情節因其原創性而受到讚揚。","analysis":"此字源自義大利語 'scenario'（情節、劇本），可能源自 'scena'（場景，來自拉丁語 'scena'，希臘語 'skēnē'），或與「下雨」有關（指農作物的情境）。最初指戲劇的「劇本」或「情節」。在現代英語中，'scenario' 廣泛指代對未來可能發生的「情況」、「局面」或「一系列事件」的設想或描述，常用於規劃、風險評估等。","definition":"a postulated sequence or development of events; a written list of scenes and dialogue for a play or film; an imagined situation or sequence of events.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"What is the worst-case scenario?\",\n    \"ch\": \"最壞的情況是怎樣的？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The film's scenario was praised for its originality.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這部電影的情節因其原創性而受到讚揚。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這部電影的情節因其原創性而受到讚揚。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U63"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4391,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::scholarship::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"His ____ in ancient history is well-known.","expectedAnswer":"scholarship","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"His ____ in ancient history is well-known.","clozeAnswer":"scholarship","exampleTranslation":"他在古代史方面的學術造詣眾所周知。","reference":{"eng":"scholarship","kk":"/ˈskɒləʃɪp/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['獎學金'], ['學術成就', '學識']]","chEntries":["獎學金","學術成就","學識"],"practiceMeaning":"他在古代史方面的學術造詣眾所周知。","analysis":"詞源自 'scholar'（學者）， '-ship' 是表示狀態、技能或職位的後綴。原意是學者應具備的學識或品質。現今最常見的用法是指學校或機構提供的，用於資助學生學習的經濟援助，即獎學金。","definition":"an amount of money given by a school, university, or other organization to a student to help pay for their education; the studies and achievements of a scholar.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She received a scholarship to study abroad.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她獲得獎學金出國留學。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His scholarship in ancient history is well-known.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在古代史方面的學術造詣眾所周知。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他在古代史方面的學術造詣眾所周知。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4079,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u4::scissors::n-plural","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She cut the paper with ____.","expectedAnswer":"scissors","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She cut the paper with ____.","clozeAnswer":"scissors","exampleTranslation":"她用剪刀剪了紙。","reference":{"eng":"scissors","kk":"/ˈsɪzərz/","tense":"n. (plural)","ch":"[['剪刀']]","chEntries":["剪刀"],"practiceMeaning":"她用剪刀剪了紙。","analysis":"源自古法語 'cisour'，來自拉丁語 'caesorius'，意為「切割的」。'scissors' 在語法上始終為複數形式，因為它指由兩片刀刃組成的工具。","definition":"a tool for cutting cloth, paper, and other light materials, consisting of two blades joined at one end that move against each other","example":"[\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"你能把剪刀遞給我嗎？\",\n    \"eng\": \"Can you pass me the scissors?\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"她用剪刀剪了紙。\",\n    \"eng\": \"She cut the paper with scissors.\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她用剪刀剪了紙。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5313,"wordRef":"字彙王::u63::scope::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"This decision is beyond the ____ of my authority.","expectedAnswer":"scope","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This decision is beyond the ____ of my authority.","clozeAnswer":"scope","exampleTranslation":"這個決定超出了我的權限範圍。","reference":{"eng":"scope","kk":"skoʊp","tense":"n.","ch":"[['範圍', '幅度'], ['（能力、影響等的）範圍', '餘地'], ['（望遠鏡、顯微鏡等的）鏡筒']]","chEntries":["範圍","幅度","餘地","鏡筒"],"practiceMeaning":"這個決定超出了我的權限範圍。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'scopus'（目標，目的），來自希臘語 'skopos' (σκοπός)，意為「觀察者、目標、目的」。構詞上，'scop-' 為詞根，'-us' 為名詞後綴。原始語意為「看」、「觀察」或「目標」。此語意引申為「觀察的範圍」、「理解的範圍」、「活動的範圍」或「影響的範圍」。","definition":"the extent of the area or subject matter that something deals with; the opportunity for doing something; the part of a telescope or microscope that contains the lenses.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The scope of the research was limited.\",\n    \"ch\": \"研究的範圍是有限的。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This decision is beyond the scope of my authority.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個決定超出了我的權限範圍。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The microscope has a wide-field scope.\",\n    \"ch