e cold water.","expectedAnswer":"sip","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She took a ____ of the cold water.","clozeAnswer":"sip","exampleTranslation":"她啜飲了一口冷水。","reference":{"eng":"sip","kk":"/sɪp/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['啜飲']]","chEntries":["啜飲"],"practiceMeaning":"她啜飲了一口冷水。","analysis":"擬聲詞，模仿小口喝水的聲音。核心語意是「小口地喝」。","definition":"1. To drink (something) by taking small mouthfuls.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He sipped his tea slowly.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他緩慢地啜飲著他的茶。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She took a sip of the cold water.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她啜飲了一口冷水。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她啜飲了一口冷水。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5434,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l3::situate::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We need to ____ ourselves in the context of global markets.","expectedAnswer":"situate","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We need to ____ ourselves in the context of global markets.","clozeAnswer":"situate","exampleTranslation":"我們需要將自己置於全球市場的背景下。","reference":{"eng":"situate","kk":"ˈsɪtʃueɪt","tense":"v.","ch":"[['使位於'], ['使坐落於'], ['安置']]","chEntries":["使位於","使坐落於","安置"],"practiceMeaning":"我們需要將自己置於全球市場的背景下。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 \"situare\"，意為\"使處於……位置\"，來自 \"situs\" (位置、地點)。構詞上，\"situ-\" 提供了核心的「位置」語意，\"-ate\" 是動詞字尾。 \"Situate\" 的核心語義是「將某物放置或安置在一個特定的位置或環境」，通常用於描述固定物體的地理位置。","definition":"to put in a particular position or place; to locate; to place or locate.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The new factory was situated in an industrial park.\",\n    \"ch\": \"新工廠被安置在一個工業園區。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to situate ourselves in the context of global markets.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要將自己置於全球市場的背景下。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們需要將自己置於全球市場的背景下。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3975,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u3::skate::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"____ is a popular 