kip the introduction and go straight to the main topic.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請跳過引言，直接進入主要話題。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He skipped a grade in elementary school.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在小學跳級了。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"請跳過引言，直接進入主要話題。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U17"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5807,"wordRef":"字彙王::u60::skull::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Archaeologists found a human ____ at the dig site.","expectedAnswer":"skull","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Archaeologists found a human ____ at the dig site.","clozeAnswer":"skull","exampleTranslation":"考古學家在挖掘地點發現了一顆人頭骨。","reference":{"eng":"skull","kk":"skʌl","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"頭蓋骨\"  ],  [    \"顱骨\"  ],  [    \"髑髏\"  ]]","chEntries":["頭蓋骨","顱骨","髑髏"],"practiceMeaning":"考古學家在挖掘地點發現了一顆人頭骨。","analysis":"此字為名詞，源自古英語scull，可能與古諾斯語skalli（光禿的頭）有關，詞源意義為「頭部」或「頭蓋」。核心語義是指「構成頭部骨骼結構的骨頭」，即頭蓋骨或顱骨。語意演變上，從「頭部」的概念，具體化為保護大腦的「頭骨」。","definition":"1. the bony framework of the head of a person or vertebrate animal, enclosing the brain and supporting the facial structures.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The skull protects the brain.\",\n    \"ch\": \"頭蓋骨保護大腦。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Archaeologists found a human skull at the dig site.\",\n    \"ch\": \"考古學家在挖掘地點發現了一顆人頭骨。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The skull and crossbones is a symbol of danger.\",\n    \"ch\": \"骷髏頭和交叉的骨頭是危險的象徵。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"考古學家在挖掘地點發現了一顆人頭骨。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U60"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6242,"wordRef":"字彙王::u67::slam::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ of the gavel echoed through the courtroom.","expectedAnswer":"slam","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ of the gavel echoed through the courtroom.","clozeAnswer":"slam","exampleTranslation":"法槌的重擊聲在法庭上迴盪。","reference":{"eng":"slam","kk":"slæm","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"猛擊聲\"  ],  [    \"重擊\"  ],  [    \"猛烈批評\"  ]]","chEntries":["猛擊聲","重擊","猛烈批評"],"practiceMeaning":"法槌的重擊聲在法庭上迴盪。","analysis":"此字源自擬聲詞，模仿門窗等重重關閉的聲音。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根。名詞義指猛關、猛摔或猛擊的動作及其發出的聲音，也引申為強烈的批評或抨擊。中文翻譯為「猛擊聲；重擊；猛烈批評」。","definition":"1. the action of closing something forcefully with a loud noise; 2. a hard hit or blow; 3. a strong criticism.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I heard the slam of the car door.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我聽到了汽車車門猛關的聲音。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The slam of the gavel echoed through the courtroom.\",\n    \"ch\": \"法槌的重擊聲在法庭上迴盪。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The politician faced a barrage of slams from the opposition.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位政治家面臨來自反對黨的猛烈抨擊。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"法槌的重擊聲在法庭上迴盪。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U67"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5809,"wordRef":"字彙王::u60::slap::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The decision was a ____ in the face to the workers.","expectedAnswer":"slap","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The decision was a ____ in the face to the workers.","clozeAnswer":"slap","exampleTranslation":"這個決定對工人來說是個打擊。","reference":{"eng":"slap","kk":"slæp","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"摑（耳光）\"  ],  [    \"拍打\"  ],  [    \"一擊\"  ]]","chEntries":["摑","拍打","一擊"],"practiceMeaning":"這個決定對工人來說是個打擊。","analysis":"此字為名詞，與動詞同源。核心語義是指「用手掌打擊的動作或聲音」。語意演變上，從具體的「摑耳光」或「拍打」動作，也可用來形容某種突然或有力的接觸，或比喻為一次意外的打擊。","definition":"1. an act of hitting someone or something with the palm of your hand; 2. the sound of a slap; 3. an unpleasant shock or disappointment.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He received a slap on the back for his achievement.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他因成就而得到背部拍打（讚揚）。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The decision was a slap in the face to the workers.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個決定對工人來說是個打擊。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The slap of the waves was loud.\",\n    \"ch\": \"海浪拍打的聲音很大。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這個決定對工人來說是個打擊。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U60"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5101,"wordRef":"字彙王::u61::slavery::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"For centuries, ____ was practiced in many parts of the world.","expectedAnswer":"slavery","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"For centuries, ____ was practiced in many parts of the world.","clozeAnswer":"slavery","exampleTranslation":"數百年來，奴隸制度曾在世界許多地方實行。","reference":{"eng":"slavery","kk":"ˈsleɪvəri","tense":"n.","ch":"[['奴隸制度'], ['奴役'], ['被束縛的狀態']]","chEntries":["奴隸制度","奴役","被束縛的狀態"],"practiceMeaning":"數百年來，奴隸制度曾在世界許多地方實行。","analysis":"此字由 'slave' (奴隸) + '-ry' (名詞化後綴，表示狀態、職業、集合) 構成。'-ry' 後綴常表示與某事物相關的狀態、職業、地方或集合，如 'bakery' (麵包店)、'bravery' (勇氣)。'Slavery' 的核心語義是 '被視為財產並被迫勞動，且失去自由的狀態'。它既指社會制度，也指個人遭受的 '奴役' 或 '被束縛' 的處境。","definition":"1. The state or condition of being a slave; the practice of owning slaves.; 2. The system whereby people are treated as property and are forced to work.; 3. A state of being controlled by a powerful force or addiction.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The abolition of slavery was a major turning point in history.\",\n    \"ch\": \"廢除奴隸制度是歷史上一個重要的轉捩點。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"For centuries, slavery was practiced in many parts of the world.\",\n    \"ch\": \"數百年來，奴隸制度曾在世界許多地方實行。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He felt in slavery to his ambition.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他覺得自己被野心所奴役。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"數百年來，奴隸制度曾在世界許多地方實行。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U61"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3117,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::slight::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She is a ____ woman, but very strong.","expectedAnswer":"slight","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She is a ____ woman, but very strong.","clozeAnswer":"slight","exampleTranslation":"她身材纖細，但非常強壯。","reference":{"eng":"slight","kk":"/slaɪt/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['輕微的；微小的'], ['瘦弱的；纖細的']]","chEntries":["輕微的","微小的","瘦弱的","纖細的"],"practiceMeaning":"她身材纖細，但非常強壯。","analysis":"起源不明，可能與古英語 'slīhtan' (to graze) 有關。核心意義是「非常小