er":"territory","exampleTranslation":"獅子標記了牠的勢力範圍。","reference":{"eng":"territory","kk":"/ˈtɛrɪtɔːri/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['領土'], ['地域'], ['（動物的）勢力範圍'], ['（知識或活動的）範圍']]","chEntries":["領土","地域","勢力範圍","範圍"],"practiceMeaning":"獅子標記了牠的勢力範圍。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 terra，意為「土地」。加上 -ory (表示「地方」或「狀態」的名詞後綴)。核心語意是「土地的區域」。引申為國家或組織聲稱擁有管轄權的土地、動物為了生存而佔據的區域，以及學術或技能的特定領域。","definition":"1. An area of land under the jurisdiction of a ruler or state; 2. An area of land occupied or claimed by an animal or group of animals; 3. An area of knowledge or activity.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The country defended its territory from invaders.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該國保衛其領土免受入侵者侵害。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The lion marked its territory.\",\n    \"ch\": \"獅子標記了牠的勢力範圍。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is a new territory for our research.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是我們研究的新領域。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"獅子標記了牠的勢力範圍。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4521,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::the::art","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"I saw ____ book you mentioned.","expectedAnswer":"the","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"I saw ____ book you mentioned.","clozeAnswer":"the","exampleTranslation":"我看到了你提到的那本書。","reference":{"eng":"the","kk":"/ðə/, /ði/","tense":"art.","ch":"[['這（那）個']]","chEntries":["這個"],"practiceMeaning":"我看到了你提到的那本書。","analysis":"定冠詞，源自古英語 þē。用於特指或已知的名詞前，表示「這個」、「那個」。","definition":"1. Used before singular or plural nouns to refer to a person or thing that is unique or known to the speaker and listener; 2. Used to refer to something that has been mentioned before.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The sun is shining.\",\n    \"ch\": \"太陽正在閃耀。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I saw the book you mentioned.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我看到了你提到的那本書。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我看到了你提到的那本書。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"word