eoretical model, not a practical solution.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是一個理論模型，不是實際的解決方案。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The plan is sound in theoretical terms.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個計畫在理論上是可靠的。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這是一個理論模型，不是實際的解決方案。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U65"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4002,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u3::theory::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"In ____, this plan should work perfectly.","expectedAnswer":"theory","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"In ____, this plan should work perfectly.","clozeAnswer":"theory","exampleTranslation":"理論上，這個計畫應該能完美運作。","reference":{"eng":"theory","kk":"/ˈθɪəri/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['理論'], ['學說'], ['猜測', '看法']]","chEntries":["理論","學說","猜測","看法"],"practiceMeaning":"理論上，這個計畫應該能完美運作。","analysis":"詞源：希臘文 'theōria' (觀察、沉思)。指對現象的解釋或一套原則，與實踐相對。","definition":"1. a supposition or a system of ideas intended to explain something, especially one based on general principles independent of the thing to be explained; 2. a set of principles on which the practice of an activity is based; 3. a speculative or conjectural explanation.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The theory of relativity revolutionized physics.\",\n    \"ch\": \"相對論徹底改變了物理學。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"In theory, this plan should work perfectly.\",\n    \"ch\": \"理論上，這個計畫應該能完美運作。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"理論上，這個計畫應該能完美運作。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5668,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l8::thorough::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He gave the car a ____ cleaning.","expectedAnswer":"thorough","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He gave the car a ____ cleaning.","clozeAnswer":"thorough","exampleTranslation":"他把汽車徹底地清洗了一遍。","reference":{"eng":"thorough","kk":"ˈθɜːroʊ","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['徹底的'], ['全面的'], ['詳盡的'], ['仔細的']]","chEntries":["徹底的","全面的","詳盡的","仔細的"],"practiceMeaning":"他把汽車徹底地清洗了一遍。","analysis":"此字源自古英語 þurh，意為「通過」，與 through 同源。其詞源追溯至原始日耳曼語 *thurz（通過）。核心語義為「穿過」、「完全」。構詞上，此字為單一詞根，無明顯字首字尾，其意義由詞根本身演變而來。此處為形容詞用法，描述事物「完全」、「仔細」、「不遺漏任何細節」。","definition":"complete with regard to every detail; not overlooking any part or point; performed with great care and completeness.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We conducted a thorough investigation.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們進行了一項徹底的調查。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He gave the car a thorough cleaning.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他把汽車徹底地清洗了一遍。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他把汽車徹底地清洗了一遍。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5813,"wordRef":"字彙王::u60::thriller::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The movie was a political ____ with a lot of suspense.","expectedAnswer":"thriller","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The movie was a political ____ with a lot of suspense.","clozeAnswer":"thriller","exampleTranslation":"這部電影是一部充滿懸念的政治驚悚片。","reference":{"eng":"thriller","kk":"ˈθrɪlər","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"驚悚片\"  ],  [    \"驚悚小說\"  ],  [    \"令人興奮的事物\"  ]]","chEntries":["驚悚片","驚悚小說","令人興奮的事物"],"practiceMeaning":"這部電影是一部充滿懸念的政治驚悚片。","analysis":"此字為名詞，構詞自thrill（使興奮；使激動）+ -er（名詞字尾，表示「事物」或「人」）。thrill源自中古英語。因此，thriller的核心語義是指「能夠引起強烈興奮、激動或恐懼的事物」，特別是用於指「驚悚電影」或「驚悚小說」，這類作品旨在提供強烈的感官刺激和緊張感。語意演變上，由形容「令人興奮的」轉化為指代「能製造這種興奮體驗的媒介（電影、書籍）」。","definition":"1. a novel, play, or film that has an exciting or frightening plot; 2. a person or thing that causes excitement.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She enjoys reading thrillers before bed.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她喜歡睡前閱讀驚悚小說。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The movie was a political thriller with a lot of suspense.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這部電影是一部充滿懸念的政治驚悚片。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The adventure was a real thriller for the participants.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這次冒險對參與者來說是一次真正的刺激體驗。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這部電影是一部充滿懸念的政治驚悚片。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U60"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4161,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::time::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"This is the third ____ he has called.","expectedAnswer":"time","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This is the third ____ he has called.","clozeAnswer":"time","exampleTranslation":"這是他打來的第三次電話。","reference":{"eng":"time","kk":"/taɪm/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['時間'], ['次數'], ['時代', '時期']]","chEntries":["時間","次數","時代","時期"],"practiceMeaning":"這是他打來的第三次電話。","analysis":"源自古英語 tīma（時間，時期）。核心概念是「連續的事件」，是事物發生、發展、變化的基本度量。","definition":"1. the indefinite continued progress of existence and events; 2. a particular occasion when something happens; 3. a period considered as a distinct entity","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"How much time do we have?\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們有多少時間？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is the third time he has called.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是他打來的第三次電話。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"With the passage of time, old memories fade.\",\n    \"ch\": \"隨著時間的流逝，舊的記憶會逐漸淡忘。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這是他打來的第三次電話。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4217,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::timely::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Your advice was very ____.","expectedAnswer":"timely","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Your advice was very ____.","clozeAnswer":"timely","exampleTranslation":"你的建議非常及時。","reference":{"eng":"timely","kk":"/ˈtaɪmli/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['及時的；適時的']]","chEntries":["及時的","適時的"],"practiceMeaning":"你的建議非常及時。","analysis":"由 'time'（時間）和後綴 '-ly'（形容詞化）構成。核心是與“時間”相關。表示行動、事件發生在最合適、最有益或最需要的時候。","definition":"Done or occurring at a favorable or useful time; opportune.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The timely warning saved many lives.\",\n    \"ch\": \"及時的警告拯救了許多生命。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Your advice was very timely.\",\n    \"ch\": \"你的建議非常及時。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"你的建議非常及時。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5673,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l8::to-such-an-extent-that::phrase","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The damage was ____ the building had to be demolished.","expectedAnswer":"to such an extent that","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The damage was ____ the building had to be demolished.","clozeAnswer":"to such an extent that","exampleTranslation":"損壞的程度如此之大，以至於這棟建築物必須拆除。","reference":{"eng":"to such an extent that","kk":"tuː sʌtʃ ən ɪkˈstɛnt ðæt","tense":"phrase","ch":"[['到了……的程度'], ['以至於']]","chEntries":["到了……的程度","以至於"],"practiceMeaning":"損壞的程度如此之大，以至於這棟建築物必須拆除。","analysis":"此片語由介詞 to + 程度不定詞 such + 名詞 extent（程度）+ 連接詞 that 構成。extent 源自拉丁語 extentus（伸展，擴展）。such an extent 指「如此大的程度」，that 則引出結果。整體表達「程度之大，以至於發生……」。此為一個固定的表示程度和結果的連接片語，應視為整體處理，不可拆解為個別字詞的詞彙分析。","definition":"to a degree so great that something else happens.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He was tired to such an extent that he fell asleep standing up.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他疲倦到了站著都能睡著的程度。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The damage was to such an extent that the building had to be demolished.\",\n    \"ch\": \"損壞的程度如此之大，以至於這棟建築物必須拆除。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"損壞的程度如此之大，以至於這棟建築物必須拆除。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5550,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l5::to-this-day::adv","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The mystery remains unsolved ____.","expectedAnswer":"to this day","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The mystery remains unsolved ____.","clozeAnswer":"to this day","exampleTranslation":"這個謎團至今仍未解開。","reference":{"eng":"to this day","kk":"tə ðɪs deɪ","tense":"adv.","ch":"[['至今'], ['直到今天']]","chEntries":["至今","直到今天"],"practiceMeaning":"這個謎團至今仍未解開。","analysis":"此為固定片語，由介詞 'to'，指示詞 'this'，名詞 'day' 構成。'this day' 指「今天、此刻」。'to this day' 表示「從過去的某個時間點一直持續到今天」，強調某事物（事件、狀態、信念等）的延續性或持續影響力。它常與過去發生的事情連結，說明該事件的影響力延續至今。此片語用來強調時間的連續性。","definition":"until the present time; up to now.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I still remember that day to this day.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我至今仍然記得那天。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The mystery remains unsolved to this day.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個謎團至今仍未解開。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這個謎團至今仍未解開。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4461,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::ton::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She has a ____ of homework to do.","expectedAnswer":"ton","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She has a ____ of homework to do.","clozeAnswer":"ton","exampleTranslation":"她有大量的家庭作業要做。","reference":{"eng":"ton","kk":"/tʌn/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['噸'], ['（非正式）大量，許多']]","chEntries":["噸","大量，許多"],"practiceMeaning":"她有大量的家庭作業要做。","analysis":"源自古英語 tunne，意為「大桶」。後來演變成表示重量的單位。語意也引申為「大量的」。","definition":"1. A unit of weight equal to 2,000 pounds (US) or 2,240 pounds (UK); 2. (informal) A large amount of something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The truck can carry several tons of goods.\",\n    \"ch\": \"卡車可以載運數噸的貨物。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She has a ton of homework to do.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她有大量的家庭作業要做。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她有大量的家庭作業要做。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4658,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u16::tragedy::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The earthquake was a terrible ____.","expectedAnswer":"tragedy","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The earthquake was a terrible ____.","clozeAnswer":"tragedy","exampleTranslation":"那場地震是一場可怕的災難。","reference":{"eng":"tragedy","kk":"/ˈtrædʒədi/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['悲劇'], ['悲劇作品'], ['災難']]","chEntries":["悲劇","悲劇作品","災難"],"practiceMeaning":"那場地震是一場可怕的災難。","analysis":"源自希臘語 'tragoidia'，意為「悲劇」。指以悲慘結局為特點的戲劇、電影或文學作品。引申義指非常不幸的事件或災難。","definition":"a genre of drama in which the main character(s) suffer disaster or misfortune; an event causing great suffering, destruction, and distress.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Shakespeare's Hamlet is a famous tragedy.\",\n    \"ch\": \"莎士比亞的《哈姆雷特》是一部著名的悲劇。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The earthquake was a terrible tragedy.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那場地震是一場可怕的災難。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"那場地震是一場可怕的災難。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U16"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5552,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l6::transaction::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"This is a complex financial ____ that requires careful consideration.","expectedAnswer":"transaction","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This is a complex financial ____ that requires careful consideration.","clozeAnswer":"transaction","exampleTranslation":"這是一筆複雜的金融交易，需要仔細考量。","reference":{"eng":"transaction","kk":"trænˈzækʃən","tense":"n.","ch":"[['交易'], ['買賣'], ['事項'], ['業務']]","chEntries":["交易","買賣","事項","業務"],"practiceMeaning":"這是一筆複雜的金融交易，需要仔細考量。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 \"trānsāctiō\"，由 \"trāns-\"（across, beyond，穿越，越過）和 \"agere\"（to do, drive，做，驅動）的名詞化形式 \"āctiō\"（行動）組成。\"trānsāctiō\" 最初指「完成、達成」，特別是指「完成一項協議或交易」。\"trāns-\" 加上 \"agere\" 的動作，強調的是「跨越、完成」某事。因此，核心語義是「完成某項活動或協議」。在商業語境中，最常見的義項就是「交易」，指買賣雙方完成貨幣或商品交換的行為。它也可以泛指「處理、辦理」的具體事項或業務。","definition":"1. An instance of buying or selling something; a business deal; 2. The act of conducting business; dealing; 3. An exchange or interaction between people.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The bank is processing thousands of transactions every day.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家銀行每天處理數千筆交易。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is a complex financial transaction that requires careful consideration.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是一筆複雜的金融交易，需要仔細考量。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"All transactions are recorded in the ledger.\",\n    \"ch\": \"所有事項都記錄在帳簿上。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這是一筆複雜的金融交易，需要仔細考量。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5463,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l4::tribal::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The artist painted a scene of ____ life.","expectedAnswer":"tribal","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The artist painted a scene of ____ life.","clozeAnswer":"tribal","exampleTranslation":"藝術家描繪了一幅部落生活的景象。","reference":{"eng":"tribal","kk":"ˈtraɪbəl","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['部落的'], ['部族的']]","chEntries":["部落的","部族的"],"practiceMeaning":"藝術家描繪了一幅部落生活的景象。","analysis":"此字由名詞 'tribe'（部落）加上形容詞字尾 '-al' 構成。'-al' 是來自拉丁語 '-alis' 的變體，用於構成形容詞，表示「……的、關於……的」。因此，'tribal' 的意思是「屬於部落的、與部落有關的」，用來形容與部落社會結構、文化、習俗或組織相關的事物。","definition":"1. Relating to or characteristic of a tribe or tribes.; 2. Organized according to a tribe.; 3. Belonging to or characteristic of a tribal society.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They have a rich tribal history and traditions.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們擁有豐富的部落歷史和傳統。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The artist painted a scene of tribal life.\",\n    \"ch\": \"藝術家描繪了一幅部落生活的景象。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The conflict was fueled by tribal rivalries.\",\n    \"ch\": \"衝突是由部落之間的對立所加劇的。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"藝術家描繪了一幅部落生活的景象。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5462,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l4::tribe::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The members of the ____ were known for their hunting skills.","expectedAnswer":"tribe","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The members of the ____ were known for their hunting skills.","clozeAnswer":"tribe","exampleTranslation":"這個部落的成員以他們的狩獵技巧而聞名。","reference":{"eng":"tribe","kk":"traɪb","tense":"n.","ch":"[['部落'], ['部族'], ['（某些動物的）族']]","chEntries":["部落","部族","族"],"practiceMeaning":"這個部落的成員以他們的狩獵技巧而聞名。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'tribus'，原意指古羅馬的「三個部落」，是羅馬社會的基本組成單位。在羅馬共和國後期，'tribus' 演變為行政區劃單位。後來，這個詞被借用到古英語和中古英語中，尤其是在描述社會組織形式時。在人類學和社會學中，'tribe' 指的是一個由共同血緣、語言、文化或地域聯繫起來的社會群體，通常具有較為簡單的政治組織。核心語意是「一個具有共同特徵和組織結構的群體」。","definition":"1. A social group consisting of families or clans with a common kinship, culture, and dialect, typically having a recognized leader.; 2. A group of people of common lineage, often a clan or federation of clans.; 3. A social group that shares a common culture, leadership, and territory.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The Amazon basin is home to many indigenous tribes.\",\n    \"ch\": \"亞馬遜盆地是許多原住民部落的家園。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The members of the tribe were known for their hunting skills.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個部落的成員以他們的狩獵技巧而聞名。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They lived in a small village belonging to the tribe.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們住在一屬於該部落的小村莊裡。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這個部落的成員以他們的狩獵技巧而聞名。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4129,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::tricky::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He's known for his ____ negotiation tactics.","expectedAnswer":"tricky","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He's known for his ____ negotiation tactics.","clozeAnswer":"tricky","exampleTranslation":"他以其狡猾的談判策略而聞名。","reference":{"eng":"tricky","kk":"/ˈtrɪki/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['棘手的', '難辦的'], ['狡猾的', '奸詐的'], ['需要技巧的', '巧妙的']]","chEntries":["棘手的","難辦的","狡猾的","奸詐的","需要技巧的","巧妙的"],"practiceMeaning":"他以其狡猾的談判策略而聞名。","analysis":"源自 trick（詭計，花招）。核心概念是「需要小心處理」，因為存在隱藏的困難、欺騙或複雜性。引申為難以應付的問題、狡猾的人或需要精細操作的任務。","definition":"1. difficult to deal with or accomplish; 2. cunning or deceitful; 3. requiring skill or dexterity","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"That was a tricky question.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那是一個棘手的問題。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He's known for his tricky negotiation tactics.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他以其狡猾的談判策略而聞名。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Learning to juggle can be tricky.\",\n    \"ch\": \"學會玩雜耍可能需要技巧。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他以其狡猾的談判策略而聞名。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5151,"wordRef":"字彙王::u62::trivial::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The argument was over something ____.","expectedAnswer":"trivial","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The argument was over something ____.","clozeAnswer":"trivial","exampleTranslation":"爭吵是為了某件微不足道的事情。","reference":{"eng":"trivial","kk":"ˈtrɪviəl","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['瑣碎的'], ['微不足道的'], ['不重要的']]","chEntries":["瑣碎的","微不足道的","不重要的"],"practiceMeaning":"爭吵是為了某件微不足道的事情。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 trivialis，由 tri-（三）+ via（道路）組成。原意是「位於三條道路交匯處的，隨處可見的、普通的」。引申為「平凡的、不值一提的」。","definition":"of little value or importance; insignificant.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Don't worry about such trivial matters.\",\n    \"ch\": \"別擔心那些瑣碎的小事。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The argument was over something trivial.\",\n    \"ch\": \"爭吵是為了某件微不足道的事情。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"爭吵是為了某件微不足道的事情。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U62"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4329,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u8::troop::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The circus featured a ____ of acrobats.","expectedAnswer":"troop","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The circus featured a ____ of acrobats.","clozeAnswer":"troop","exampleTranslation":"馬戲團有一個雜技演員團。","reference":{"eng":"troop","kk":"/truːp/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['部隊；軍隊'], ['（表演、遊行等的）群；組']]","chEntries":["部隊","軍隊","群","組"],"practiceMeaning":"馬戲團有一個雜技演員團。","analysis":"源自法語 'troupe'，意為『一夥人』，來自拉丁語 'troppus' (flock, herd)。1. 特指軍事單位，如『部隊』、『軍隊』。2. 指一群一起行動的人，如『（馬戲團的）一隊演員』、『（童子軍的）小隊』等，強調『一群』的概念。","definition":"a group of soldiers, especially an armoured or airborne unit; a group of performers or dancers","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A troop of soldiers marched into the town.\",\n    \"ch\": \"一支部隊開進了鎮上。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The circus featured a troop of acrobats.\",\n    \"ch\": \"馬戲團有一個雜技演員團。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Scout troops often go camping at weekends.\",\n    \"ch\": \"童子軍小隊週末經常去露營。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"馬戲團有一個雜技演員團。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U8"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5317,"wordRef":"字彙王::u63::trophy::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He brought back a ____ from his African safari.","expectedAnswer":"trophy","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He brought back a ____ from his African safari.","clozeAnswer":"trophy","exampleTranslation":"他從非洲狩獵之旅帶回了一件戰利品。","reference":{"eng":"trophy","kk":"ˈtroʊfi","tense":"n.","ch":"[['獎杯'], ['戰利品'], ['（狩獵的）戰利品']]","chEntries":["獎杯","戰利品"],"practiceMeaning":"他從非洲狩獵之旅帶回了一件戰利品。","analysis":"此字源自希臘語 'tropaion' ( τρόπαιον)，意為「勝利的標誌」，來自 'trepein' (τρέπ╓ν)，意為「轉動、擊退」。在古希臘，'tropaion' 是為了紀念戰勝敵軍而設立的紀念物。構詞上，'troph-' 為詞根，'-y' 為名詞後綴。核心語意為「勝利的象徵」。引申為體育競賽的「獎杯」，以及戰爭中的「戰利品」。","definition":"a prize for winning a competition or race; a spoil taken from an enemy, especially in battle; a symbol of victory or achievement.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The team proudly displayed their championship trophy.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這支隊伍自豪地展示了他們的冠軍獎杯。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He brought back a trophy from his African safari.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他從非洲狩獵之旅帶回了一件戰利品。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他從非洲狩獵之旅帶回了一件戰利品。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U63"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5318,"wordRef":"字彙王::u63::tuition::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She received private ____ in mathematics.","expectedAnswer":"tuition","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She received private ____ in mathematics.","clozeAnswer":"tuition","exampleTranslation":"她接受了數學的私人指導。","reference":{"eng":"tuition","kk":"tuˈɪʃən","tense":"n.","ch":"[['學費'], ['教學', '指導']]","chEntries":["學費","教學","指導"],"practiceMeaning":"她接受了數學的私人指導。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'tutio'（保護，守衛），'tutor'（保護者，導師）。構詞上，'tuit-' 為詞根，'-ion' 為名詞後綴。原始語意為「保護」或「指導」。此語意引申為「教學、指導」，以及由此產生的費用，即「學費」。","definition":"money that you pay for teaching, especially at a college or university; instruction or teaching.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The tuition fees for this year have increased.\",\n    \"ch\": \"今年的學費