版本","譯本","改編","敘述","說法"],"practiceMeaning":"她說了她對這件事的說法。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 version（翻譯，來自拉丁語 versio，意為『轉動，轉變，翻譯』），由 vertere（轉動，轉變）+ -io（名詞化後綴）構成。構詞上，'vertere' 提供核心語意「轉變」，'-io' 則形成名詞。核心語意是「從一種形式或狀態轉變到另一種形式或狀態」。這直接體現在「翻譯」（將一種語言轉化為另一種語言）、書籍或電影的「版本」（同一作品的不同呈現方式）、以及個人對事件的「敘述」或「說法」（基於個人視角轉變的呈現）。","definition":"a particular form of something that differs in certain respects from other forms of the same type or from a more basic type; an account given by one who has witnessed or experienced an event.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is the latest version of the software.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是最新版本的軟體。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She gave her version of the story.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她說了她對這件事的說法。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她說了她對這件事的說法。","sourceName":"龍騰課本、字彙王","unitName":"L9、U60"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5110,"wordRef":"字彙王::u61::viable::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We need to find a ____ solution.","expectedAnswer":"viable","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We need to find a ____ solution.","clozeAnswer":"viable","exampleTranslation":"我們需要找到一個可行的解決方案。","reference":{"eng":"viable","kk":"ˈvaɪəbl","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['可行的'], ['可持續的'], ['生存的']]","chEntries":["可行的","可持續的","生存的"],"practiceMeaning":"我們需要找到一個可行的解決方案。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'via' (way)，透過古法語 'viable' (capable of living) 演變而來。其核心語義是 '能夠生存、發展或成功地運作'。這可以指生物的生命力，如 'a viable fetus' (存活的胎兒)，也可以指計劃、項目或商業模式的可行性，強調其在現實條件下能夠實施並產生預期結果的能力。","definition":"1. Capable of working successfully; feasible.; 2. Able to survive or to function successfully.; 3. (Of a newborn infant) able to survive after birth.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The plan is not viable in the long term.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個計劃從長遠來看是不可行的。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to find a viable solution.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要找到一個可行的解決方案。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company's business model is no longer viable.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家公司的商業模式已不再可行。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslati