 as described, but not completely or according to strict definition; (of a computer environment) simulated by computer software.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Although not officially president, he was the virtual leader of the country.\",\n    \"ch\": \"雖然他不是正式的總統，但他實際上是國家的領導人。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Virtual reality allows users to experience simulated environments.\",\n    \"ch\": \"虛擬實境讓使用者體驗模擬的環境。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"虛擬實境讓使用者體驗模擬的環境。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U62"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5111,"wordRef":"字彙王::u61::vocal::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He is very ____ in his opposition to the plan.","expectedAnswer":"vocal","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He is very ____ in his opposition to the plan.","clozeAnswer":"vocal","exampleTranslation":"他對這項計劃的Opposition非常直言不諱。","reference":{"eng":"vocal","kk":"ˈvoʊkl","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['聲音的'], ['發聲的'], ['直言不諱的']]","chEntries":["聲音的","發聲的","直言不諱的"],"practiceMeaning":"他對這項計劃的Opposition非常直言不諱。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'vocalis'，意為 '與聲音有關的'，源於 'vox, vocis' (voice)。'Vocal' 的核心語義是指 '與聲音相關的'，如 'vocal cords' (聲帶)。引申開來，'vocal' 也指 '能夠發聲的'。更進一步，它形容一個人 '直言不諱'，能夠清晰、公開地表達自己的意見，尤其是在表達不滿或批評時，這意味著他們的聲音被清晰地 '聽見'。","definition":"1. Relating to or produced by the voice.; 2. Able to speak or utter sounds.; 3. Expressing opinions or feelings strongly and openly.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She has a strong vocal presence.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她有很強的聲音表現力。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is very vocal in his opposition to the plan.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他對這項計劃的Opposition非常直言不諱。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Vocal music is an important part of the concert.\",\n    \"ch\": \"聲樂是音樂會的重要組成部分。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他對這項計劃的Opposition非常直言不諱。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U61"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3925,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u2::volume::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"This bottle has a ____ of one liter.","expectedAnswer":"volume","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This bottle has a ____ of one liter.","clozeAnswer":"volume","exampleTranslation":"這個瓶子的容量是一公升。","reference":{"eng":"volume","kk":"/ˈvɒljum/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['音量'], ['體積', '容量'], ['數量', '大量'], ['冊']]","chEntries":["音量","體積","容量","數量","大量","冊"],"practiceMeaning":"這個瓶子的容量是一公升。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'volumen'，意為「捲、卷軸」，來自 'volvere' (意為「滾動、捲起」)。最初指捲起的紙張，引申為「書本的一卷」；後引申為「物體的體積」；再引申為「聲音的大小」，即「音量」；另引申為「數量、大量」。","definition":"1. the amount of space that a substance or object occupies, or that is enclosed within a container; 2. the loudness of a sound; 3. a quantity of something, especially a large quantity; 4. a single book forming part of a work or series.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please turn down the volume, it's too loud.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請把音量轉小，太吵了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This bottle has a volume of one liter.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個瓶子的容量是一公升。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A large volume of mail arrived today.\",\n    \"ch\": \"今天收到大量的郵件。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is the third volume of the encyclopedia.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是百科全書的第三卷。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這個瓶子的容量是一公升。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U2、L1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4130,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::wage::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She earns a decent ____.","expectedAnswer":"wage","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She earns a decent ____.","clozeAnswer":"wage","exampleTranslation":"她的收入不錯。","reference":{"eng":"wage","kk":"/weɪdʒ/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['工資', '薪水']]","chEntries":["工資","薪水"],"practiceMeaning":"她的收入不錯。","analysis":"源自古英語 wæcce（警衛），後引申為「報酬」，尤其是為勞動或服務支付的。核心概念是「為工作付出的代價」。","definition":"a fixed regular payment, typically paid on a daily or weekly basis, made by an employer to an employee","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The minimum wage has increased.\",\n    \"ch\": \"最低工資有所提高。\"\n  