構構成的物品」，例如漁網或編織品。隨著科技發展，\"network\" 的語義擴展到「互相連接的系統」，例如電話網絡、電腦網絡。在社會學和商業領域，\"network\" 也指「由人組成的聯繫體系」，即「人脈」或「社交網絡」。核心語義是「由相互連接的元素組成的結構」。","definition":"1. A group of interconnected computers, machines, etc.; 2. A system of roads, railways, etc.; 3. A group of people who know each other and can help each other; 4. A system of connected television or radio stations.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company has an extensive marketing network.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家公司擁有廣泛的市場網絡。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The internet is a global computer network.\",\n    \"ch\": \"網際網路是一個全球性的電腦網絡。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Building a strong professional network is important for career advancement.\",\n    \"ch\": \"建立強大的人脈網絡對職業發展很重要。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"建立強大的人脈網絡對職業發展很重要。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5092,"wordRef":"字彙王::u61::nowhere::adv","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He seemed to come from ____.","expectedAnswer":"nowhere","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He seemed to come from ____.","clozeAnswer":"nowhere","exampleTranslation":"他似乎是憑空出現的。","reference":{"eng":"nowhere","kk":"ˈnoʊwer","tense":"adv.","ch":"[['無處'], ['到處都沒有']]","chEntries":["無處","到處都沒有"],"practiceMeaning":"他似乎是憑空出現的。","analysis":"此字由 'now' (現在) + 'where' (哪裡) 組合而成。其核心語義是 '在任何地方都不'，表示一個地點或狀態不存在、找不到。它是一個副詞，用於否定地點的存在，強調 '沒有地方' 達到某種狀態或存在某物。","definition":"1. In or at no place.; 2. To no place.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He searched everywhere but found nowhere.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他到處尋找，但一無所獲。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The lost cat was nowhere to be found.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那隻走失的貓在哪裡都找不到。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He seemed to come from nowhere.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他似乎是憑空出現的。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他似乎是憑空出現的。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U61"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5845,"wordRef":"字彙王::u58::obscure::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType"