'，意為「機會」，由 'ob-' (against, toward) + 'cadere' (to fall) 構成，字面意思是「（事件）的發生、來臨」。引申為「時機」、「機會」，也指特定的「場合」、「時刻」。第四個義項「原因」則是由「機會」進一步引申，表示引起某事發生的「原因」或「起因」。","definition":"1. a particular time or event; 2. a special or important event; 3. a reason or cause","example":"[\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"這是我們家的特殊場合。\",\n    \"eng\": \"This is a special occasion for our family.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"他錯過了太多發言的機會。\",\n    \"eng\": \"He has missed too many occasions to speak.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"壞天氣是取消野餐的原因。\",\n    \"eng\": \"The bad weather was the occasion for cancelling the picnic.\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"壞天氣是取消野餐的原因。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4429,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::odd::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"I found an ____ sock in the drawer.","expectedAnswer":"odd","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"I found an ____ sock in the drawer.","clozeAnswer":"odd","exampleTranslation":"我在抽屜裡找到了一隻單隻的襪子。","reference":{"eng":"odd","kk":"/ɒd/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['奇特的', '古怪的'], ['單數的'], ['零散的', '不成對的'], ['偶爾的', '不尋常的']]","chEntries":["奇特的","古怪的","單數的","零散的","不成對的","偶爾的","不尋常的"],"practiceMeaning":"我在抽屜裡找到了一隻單隻的襪子。","analysis":"詞源來自古英語 'ād'，意為「機會、命運」，後來在16世紀的賭博中，指「不平均、不相等的」機會。引申為「不尋常、奇特、單數」。","definition":"different from what is usual or expected; strange; not a multiple of two; not paired.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He has a rather odd sense of humor.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他有一種相當古怪的幽默感。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The number 7 is an odd number.\",\n    \"ch\": \"數字七是一個奇數。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I found an odd sock in the drawer.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我在抽屜裡找到了一隻單隻的襪子。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我在抽屜裡找到了一隻單隻的襪子。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5051,"wordRef":"字彙王::u59::odds::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ on the favorite are low.","expectedAnswer":"odds","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ on the favorite are low.","clozeAnswer":"odds","exampleTranslation":"熱門選手的賠率很低。","reference":{"eng":"odds","kk":"ɑːdz","tense":"n.","ch":"[['可能性'], ['機率'], ['（尤指賭博中的）賠率']]","chEntries":["可能性","機率","賠率"],"practiceMeaning":"熱門選手的賠率很低。","analysis":"此字源自中古英語oddes，是 odd（奇數、單獨的）的複數形式。最初可能指「單獨的、不規則的」，引申為「機會、可能性」。其核心語意是「不確定的、難以預測的結果」。在賭博中，odds 指的是「贏的機會與輸的機會的比例」。OCR 掃描時可能將 'o' 誤判為 '0'，或 'd' 誤判為 'cl'。此處修正為 odds，通常以複數形式出現。","definition":"1. the probability of something happening or being the case; 2. the ratio between the amounts staked by parties to a gamble or bet.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"What are the odds of winning the lottery?\",\n    \"ch\": \"中樂透的機率是多少？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The odds are against us.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們勝出的可能性不大。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The odds on the favorite are low.\",\n    \"ch\": \"熱門選手的賠率很低。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"熱門選手的賠率很低。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U59"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5794,"wordRef":"字彙王::u60::offering::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"They made a generous ____ to the temple.","expectedAnswer":"offering","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"They made a generous ____ to the temple.","clozeAnswer":"offering","exampleTranslation":"他們向寺廟做出了慷慨的捐獻。","reference":{"eng":"offering","kk":"ˈɔfərɪŋ","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"供品\"  ],  [    \"祭品\"  ],  [    \"奉獻物\"  ],  [    \"出價\"  ],  [    \"首次公開發行股票（IPO）\"  ]]","chEntries":["供品","祭品","奉獻物","出價","首次公開發行股票"],"practiceMeaning":"他們向寺廟做出了慷慨的捐獻。","analysis":"此處 offering 作名詞，由動詞offer（提供；奉獻）+ -ing（名詞字尾，表示行為或結果）構成。源自古英語offrian，受拉丁語offerre（奉獻；提供）影響。名詞義可指「自願提供的東西」，特別是宗教上的「供品」或「祭品」。也可指「商業上的出價」或「首次公開發行股票」（IPO），皆為「提供的東西」。語意演變上，由動詞「提供；奉獻」的動作，發展為「被提供的東西」，包括宗教祭品、商業出價，以及金融市場上的「首次公開發行」。","definition":"1. something that is offered, especially a gift or sacrifice to a god; 2. a price offered for something; 3. a company's first offer of stock for sale to the