'], ['口服的 (adj.)'], ['口試 (n.)']]","chEntries":["口頭的","口語的","口服的","口試"],"practiceMeaning":"期末考是口試。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'oralis'，來自 'os, oris' (mouth)。核心是與「嘴巴」或「口」相關。作為形容詞，指「用嘴說出的」（口頭的、口語的），以及「通過嘴進入體內的」（口服的）。作為名詞，'oral' 常指「口試」，是 'oral examination' 的縮略。","definition":"1. spoken, not written; 2. taken through or relating to the mouth; 3. an examination which is spoken","example":"[\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"她做了口頭研究報告。\",\n    \"eng\": \"She gave an oral presentation of her research.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"患者被開了口服藥。\",\n    \"eng\": \"The patient was prescribed oral medication.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"ch\": \"期末考是口試。\",\n    \"eng\": \"The final exam is an oral.\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"期末考是口試。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3236,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::orbit::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He operates within his own ____ of influence.","expectedAnswer":"orbit","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He operates within his own ____ of influence.","clozeAnswer":"orbit","exampleTranslation":"他活躍在自己的勢力範圍內。","reference":{"eng":"orbit","kk":"/ˈɔːrbɪt/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['軌道'], ['勢力範圍']]","chEntries":["軌道","勢力範圍"],"practiceMeaning":"他活躍在自己的勢力範圍內。","analysis":"詞源來自拉丁文 'orbita'，原指『車輪的軌跡』，引申為天體繞著另一個天體運行的路徑。也引申為某人活動的範圍或影響範圍。","definition":"1. the curved path of a celestial object or spacecraft round a star, planet, or moon; 2. the range of action or influence of something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The Earth revolves in orbit around the Sun.\",\n    \"ch\": \"地球圍繞太陽運行在軌道上。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The satellite entered its final orbit.\",\n    \"ch\": \"衛星進入了它的最終軌道。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He operates within his own orbit of influence.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他活躍在自己的勢力範圍內。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他活躍在自己的勢力範圍內。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U41"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3238,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::orientation::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Please adjust the ____ of the map.","expectedAnswer":"orientation","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Please adjust the ____ of the map.","clozeAnswer":"orientation","exampleTranslation":"請調整地圖的方位。","reference":{"eng":"orientation","kk":"/ˌɔːriənˈteɪʃn/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['定向'], ['定位'], ['新生訓練'], ['（政治、思想上的）立場']]","chEntries":["定向","定位","新生訓練","立場"],"practiceMeaning":"請調整地圖的方位。","analysis":"詞源來自拉丁文 'oriens' (rising)。原指『確定方向』，例如在地理上。引申為『定位』，找到自身在某環境中的位置。在社會學和教育學中，指幫助新人熟悉新環境的『新生訓練』。在政治或思想上，指某人的『立場』或『傾向』。","definition":"1. the position or direction relative to the points of the compass or other specified directions; 2. the orientation of a new student or employee; 3. the relative physical position or direction of something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The orientation session will help you adjust to college life.\",\n    \"ch\": \"新生訓練將幫助您適應大學生活。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He has a conservative political orientation.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他有保守的政治立場。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please adjust the orientation of the map.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請調整地圖的方位。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"請調整地圖的方位。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U41"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5093,"wordRef":"字彙王::u61::overturn::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The rebels attempted to ____ the government.","expectedAnswer":"overturn","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The rebels attempted to ____ the government.","clozeAnswer":"overturn","exampleTranslation":"叛軍試圖推翻政府。","reference":{"eng":"overturn","kk":"ˌoʊvərˈtɜːrn","tense":"v.","ch":"[['推翻'], ['顛覆'], ['翻倒']]","chEntries":["推翻","顛覆","翻倒"],"practiceMeaning":"叛軍試圖推翻政府。","analysis":"此字由 'over-' (over, above) + 'turn' (轉動、翻轉) 構成。'Over-' 在此強調 '向上、向外' 或 '徹底' 的動作。'Overturn' 的核心語義是 '使某物從正常位置翻轉或倒下'，例如船隻 '翻覆'。它也引申為 '推翻' 或 '顛覆' 法律、決定、政府或信仰，表示徹底改變或否定原有的結構或觀念。","definition":"1. To turn over or upside down.; 2. To reverse or annul (a decision, law, etc.).; 3. To defeat or overthrow.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The boat was overturned by a large wave.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那艘船被大浪打翻了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The court overturned the previous ruling.\",\n    \"ch\": \"法院推翻了之前的裁決。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The rebels attempted to overturn the government.\",\n    \"ch\": \"叛軍試圖推翻政府。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"叛軍試圖推翻政府。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U61"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3241,"wordRef":"字彙王::u41::panel::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"A ____ of judges will decide the winner.","expectedAnswer":"panel","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"A ____ of judges will decide the winner.","clozeAnswer":"panel","exampleTranslation":"一個由法官組成的陪審團將決定獲勝者。","reference":{"eng":"panel","kk":"/ˈpænl/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['儀表板'], ['鑲板'], ['面板'], ['陪審團']]","chEntries":["儀表板","鑲板","面板","陪審團"],"practiceMeaning":"一個由法官組成的陪審團將決定獲勝者。","analysis":"詞源來自古法語 'pan' (piece of cloth)。最初指鑲嵌在牆壁或門上的裝飾性板塊。引申為各種具有平坦表面的板狀物，如汽車的儀表板、電腦的顯示面板。也指由選定人員組成的『專家組』或『陪審團』。","definition":"1. a flat or curved piece of wood or other hard material, used as a part of a door, wall, or screen; 2. a flat surface containing a group of instruments or controls; 3. a group of people chosen to hear evidence and make a decision.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The pilot checked the control panel.\",\n    \"ch\": \"飛行員檢查了儀表板。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The room had wooden panels on the walls.\",\n    \"ch\": \"房間的牆壁有木質鑲板。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"A panel of judges will decide the winner.\",\n    \"ch\": \"一個由法官組成的陪審團將決定獲勝者。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"一個由法官組成的陪審團將決定獲勝者。","sourceName":"字彙王、龍騰課本","unitName":"U41、L2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5607,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l7::paralyze::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The economic crisis threatened to ____ the country's industry.","expectedAnswer":"paralyze","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The economic crisis threatened to ____ the country's industry.","clozeAnswer":"paralyze","exampleTranslation":"經濟危機威脅著要使該國工業癱瘓。","reference":{"eng":"paralyze","kk":"ˈpærəlaɪz","tense":"v.","ch":"[['使癱瘓'], ['麻痺'], ['癱瘓'], ['使癱瘓'], ['使失去作用']]","chEntries":["使癱瘓","麻痺","癱瘓","使失去作用"],"practiceMeaning":"經濟危機威脅著要使該國工業癱瘓。","analysis":"此字源自希臘語 'paralyein' (παραλύειν)，意為「使解除武装」、「鬆懈」，由 'para-'（在旁邊）和 'lyein'（鬆開、解除）組成。'-lyze' 是常見的動詞化字尾，源自希臘語 '-izein'，表示「使……」。構詞學上，'para-' 字首在這裡有「在旁邊」或「失去聯繫」的含義，'lyein' 意為「鬆開」或「解除」，組合起來表示「使其失去聯結、功能」，引申為「麻痺」或「癱瘓」。這與身體神經系統失調導致的「癱瘓」或「麻痺」的語意緊密相連。也可用於比喻，形容「使某事物無法運作」或「使某人無所適從」。","definition":"1. To cause (a person or part of the body) to become unable to move; 2. To render powerless or unable to do something; 3. To make rigid or motionless.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The accident left him paralyzed from the waist down.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那場事故使他腰部以下癱瘓。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Fear paralyzed her, and she couldn't move.\",\n    \"ch\": \"恐懼使她動彈不得。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The economic crisis threatened to paralyze the country's industry.\",\n    \"ch\": \"經濟危機威脅著要使該國工業癱瘓。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"經濟危機威脅著要使該國工業癱瘓。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L7"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5850,"wordRef":"字彙王::u58::partly::adv","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The room was ____ furnished.","expectedAnswer":"partly","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The room was ____ furnished.","clozeAnswer":"partly","exampleTranslation":"房間只部分佈置了家具。","reference":{"eng":"partly","kk":"ˈpɑːrtli","tense":"adv.","ch":"[  [    \"部分地\"  ],  [    \"在某種程度上\"  ],  [    \"多少\"  ]]","chEntries":["部分地","在某種程度上","多少"],"practiceMeaning":"房間只部分佈置了家具。","analysis":"此字由 'part' (部分) 加上副詞字尾 '-ly' 構成。'Part' 源自拉丁語 'partire' (to divide)。'-ly' 是常見的副詞字尾，將名詞或形容詞轉化為副詞。'Partly' 的核心語意是「不是完全地」、「在一定程度上」，表示某事物僅部分實現或僅部分為真。例如，也可指「有一定程度地」。","definition":"1. To some extent; in part.; 2. Not completely.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The success was partly due to luck.\",\n    \"ch\": \"成功的部分原因在於運氣。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He was partly responsible for the accident.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他對事故負有部分責任。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The room was partly furnished.\",\n    \"ch\": \"房間只部分佈置了家具。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She was partly to blame for the misunderstanding.\",\n    \"ch\": \"誤會的產生她也有一定程度的責任。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"房間只部分佈置了家具。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U58"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5851,"wordRef":"字彙王::u58::passionate::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"They have a ____ relationship.","expectedAnswer":"passionate","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"They have a ____ relationship.","clozeAnswer":"passionate","exampleTranslation":"他們有一段熱烈的感情。","reference":{"eng":"passionate","kk":"ˈpæʃənət","tense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"熱情的\"  ],  [    \"激情的\"  ],  [    \"熱烈的\"  ],  [    \"充滿愛意的\"  ]]","chEntries":["熱情的","激情的","熱烈的","充滿愛意的"],"practiceMeaning":"他們有一段熱烈的感情。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'passio' (suffering, feeling, passion)，由 'pati' (to suffer, endure) 構成。'Passionate' 的核心語意是「充滿強烈情感」，尤其是「熱情」、「激情」或「愛」。它描述的是一種被強烈情感驅動的狀態，無論是正面（如熱愛、激勵）或負面（如憤怒、痛苦）。在現代用法中，通常指對某事物有強烈的興趣、熱情和投入。例如，也可指「充滿愛意的」，用於形容關係。","definition":"1. Showing or caused by strong feelings or a strong belief.; 2. Having or showing strong sexual desire.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is passionate about environmental protection.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她對環境保護充滿熱情。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His passionate speech moved the audience.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他充滿激情的演講感動了聽眾。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They have a passionate relationship.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們有一段熱烈的感情。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He was passionate in his defense of the proposal.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他充滿激情地為該提議辯護。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他們有一段熱烈的感情。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U58"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5307,"wordRef":"字彙王::u63::patron::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"St. Patrick is the ____ saint of Ireland.","expectedAnswer":"patron","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"St. Patrick is the ____ saint of Ireland.","clozeAnswer":"patron","exampleTranslation":"聖派崔克是愛爾蘭的守護神。","reference":{"eng":"patron","kk":"ˈpeɪtrən","tense":"n.","ch":"[['贊助人', '保護人'], ['顧客', '常客'], ['（聖徒）守護神']]","chEntries":["贊助人","保護人","顧客","常客","守護神"],"practiceMeaning":"聖派崔克是愛爾蘭的守護神。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 'patronus'，意為「保護者、贊助人」，來自 'pater'（father）。構詞上，'patr-' 為詞根，'-on' 為名詞後綴。原始語意為「像父親一樣保護者」。此字有多重語意發展：在古代羅馬，'patronus' 指保護自由民或奴隸的貴族；引申為藝術、文學的「贊助人」；在商業語境中，指商店的「顧客」或「常客」；在宗教語境中，指教堂的「守護神」。","definition":"a person who gives financial or other support to a person, organization, cause, or activity; a regular customer of a shop or restaurant; a person or spirit regarded as a special protector.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is a wealthy patron of the arts.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是一位富有的藝術贊助人。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We are regulars at this restaurant, we are loyal patrons.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們是這家餐廳的常客，是忠實的顧客。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"St. Patrick is the patron saint of Ireland.\",\n    \"ch\": \"聖派崔克是愛爾蘭的守護神。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"聖派崔克是愛爾蘭的守護神。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U63"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3315,"wordRef":"字彙王::u42::peculiar::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He had a ____ way of walking.","expectedAnswer":"peculiar","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He had a ____ way of walking.","clozeAnswer":"peculiar","exampleTranslation":"他走路的方式很奇特。","reference":{"eng":"peculiar","kk":"/pɪˈkjuːliər/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['奇怪的；奇特的'], ['（尤指）特有的；獨特的']]","chEntries":["奇怪的","奇特的","特有的","獨特的"],"practiceMeaning":"他走路的方式很奇特。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'peculiaris'，由 'peculium' (私有財產) 演變而來，原意為「屬於某人自己的」，後引申為「特殊的」，再進一步發展為「奇怪的」。","definition":"1. strange or odd; unusual; 2. belonging exclusively to one person, group, or thing.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There was a peculiar smell in the room.\",\n    \"ch\": \"房間裡有一種奇怪的氣味。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This custom is peculiar to this region.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這種習俗是這個地區特有的。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He had a peculiar way of walking.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他走路的方式很奇特。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他走路的方式很奇特。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U42"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3934,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u2::pepper::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Black ____ is a common spice.","expectedAnswer":"pepper","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Black ____ is a common spice.","clozeAnswer":"pepper","exampleTranslation":"黑胡椒是一種常見的香料。","reference":{"eng":"pepper","kk":"/ˈpepər/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['胡椒'], ['辣椒'], ['胡椒粉']]","chEntries":["胡椒","辣椒","胡椒粉"],"practiceMeaning":"黑胡椒是一種常見的香料。","analysis":"源自古英語 'pipor'，經由拉丁語 'piper'，最終源自梵語 'pippala' (意為「長胡椒」)。最初指胡椒，後泛指各種辛辣的香料，包括辣椒。","definition":"1. a hot-tasting powder made from dried, ground berries, used in cooking; 2. a hollow green, red, or yellow vegetable that is sweet when cooked and can be eaten raw; 3. a red or black powder used to give food a hot taste.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Please add some pepper to the soup.\",\n    \"ch\": \"請在湯裡加點胡椒粉。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She likes her food very spicy, with lots of pepper.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她喜歡她的食物非常辣，要加很多辣椒。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Black pepper is a common spice.\",\n    \"ch\": \"黑胡椒是一種常見的香料。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"黑胡椒是一種常見的香料。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3930,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u2::perform::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The band will ____ at the festival.","expectedAnswer":"perform","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The band will ____ at the festival.","clozeAnswer":"perform","exampleTranslation":"樂團將在音樂節上演出。","reference":{"eng":"perform","kk":"/pərˈfɔːrm/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['表演'], ['執行', '履行'], ['演出']]","chEntries":["表演","執行","履行","演出"],"practiceMeaning":"樂團將在音樂節上演出。","analysis":"源自古法語 'parfournir'，由 'par-' (意為「徹底」) 和 'fournir' (意為「供應」) 組成。最初的意思是「徹底完成」，引申為「執行、履行」；在藝術領域則指「表演、演出」。","definition":"1. to do or perform an action, task, or duty; 2. to present a form of entertainment to an audience.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The actor performed brilliantly in the play.\",\n    \"ch\": \"那位演員在戲劇中表現出色。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The surgeon performed the operation successfully.\",\n    \"ch\": \"外科醫生成功地完成了手術。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The band will perform at the festival.\",\n    \"ch\": \"樂團將在音樂節上演出。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"樂團將在音樂節上演出。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U2"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4162,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::person::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Every ____ has their own unique qualities.","expectedAnswer":"person","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Every ____ has their own unique qualities.","clozeAnswer":"person","exampleTranslation":"每個人都有自己獨特的品質。","reference":{"eng":"person","kk":"/ˈpɜːrsn/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['人']]","chEntries":["人"],"practiceMeaning":"每個人都有自己獨特的品質。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 persona（面具，角色，人）。核心概念是「具有個體意識和行為能力的個體」。","definition":"a human being regarded as an individual","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is a very kind person.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她是一個非常善良的人。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He's a tricky person to understand.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他是一個難以理解的人。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Every person has their own unique qualities.\",\n    \"ch\": \"每個人都有自己獨特的品質。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"每個人都有自己獨特的品質。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5、C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6084,"wordRef":"字彙王::u64::pessimism::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Economic ____ is widespread among consumers.","expectedAnswer":"pessimism","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Economic ____ is widespread among consumers.","clozeAnswer":"pessimism","exampleTranslation":"消費者普遍存在經濟悲觀情緒。","reference":{"eng":"pessimism","kk":"ˈpɛsəˌmɪzəm","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"悲觀主義\"  ],  [    \"悲觀\"  ]]","chEntries":["悲觀主義","悲觀"],"practiceMeaning":"消費者普遍存在經濟悲觀情緒。","analysis":"此字由 pessimist（悲觀主義者）加上名詞後綴 -ism（表示主義、傾向或狀態）構成。Pessimist 源自拉丁語 pessimus（worst），是 malus（bad）的最高級。核心語義是「認為最壞情況會發生」的態度或思想。","definition":"a tendency to see the worst aspect of things or believe that the worst will happen.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"His constant pessimism was discouraging.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他持續的悲觀態度令人沮喪。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Despite the difficulties, she refused to give in to pessimism.\",\n    \"ch\": \"儘管有困難，她拒絕屈服於悲觀。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Economic pessimism is widespread among consumers.\",\n    \"ch\": \"消費者普遍存在經濟悲觀情緒。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"消費者普遍存在經濟悲觀情緒。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U64"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6089,"wordRef":"字彙王::u64::photographic::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She is studying ____ techniques.","expectedAnswer":"photographic","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She is studying ____ techniques.","clozeAnswer":"photographic","exampleTranslation":"她正在學習攝影技術。","reference":{"eng":"photographic","kk":"ˌfɑtəˈɡræfɪk","tense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"攝影的\"  ],  [    \"照片的\"  ],  [    \"像片似的\"  ]]","chEntries":["攝影的","照片的","像片似的"],"practiceMeaning":"她正在學習攝影技術。","analysis":"此字由 photograph（照片）加上形容詞後綴 -ic（關於……的）構成。Photograph 源自希臘語 phōs（light）和 graphein（to write），字面意思是「用光書寫」。Photographic 的核心語義是「與攝影有關的」，包括攝影技術、攝影設備、照片本身，或形容記憶、細節像照片一樣清晰。","definition":"1. relating to or used in photography; 2. resembling a photograph; very clear or detailed.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He has a photographic memory for faces.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他有照片般清晰的記人能力。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The exhibition featured photographic prints from the early 20th century.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這次展覽展出了二十世紀初的攝影作品。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is studying photographic techniques.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她正在學習攝影技術。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她正在學習攝影技術。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U64"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6133,"wordRef":"字彙王::u65::pitcher::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He filled the ____ with lemonade.","expectedAnswer":"pitcher","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He filled the ____ with lemonade.","clozeAnswer":"pitcher","exampleTranslation":"他把罐子裝滿了檸檬水。","reference":{"eng":"pitcher","kk":"ˈpɪtʃər","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"投手\"  ],  [    \"罐子\"  ],  [    \"壺\"  ]]","chEntries":["投手","罐子","壺"],"practiceMeaning":"他把罐子裝滿了檸檬水。","analysis":"此字有兩主要詞源。一源自古法語 pichier，意為「帶柄的水罐」，來自拉丁語 picta，意為「繪製的」（指罐上的裝飾），向上可追溯至 pey（繪畫）。此義項指帶有把手和壺嘴的容器。另一源自 pitch（投擲），指在棒球運動中投球的人。因此，此字有兩個不同的語義分支，但構詞上並無直接關聯。","definition":"1. a container, typically with a handle and spout, for serving drinks; 2. a player in baseball or softball who throws the ball from the pitcher's mound toward the catcher.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She poured water from the pitcher.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她從壺裡倒了水。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The star pitcher threw a perfect game.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位明星投手投出了一場無失分比賽。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He filled the pitcher with lemonade.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他把罐子裝滿了檸檬水。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他把罐子裝滿了檸檬水。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U65"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6181,"wordRef":"字彙王::u66::pledge::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She had to ____ her jewelry to get the money.","expectedAnswer":"pledge","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She had to ____ her jewelry to get the money.","clozeAnswer":"pledge","exampleTranslation":"她不得不抵押她的珠寶來換取金錢。","reference":{"eng":"pledge","kk":"plɛdʒ","tense":"v.","ch":"[  [    \"保證\"  ],  [    \"承諾\"  ],  [    \"發誓\"  ],  [    \"抵押\"  ]]","chEntries":["保證","承諾","發誓","抵押"],"practiceMeaning":"她不得不抵押她的珠寶來換取金錢。","analysis":"此字源自古法語 plege，意為「保證、抵押品」，源於日耳曼語詞根，與古英語 tæfl「棋盤」相關，可能最初指用於玩遊戲的籌碼或抵押品。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根。作為動詞，其核心語義是「鄭重地做出承諾或保證」。詞源中的「抵押品」概念引申出「提供擔保」的語義，進而發展為「承諾」和「保證」。","definition":"1. to make a solemn promise to do something or that something will happen; 2. to give or leave something as security for a debt or loan.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They pledged to support the cause.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們承諾支持這項事業。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He pledged allegiance to his country.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他向他的國家宣誓效忠。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She had to pledge her jewelry to get the money.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她不得不抵押她的珠寶來換取金錢。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The organization pledged to help the refugees.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該組織承諾幫助難民。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她不得不抵押她的珠寶來換取金錢。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U66"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5471,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l4::plentiful::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Opportunities for graduates are ____.","expectedAnswer":"plentiful","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Opportunities for graduates are ____.","clozeAnswer":"plentiful","exampleTranslation":"畢業生的機會很多（充裕）。","reference":{"eng":"plentiful","kk":"ˈplɛntɪfəl","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['豐富的'], ['充裕的'], ['許多的']]","chEntries":["豐富的","充裕的","許多的"],"practiceMeaning":"畢業生的機會很多（充裕）。","analysis":"此字由名詞 'plenty'（充足）加上形容詞字尾 '-ful'（來自古英語 '-ful'，表示「充滿……的」）構成。'Plenty' 本身源自古法語 'plente'，意為「滿足、充足」，最終來自拉丁語 'plenitas'（充滿），'plenus'（滿的）。因此，'plentiful' 的核心語意是「充滿的、量大的、足夠的」，表示某物非常豐富，有充足的供應，超過了最低需求。","definition":"1. Existing in or yielding great quantities; abundant.; 2. Abundant; ample; copious.; 3. Having plenty of something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Fresh fruit is plentiful in the summer.\",\n    \"ch\": \"夏季水果豐富。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"There was a plentiful supply of food at the feast.\",\n    \"ch\": \"宴會上有充足的食物供應。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Opportunities for graduates are plentiful.\",\n    \"ch\": \"畢業生的機會很多（充裕）。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"畢業生的機會很多（充裕）。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5797,"wordRef":"字彙王::u60::poetic::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The poem uses simple language but has a powerful ____ effect.","expectedAnswer":"poetic","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The poem uses simple language but has a powerful ____ effect.","clozeAnswer":"poetic","exampleTranslation":"這首詩語言樸素，卻有強烈的詩意效果。","reference":{"eng":"poetic","kk":"poʊˈɛtɪk","tense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"詩的\"  ],  [    \"詩意的\"  ],  [    \"詩人般的\"  ]]","chEntries":["詩的","詩意的","詩人般的"],"practiceMeaning":"這首詩語言樸素，卻有強烈的詩意效果。","analysis":"此字為形容詞，構詞自poet（詩人）+ -ic（形容詞字尾，表示「關於……的；具有……性質的」）。poet源自古希臘語poiētēs（創作者，詩人），來自poiein（製作；創造）。-ic字尾源自拉丁語-icus。因此，poetic的核心語義是指「與詩歌有關的」，或「具有詩歌的特質」，例如優美、富有想像力、富含情感等。語意演變上，從「詩歌的」具體意義，擴展到「富含詩意」的抽象描述。","definition":"1. relating to or characteristic of poets or poetry; 2. having an appropriate quality or style for poetry; 3. having an imaginative or expressive quality.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The sunset cast a poetic glow over the landscape.\",\n    \"ch\": \"夕陽為大地投下詩意的光輝。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She wrote a poetic description of her childhood.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她寫了一段詩意般地描述她的童年。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The poem uses simple language but has a powerful poetic effect.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這首詩語言樸素，卻有強烈的詩意效果。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這首詩語言樸素，卻有強烈的詩意效果。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U60"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3872,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u1::political::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The decision has significant ____ implications.","expectedAnswer":"political","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The decision has significant ____ implications.","clozeAnswer":"political","exampleTranslation":"這個決定具有重大的政治影響。","reference":{"eng":"political","kk":"/pəˈlɪtɪkl/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['政治的']]","chEntries":["政治的"],"practiceMeaning":"這個決定具有重大的政治影響。","analysis":"源自古希臘 'politikos'，意指「關於公民」、「國家」、「政府」等。與政治事務、政府、權力、政策等相關。","definition":"of or relating to the government or public affairs of a country or countries.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The two countries have strong political ties.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這兩個國家有著緊密的政治聯繫。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He made a political speech.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他發表了一篇政治演說。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The decision has significant political implications.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個決定具有重大的政治影響。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這個決定具有重大的政治影響。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6236,"wordRef":"字彙王::u67::prejudice::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The judge must be free from ____.","expectedAnswer":"prejudice","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The judge must be free from ____.","clozeAnswer":"prejudice","exampleTranslation":"法官必須不受偏見影響。","reference":{"eng":"prejudice","kk":"ˈprɛdʒədɪs","tense":"n.","ch":"[  [    \"偏見\"  ],  [    \"歧視\"  ],  [    \"成見\"  ]]","chEntries":["偏見","歧視","成見"],"practiceMeaning":"法官必須不受偏見影響。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 præjudicium，意為「先前的判斷」，由 præ-（先）和 judicare（判斷）構成。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根。名詞義指對某人或某群人基於其所屬群體（如種族、性別、宗教）而產生的不公平的、預先形成的負面看法或態度，通常缺乏理性根據，並可能導致歧視。中文翻譯為「偏見；歧視；成見」。","definition":"1. a preconceived opinion that is not based on reason or actual experience; 2. the tendency to pre-judge or form an opinion before obtaining adequate information; 3. unreasonable feelings, opinions, or attitudes, especially of hostility, toward an ethnic, racial, sex, or national group.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Prejudice against women is still a problem in some parts of the world.\",\n    \"ch\": \"對女性的偏見在世界某些地區仍然是一個問題。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We must overcome our own prejudices.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們必須克服自身的偏見。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The judge must be free from prejudice.\",\n    \"ch\": \"法官必須不受偏見影響。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"法官必須不受偏見影響。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U67"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":6237,"wordRef":"字彙王::u67::preliminary::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"This is just a ____ estimate.","expectedAnswer":"preliminary","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"This is just a ____ estimate.","clozeAnswer":"preliminary","exampleTranslation":"這只是一個初步的估計。","reference":{"eng":"preliminary","kk":"prɪˈlɪmɪnɛri","tense":"adj.","ch":"[  [    \"初步的\"  ],  [    \"預備的\"  ],  [    \"先行的\"  ]]","chEntries":["初步的","預備的","先行的"],"practiceMeaning":"這只是一個初步的估計。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 præliminarius，由 præ-（在…之前）和 limen（門檻）組成，意為「在門檻之前」，引申為「進入之前，準備階段」。此字在現代英語中不宜硬拆為字首或字根。作形容詞時，指發生在主要事件、行動或程序之前，作為準備或預示。中文翻譯為「初步的；預備的；先行的」。","definition":"1. happening before a more important event or activity, especially in order to prepare for it; 2. happening too soon or before the normal time.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They held preliminary talks to discuss the details.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們舉行了初步會談以討論細節。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The report contained only preliminary findings.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該報告只包含初步的調查結果。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"This is just a preliminary estimate.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這只是一個初步的估計。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這只是一個初步的估計。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U67"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5414,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l3::preservation::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ of food through canning is a common method.","expectedAnswer":"preservation","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ of food through canning is a common method.","clozeAnswer":"preservation","exampleTranslation":"通過罐裝保存食物是一種常見的方法。","reference":{"eng":"preservation","kk":"ˌprezərˈveɪʃn","tense":"n.","ch":"[['保存'], ['保護'], ['維護']]","chEntries":["保存","保護","維護"],"practiceMeaning":"通過罐裝保存食物是一種常見的方法。","analysis":"此字為派生詞，由動詞 \"preserve\" 加上名詞化字尾 \"-ation\" 構成。\"preserve\" 源自古法語 \"preserver\"，其拉丁語詞源為 \"praeservare\"，意為\"事先保存\"。其中 \"prae-\" 是表示\"事先\"、\"在前面\"的字首，\"servare\" 則是\"保存\"、\"守護\"的意思。構詞上，\"prae-\" 提供了時間上的預防性，\"servare\" 提供了核心的\"保護\"與\"守護\"語意。字尾 \"-ation\" 將動詞轉化為抽象名詞，表示「保存」的行為、狀態或結果。因此，\"preservation\" 指的是為了防止損壞、變質或消失而進行的保護與維護工作，尤其常用於文化遺產、自然環境或食品等方面。","definition":"the act of preserving something; the state of being preserved; the protection of something from harm or destruction; the maintenance of something in its original or existing state.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The preservation of ancient artifacts is crucial.\",\n    \"ch\": \"保存古代文物至關重要。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Wildlife preservation efforts have increased.\",\n    \"ch\": \"野生動物保護的努力已經增加。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The preservation of food through canning is a common method.\",\n    \"ch\": \"通過罐裝保存食物是一種常見的方法。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"通過罐裝保存食物是一種常見的方法。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L3"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4210,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::price::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ of success is hard work.","expectedAnswer":"price","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ of success is hard work.","clozeAnswer":"price","exampleTranslation":"成功的代價是辛勤的工作。","reference":{"eng":"price","kk":"/praɪs/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['價格'], ['（為獲得某物所付出的）代價']]","chEntries":["價格","代價"],"practiceMeaning":"成功的代價是辛勤的工作。","analysis":"源自古法語 pris，意為“獎勵，價值”，來自拉丁語 pretium（價格，價值）。核心是某物或某事的價值評估。1. “價格”是指商品或服務的貨幣價值。2. “代價”是抽象意義，指為了達成某事而必須付出的努力、犧牲或其他成本。","definition":"1. the amount of money expected, required, or given in payment for something; 2. the cost, especially in terms of effort or sacrifice, incurred in achieving or obtaining something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"What is the price of this book?\",\n    \"ch\": \"這本書的價格是多少？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He learned the hard way the price of dishonesty.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他通過慘痛的教訓明白了不誠實的代價。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The price of success is hard work.\",\n    \"ch\": \"成功的代價是辛勤的工作。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"成功的代價是辛勤的工作。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5486,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l4::privacy::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The hotel room offered a sense of ____.","expectedAnswer":"privacy","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The hotel room offered a sense of ____.","clozeAnswer":"privacy","exampleTranslation":"這間飯店房間提供了隱私感。","reference":{"eng":"privacy","kk":"ˈpraɪvəsi","tense":"n.","ch":"[['隱私'], ['私密性'], ['清靜']]","chEntries":["隱私","私密性","清靜"],"practiceMeaning":"這間飯店房間提供了隱私感。","analysis":"此字由形容詞 'private'（私人的）加上名詞字尾 '-cy'（來自拉丁語 '-tia' 或 '-cia'）構成。'-cy' 用來形成表示「狀態、品質或條件」的名詞。因此，'privacy' 指的是「私人的狀態、私密的品質，或不受干擾的寧靜」。它強調的是個人空間、資訊和生活不受外部侵擾的權利或狀態。核心語意是「不受干擾或公開的狀態」。","definition":"1. The state of being free from intrusion or disturbance by other people.; 2. The condition of being secluded or secret.; 3. Freedom from publicity or notoriety.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Protecting the privacy of users is crucial.\",\n    \"ch\": \"保護用戶的隱私至關重要。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He values his privacy and rarely gives interviews.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他重視個人隱私，很少接受採訪。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The hotel room offered a sense of privacy.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這間飯店房間提供了隱私感。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"這間飯店房間提供了隱私感。","sourceName":"龍騰課本","unitName":"L4"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3885,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u1::process::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We need to ____ this application quickly.","expectedAnswer":"process","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We need to ____ this application quickly.","clozeAnswer":"process","exampleTranslation":"我們需要快速處理這份申請。","reference":{"eng":"process","kk":"/ˈprɑːsɛs/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['處理'], ['加工'], ['訴訟']]","chEntries":["處理","加工","訴訟"],"practiceMeaning":"我們需要快速處理這份申請。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'processus' (向前進行)。核心是「按照特定方式處理」。引申為對某事物進行操作、處理、加工，使其符合要求或達成預期目標。在法律上，指對文件或訴訟進行正式處理。","definition":"1. perform a series of mechanical or chemical operations on (something) in order to change or preserve it. 2. deal with (a matter or situation) in a customary or established sequence of actions. 3. to take legal action against (someone).","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The factory processes raw materials into finished goods.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這家工廠將原材料加工成成品。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The system processes thousands of requests daily.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該系統每天處理數千個請求。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to process this application quickly.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要快速處理這份申請。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們需要快速處理這份申請。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3906,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u1::producer::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"She is a successful theatre ____.","expectedAnswer":"producer","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"She is a successful theatre ____.","clozeAnswer":"producer","exampleTranslation":"她是一位成功的戲劇製作人。","reference":{"eng":"producer","kk":"/prəˈduːsər/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['製片人'], ['生產者'], ['製造者']]","chEntries":["製片人","生產者","製造者"],"practiceMeaning":"她是一位成功的戲劇製作人。","analysis":"由 'produce' (生產) 加上名詞後綴 '-er' (做某事的人) 組成。核心是「生產某事物的人」。可指電影、戲劇、音樂的製片人，或任何商品的生產者、製造者。","definition":"1. a person who creates or makes something. 2. a person responsible for the financial and managerial aspects of the production of a play, film, or television show.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The producer of the film won an award.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這部電影的製片人獲得了獎項。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Farmers are the producers of our food.\",\n    \"ch\": \"農民是我們食物的生產者。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is a successful theatre producer.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她是一位成功的戲劇製作人。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她是一位成功的戲劇製作人。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4212,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u6::profit::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He found great ____ in studying history.","expectedAnswer":"profit","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He found great ____ in studying history.","clozeAnswer":"profit","exampleTranslation":"他在研究歷史中發現了很多益處。","reference":{"eng":"profit","kk":"/ˈprɒfɪt/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['利潤；收益'], ['好處；益處']]","chEntries":["利潤","收益","好處","益處"],"practiceMeaning":"他在研究歷史中發現了很多益處。","analysis":"源自古法語 profit，意為“好處，進步”，來自拉丁語 profectus，'pro-'（向前）+ 'facere'（做）。字面意思是“向前做”，引申為“進步，成就，好處”。1. “利潤”是商業和金融領域的核心含義。2. “好處；益處”是更廣泛的意義，指任何有益的結果。","definition":"1. a financial gain, especially the difference between the amount earned and the amount spent in buying, operating, or producing something; 2. an advantage or benefit gained from something.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company made a large profit last year.\",\n    \"ch\": \"公司去年盈利頗豐。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It's in our best interest to maximize profit.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們的最大利益在於將利潤最大化。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He found great profit in studying history.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他在研究歷史中發現了很多益處。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他在研究歷史中發現了很多益處。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U6"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3873,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u1::property::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Water has the ____ of expanding when it freezes.","expectedAnswer":"property","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Water has the ____ of expanding when it freezes.","clozeAnswer":"property","exampleTranslation":"水具有結冰時膨脹的特性。","reference":{"eng":"property","kk":"/ˈprɑːpərti/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['財產', '財物'], ['所有權'], ['特性', '屬性']]","chEntries":["財產","財物","所有權","特性","屬性"],"practiceMeaning":"水具有結冰時膨脹的特性。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'proprietas'，意為「所有權」、「特徵」，其根源是 'proprius' (one's own)。核心概念是「屬於某人」的東西。引申為個人擁有的動產或不動產、財產的所有權，以及事物的固有特質或屬性。","definition":"1. things that are owned by a person or company. 2. the exclusive right to own, possess, use, and dispose of something. 3. a quality or characteristic.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He owns a lot of property.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他擁有許多財產。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The property was inherited from her grandparents.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這份財產是從她祖父母那裡繼承來的。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Water has the property of expanding when it freezes.\",\n    \"ch\": \"水具有結冰時膨脹的特性。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"水具有結冰時膨脹的特性。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字、龍騰課本","unitName":"C3U1、L1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5142,"wordRef":"字彙王::u62::provision::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"They made ____ for their old age.","expectedAnswer":"provision","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"They made ____ for their old age.","clozeAnswer":"provision","exampleTranslation":"他們為晚年做好了準備。","reference":{"eng":"provision","kk":"prəˈvɪʒən","tense":"n.","ch":"[['供應'], ['糧食、補給品'], ['規定、條款'], ['預備']]","chEntries":["供應","糧食、補給品","規定、條款","預備"],"practiceMeaning":"他們為晚年做好了準備。","analysis":"此字源自拉丁語 provisio，來自 providere（預見、準備、供應），由 pro-（向前）+ videre（看見）組成。核心語意是「預見並為未來做準備」。引申為「供應（尤指糧食和物資）」、「為未來做的準備」、「法律或合約中的規定或條款」。","definition":"the action of providing or supplying something for use; an amount of food, drink, or other necessary supplies; a condition or requirement in a legal document.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The army needs adequate provision of food and ammunition.\",\n    \"ch\": \"軍隊需要足夠的糧食和彈藥補給。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The contract includes a provision for early termination.\",\n    \"ch\": \"合約包含一項提前終止的規定。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They made provision for their old age.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他們為晚年做好了準備。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他們為晚年做好了準備。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U62"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3184,"wordRef":"字彙王::u40::psychologist::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He consulted a ____ for advice on his career.","expectedAnswer":"psychologist","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He consulted a ____ for advice on his career.","clozeAnswer":"psychologist","exampleTranslation":"他諮詢了一位心理學家，尋求職業建議。","reference":{"eng":"psychologist","kk":"/saɪˈkɒlədʒɪst/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['心理學家']]","chEntries":["心理學家"],"practiceMeaning":"他諮詢了一位心理學家，尋求職業建議。","analysis":"名詞，來自 'psychology'。'Psychologist' 是指專門研究人類和動物心理、行為、情感和思想過程的專業人士。他們可能從事研究、諮詢、治療或教學工作。","definition":"an expert or specialist in psychology.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The psychologist helped her to overcome her anxiety.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位心理學家幫助她克服了焦慮。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Child psychologists often work with parents and teachers.\",\n    \"ch\": \"兒童心理學家經常與家長和老師合作。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He consulted a psychologist for advice on his career.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他諮詢了一位心理學家，尋求職業建議。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"他諮詢了一位心理學家，尋求職業建議。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U40"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4163,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::question::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The ____ of his honesty is still debated.","expectedAnswer":"question","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The ____ of his honesty is still debated.","clozeAnswer":"question","exampleTranslation":"關於他是否誠實的問題仍在爭論中。","reference":{"eng":"question","kk":"/ˈkwestʃən/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['問題'], ['疑問']]","chEntries":["問題","疑問"],"practiceMeaning":"關於他是否誠實的問題仍在爭論中。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 quaestio（尋求，詢問），是 quaerere（尋找，詢問）的名詞形式。核心概念是「對未知事物進行詢問」。","definition":"1. a sentence worded or expressed so as to elicit information; 2. a doubt or dispute concerning a matter","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Do you have any questions?\",\n    \"ch\": \"你有什麼問題嗎？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"That's a tricky question.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這是一個棘手的問題。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The question of his honesty is still debated.\",\n    \"ch\": \"關於他是否誠實的問題仍在爭論中。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"關於他是否誠實的問題仍在爭論中。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3896,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u1::rate::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"How do you ____ his performance?","expectedAnswer":"rate","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"How do you ____ his performance?","clozeAnswer":"rate","exampleTranslation":"你如何評價他的表現？","reference":{"eng":"rate","kk":"/reɪt/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['評定', '評價'], ['認為']]","chEntries":["評定","評價","認為"],"practiceMeaning":"你如何評價他的表現？","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'rata' (reckoned)。核心是「被計算」、「被評估」。引申為對某事物給予評價、等級，或認為其具有某種品質、價值。","definition":"1. to assign a standard or value to (something) according to a scale. 2. to consider or regard as.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The movie was rated highly by critics.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這部電影受到評論家的高度評價。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He is rated as one of the best players.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他被評為最佳球員之一。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"How do you rate his performance?\",\n    \"ch\": \"你如何評價他的表現？\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"你如何評價他的表現？","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3874,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u1::recognize::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"We must ____ the need for change.","expectedAnswer":"recognize","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"We must ____ the need for change.","clozeAnswer":"recognize","exampleTranslation":"我們必須認識到變革的必要性。","reference":{"eng":"recognize","kk":"/ˈrɛkəɡˌnaɪz/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['認出', '辨認出'], ['承認', '認可'], ['認識到', '意識到']]","chEntries":["認出","辨認出","承認","認可","認識到","意識到"],"practiceMeaning":"我們必須認識到變革的必要性。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'recognoscere'，'re-' (again) + 'cognoscere' (to know)。核心是「再次知道」或「重新識別」。可指辨認出熟悉的人事物，承認某事物或人的價值、合法性，或意識到某個事實。","definition":"1. to identify someone or something seen before. 2. to acknowledge the existence, truth, or legality of something. 3. to become aware of; realize.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I recognized him immediately.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我立刻認出他了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The government recognized the new nation.\",\n    \"ch\": \"政府承認了這個新國家。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We must recognize the need for change.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們必須認識到變革的必要性。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"我們必須認識到變革的必要性。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U1"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4473,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u10::relax::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"After exercise, it's important to ____ your muscles.","expectedAnswer":"relax","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"After exercise, it's important to ____ your muscles.","clozeAnswer":"relax","exampleTranslation":"運動後，放鬆肌肉很重要。","reference":{"eng":"relax","kk":"/rɪˈlæks/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['放鬆'], ['減輕（緊張、約束等）'], ['（肌肉、金屬等）鬆弛']]","chEntries":["放鬆","減輕","鬆弛"],"practiceMeaning":"運動後，放鬆肌肉很重要。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 relaxare，意為「伸展」、「放鬆」。re- (回) + laxare (放鬆，來自 laxus, 寬鬆的)。核心語意是「從緊張狀態恢復到鬆弛狀態」。","definition":"1. To make or become less tense or anxious; 2. To make or become less strict; 3. To make or become less tight or firm.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"I like to relax by reading a book.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我喜歡通過閱讀書籍來放鬆。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The government decided to relax the travel restrictions.\",\n    \"ch\": \"政府決定放寬旅行限制。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"After exercise, it's important to relax your muscles.\",\n    \"ch\": \"運動後，放鬆肌肉很重要。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"運動後，放鬆肌肉很重要。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U10"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4411,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u9::release::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"Exercise can help ____ stress.","expectedAnswer":"release","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"Exercise can help ____ stress.","clozeAnswer":"release","exampleTranslation":"運動有助於緩解壓力。","reference":{"eng":"release","kk":"/rɪˈliːs/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['釋放', '放出'], ['發布', '公開'], ['緩解', '解除（壓力、緊張等）']]","chEntries":["釋放","放出","發布","公開","緩解","解除"],"practiceMeaning":"運動有助於緩解壓力。","analysis":"詞源自拉丁語 're-' (back) + 'laxare' (to loosen)。核心概念是「放開」，從束縛、限制中解脫出來。引申到公開資訊、釋放情感或緩解壓力。","definition":"to allow someone or something to move freely away from a place where they are being kept or held; to make information available to the public; to let out or allow to escape.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The police released the suspect after questioning.\",\n    \"ch\": \"警方在訊問後釋放了嫌疑犯。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The company will release its annual report next month.\",\n    \"ch\": \"公司將於下月發布年度報告。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Exercise can help release stress.\",\n    \"ch\": \"運動有助於緩解壓力。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"運動有助於緩解壓力。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U9"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3915,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u2::religious::adj","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"They have a ____ adherence to their daily schedule.","expectedAnswer":"religious","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"They have a ____ adherence to their daily schedule.","clozeAnswer":"religious","exampleTranslation":"他們嚴格遵守他們的日常行程。","reference":{"eng":"religious","kk":"/rɪˈlɪdʒəs/","tense":"adj.","ch":"[['宗教的', '虔誠的'], ['嚴謹的', '認真的']]","chEntries":["宗教的","虔誠的","嚴謹的","認真的"],"practiceMeaning":"他們嚴格遵守他們的日常行程。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'religiosus'，意為「虔誠的」，與 'religio' (意為「宗教、敬畏」) 有關，可能源自 'religare' (意為「綁定、約束」)。最初指與神聖事物相關，引申為「虔誠」；另一層語意則指對某事物的嚴謹態度，類似於「恪守規矩」。","definition":"1. relating to or believing in a particular religion; 2. showing or having strong beliefs about religion; 3. very careful and thorough.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Many people hold strong religious beliefs.\",\n    \"ch\": \"許多人持有堅定的宗教信仰。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She is a very religious person and attends church every Sunday.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她是一個非常虔誠的人，每週日都去教堂。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"They have a religious adherence to their daily schedule.\