:"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"Water is a vital natural resource.\",\n    \"ch\": \"水是重要的自然資源。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The project requires significant financial resources.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個項目需要大量的財政資源。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"She has a lot of resource when it comes to solving problems.\",\n    \"ch\": \"她在解決問題方面很有辦法。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"她在解決問題方面很有辦法。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":4160,"wordRef":"文華高中-常春藤單字::c3u5::resources::n","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"The organization lacks financial ____.","expectedAnswer":"resources","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"The organization lacks financial ____.","clozeAnswer":"resources","exampleTranslation":"該組織缺乏財政資源。","reference":{"eng":"resources","kk":"/ˈriːsɔːrsɪz/","tense":"n.","ch":"[['資源']]","chEntries":["資源"],"practiceMeaning":"該組織缺乏財政資源。","analysis":"由 resource（資源）的複數形式。核心概念是「可供利用的來源」。","definition":"assets on which a person or organisation can draw to function effectively or achieve its aims","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The country has abundant natural resources.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這個國家擁有豐富的自然資源。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"We need to manage our resources wisely.\",\n    \"ch\": \"我們需要明智地管理我們的資源。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The organization lacks financial resources.\",\n    \"ch\": \"該組織缺乏財政資源。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"該組織缺乏財政資源。","sourceName":"文華高中-常春藤單字","unitName":"C3U5"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":3115,"wordRef":"字彙王::u39::retire::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"It's time to ____ for the night.","expectedAnswer":"retire","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"It's time to ____ for the night.","clozeAnswer":"retire","exampleTranslation":"是時候去睡覺了。","reference":{"eng":"retire","kk":"/rɪˈtaɪər/","tense":"v.","ch":"[['退休'], ['退役'], ['就寢；休息'], ['退居；隱退']]","chEntries":["退休","退役","就寢","休息","退居","隱退"],"practiceMeaning":"是時候去睡覺了。","analysis":"源自拉丁語 'retirare'，'re-' (back) + 'tendere' (to stretch, to draw)。原意為「退後」，引申為「脫離」或「休息」。\n1. 退休：指停止工作，通常是達到法定年齡或工作年限。\n2. 退役：指軍人或運動員結束其服役或參賽生涯。\n3. 就寢；休息：指準備睡覺或進行休息。\n4. 退居；隱退：指退出公眾事務或活躍的社會生活，過上較為平靜的生活。","definition":"1. to stop working, usually because you have reached an age at which you can stop; 2. to stop being in the army, navy, or air force; 3. to go to bed; 4. to withdraw from public life.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"He plans to retire next year.\",\n    \"ch\": \"他計劃明年退休。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The general decided to retire after many years of service.\",\n    \"ch\": \"將軍在服役多年後決定退役。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"It's time to retire for the night.\",\n    \"ch\": \"是時候去睡覺了。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The actor retired from the stage at the height of his career.\",\n    \"ch\": \"這位演員在他事業的巔峰時期退出了舞台。\"\n  }\n]","exampleTranslation":"是時候去睡覺了。","sourceName":"字彙王","unitName":"U39"},"learningMeta":{"attempts":0,"accuracy":0,"mastered":false}},{"wordId":5572,"wordRef":"龍騰課本::l6::retrace::v","mode":"cloze_en","questionType":"typing","prompt":"He tried to ____ his thoughts before the accident.","expectedAnswer":"retrace","choices":[],"clozeSentence":"He tried to ____ his thoughts before the accident.","clozeAnswer":"retrace","exampleTranslation":"他試圖回溯事故發生前的思緒。","reference":{"eng":"retrace","kk":"riˈtreɪs","tense":"v.","ch":"[['重走'], ['回溯'], ['追溯']]","chEntries":["重走","回溯","追溯"],"practiceMeaning":"他試圖回溯事故發生前的思緒。","analysis":"此字由字首 \"re-\"（again, back，再次，向後）和動詞 \"trace\"（追蹤，描繪）組成。\"trace\" 源自古法語 \"tracer\"，來自拉丁語 \"tractus\"，是 \"trahere\"（to draw, pull，繪製，拉）的過去分詞。\"tractus\" 的語義是「被拉出的線條」或「走過的軌跡」。\"re-\" 加上 \"trace\"，核心語義是「沿著原來的路徑返回」或「重新追溯」。它可以指物理上的「重走」，例如「重走犯罪現場」；也可以指抽象上的「追溯某事的來源、原因或歷史」，例如「追溯某個想法的起源」。","definition":"1. Go back over (a route or journey); 2. Trace back the course or steps of.","example":"[\n  {\n    \"eng\": \"The police decided to retrace their steps to the scene of the crime.\",\n    \"ch\": \"警方決定重走一遍到犯罪現場的路徑。\"\n  },\n  {\n 